window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1901,"title":"Chapter 1901 Destroying the Giant Turtle Monster Horde","paragraphs":["1901 Destroying the Giant Turtle Monster Horde","All kinds of itinerant cultivators, whether righteous or evil, were the mainstream throughout the Eastern Sea. Even with the strength Grand Xia possessed, they were unable to expand their territory to the vast sea region. In the coastal areas, the fleet of Grand Xia swept through all directions, but in the deep sea region, it was still an area that Grand Xia could not control. Not to mention, there were countless ferocious beasts in the sea. This place was even more dangerous than the Demon Region on land.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and appeared on the surface of the sea in the blink of an eye. He looked around and saw endless waves everywhere. It was impossible to tell which direction was north, south, east, or west.","He closed his eyes and located the aura of the array he had left in Baotai. Although the array was thousands of miles away, he could still sense the aura, albeit faintly. With a direction, the rest was easy to handle.","Suddenly, at this moment, a bloody mouth rose out of the waves and bit at Chu Yunfan.","Clang!","The bloody mouth could get within three inches of Chu Yunfan’s body as if it had bitten into some metal or stone.","“B*stard, you’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","His entire body burst out with waves of sword light, cutting the bloody mouth into pieces. At the same time, he reached out with a big hand and grabbed the ferocious beast. It was a turtle-shaped monster the size of a small mountain.","This turtle beast had a spiky shell and a mouth full of fangs. It was extremely ferocious, but it was caught by Chu Yunfan and its mouth was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan. At this moment, it was struggling desperately.","However, it was impossible for it to escape Chu Yunfan’s attack. The attack easily tore the huge turtle-shaped monster into two halves. It couldn’t be more dead.","A Cosmic monster could definitely be considered a small overlord. Ordinary monsters were no match for it. Unfortunately, this monster had encountered Chu Yunfan and was no match for him.","Chu Yunfan had not expected this ferocious sea beast to be so bold. It actually dared to bite him while he was flying through the air.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan had an idea. He made a hand seal and dove into the water. He had cast a spell to repel the water. Now that he had reached the divine tier and had gained divine power, he could easily go through fire and water. However, using a water repel spell was much more convenient.","After entering the water, Chu Yunfan scanned his surroundings. It was pitch-black everywhere. He could not see any light at all. He could only use his divine will to scan out and see the situation around him.","In the depths of the deep sea, countless huge ferocious beasts lay dormant. They were cultivating. These beasts were constantly swallowing the seawater and absorbing the spirit energy within. Chu Yunfan also saw many monsters swallowing spirit stones and then absorbing the spirit energy within the stones.","Like human cultivators, these monsters had a certain level of intelligence and could cultivate. But unlike humans, humans needed to have special inheritances whereas these monsters often contained cultivation techniques in their bloodlines. Those who were ignorant would also cultivate, and naturally, they would be able to cultivate to an extremely profound level. However, compared to humans, their intelligence was not as high. They could only be enlightened and gain intelligence comparable to humans after cultivating to a certain extent. This was considered their own strength.","“Spirit stones. Just in time. I need a lot of them.”","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over the ferocious sea beasts, and they too sensed Chu Yunfan’s existence and looked toward him.","However, Chu Yunfan immediately formed a seal and restrained his aura. The divine wills of these ferocious beasts were unable to detect him. In this incomparably dark place, one had to use divine will to scan one’s surroundings instead of relying on one’s eyes.","Chu Yunfan then began to act. To collect the spirit stones needed to catalyze the growth of the Brahma Tree, he flashed and appeared behind a giant turtle. This giant turtle kept exhaling a huge amount of seawater, forming a tornado. It was even more shocking than the giant turtle that tried to engulf Chu Yunfan earlier. It was definitely at least at the fifth stage of the Cosmos Stage.","However, the turtle did not sense Chu Yunfan’s presence.","Suddenly, a large hand grabbed the turtle and dragged it into the Mountain River Diagram. The turtle instantly sensed that something was wrong. It let out a loud roar and pounced fiercely at Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan was even faster. A sword light condensed and swept out a sword light that was hundreds of feet long, beheading the giant turtle. Blood spurted out as the huge body fell to the ground. Chu Yunfan then threw the turtle under the Brahma Tree. Soon, the carcass was entangled by the huge roots of the Brahma Tree.","The one million mid-grade spirit stones the turtle’s nest that it had been using for cultivation naturally fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands. Because most of the mid-grade spirit stones had been used up by the giant turtle, there was only this little left. These beasts had no intention of storing them.","In this endless ocean, there were endless hidden dangers. These beasts could die in the deep sea at any moment. Any wealth collected had to be used to strengthen their strength to protect themselves. On this point, these beasts had a much deeper understanding than ordinary people.","These mid-grade spirit stones piled up like a mountain. Soon, Chu Yunfan turned them all into powder, and the spirit energy inside poured into the Brahma Tree.","“It’s not enough.” Chu Yunfan shook his head, feeling a little regretful.","The wealth of the experts of the Demon God Sect and the demons that he had killed had not fallen into his hands. That person had appeared too quickly and did not give Chu Yunfan any time to clean up.","With a thought, Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and appeared in another spot of the deep sea. He went straight for another giant turtle. He could already tell that this place was the nesting grounds of giant turtle monsters. He could see many of them here.","Chu Yunfan’s movements were very fast. These giant turtles did not have time to react and disappeared from their nests one by one. He didn’t even alarm any of the other turtle monsters as he killed them one by one. This small group of turtle monsters was wiped out by Chu Yunfan single-handedly.","The only setback Chu Yunfan encountered was when he went after the turtle demon king. It was a Creator monster, which made Chu Yunfan slightly exhausted, but he still completed the task satisfactorily."]},{"number":1902,"title":"Chapter 1902 Breakthrough, Sixth Level of the Cosmic Stage","paragraphs":["1902 Breakthrough, Sixth Level of the Cosmic Stage","All the spirit stones accumulated from this turtle monster group fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands and turned into his resources. It was used to catalyze the growth of the Brahma Fruit.","However, the accumulation of this giant turtle beast group was not enough. Chu Yunfan turned his gaze to the surrounding deep-sea beasts. At this moment, the deep-sea beasts were in trouble. Chu Yunfan’s attack was fast and ruthless, and he did it quietly. These beasts usually cultivated on their own and only went out to hunt for food. Therefore, many beasts disappeared without any other noticing.","Each of these ferocious beasts was more ferocious than the last. They were all above the Cosmos Stage. In the coastal areas, they would definitely be a demon king. However, in the deep sea area, they were nothing. They were only ordinary.","And now, they encountered Chu Yunfan, who was much more ferocious than them. He dragged them into the Mountain River Diagram, so even if they fought inside, it would not cause any ripples in the outside world. Otherwise, just the smell of blood would’ve attracted countless covetous eyes. The noses of these fierce beasts were very sensitive.","After a full month of hunting, Chu Yunfan finally stopped because the first Brahma Fruit had completely matured.","In the Mountain River Diagram, in the herb mountain, Chu Yunfan opened the enchantment near the Brahma Tree. Immediately, a fruity fragrance assailed his nose, filling the entire Mountain River Diagram.","“It has finally matured!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he saw this. After a month of non-stop hunting sea monsters, he had eliminated several groups of monsters. He had finally gathered enough spirit stones to catalyze the Brahma Fruit’s growth.","He immediately plucked the Brahma Fruit without hesitation. After flying out of the herb mountain, he sat cross-legged in midair and swallowed the fruit.","Boom!","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan felt an incomparably terrifying energy flood every meridian in his body. The energy was about to burst out of his body, but Chu Yunfan wasn’t about to let that happen. He closed his pores and circulated the Emperor Method to absorb the energy into his body.","Chu Yunfan felt that almost every cell in his body had been nourished. The Brahma Tree was indeed worthy of being a divine tree that had been famous since ancient times. Countless people had fought over the Brahma Tree.","And now, Chu Yunfan had such a treasure tree in his hands. One had to know that without this Brahma Tree, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation progress would not have been so fast. It could be said that it would have been at least twice as slow as now.","Chu Yunfan immediately began to circulate the Emperor Level Technique and began to trigger this terrifying energy tide to attack the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage. His cultivation was already at the peak of the fifth level.","During this month, apart from constantly killing these deep-sea ferocious beasts, Chu Yunfan also constantly consolidated his cultivation. After a month, his foundation was unprecedentedly solid. Only then did he begin to break through.","Although his cultivation base had broken through continuously in a short period, it was not like he was trying to pull up seedlings to help them grow. He had long understood the many mysteries of the Cosmos Stage. Not only did he have the help of the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, but he also had an astonishing comprehension with the help of the godhead.","Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of the Creation Stage was extremely shocking, and he was not inferior to many veteran Creators. What he lacked now was the energy to raise his cultivation. The ripening of the Brahma Fruit was just enough to fill the need for him to increase his power in a short time.","According to the method of accumulation over time, it was impossible for him to reach a level of rapid progress in cultivation. With the short lifespan of humans, it was impossible for them to advance to the next level before their birthday without the help of various fortuitous encounters and various treasures. Chu Yunfan could feel that his cultivation, which had already been somewhat stagnant, was beginning to loosen up again. As his cultivation level loosened up, it began to show signs of improvement.","Bit by bit, Chu Yunfan broke through.","“Just a little more... A little more!”","Cultivation knew no time. In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had been in seclusion in the Mountain River Diagram for an entire month. He had reached the key point of breaking through. A huge amount of energy had accumulated in his body. It was just like the moment before a flash flood.","The barrier of the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage was filled with cracks as he continued to charge forward. It was as if it would be broken through in the next moment.","After circulating the Emperor Method for another round, the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body shattered the sixth Cosmos Stage barrier like a flash flood.","A mighty momentum!","Chu Yunfan had broken through to the sixth stage of the Cosmos Stage. Moreover, it was not a forced breakthrough that could cause his cultivation to fall at any time. On the contrary, his breakthrough was very shocking and very stable. Even if he had a big battle immediately, it would not be able to shake his realm.","“This is great!”","Chu Yunfan laughed. He could feel the surging divine power in his body soaring. In just a short time, it had already doubled from his original foundation. This meant that his combat strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. This was not just a slight increase, it was not even double, but several times.","A satisfied smile appeared on Chu Yunfan’s face. Every breakthrough he made was much more difficult than ordinary people, and the resources he needed were unimaginable for ordinary people. Any one of those Creator monster carcasses he had used was priceless. Countless buyers would be tempted by the news. However, to Chu Yunfan, only the Brahma Fruit had the greatest value.","The amount of resources consumed was not something that ordinary people could hope to match. Fortunately, he had paid a lot and gained a lot. Every breakthrough was enough to make his combat strength undergo a world-shaking change.","‘Now, even if Li Qianyuan is in front of me, it won’t be difficult for me to kill him,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","If he was originally confident that he could defeat Li Qianyuan, then now that his cultivation had advanced even further, he was confident that he could kill Li Qianyuan."]},{"number":1903,"title":"Chapter 1903 Since You’ve Come, You Aren’t Leaving","paragraphs":["1903 Since You’ve Come, You Aren’t Leaving","Of course, this was on the premise that Li Qianyuan’s strength did not change much. However, even if Li Qianyuan’s strength had further developed, Chu Yunfan was absolutely confident that Li Qianyuan could not be his opponent.","While Li Qianyuan was making rapid progress, Chu Yunfan’s progress was even faster.","After his breakthrough, Chu Yunfan began to head toward the Central Plains. Three days later, he reached a city on a huge island. The place was crowded with people. As the central city of the nearby sea area, the nearby itinerant cultivators gathered here and slowly developed this location into a city.","‘I didn’t expect there to be such a city out on the Eastern Sea.’ Chu Yunfan observed the huge city and found that there were all kinds of barriers above the island. These barriers blocked the monstrous waves and prevented them from hitting the island.","Above the island, many barriers were shining faintly under the sunlight. It looked like a golden world. It was these barriers that protected the entire island, making it different from other places. It had become a holy land for human itinerant cultivators.","Chu Yunfan recalled the information about the Eastern Sea mentioned in “The World”. On the East Sea, islands were like stars throughout the endless ocean. These islands were like nodes that controlled the various alleys of the entire Eastern Sea.","Chu Yunfan descended and entered the city. He found that inside, besides the locals of the Eastern Sea, there were many cultivators originating from Grand Xia. The reason he could distinguish them was because the Eastern Sea cultivators had been separated from Grand Xia for a long time, so their clothing style was somewhat different from Grand Xia. Although the difference was not big, it was still easy to distinguish whether they were experts of Grand Xia according to the style of clothing.","As soon as he entered the city, Chu Yunfan noticed that the crowd was moving toward the center of the city. In the center, many cultivators were standing before a house. Everyone seemed to be attracted by something.","On a horizontal board located in this courtyard, there were words carved onto it. It was vigorous and powerful as if it had been carved. The surrounding crowd excitedly discussed the words carved on them.","“Is this the Li clan that Li Qianyuan is from?”","“I didn’t expect the Li clan to leave the Central Plains and come to the Eastern Sea.”","“I heard that even Li Qianyuan came here in person. It seems that he came for an ancient inheritance. How unscrupulous.”","“Yeah, he has no respect for the various powers of the Eastern Sea, but so what? He’s the Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia, the number one expert of the younger generation. It’s not that no one can kill him, but who can withstand the wrath of Grand Xia?”","Everyone was talking about it, especially the locals who showed indignant expressions. Li Qianyuan did not restrain himself when he came to the Eastern Sea. Instead, he swaggered in as if he had little care for the various forces of the Eastern Sea.","Li Qianyuan had come for an ancient inheritance in the Eastern Sea. In the eyes of many cultivators here, this inheritance should be theirs, but Li Qianyuan wanted to interfere and seize the opportunity that they thought belonged to them. Naturally, this was not welcomed.","There were many masters among the cultivators in the Eastern Sea. It was not that no one could do anything to Li Qianyuan, but no one could bear the anger of Grand Xia.","‘Li Qianyuan is here?’ A cold glint flashed through Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","He knew that while he was busy improving, Li Qianyuan would definitely not stay where he was. With Li Qianyuan’s influence, he did not need to personally attack Chu Yunfan. He had many ways to target Chu Yunfan from all aspects. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan could only accept it passively. This was the biggest gap between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan.","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that this might be a good opportunity. All along, he had been in the light and Li Qianyuan was in the dark, so he could only passively bear Li Qianyuan’s various attacks. But now, it was different. Li Qianyuan came to the Eastern Sea openly and was out in the open. He would not expect Chu Yunfan to be right here as well through a strange combination of factors.","This was Chu Yunfan’s best chance to use Li Qianyuan’s own intentions against him.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a calculative light. He didn’t even think of stopping Li Qianyuan from obtaining this ancient inheritance and making great progress in strength. He only had one thought—to take advantage of this opportunity to kill Li Qianyuan.","“Since you’ve come to the Eastern Sea, you aren’t leaving.”","Chu Yunfan had planned to kill Li Qianyuan at the husband selection, but now that a new opportunity was in front of him, Chu Yunfan was not about to let go. In particular, Chu Yunfan also suspected that Li Qianyuan had cooperated with the Demon God Sect before. Otherwise, with the ability of the Demon God Sect, it was impossible for them to completely block Baotai from sending out news.","That incident must have involved a large number of forces working together behind the scenes. Chu Yunfan didn’t know how big of a commotion the Grand Commandant’s Office had caused in Grand Xia, but he could vaguely guess what happened.","However, Chu Yunfan knew that this matter had to be considered in the long run. Li Qianyuan would not come alone. After all, he came to the Eastern Sea to fight for an inheritance. If someone was determined to target Li Qianyuan, he would probably die.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t the only one targeted by the various forces. Every single one of the prodigies on the prodigy list had been suppressed and targeted by various forces more than once. Those who couldn’t make it through would be removed from the prodigy list. Those who made it through would often welcome a world-shaking change in their cultivation.","Being on the list was both a calamity and an opportunity.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s appearance quietly changed. He grew by two meters and turned from a handsome young man into a rough-looking middle-aged man. A steel staff appeared in his hand. It was the staff that the ape demon king had used.","Although the ape demon king had easily died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, it was not because it was too weak. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was too strong at that time. He had reached his limit and even surpassed it.","There was no doubt about the power of the staff in Chu Yunfan’s hand. Ordinary Creators would be severely injured or even turned into ashes if they were hit by it."]},{"number":1904,"title":"Chapter 1904 The Li Clan Deterrence, Li Qianyuan, Arrives","paragraphs":["1904 The Li Clan Deterrence, Li Qianyuan, Arrives","After all, this staff was a magic weapon left behind by a peak Creator. Although there was a certain gap between the demons and the humans in terms of refining weapons, an expert at this level naturally had the conditions to obtain a powerful divine weapon.","Carved ancient runes wrapped around the steel staff. There were also sceneries of mountains and rivers painted on it.","After a while, the gates of the Li Mansion opened. A group of people filed out under the lead of an old man who looked like a butler.","“Everyone, Marquis Huntian has personally come to the Eastern Sea to establish a new partnership with everyone here. He will establish a long-term resource collection point here. As long as it is what we need, we will purchase it for the foreseeable future. This is the list of items we are looking for.”","The old man who looked like a butler waved, and a screen appeared in front of him. On the screen, there was a list of many treasures. There was even a price stated at the end of the list.","Many people gasped. The wealth required to purchase all kinds of heavenly materials and earthly treasures was an astronomical figure. One could imagine how rich the Li clan was.","In the Eastern Sea, there were many heavenly resources that Grand Xia did not possess. Hence, there were often many aristocratic families and sects of Grand Xia that established specialized resource collection points on the various islands in the Eastern Sea.","“Those who are interested in selling their wares, please follow me inside. There will be someone to register everyone. We will not cheat the old or the young,” the butler said, “But if anyone takes this opportunity to cause trouble, don’t blame us for being impolite. Huntian Marquis’s residence isn’t a small force without roots. I’d advise against crooked ideas.”","As the butler spoke, he faintly emitted waves of pressure that crushed everyone’s hearts.","The Creation Stage!","Many people sucked in a breath of cold air. This butler of the Huntian Marquis residence was a Creator. What kind of concept was a Creator in the Eastern Sea? They were overlords who could dominate an island and become the owner of it. They were at the level of an ancestor.","Now, such a person was Li Qianyuan’s butler. This was a big deal. Everyone looked at the other people and found that the guards behind the butler were all Cosmics.","A row of experts standing around was certainly a great deterrent.","After everyone recovered from their shock, they quickly understood that the Huntian Marquis Residence was putting its foundation on the surface to deter those with ulterior motives. The Eastern Sea was not as orderly as Grand Xia. Killing and stealing treasures here was not a special occurrence. Regardless of whether these itinerant cultivators were righteous or evil, they believed in the survival of the fittest. Under the drive of huge profits, it was very possible for some people to take risks.","However, many people were clearly prepared. After looking at the list, they quickly confirmed how much they could sell and began to line up to enter the Li Mansion to sell their goods. Only then did Chu Yunfan understand why so many people had gathered here. It was likely that Marquis Huntian had already released the news earlier, so it had attracted many people. Even though many of the powers of Grand Xia were unwilling to extend their hands into the Eastern Sea, no one would go against money.","The grand spending of the Marquis Huntian’s residence had attracted many itinerant cultivators.","‘Interesting.’ Chu Yunfan looked at the scene before him, but he was not in a hurry to make a move. This was because he felt more powerful auras coming from inside the mansion. There was more than one Creator guarding it.","‘This is definitely not a force that Li Qianyuan himself can have. He has just entered the Creation Stage. Even if he has followers in the Creation Stage, it is impossible for him to have so many.’","Chu Yunfan had sensed more than 20 Creators in the Li Mansion. Of course, this didn’t compare to the lineup that the Demon God Sect had used to ambush Chu Yunfan, but it was still a huge force. If the Cosmics were included, it would be even more so.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if this was related to the Li clan behind Li Qianyuan or the crown prince, but either force was a giant.","Li Qianyuan was able to become Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia at such a young age. He was the first marquis of the younger generation and the top expert of the younger generation. Naturally, he was not from a commoner’s background.","The Li clan was a military aristocratic family and had produced more than one marquis. The members of the clan had been marquises for generations and the power of the clan was extremely huge.","As for the crown prince, as the Emperor’s eldest son, he had been appointed as the crown prince long ago. He had countless followers in the court. Compared to Li Qianyuan, the crown prince was the real colossus.","However, Chu Yunfan understood that if Li Qianyuan’s goal was to seize an inheritance, he would probably need a large number of masters to come together with him. It was impossible to obtain those ancient inheritances smoothly within them. Therefore, Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to make a move. He found a hotel in the city and stayed there.","As time passed, more and more people came to the Li Mansion. A small market was formed around the place. Many people did not have the resources that the Li Mansion needed, but they would take this rare opportunity to exchange for the resources that they needed.","Chu Yunfan monitored the Li Mansion from afar. He was not in a hurry to make a move. He consolidated his cultivation while waiting for the best opportunity.","In just a few days, he saw many experts coming in and out, and more and more experts came. He even spotted an elite troop of up to 3,000 people flying across the sky. However, it was not the army of Grand Xia. It was the private army of the Li clan.","This private army was very elite. Although it could not compare to the External Army that Chu Yunfan had developed with all his strength, it was still a rare elite army.","Whether it was the experts or the private army, the Li clan did not hide anything. On the contrary, they were very high-profile as if they were afraid that no one would know. Even those who were not sensitive to this could see the Li clan’s goal. They wanted to intimidate the various forces in the Eastern Sea to prevent these people from taking risks.","However, as the Li clan became more and more high-profile, more and more figures appeared to investigate. Finally, on this day, a piece of news spread throughout the city.","Marquis Huntian, Li Qianyuan, had arrived."]},{"number":1905,"title":"Chapter 1905 Undercurrents Surge, the Beginning of a Major Event","paragraphs":["1905 Undercurrents Surge, the Beginning of a Major Event","This news made the whole city boil. During this period, the Li clan had been so high-profile that even the itinerant cultivators in the nearby area knew that Li Qianyuan was going to visit the Eastern Sea personally.","“He’s finally here. I’ve never seen such a grand display before!”","“What’s so strange about that? After all, Li Qianyuan is the number one expert of the younger generation and the number one figure on the prodigy list.”","“That’s right. If nothing goes wrong, he will definitely become one of the giants of Grand Xia’s military in the future. He might even become the future Grand Commandant of Grand Xia!”","“I heard that he supports the crown prince of Grand Xia. If the crown prince succeeds in ascending to the throne, he might really become the Grand Commandant.”","Everyone was talking about it, but there were more and more spies from various forces around. There was news that Li Qianyuan had come to seize an ancient inheritance located in the Eastern Sea.","This wasn’t anything strange to everyone. If those peerless geniuses wanted to grow rapidly, none of them would cultivate obediently and step by step. Almost every step was a leap in development. Naturally, there were all kinds of fortuitous encounters.","Although Li Qianyuan, the Li clan, and the crown prince were all giants, a strong dragon could not suppress a local snake. This place was a gathering place for itinerant cultivators who did not obey the control of Grand Xia. Therefore, there were many people who had their eyes on this inheritance, and many people who wanted to take advantage of it gathered.","At this moment, it was time to determine who was better.","In the Li Mansion, Li Qianyuan gathered up all the masters who had come earlier immediately upon his arrival. Although many of these people were stronger than Li Qianyuan, they all followed his lead.","“What happened? How did the word leak out?” Li Qianyuan questioned.","The butler stepped forward and explained, “When the inheritance was born, it caused a huge commotion. We’re not the only ones who received the news. I’m afraid someone secretly released the news and wanted to stir up this mess. When the time comes, we can fish in troubled waters.","“It’s precisely because we can’t hide it anymore that we spread the news with great fanfare. At that time, we should be able to intimidate most of the people with evil intentions.”","“Hmph! They want to take advantage of the Li clan and me. I want to see if they have such sharp teeth!” Li Qianyuan snorted.","This time, he not only mobilized many masters from the Li clan but also borrowed some masters from the crown prince.","“But it doesn’t matter. If our clan wants to establish a foothold in the Eastern Sea, it’s inevitable that we will have to clash with these people. This time, we will let them see the strength of our clan so that they won’t come and find trouble with us in the future,” Li Qianyuan said coldly.","He knew very well that apart from being Marquis Huntian, he was also the head disciple of the Li clan, the next patriarch. Naturally, he had to consider the Li clan’s perspective.","In Grand Xia, the various powers were intertwined and complicated. If they wanted to obtain any benefits, they had to snatch the meat from the mouths of the wolves. Naturally, it was not that easy. In comparison, there were countless rare treasures in the Eastern Sea, and there were even inheritances left behind by countless senior cultivators. This place was an endless treasure trove. However, there was no power that could unify the forces of the Eastern Sea, so it was an undeveloped virgin land.","Hence, over the past few years, more and more powers of Grand Xia had set their sights on the Eastern Sea. The Li clan was no exception. To the locals of the Eastern Sea, this was naturally like a dragon crossing the river. Many people were dissatisfied with this and were waiting for an opportunity to erupt.","Li Qianyuan intended to use this opportunity to wipe out all those who wanted to oppose his clan, laying the foundation for the Li clan to enter the Eastern Sea. This was a mission given to him by the clan. If he completed it well, his position as the heir would naturally be more stable. If he failed, it might be a blow to his prestige. Although it would not be a fatal blow, for someone as proud as him, since he had done it, he had to do it to the best of his ability.","In his heart, there was only one thing he had to do next, and that was to win the Elder Princess’ husband selection event and gain her support for the crown prince. As for who he married, he did not care.","“Yes, sir!” Everyone in the hall agreed.","They were all showing respect to Li Qianyuan despite him just being a junior. They all knew that their cultivation had reached the limit, and the probability of further improvement in the future was very small. However, Li Qianyuan was different. Although he was currently a little worse than them, it wouldn’t take long for him to completely surpass them.","Chu Yunfan, who had been paying attention to this matter, soon heard the news. However, he still did not act rashly. He just quietly waited for an opportunity.","Early the next morning, under the watchful eyes of the public, Li Qianyuan led a group of masters and 3,000 elite private soldiers of the Li clan into the deep sea.","Chu Yunfan made a hand seal, and an invisible light fell on one of the private soldiers. Although the soldier was an elite, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, how could they sense that Chu Yunfan had done something?","Chu Yunfan closed his eyes and could sense the general direction of the private soldier he had tampered with. He was relieved, but he soon realized that he was not the only one who had tampered with this private soldier.","‘Interesting. Looks like I’m not the only one who has his eyes on the Li clan.’ Chu Yunfan sneered and didn’t follow after the soldier immediately.","Instead, he glanced at the Li Mansion, which was located in the bustling area of the city, and his eyes flashed with a shocking light."]},{"number":1906,"title":"Chapter 1906 I’ll Slap the Li Clan’s Face","paragraphs":["1906 I’ll Slap the Li Clan’s Face","After confirming that Li Qianyuan and a large number of masters had left for more than thousands of miles, Chu Yunfan began to act.","Chu Yunfan formed a seal, and the space around the Li Mansion fluctuated. In a moment, it formed a huge barrier that surrounded the Li Mansion. This sudden change instantly attracted the attention of the experts in the Li Mansion, and they erupted into furious roars.","“Who is it?!”","“How dare you!”","“You’re courting death!”","At this moment, the Li Mansion itself was the focus of the entire city. With such a change happening, there was no doubt that someone had made a move.","“Someone’s making a move!”","Countless divine wills immediately swept over. At this moment, they saw a tall middle-aged man about two meters tall walking over from the end of the long street with a long staff in his hand.","The man moved quickly, and in just a moment, he had already arrived in front of the Li Mansion. Many other figures appeared in front of the Li Mansion as well. They were the experts of the Li clan. Although many experts had followed Li Qianyuan to the ancient inheritance, there were still many experts left, which was enough to deter those who had ideas.","The leader of the group was the old butler.","“Who are you? Are you planning to against the Li clan?” The butler’s expression was extremely solemn.","The butler did not look down on Chu Yunfan just because he came alone. He knew very well that anyone who dared to cause trouble at this critical moment, unless he was crazy, must have someone to rely on. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan did not look like that kind of crazy person, so there was only one possibility—Chu Yunfan had someone to rely on.","No matter what Chu Yunfan relied on, the butler could not let his guard down.","“Tell me who is your master and I will spare your life,” the butler said coldly.","Before Li Qianyuan left, he instructed the butler to fight back with the strongest attitude so that others would not underestimate the Li clan. This was the best way to avoid a bigger conflict in the future.","“Spare my life?” Chu Yunfan grinned, clenching the steel staff in his hand. “I have no other purpose in coming here today than to rob you. Hand over your spirit stones and all the materials and treasures you have. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude.”","“You’re here to rob us?” The butler was instantly angered by Chu Yunfan’s words. There was someone who dared to look down on the Li clan to this extent. This man clearly had no respect for the Li clan and dared to try and rob them.","“How dare you! Do you think that the Li clan is powerless?” The butler burned with anger.","The people watching the battle with their divine will from afar were shocked. This Chu Yunfan’s courage was extraordinary. He actually dared to have designs on the Li clan.","The Li clan was like a ferocious dragon crossing the river. They had led a large number of experts to the Eastern Sea in an extremely high-profile manner. There were countless people who were not pleasing to the eye, but few dared to make a move, let alone attack and rob them.","The eyes of everyone in the Li Mansion lit up, and they immediately surrounded Chu Yunfan.","From all directions, more than a dozen powerful figures attacked Chu Yunfan with their most terrifying attacks.","“The Li clan is nothing. I just want you to understand that I’m hitting the Li clan’s face!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","These attacks turned into a torrent and swept toward him, but Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. He waved the staff in his hand and instantly smashed these attacks into nothingness.","Bam!","A Cosmic of the Li clan didn’t even have time to react before his head exploded and he died instantly. And Chu Yunfan had no intention of stopping after this attack. He immediately swung his staff again.","Boom!","The air shook, and a terrifying explosion raged out. Under this strike, the Cosmics who were flying over suffered heavy blows. They were all severely injured and thrown backward.","Chu Yunfan swept away the Cosmics who were pouncing at him with a single strike. There was no need for him to attack a second time. When the experts of the various large factions who were watching the battle from afar saw this scene, they gasped in horror.","It was as if they had seen a monster!","Those experts were all Cosmics at least. In any force, they were considered the backbone. Though they were no match for Creators, the formation formed by so many people was enough to resist for a while. It was impossible for them to be in such a miserable state.","But now, even with all of them working together, they still couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s staff.","This made many people wonder when a master who used a staff had appeared in the Eastern Sea. The names of many staff-wielding experts flashed through their minds, but none of them could match the person in front of them. After all, it was impossible for someone with such a cultivation level to be unknown.","On the Eastern Sea, the competition between the various itinerant cultivators was far more intense than in Grand Xia. It was impossible to cultivate to the Creation Stage quietly here.","‘Could this man be from somewhere else?’ Many people had such a thought. However, they were still happy that someone dared to take the initiative to find trouble with the Li clan.","The Li clan was a powerful dragon crossing the river. They had long been dissatisfied with the fact that they wanted to crush the local snake. Now that someone had come knocking on the Li clan’s door, it was exactly what they wanted.","“How dare you kill those of the Li clan! There will be no place for you in the sky or on earth!”","The butler was fuming with anger at Chu Yunfan. He didn’t know where this person had come from to actually dare to go against the Li clan. Relying on the Li clan name, even those who wanted to uproot the clan did not dare to ignore the clan like this. They were one of the top military aristocratic families in Grand Xia.","“You’re just relying on His Grace’s absence. When His Grace returns, we’ll see where you can escape to!” the butler roared.","But before he could say more, everyone heard a loud slap.","Smack!"]},{"number":1907,"title":"Chapter 1907 A Beatdown","paragraphs":["1907 A Beatdown","Everyone stared at the scene before them with their mouths agape. They saw Chu Yunfan fiercely slap the butler. A powerful protective shield appeared on the old man’s body. However, it collapsed instantly. The slap then landed on the butler’s body.","Blood splattered everywhere, and even a few of his teeth were knocked out. The butler was stunned by the slap. He was completely dumbfounded. He was slapped until he saw stars and blood seeped out of the corner of his mouth.","“I’m going to hit the Li clan and Li Qianyuan. Who is Li Qianyuan? Tell him to come out and I’ll beat him up one-on-one!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Everyone was stunned by this slap. There were many people who dared to deal with the Li clan, but those who trampled on the dignity of the Li clan were probably rare. Unless there was a deep hatred between them, ordinary people would not easily humiliate such a force. Otherwise, these forces would definitely target them to the death.","This staff-wielding expert was clearly not afraid of the Li clan. He even had the intention of targeting the Li clan. He wanted to target the Li clan and slap the Li clan in the face. It was so domineering.","They didn’t know that there was more than a deep hatred between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan. Li Qianyuan had targeted Chu Yunfan many times, causing him to face danger and almost died many times.","Everyone could also see that Chu Yunfan was slapping the Li clan in the face. However, many people understood Chu Yunfan’s meaning. For Li Qianyuan, who many people were very afraid of, Chu Yunfan did not seem to care about him. He even said that he could beat Li Qianyuan one-on-one.","This made everyone view Chu Yunfan in a new light. They didn’t know if he was just bragging or if he really had such ability. Although Li Qianyuan was still a junior, his strength had already entered the Creation Stage and he was ranked first on the prodigy list. This kind of person was even more difficult to deal with than ordinary Creators who had accumulated power for many years.","Not only were their combat strength far above their cultivation level but more importantly, these people were the treasures of the major forces. They were all geniuses who had accumulated all kinds of fortuitous encounters. All kinds of heavenly and earthly treasures, divine weapons, magical treasures, and trump cards were piled up on these people as if they were free. Even if their cultivation was higher than these prodigies, it was a hundred times harder to kill them than to defeat them.","Just like Chu Yunfan, he had faced danger many times. Even the demons had personally attacked him, but in the end, he had still escaped. The others might not have as many trump cards as Chu Yunfan, but they were still much stronger than ordinary experts of the same level. Therefore, many people felt that Chu Yunfan was just boasting.","“How dare you insult my clan! There will be no place for you in this world!” The old butler was furious and flew into a rage.","He swept out a demonic claw, and it was so dense that it dyed the sky black. It headed straight toward Chu Yunfan.","“Oh? So you’re an old demon.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The butler had not made a move earlier, so no one knew what martial arts he cultivated. But now, everything was exposed. This man was actually an old demon who had cultivated demonic techniques for god knows how many years.","Everyone outside the Li Mansion was shocked. They knew that with the Li clan’s status, they would not cultivate demonic experts. After all, the demons had invaded the world many times and were the greatest enemy of all living beings. Once they were discovered, it would definitely be a shocking case.","Then there was only one possibility. This butler was a demon in the demonic path. After being subdued by the Li clan, he obediently became the butler of the Li clan.","Such a grand display was indeed huge. Only in a place like Grand Xia, where rivers flowed into the sea, could one subdue a Creator demon for their own use.","Before the attack landed, Chu Yunfan waved the staff in his hand. In an instant, the entire mansion began to shake. With a sweep of the staff, the huge demonic claw exploded in the air, and blood splattered.","“Aaaagggghh!” the butler screamed and retreated.","One of the butler’s hands was blown off, and blood flowed out. His eyes flickered with shock. His cultivation was definitely not weak. He had entered the Creation Stage for many years, but after submitting to the Li clan, his cultivation was restricted and he could not advance further. Even so, he was definitely not weak.","However, Chu Yunfan had smashed his hand into pieces.","His eyes flickered with a venomous gaze that was incomparably fierce. He revealed his past ferocious demon appearance.","Smack!","However, before the butler could react, Chu Yunfan raised his arm again and slapped him again, knocking him to the ground. With a loud slap and a miserable cry, the old butler was slapped to the ground. Countless bones in his body were broken, interrupting the divine power he was condensing. The strength of the Creation Stage that he possessed seemed to have lost its effect in an instant when facing Chu Yunfan. It was completely useless.","A single slap had scattered his cultivation.","“Don’t be arrogant. When His Grace returns, he will kill you with one hand!” The old butler gritted his teeth and looked at Chu Yunfan with a vicious gaze. He wanted to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","The butler didn’t know where this damn guy, who didn’t fear the prestige of the Li clan, came from. He even said that he came for Li Qianyuan. This sudden change made him a little flustered, but he also looked at Chu Yunfan with incomparable hatred.","“Tell me, where did you hide the items?” Chu Yunfan sneered and stomped down, causing the butler’s chest to collapse.","Blood splattered out. Chu Yunfan deliberately avoided the butler’s vital points, causing him to be seriously injured but not trampled to death. After all, there was still a use for him to stay alive.","Before Chu Yunfan made his move, he had already sealed the entire Li Mansion with a barrier. It was impossible for anyone to escape.","Spurt!","The butler spat out a mouthful of blood. Countless bones in his body were broken, and he screamed continuously."]},{"number":1908,"title":"Chapter 1908 The Grievance of the Li Mansion","paragraphs":["1908 The Grievance of the Li Mansion","If it was just a broken bone, this old demon’s willpower, he wouldn’t even let out a grunt. However, Chu Yunfan’s kick penetrated his divine power and turned it into a terrifying attack that surged into his body, almost tearing his soul apart. That was why this old demon couldn’t take it and screamed.","Some people gasped when they saw this scene. They looked at Chu Yunfan as if they had seen a ghost. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed that someone could do this.","With the butler’s strength, he was indeed an expert in the Creation Stage. He thought that he could fight with Chu Yunfan and at least retreat while fighting. Who knew that he would be defeated so badly from the get go?","Chu Yunfan crushed the butler with his indisputable strength. Even now, what really frightened many people was that they still didn’t know what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had reached. This was because no one could make Chu Yunfan fight with all his strength at the moment. Chu Yunfan could not even be a little serious.","“He dared to block the Li Mansion and attack them. I’m afraid that even if he wants to escape after this, he will inevitably face the Li clan’s relentless pursuit.”","“That’s right. If I were from the Li clan, I wouldn’t be able to endure such blatant humiliation. This man clearly has no respect for the Li clan.”","“He can’t really rob the Li clan of all their wealth, right?”","“The Li clan’s power isn’t limited to just this. They’re a military aristocratic family in Grand Xia and have a deep foundation. Otherwise, they would not have been able to cultivate a character like Li Qianyuan.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, and they all thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy. Although this wealth was shocking and made everyone drool, they knew they would not be able to handle it.","After this battle, no matter who won or lost, the Li clan would definitely chase after Chu Yunfan like crazy. Although the Eastern Sea was huge, if the Li clan desperately searched for him, it would not be so easy to escape.","“Didn’t you hear what he said? He’s here to target Li Qianyuan. I think he has some old grudge against Li Qianyuan. He’s clearly here for revenge.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. This scene was explosive. More and more divine wills gathered over. In this city, there was only a difference in cultivation level, but there was no fundamental difference. Everyone was a martial artist. They didn’t even need to get close to see it with their own eyes.","Many people in the Li Mansion clenched their fists. When had their Li clan ever been so aggrieved? The impossible had happened.","These men had always been respected in Grand Xia. As Li Qianyuan’s family guards and followers, they were all awe-inspiring. Even court officials had to be wary of them. They were bullies, and no one had ever dared to block the door and slap their faces like this.","“Why hasn’t His Grace returned yet? When His Grace returns, I will request for that man to be skinned alive!”","“We can’t get in touch with His Grace right now. The entire mansion has been sealed off by a barrier. Unless we can break it, we can’t get the word out,” someone said in frustration.","They had tried to break the barrier earlier, but they couldn’t. Otherwise, word would’ve been sent out long ago.","“But now that such a big thing has happened here, the other factions of the Li clan hidden in the city will surely spread the news. It won’t be long before His Grace returns. At that time, that man will be dead!”","Many people did not dare to step forward. They only dared to look at Chu Yunfan angrily, wishing they could tear him into pieces. They all wished that Chu Yunfan would continue to delay. When Li Qianyuan got back, he would meet him and kill this hateful guy.","This one person dared to provoke the Li clan, making them feel humiliated. However, Chu Yunfan seemed to understand what they were thinking. Seeing that the butler refused to say anything, he simply stepped on the butler’s head and crushed it, causing the butler to die on the spot. Then, he picked up the butler’s corpse and went straight into the depths of the Li Mansion.","As Chu Yunfan moved forward, his divine will spread out. The entire Li Mansion—inside and outside—came into his mind’s eye. Soon, he had determined the location of the Li Mansion treasury.","A man would not be rich without a windfall, and a horse would not be fat without grass at night.","“You overestimate yourself! You’re courting death!”","Suddenly, a few divine wills swept out from the depths of the Li Mansion. Following this roar, four figures appeared before Chu Yunfan.","The four of them were like iron towers, blocking Chu Yunfan’s path. Chu Yunfan was two meters tall after transforming, but in front of these four, he was still like a child. These four people were at least three meters tall.","The four surrounded Chu Yunfan and formed a small array. Chu Yunfan instantly felt a pressure pressing down on him. The array formation began to operate with these four people as the core.","‘The Minor Four Symbols Formation.’ Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at the four.","Their strength was even above that of the butler. They were at the third Creation Stage. The four of them joined forces to form a battle formation called the Minor Four Symbols Formation. With this battle formation as a link, the four of them could gather their combat strength into one.","No matter which direction they broke out from or which direction they attacked from, they would face the combined attack of the four of them. Not to mention those whose cultivation levels were far inferior to these four, even if their cultivation levels were similar, they would not be able to escape from this Minor Four Symbols Formation.","The only way was to break the formation with absolute strength. The simpler the formation, the sturdier it was, and the smaller the flaw, making it harder to deal with.","“Do you want to surrender, or do you want us to break your limbs before capturing you?” One of them, a middle-aged man who looked like an iron tower, looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his eyes filled with unimaginable killing intent."]},{"number":1909,"title":"Chapter 1909 They Can’t Even Take a Single Blow","paragraphs":["1909 They Can’t Even Take a Single Blow","“Why do those four look exactly the same?” someone wondered out loud after noticing that these four tower-like burly men looked similar to one another.","Quadruplets weren’t a shocking thing. After all, although rare, they weren’t unheard of. What truly shocked them was that these quadruplets had each cultivated to the Creation Stage. That was the rare part.","“I remember now. I’ve heard of these four warriors under Li Qianyuan. It’s said that these quadruplets were hunted by a strong enemy in their early years. Later, they were saved by Li Qianyuan, so they joined Li Qianyuan and became his underlings.”","“Yes, I’ve heard of the four warriors too, but after they joined Li Qianyuan, they rarely fought. I didn’t expect to see them here.”","“I’m afraid this person won’t have an easy time. The strength these four warriors is extremely terrifying. Moreover, the four of them know a joint attack formation. Even someone with higher cultivation than them might not be able to do anything to them.”","Many people in the city discussed animatedly. They had some inkling of who these four warriors were, but they didn’t know much.","“Kill him. Otherwise, when Qianyuan gets back, you won’t have a good ending,” a young man said as he strode out from inside. He was dressed in a luxurious robe and looked outstanding.","A seventh-level Cosmic!","Although this youth was still far from being able to enter the prodigy list, among his peers, he was undoubtedly the best among the best.","The four warriors glanced at the young man and ignored him. With their arrogance, this young man couldn’t command them. This young man may be Li Qianyuan’s cousin, but he and Li Qianyuan were still worlds apart. If Li Qianyuan had not saved them, they would not have followed him.","“Zhang Hao, we don’t answer to you,” the eldest of the four warriors said as he glanced at the youth. As a Creation Stage giant, he naturally had his pride.","When the young man named Zhang Hao heard this, a sinister look flashed through his eyes. However, he quickly turned his gaze to Chu Yunfan.","“Attack!”","After a loud shout, the four warriors attacked at the same time. The Minor Four Symbols Formation was activated. Chu Yunfan instantly felt a wave of pressure that covered the sky and earth.","The four warriors were all at the third level of the Creation Stage. In terms of strength, they were enough to look down on all the heroes, let alone when they joined forces. Then, four large hands that were like praying mats suddenly slapped out four large palm prints and slapped down on Chu Yunfan from all directions.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move an inch. His entire body was like an unmoving statue, completely ignoring the slaps that were coming down.","Boom!","The place where Chu Yunfan was standing was blasted into a mushroom cloud. The four warriors attacked and shattered the vacuum. They had amazing power.","However, when everyone’s divine will swept over, they found that Chu Yunfan, who was in the mushroom cloud, had not moved. Even the corner of his clothes had not moved. His divine power formed a protective barrier around him.","The attacks of the four warriors were unable to shake Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","“Four Warriors? You’re nothing. It’s my turn next!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","These four warriors were indeed strong. In addition to the Minor Four Symbols Formation that they had set up together, it could be said that an ordinary third-level Creator would be severely injured or even killed in one strike.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His strength had surpassed the limits that ordinary people could understand. His combat strength had surpassed the limit of the third level of the Creation Stage and was infinitely close to the fourth level.","This kind of attack could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan brandished the staff in his hand, and it was as if he was waving the wind and clouds. A terrifying tide swept out, turning into a shocking staff light that smashed forward.","“Oh no!”","The expert who was standing in front of Chu Yunfan felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave. A chill ran down his spine. This feeling was as terrifying as facing a primordial beast.","“How is he so terrifying?!” He did not know why he felt so terrified. “Join hands and fight it out!”","The man mobilized the power of the Minor Four Symbols Formation. In front of him, layers of barriers surged up, turning from an offensive barrier to a defensive barrier.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan smashed down with the staff. The moment the staff fell, the array was instantly shattered. The power of the Minor Four Symbols Formation was shattered by the staff, and a golden tide erupted.","Boom!","The entire array exploded, and the staff smashed down.","Bam!","The staff fell, hitting one of the four warriors and sending him flying. Everyone saw the chest of this expert explode, and blood spurted out. No one knew how many of his bones were broken, and his internal organs had been smashed into pieces.","He died tragically!","“Fourth Brother!”","The remaining three of the four warriors were instantly filled with grief and indignation. The four of them were quadruplets. They had embarked on the path of cultivation together and entered the Creation Stage together. They had been together for more than a hundred years and had a deep relationship. Now that they saw their fourth brother die in front of them, their eyes widened as if they were about to cry blood.","“He couldn’t even withstand a single blow.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","To ordinary people, the four warriors were very strong, but to him, they were nothing. Without the protection of the Minor Four Symbols Formation, these people were simply unable to withstand a single blow from him.","“Kill him and avenge Fourth Brother!”","Tears welled up in the eyes of the remaining three warriors as they exploded forth. A terrifying aura filled the entire mansion. The three of them didn’t even stop to think as they pounced on Chu Yunfan. They were like fierce tigers descending the mountain, each of them blasting out their greatest attacks.","Even though they didn’t have the Minor Four Symbols Formation, the three of them had formed the Minor Three Talents Formation after their years of tacit understanding, and it brought their strengths to the extreme.","Boom!","However, in the next moment, just like before, Chu Yunfan’s staff swept out. Wherever it passed, the array was torn apart and turned into nothingness.","Bam!","One of the warriors was hit by Chu Yunfan’s strike, and he was sent flying. He fell to the ground and tried to struggle, but it was useless. After struggling for a while, his body exploded. It turned out that Chu Yunfan’s strike had covered his body with cracks, like a spider web. It looked extremely terrifying.","Another of the four warriors had died, and it was just one strike!"]},{"number":1910,"title":"Chapter 1910 The Four Warriors Are Destroyed, Someone Is Scared to Death","paragraphs":["1910 The Four Warriors Are Destroyed, Someone Is Scared to Death","“Another one was killed... That’s just too fast!”","Many people gulped. They were still immersed in the shock of Chu Yunfan killing one of the Four Warriors. But before they could even catch their breath, Chu Yunfan had smashed another one to death with lightning speed.","This speed was too fast, so fast that it made them feel shocked!","Before they could even react, two of the four famous warriors were already dead. They were no match for Chu Yunfan. The difference in strength between the two sides was clear at a glance.","“Who is this person? Send someone to investigate now. Who is this guy?”","“Dig out this person’s information immediately and report back to me!”","“This person is not on good terms with the Li clan. I think we can rope him in. Maybe we can even make use of him.”","For a moment, the major forces in the city were in an uproar. Many people’s first reaction was to find out Chu Yunfan’s background. Originally, they looked down on him. They only thought that he was a person who didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth. There were many such people in the Eastern Sea, and they quickly disappeared.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan should be about the same. Who would have thought that the strength that he displayed would make them tremble in fear? It had far exceeded the standard of an ordinary Creator.","With such a person of unknown origin, if they were not careful, they might even hurt themselves. They had no choice but to care.","At this moment, the remaining two warriors of the Li Mansion were furious. They were not afraid. On the contrary, in their anger, they could not care less. In a flash, they charged at Chu Yunfan. The death of their two brothers had driven them completely insane.","However, their outcome was no different from the other two. After the death of the two Four Warriors, the strength that the two of them could display had plummeted greatly.","“You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan raised his arm and threw a slap.","One of the Four Warriors was hit, and his head exploded. Blood and white brain matter splattered everywhere.","Crushing? What was crushing? This was crushing!","Chu Yunfan’s strength was far beyond their imagination.","At this time, the last of the Four Warriors had no time to care about anything else. He finally managed to land a full-powered attack on Chu Yunfan’s mountain. When his saber slashed at Chu Yunfan’s body, it produced a sound of metal clashing. The collision of metal and metal sent out dazzling sparks.","However, he was unable to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","“How is that possible? What king-level physique do you have?” the last warrior was dumbstruck.","If Chu Yunfan was wearing inner armor or using a defensive magic treasure to defend himself, it would be fine. However, he was able to block his saber with just the defense of his body.","What kind of terrifying physique was this? He immediately thought of the legendary king-level physiques, and it had to be one that specialized in body cultivation to be able to achieve such a level.","He didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had two special physiques, both of which far surpassed king-level physiques. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to kill Creators as easily as killing an ant.","“The dead people don’t need to know so much!” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look and slapped him.","Bam!","Before this expert could even react, Chu Yunfan slapped him on the head. His entire head flew away like a ball, falling from his neck and rolling across the ground. The warrior’s towering body fell to the ground, and he died instantly. The eyes on his head were still filled with disbelief as if he had seen the most unbelievable thing. He was no match for Chu Yunfan at all.","When he faced Chu Yunfan, he was so vulnerable. The two of them were not on the same level.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, in less than ten breaths, the Four Warriors who had blocked Chu Yunfan’s way had been slaughtered. The experts of the major forces outside the city were dumbfounded by this scene. Chu Yunfan’s strength was too shocking. It could even be called a brutal fighting style.","What fierce battle?","It didn’t exist.","To Chu Yunfan, the famous Four Great Generals were nothing. He said he was going to sweep them all and sweep them all he did!","I said I’m going to slap your face, so I’m going to slap your face.","It was so amazing!","At this moment, everyone in the Li Mansion was silent. Before this, they were all confident that this guy who dared to enter the tiger’s den would definitely die. As long as they could delay Chu Yunfan, by the time the marquis returned, this person would definitely be dead.","However, the result was beyond their expectations. They thought that either the butler or the Four Warriors could stop Chu Yunfan, but they were so weak when facing him.","It was just a simple attack, but it was a sweep!","The one who was even more dumbfounded was the young man in the luxurious robe, Zhang Hao. At this time, he was no longer arrogant. He dared to speak earlier because he was Li Qianyuan’s cousin. In addition, he thought that Chu Yunfan was definitely not a match for the Four Warriors.","He came out to make his presence known, but who would have thought that he would see the Four Warriors being swept clean by Chu Yunfan’s lightning-like power?","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over Zhang Hao, who collapsed. He had never thought that he was so close to death. With his strength, even if he could not compare to the prodigies on the prodigy list, he was still an outstanding person among his peers. It was also very likely that he would enter the Creation Stage in the future. He had always been the one who made others feel the taste of death. He had never thought that one day, everything would be the opposite. He had already reached the edge of death.","“Were you the one who said you wanted to kill me?” Chu Yunfan tilted his head and revealed a bright smile.","In Zhang Hao’s eyes, this sunny smile was like a devil’s smile. Even a devil could not kill as efficiently as Chu Yunfan. He was so scared that he almost peed his pants.","He had once thought that he was not afraid of death and that he could face death with ease. However, reality told him that he had overestimated himself. The reason why he had such a misunderstanding in the past was purely because no one had forced him to death.","At this moment, Zhang Hao truly felt what it meant to be like falling into an ice cave, to be a lamb waiting for slaughter.","Instantly, he made a decision."]},{"number":1911,"title":"Chapter 1911 He Isn’t Human, He’s a Monster!","paragraphs":["1911 He Isn’t Human, He’s a Monster!","Zhang Hao took a deep breath, looking righteous. Just as Chu Yunfan thought he was going to fight back, Zhang Hao suddenly knelt down.","Everyone was deceived, especially Li Qianyuan’s followers, who watched this scene with their mouths agape. Then, they were furious. Zhang Hao usually relied on his status as Li Qianyuan’s cousin and did many things to bully others. They thought that he was at least a tough nut to crack. Who knew that in the face of Chu Yunfan’s power, he would kneel down to Chu Yunfan?","Zhang Hao could feel those disdainful gazes, but at this moment, he only had one feeling in his heart. ‘You people know nothing.’","What backbone? What tough bones? Was it more important than being alive?","Staying alive was the most important thing!","Zhang Hao tried his best to squeeze out a charming smile.","“Spirit stones? If I kill you, those stones will still be mine!” Chu Yunfan sneered and pointed his staff at Zhang Hao. However, a playful smile appeared on his face.","“I-I will lead the way, Big Brother. I know where the treasury is,” Zhang Hao quickly said, looking like a brave guide.","“You’re a traitor, Zhang Hao!”","“Zhang Hao, are you worthy of His Grace treating you so well?”","“What a traitor!”","Immediately, the Li clan erupted into a series of curses. Although they were afraid of angering Chu Yunfan, they couldn’t care less at this time.","Zhang Hao ignored these curses. Surviving was the most important thing. With the strength of his family, he could amass these resources again. However, if he lost his life, it would really be gone.","His life was not as cheap and worthless as those lowly people.","“I already know where the treasury is. I don’t need you to lead the way. Give me another reason not to kill you.” Chu Yunfan grinned, revealing his neat, white teeth.","However, in Zhang Hao’s eyes, this made Chu Yunfan look even more terrifying. He didn’t doubt that if he couldn’t give a reason, Chu Yunfan would smash his head.","“I-I know that Li Qianyuan has a secret treasury. There’s a great medicine in it, which he used to breakthrough. You’re interested in that, right, Big Brother?” Zhang Hao revealed a fawning smile.","“Traitor! How dare you!”","“How dare you!”","Everyone in the Li Mansion was cursing at Zhang Hao’s shamelessness. They were all Li Qianyuan’s followers, so they naturally knew how much effort Li Qianyuan had put in to get these herbs, but now Zhang Hao was giving them up.","Everyone in the Li Mansion almost fainted from anger. They couldn’t help but curse. They had seen shameless people, but they had never seen such shameless people. So when someone came to rob them, they had to pretend that they didn’t see it and obediently hand over their treasures?","“That’s right, that’s right. They don’t know what’s good for them at all!” Zhang Hao nodded.","His face showed some heartfelt approval. In his opinion, these people did not know what was good for them. Was the life of the dignified young master of the Zhang clan not as valuable as this medicinal herb? What a joke! Was he supposed to sacrifice his life to keep Li Qianyuan’s secret? Although he was not as important as Li Qianyuan, he was still a famous genius youth. Why should he sacrifice his life to help Li Qianyuan?","In fact, he even began to hope that Chu Yunfan would teach these people a lesson.","“That’s right. You see, when I went out this morning, a blind Taoist priest suddenly stopped in front of me. He read my fortune and said that there was a treasure in your house. It’s fated with me and should be mine. As the saying goes, the treasures in the world belong to the virtuous. Look at me. I like to convince people with virtue and don’t like to fight. Doesn’t that fulfill the condition of a virtuous person? It means that this treasure is prepared for me.”","Chu Yunfan nodded and patted Zhang Hao’s shoulder. His face was full of righteousness as if he was really doing something righteous.","‘Shameless!’","Everyone in the Li Mansion had this thought. However, they gritted their teeth and didn’t dare to utter this word. What kind of joke was this? This guy in front of them had the ability to wipe out the entire Li clan in an extremely short time. If Chu Yunfan had such an idea, their greatest expectation would be that Li Qianyuan would not be able to react in time. They dared to bare their teeth at Zhang Hao, but they did not dare to do the same to Chu Yunfan.","But even under Chu Yunfan’s intimidation, they still couldn’t help but roll their eyes.","Conquering people with virtue? Don’t like to fight? Then how did the corpses all over the ground come about? Could it be that these people couldn’t take it anymore and committed suicide collectively?","At the thought of this, everyone was powerless to complain. They felt that they had seen too many shameless people in their lives, but they were afraid that they were not even half as obsessed with martial arts as this guy.","Many people wanted to go up and wipe down his bright smiling face to see what material it was made of to be so thick-skinned.","Chu Yunfan grinned and ignored the resentment of the people in the Li Mansion. He went straight in the direction of the treasury. Soon, a huge treasury appeared before Chu Yunfan in the depths of the Li Mansion. However, a huge door blocked his way.","“I’ll help you find the key, Big Brother.” Zhang Hao rolled his eyes and immediately thought of an idea.","“There’s no need.” Chu Yunfan swept out with his staff and smashed at the door.","Bam!","The door before Chu Yunfan collapsed with a loud bang.","Zhang Hao’s mouth hung wide open. He knew how powerful this door was. Even a Creator could not smash it open. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would actually smash it open with one hand?","‘How strong is he? He isn’t a human at all. He’s a monster!’"]},{"number":1912,"title":"Chapter 1912 Plundering the Li Clan’s Wealth","paragraphs":["1912 Plundering the Li Clan’s Wealth","The Li Masion treasury had naturally been specially reinforced. Even a Creator would find it extremely difficult to break through.","Who knew that it would be smashed open by Chu Yunfan’s staff? How much strength did he have to use to do that?","Zhang Hao’s expression froze. He was almost scared to death!","At the same time, he knew that he was targeted by a monster. This terrifying monster was different from ordinary people. It could be seen from the way he slaughtered the Four Warriors with a raise of his hand.","Although Zhang Hao was sheltered, he was not stupid. Otherwise, he would not have been able to cultivate to this stage. In the future, he might even have the chance to enter the Creation Stage.","The indifference in Chu Yunfan’s expression was something he had never seen before. He had killed people before, and many experts had died in his hands. However, he could never slaughter experts like ants like Chu Yunfan had.","This represented another level. The heart was like a boulder and would not be easily moved by external objects. Once this kind of person decided on something, they would be determined to do it.","Zhang Hao had seen such a person before, and it was his cousin, Li Qianyuan. Now there was another one. He felt that Chu Yunfan’s determination was even stronger than Li Qianyuan’s.","Chu Yunfan was even more detached than Li Qianyuan. Li Qianyuan would be dragged down by the secular world, but Chu Yunfan gave Zhang Hao a sense of detachment.","Just as Chu Yunfan smashed down the door, Zhang Hao thought of many things. However, his face twisted as he realized that Chu Yunfan was not to be trifled with. It would be difficult to take revenge on such a person in the future.","With the vastness of the Eastern Sea, if Chu Yunfan really wanted to hide, it would be very difficult for them to find him. Not to mention, with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, even the Li clan and the Zhang clan, who had been military families for generations, could not deal with Chu Yunfan.","Although there were many Creators, it was because the level of the circle they were in was high enough. If they were evenly distributed, there might not even be one Creator among ten million people.","How could such an expert be so easily produced? Moreover, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, ordinary Creators could not do anything to him. Zhang Hao immediately realized that it would not be easy for Li Qianyuan to take revenge.","After opening the treasury, Chu Yunfan saw a vast world inside. It was even larger than the entire Li Mansion, but it was contained in a treasury that didn’t look too big.","In the distance, the mid-grade spirit stones were piled up like mountains, separated by many barriers. There were actually 300 million mid-grade spirit stones. This was because the Li Mansion had bought many rare heavenly and earthly treasures. Otherwise, the amount of spirit stones would be even higher.","The Li clan’s foundation was indeed extraordinary, and this was only a part of the Li clan’s wealth. It was used to carry out operations in the Eastern Sea and could be transported over at any time. Even for Chu Yunfan, who spent money like water and treated wealth like dirt, this was a huge sum of money that could not be taken lightly.","In addition, there were many precious medicinal herbs, many of which were specialties of the Eastern Sea and could not be found in Grand Xia. Chu Yunfan glanced at them and estimated that they were worth at least 500 million mid-grade spirit stones. It could be said to be an astronomical amount of wealth. Even if a Creator suddenly obtained it, they would become rich overnight.","However, Chu Yunfan only glanced at them. Although most of the herbs were precious, they were not very important to him. They were not directly useful to him. No matter how valuable they were, they were nothing in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","He would keep only some of the supplementary ingredients for pills that he had planned to make. He would hand over the rest to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion to handle.","Chu Yunfan was much more far-sighted than ordinary people when it came to planning his own martial arts. When he was in the Cosmos Stage, he had been planning his path to the Creation Stage. After entering the Creation Stage, he had a plan for his cultivation path to reach a higher level.","This was inconceivable to ordinary people because even if they knew what the higher levels looked like, they could only know. They could not understand, let alone plan their path under those circumstances. It was even impossible for senior teachers with higher cultivation to plan for their students. Most people could only take it one step at a time. The experience of senior experts could only be used as a reference.","After cultivating to the Cosmos Stage, one would basically walk on a completely different path. The further one progressed, the greater the difference. It was impossible for them to be exactly the same.","Therefore, they could only use the experience of their predecessors as a reference and explore it step by step. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and had his own shocking understanding of the Creation Stage and even higher levels.","It could even be said that he knew better than any other expert in the world that he didn’t need to take one step at a time. Instead, he could take one step at a time and plan ten steps ahead. The only thing that he couldn’t comprehend was the level that even the Alchemy Emperor couldn’t reach back then.","It was precisely because he had a comprehensive plan for the future that he knew at a glance which materials were useful to him and which were useless. Ninety-nine percent of them were useless, and most of them were for the Cosmos Stage or even the Abstract Stage. He had no use for these, and he would give them to the External Army.","The harvest this time was huge. It was enough for Chu Yunfan to ripen another Brahma Fruit. He took a look around and waved his hand, putting all the spirit stones and treasures into the Mountain River Diagram.","Seeing this scene, many people in the Li Mansion widened their eyes, but they did not dare to step forward. This was the Li clan’s accumulation over the years. Although it was only a part of the Li clan’s wealth, it still made their hearts ache when Chu Yunfan snatched it away.","“Why hasn’t Lord His Grace returned yet?” someone whispered. His eyes were a little lost, but he didn’t dare to stop Chu Yunfan. He could only hope that Li Qianyuan would do it.","The people around Chu Yunfan looked at him with helplessness in their eyes. They knew that it was too difficult for Li Qianyuan to come back in time. After all, the time was too short.","Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough speed was too fast. They originally thought that the Four Warriors would be able to kill Chu Yunfan, but they couldn’t even delay him and were all killed.","According to the speed of the news, even if the people of the Li clan in the city spread the news at the first moment, Li Qianyuan probably hadn’t received the news yet.","The time was too short!"]},{"number":1913,"title":"Chapter 1913 Divine Flame Fruit","paragraphs":["1913 Divine Flame Fruit","Before they came, the person in charge of the Li clan’s planning had already thought of this. The Li clan was going to interfere in the interests of the Eastern Sea, so it was impossible for them not to be viewed with hostility. However, in their eyes, they would only encounter some setbacks. It was not a big deal.","With the strength of the Li clan, although they couldn’t be compared to the most terrifying behemoths, they had the backing of Grand Xia. The power they could borrow was extremely terrifying.","There were only a few forces in the Eastern Sea that had the strength to easily wipe out the Li clan. These people would not personally take action because of this matter. After all, that would be falling out with the Li clan and would not rest until one of them died.","Even if the Li clan was not a local master of the Eastern Sea, they had a strong influence in the Eastern Sea Fleet. It was too easy to find trouble with a certain force in the Eastern Sea. Even if they hid in the deep sea, they would not be able to escape.","As for those itinerant cultivators, based on the Li clan’s confidence, itinerant cultivators were not enough to shake the Li clan’s foundation. There were several Creators in the mansion. Even a Creator could establish a sect in the Eastern Sea, let alone so many.","Such strength was not very strong, but it was not a problem to support Li Qianyuan and the others. Who would have thought that they would encounter a freak like Chu Yunfan who could not be calculated by common sense? Ordinary people were afraid of the Li clan’s reputation, but Chu Yunfan was not afraid. At the same time, he had the strength to uproot the Li clan’s stronghold.","There was too much wealth in this treasury. Even with Chu Yunfan’s strength, it took him a full 15 minutes to plunder everything, leaving nothing behind. During this process, the entire Li clan was as silent as cicadas in winter. Even the experts of the major forces outside the city were silent.","What was a strong slap in the face? This was a strong slap in the face.","It was a slap to the Li clan’s face!","At this point, they could see that Chu Yunfan must have some grudge with the Li clan or Li Qianyuan. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have come to their door and slapped them in the face.","The Li clan was like a ferocious dragon crossing the river. They wanted to establish their reputation in Donghai so that no one would dare to look down on them. Now that their faces were swollen, how could they still have the ability to establish their prestige?","“The Li clan will probably go crazy after this.”","“But the Eastern Sea is huge. If he’s determined to hide, the Li clan might not be able to find him.”","Someone chuckled. He didn’t think that the Li clan would win. After all, the Li clan was very strong and had many experts. However, judging from Chu Yunfan’s strength, even ordinary Creators wouldn’t be able to find him. No matter how many experts the Li clan had, would they be able to come out in full force?","And so what if they came out in full force? In the face of the vast and boundless Eastern Sea, their small number of people was useless. They were like clay oxen entering the sea and would soon disappear without a trace. This would only be possible if they mobilized the entire power of Grand Xia to serve them.","“All right, where’s the sacred herb you mentioned earlier?” Chu Yunfan looked at Zhang Hao.","“I...” Zhang Hao’s expression was bitter.","It was finally his turn. He had hoped that Chu Yunfan would be satisfied after emptying the treasury, but who knew that Chu Yunfan did not have any intention of being satisfied and even wanted the sacred herbs he had mentioned.","This was too stifling. When had he ever been so stifled?","Smack!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at Zhang Hao and slapped him, causing his face to swell.","“Hurry up and tell me. Stop wasting my time because it’s useless. Even if Li Qianyuan comes back now, I have enough time to destroy the entire Li clan before leaving.”","Chu Yunfan grinned and looked at the Li Mansion. He had seen through the thoughts of these people in the Li Mansion. They wanted to delay him and wait for Li Qianyuan to come back.","However, he didn’t care much about it. He was completely different from the first time he fought with Li Qianyuan. Back then , he could only run for his life when he faced Li Qianyuan. But now he was confident that he could kill Li Qianyuan.","The only thing that troubled him was the experts around Li Qianyuan. He had protectors and followers, and there were even people at the peak of the Creation Stage. Before Chu Yunfan attacked, he had already observed this. Although he was fearless, he was not a reckless person.","Although Chu Yunfan was confident that he could protect himself and escape unscathed, it would still be very troublesome for him to be pestered by such people.","With his current strength, it was already shocking that he could do this. Chu Yunfan was confident that if he was given a few more years, it would not be difficult for him to kill these people. In terms of cultivation speed, he had never been afraid. It was precisely because he was confident enough that he was not afraid though he had seen through their thoughts.","Zhang Hao had no choice but to perform a series of complicated seals under Chu Yunfan’s threat. In the air above the treasury, a small door appeared. Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. He didn’t let Zhang Hao live in vain. Unless someone opened this secret vault, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, he wouldn’t have found the door unless his realm had surpassed the Creation Stage. People at that stage had a certain level of perception toward space and could sense the location of the hidden vault door.","Under Zhang Hao’s control, the door of this small vault slowly opened. In this small vault, a sacred herb was sealed in a barrier, emitting waves of dazzling light. All the medicinal fragrance was locked in the barrier. This sacred medicine was like a ball of flame, almost igniting the air.","‘It’s the Divine Flame Fruit!’ Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he saw the herb.","Others might not recognize the Divine Flame Fruit, but for Chu Yunfan who had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, there was no heavenly treasure in the world that he could not recognize.","No wonder Li Qianyuan had place this sacred herb in this secret vault. The function of the Divine Flame Fruit was not to heal wounds, nor could it directly improve cultivation or increase power.","The Divine Flame Fruit contained a type of pure flame energy. Once consumed, it could increase one’s affinity with fire energy and raise one’s comprehend fire-type divine abilities.","Of course, for an expert like Chu Yunfan, just adding a divine power was not a big deal. The real key was that the Divine Flame Fruit could refine the human body, allowing one to further expel impurities and make one’s body purer. This was the foundation for increasing a martial artist’s cultivation."]},{"number":1914,"title":"Chapter 1914 First Beat Them Into Submission, Then Use Virtue to Conquer Them!","paragraphs":["1914 First Beat Them Into Submission, Then Use Virtue to Conquer Them!","The path of cultivation was a sea of bitterness, and the physical body was the boat to cross to the other shore. The stronger the physical body, the greater the possibility of reaching the other shore. The body was the foundation of all cultivation. Whether it was martial arts or divine arts, without exception, the body was the foundation.","This was because it involved the transformation of the source of life. However, this Divine Flame Fruit was different. It could expel the impurities in the human body.","At Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level, the impurities in his body were very few. It could be said that they were almost negligible, but this made it even more difficult to eliminate them. If he wanted to eliminate them by normal means, he would need to cultivate for a long time. But with the Divine Flame Fruit, everything would be fast.","The less impurities in the body, the purer it was, and the higher the level of the body’s energy, the easier it would be for him to break through, and the more powerful his cultivation would be. Just this effect alone was priceless. This Divine Flame Fruit could save him at least a few years or even ten years of secluded cultivation.","On top of that, he would be able to produce fire-type divine abilties. To others, it might just be an additional ability, but to Chu Yunfan, who had fused with a part of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s life essence, it was extremely compatible.","After swallowing this Divine Flame Fruit, his affinity with fire would increase further. It allow him to display lightning and fire divine abilities. It was equivalent to adding another top physique. At that time, with three top physiques, the Imperial Physique, the Thunderclap Physique, and the Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physique, Chu Yunfan’s strength would have a world-shaking change. The benefits it provided to him were simply unimaginable.","The path of cultivation was about talent. Physical talent was also talent. Some people were very weak and short. These people might not be able to compare to experts who were two meters tall and had cultivated for several months.","The stronger one’s talent, the smoother one’s cultivation path would be. This was like watching the heavens reward them with food. Now, Chu Yunfan had gained another top-notch talent, which was equivalent to the benefits of reincarnating.","The environment in which the Divine Flame Fruit was born was very harsh. Only in extremely hot places with boiling spirit energy could this fruit grow. Moreover, it would take at least a thousand years for it to mature.","This was a previous item that the Li clan had painstakingly found for Li Qianyuan. If it was used by Li Qianyuan, at least several years of hard work would be saved. He himself was already far ahead of many geniuses on the prodigy list. With the help of the Divine Flame Fruit, others would not be able to catch up. This was a whole scheme to help Li Qianyuan reach the top in a short time. Unfortunately, it was interrupted by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could guess that why Li Qianyuan didn’t consume the fruit now was that he planned to wait until he reached the peak of the Creation Stage and then take it to eliminate the remaining impurities in his body and complete the transformation of his life essence. At that time, wanting to break through to the next realm would be at least ten times easier and the probability of breaking through and the time required would be greatly reduced.","Thinking of this, even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder. A behemoth like the Li clan was indeed much more powerful than ordinary people when it came to helping a person break through.","Even if the two of them had similar talents, one was a itinerant cultivator and the other was a direct descendent of a large faction. The speed of cultivation and the final achievements of the two sides might be heaven and earth.","For those itinerant cultivators, in order to obtain a suitable medicinal herb and find a suitable martial art inheritance, they would need to travel through mountains and rivers for several years.","However, for the descendants of the aristocratic families, someone had already prepared these for them. They could use them directly when they reached the proper stage. That was why their cultivation could advance by leaps and bounds in a short time.","Their speed was not something that ordinary geniuses could compare to, because an entire faction’s resources was used to feed this genius. When this prodigy rose to prominence, he would continue to lead the clan. The long-term prosperity of the faction was a mutually dependent relationship.","“Heh heh, the Li clan is so thoughtful. They know that I’m lacking the Divine Flame Fruit, so they sent it over to me!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","In the blink of an eye, he reached out and shattered the barrier around the fruit. He then grabbed it and put it into the Mountain River Diagram.","“Y-You’re evil!. You’re really going to take it?” Zhang Hao’s voice was trembling, and he was on the verge of tears.","He had betrayed Li Qianyuan to save his life, but now it seemed that his life was out of danger. Almost immediately, his fear of Li Qianyuan flooded his mind. He thought about how furious Li Qianyuan would be when he came back and saw this scene.","At this moment, he was already extremely regretful. Why did he have to act so cool? If he hadn’t come out to make his presence known, he wouldn’t have been forced to this point. He knew that his cousin Li Qianyuan valued the Divine Flame Fruit, which was related to the crucial step for him to break through to a higher stage than the Creation Stage. Now that he had lost it, the consequences were extremely terrifying.","If it weren’t for Li Qianyuan’s protectors, Chu Yunfan would have beaten him to death. Sooner or later, the two sides would have to fight, and this battle would determine life and death. So what if they offended Li Qianyuan at this time?","There was no doubt that Li Qianyuan’s loss was Chu Yunfan’s gain.","“You’ve done well. I told you long ago that I’ve always convinced people with virtue. If you had handed over the thing earlier, wouldn’t I have stopped killing earlier?” Chu Yunfan patted Zhang Hao’s shoulder and sighed. He had an expression that said, “I’m a good person, but you don’t understand me.”","Everyone in the Li clan wanted to cough up mouthfuls of blood. Was this what it meant to win people over with virtue?","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment. This was indeed convincing people with virtue. He had always beaten others into submission first, and then convinced them with virtue. There was nothing wrong with this train of thought.","These people were all moved by his moral character and took the initiative to tell him the location of the secret vault."]},{"number":1915,"title":"Chapter 1915 Shocked","paragraphs":["1915 Shocked","After accepting the Divine Flame Fruit, Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction and waved his hand at the Li family.","The entire Li family was so angry that they almost vomited blood. What did he mean by they would come again if there was good stuff?","However, at this moment, they could only grit their teeth in hatred. They did not dare to step forward at all. Now, they could not wait to send Chu Yunfan away. How could they dare to keep him?","He couldn’t wait to send this ancestor away!","Watching Chu Yunfan’s figure disappear into the horizon, the Li Residence suddenly became a sea of noise. If one listened carefully, they would find that everyone was cursing Chu Yunfan.","But after cursing for a long time, they suddenly realized that they didn’t even know Chu Yunfan’s name.","Those who reacted quickly had already condensed a drawing based on Chu Yunfan’s appearance. It was a middle-aged man about two meters tall.","An expert with a stick!","However, for some unknown reason, in such a short period of time, the picture of Chu Yunfan had spread.","The Li family was like a ferocious dragon crossing the river, and behind it represented a portion of the will of the Crown Prince of Great Xia. Who would dare to underestimate such a ferocious dragon? There were already many people paying attention to it, not to mention that the Li family was actually attacked. This was simply unprecedented.","The Li family was not the only one who wanted to know Chu Yunfan’s identity. All the major forces were paying attention and wanted to know about Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, the picture of Chu Yunfan had spread throughout the nearby sea area, and it was spreading at an even more shocking speed.","Countless scouts from various forces began to move, trying to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. However, there was no doubt that they could not find any information about Chu Yunfan.","It was as if this person had never existed before and had appeared out of nowhere.","This made many powerful forces dumbfounded. As long as Chu Yunfan had appeared before, even if it was decades ago or hundreds of years ago, they should have recorded it.","After all, these forces had existed for more than a thousand years. There were many that had existed for ten thousand years. There was almost nothing in the world that they did not know.","Although they couldn’t record everything, judging from Chu Yunfan’s strength, he shouldn’t have been unknown when he was young.","In theory, as long as he appeared or caused a commotion, it could be recorded. However, no one knew even a little about Chu Yunfan.","As long as it existed, there would be traces. Many people even thought of the experts of the Great Xia Dynasty, the Demon Region, the Hu Race, and the Barbarian Race, but none of them could match up to Chu Yunfan.","A thought flashed through everyone’s mind. It was fake. This person’s identity was fake. Only then could it be explained.","Many forces were relieved. If it were them, they would probably think the same. After all, the Li family was not to be trifled with.","However, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of falling out with the Li family. The Li family had sent people to kill Chu Yunfan many times, but many of their experts had been killed by Chu Yunfan.","They were no longer at the level of falling out with each other. It could be said that they would not rest until one of them was dead!","However, the things that Chu Yunfan was involved in weren’t enough for him to openly deal with the Li family. Under the framework of the Great Xia Dynasty, it was inconvenient for Chu Yunfan to personally appear, just like how the Li family had to use the power within the rules to deal with Chu Yunfan.","In the face of a colossal existence like Grand Xia, neither side had the ability to transcend this set of rules.","After coming to this conclusion, many people couldn’t help but feel even more depressed. If this staff-wielding expert was the result of a person changing his appearance, then all the information they had before would be useless.","Thinking of this, many people felt depressed. However, many people were still unwilling to give up. After all, such a great expert had great value in many people’s hearts.","By the time Li Qianyuan led a large number of Li Family experts and 3,000 elite soldiers back, it was already an hour later.","Returning immediately after receiving the news was fast, but he still underestimated the speed at which Chu Yunfan swept through the entire Li residence. The people he left behind in the Li residence could not do anything to Chu Yunfan, not even resist him.","He was directly swept away!","For a force like the Li family, it was undoubtedly a great humiliation to be robbed at the door.","Not to mention the proud Li Qianyuan. This was his first battle in the East Sea as the heir of the Li family, uniting the Crown Prince, the Li family, and other forces. Before he could become famous in the East Sea, he was beaten hard.","It was as if his face had been torn off and trampled into the soil.","When Li Qianyuan returned to the Li Mansion, he saw the empty treasury and the corpses all over the ground. His face was ashen.","He was no longer as high-spirited as before!","“Investigate, we must find out. If we don’t get rid of this person, he will definitely be a huge problem for our Li family!”","Li Qianyuan said coldly. It was too dangerous and passive to have such a great master who hated the Li family watching the Li family in the dark.","There was only the logic of being a thief for a thousand days, but it was impossible to guard against thieves for a thousand days!","If they were only in the Cosmos Realm, even he would not care about them. However, the Fate Realm was different. They were already a big shot, let alone Chu Yunfan slaughtering the four generals as easily as killing chickens and dogs.","Such a person was definitely not someone an ordinary Blessed Realm expert could deal with. There were not many people in the Li family who could deal with such an expert.","This was also a huge pressure for him!","“In addition, behead Zhang Hao and send him back to the Zhang family to explain the situation! “Li Qianyuan’s expression was extremely cold.","Thinking of the Divine Flame Fruit that Chu Yunfan had snatched away, his heart bled. He did not know how much he had paid to obtain this Divine Flame Fruit. All he wanted was to break through to a new realm in the future and become a true giant in the world.","This was related to his future path. Now that it was cut off, if he wanted to find something good to replace it, he did not know how much he would have to pay. This disrupted his arrangements and plans.","“Didn’t he want to betray me to live on? I want everyone to know that none of those who betrayed me will live!” Li Qianyuan said coldly."]},{"number":1916,"title":"Chapter 1916 Breakthrough, Seventh Level of the Cosmos Stage","paragraphs":["1916 Breakthrough, Seventh Level of the Cosmos Stage","“Yes, Your Grace!”","Someone accepted the order and walked out. After a while, he returned with a helpless expression on his face.","Zhang Hao had run away!","Zhang Hao had followed Li Qianyuan for many years, so he knew how cold his cousin was. Whoever dared to stand in Li Qianyuan’s way would be eliminated by hook or by crook. It was because Zhang Hao had seen too much that he knew what would happen if he betrayed Li Qianyuan. How could he stay and wait for death?","“Hmph!” Li Qianyuan’s expression was unsightly, but he quickly calmed down.","“Put out an arrest warrant and find the person who attacked the mansion. I don’t care if he came out of that mountain or if he has changed his appearance. I want his head. Offer a reward in the name of the Li clan and the crown prince. The person who kills him will be an honored guest of the Li clan. As long as the information is verified, they’ll be rewarded with a million mid-grade spirit stones,” Li Qianyuan ordered, “Let’s put aside the other things for now. The most important thing now is to find that inheritance. We can’t let others get to it first.”","Li Qianyuan took a deep breath to calm himself. The first battle had failed, and his main purpose of coming to the Eastern Sea was even more important. Otherwise, he would have worked for nothing.","“Yes, Your Grace.”","*","At this moment, above the Eastern Sea, a person was fleeing on a streak of light. Who else could it be but Zhang Hao, who had just escaped with his life?","At this moment, Zhang Hao was a little flustered. He looked behind him and confirmed that there were no pursuers. Only then did he heave a sigh of relief.","“I didn’t expect that I’d end up like this. It’s all that guy’s fault!” Zhang Hao was extremely depressed.","He hadn’t planned on betraying Li Qianyuan, nor did he want to run away like a stray dog. He had followed Li Qianyuan here to gild himself. Who would have thought that he would be sandwiched between two terrible monsters?","“I can’t go back to Grand Xia now. I have to go somewhere to hide.” Zhang Hao immediately made his decision. He knew that if he were to return to Grand Xia now, he would be doomed.","It was impossible for the Zhang clan to completely fall out with the Li clan because of him, and his status was not comparable to Li Qianyuan.","Two flowers bloomed, each showing a branch. At this time, right under Li Qianyuan’s eyes, Chu Yunfan returned to his hotel room and entered the Mountain River Diagram.","There was a mountain of wealth accumulated in the Diagram, especially the mid-grade spirit stones that Chu Yunfan had lacked before. Now that he had robbed the Li clan’s treasury, he had enough.","Chu Yunfan waved, and countless spirit stones flew up like long rivers. They shattered and turned into spirit energy that filled the sky and poured into the herb mountain. The time in the mountain sped up, and countless medicinal herbs planted by Chu Yunfan began to mature. The Brahma Tree especially absorbed most of the spirit energy and immediately began to grow rapidly.","After a full three days and three nights, the first Brahma Fruit began to ripen under the nourishment of countless amounts of spirit energy. Chu Yunfan had also planted the Divine Flame Fruit in the herb mountain. Ordinary environments could not nurture the Divine Flame Fruit, so even after the Li clan obtained it, they had to seal it up and try their best to prevent the medicinal power from leaking out. That was all they could do. There was no way to cultivate it, so they could only look for natural treasures.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. With the herb mountain, he could easily simulate the environment needed for the growth of natural treasures. As long as there was enough spirit energy, he could grow a second Divine Flame Fruit. As long as the foundation was still there and the spirituality was not dead, it could be nurtured continuously.","Among Chu Yunfan’s many treasures, the Mountain River Diagram was the most valuable. It was not something that could be measured with money.","During the three days, Chu Yunfan left the Diagram from time to time to observe the movements of the Li clan. Chu Yunfan moved freely. The Li clan didn’t expect the person they were pursuing to be right under their noses. This was the Eastern Sea, not Grand Xia. Thus, no matter how unreasonable the Li clan was, they couldn’t lock down the city to search.","Because of this matter, a large number of experts from the Li clan had dispersed. There were even more experts who had received the news and rushed over from Grand Xia. Apart from this matter, even the main Li clan could not sit idly by. For a time, the Li clan’s strength increased greatly. Although the major forces in the city were not cooperating, they would not provoke the Li clan at this time and add oil to the fire.","After this incident, Li Qianyuan seemed to be a lot more stable. He did not dare to rashly go out again. It seemed that he planned to wait for more masters to come before taking action. Therefore, Chu Yunfan could wait for the Brahma Fruit to ripen without worry.","After plucking the ripe fruit, Chu Yunfan consumed it. Immediately, the powerful medicinal efficacy of the Brahma Fruit was released, and the vast energy wreaked havoc in Chu Yunfan’s body.","If it was before, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to easily absorb such a huge amount of medicinal power. He might even have been injured. But this time, it was different. After the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, Chu Yunfan’s body had been reconstructed. Everything was different. Having attained an almost indestructible body, no matter how much medicinal power rampaged through his body, it was unable to harm him.","Another ten days passed. Suddenly, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. The surging divine power in his body began to surge, turning into a huge cocoon around his body. After a long time, the cocoon suddenly spread out, turning into divine power that filled the sky and scattered in all directions. Before the divine power could disperse, every pore in Chu Yunfan’s body opened up and crazily swallowed the divine power.","“I’ve finally broken through to the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","He had finally broken through to the seventh Cosmos Stage. This meant that his cultivation in the Cosmos Stage was about to reach the end. The only thing left to do was to slowly and steadily improve his cultivation from the seventh level to the peak of the Cosmos Stage.","It took painstaking effort and was not something that everyone could do. Many people could not naturally push their cultivation to the peak of the Cosmos Stage even after decades of hard work."]},{"number":1917,"title":"Chapter 1917 The Li Clan Moves Once More","paragraphs":["1917 The Li Clan Moves Once More","Everyone had their limits, but not everyone could reach them. The potential that most people could reach in their lifetime was far below their limits, and only a small number of geniuses could reach their limits.","In terms of cultivation, every stage was the foundation for the next stage. If one could not reach the peak and breakthrough in a hurry, then the achievements one could obtain in this life would be very limited.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His foundation was rock solid. Not only had he reached the limit of each stage, but he also broke through the limit and created a new upper limit. Therefore, to reach the limit, it was just a matter of pushing the boat with the current. It only required a certain amount of time and effort.","However, what Chu Yunfan lacked the most right now was time. Fortunately, the mid-grade spirit stones that filled the sky were still turning into spirit energy and pouring it into the Brahma Tree. When the next Brahma Fruit ripened, he would be able to use the medicinal efficacy of the Brahma Fruit to break through to the peak of the Cosmos Stage. After that was the most crucial breakthrough of the Creation Stage.","All of this was within Chu Yunfan’s plan.","After breaking through to the seventh Cosmos Stage, the divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body did not stop. It continued to increase and began to spread crazily into his limbs and bones. A steady stream of powerful divine power was produced, allowing his cultivation to increase continuously.","After another three days, Chu Yunfan finally stopped cultivating. His cultivation level had been completely stabilized, and it was impossible for it to drop. At the same time, his combat strength increased greatly after breaking through. It was more than several times stronger than before. His strength had charged from the third level of the Creation Stage to the fourth level. Moreover, he was an outstanding person among fourth-level Creators. If he were to encounter the combined attack of the Four Warriors of the Li clan, Chu Yunfan would be able to severely injure them with one strike, or even kill a few of them in one go.","The Li clan, which had been dormant for a long time, finally began to take new actions. The previous defeat had caused the Li clan to lose face, and many people had seen the outcome of provoking the Li clan. In fact, it was not much.","Even though the Li clan was furious, they could not detect Chu Yunfan’s transformation. Chu Yunfan’s transformation was far more powerful than the average person’s divine power. Ordinary people’s transformations had too many flaws. In the eyes of many experts, it was simply obvious at a glance, but Chu Yunfan’s transformation technique could not be seen through at all.","Therefore, although they guessed that this was very likely a disguise, they were helpless because they did not know who this person was. Even if they wanted to chase after him, it was simply impossible.","Therefore, the Li clan could only issue an arrest warrant and offer a reward to the entire Eastern Sea. Anyone who killed Chu Yunfan would be rewarded with hundreds of millions of mid-grade spirit stones. There were also other heavy rewards. Those who provided clues would also be rewarded with one million mid-grade spirit stones.","Such conditions were really good. Many people in the Eastern Sea began to stir, but they quickly calmed down. After all, they did not even know who that person was. The enemy was in the dark, and they were in the light. Moreover, the other party was not a powerless person. On the contrary, it was a terrifying existence that could easily slaughter ordinary Creators.","Even until now, everyone had never stopped debating about Chu Yunfan’s cultivation. This was because even when he killed the Four Warriors, Chu Yunfan did not use his full strength. Therefore, many people guessed that he was at least at the fifth or sixth level of the Creation Stage. Only then could he kill the Four Warriors so easily.","However, no matter what, it was just a guess. There was not enough evidence to support their guesses. Although everyone was talking about the situation, there was one thing that was recognized by everyone. No matter what, Chu Yunfan’s strength was out of the ordinary. If they were not careful in dealing with such a person, they might suffer a backlash. No one was willing to take chestnuts from the fire for the Li clan.","Therefore, although the Li clan was furious, there was nothing they could do. Although the Li clan’s strength was strong, it was like a clay ox entering the sea after it spread throughout the Eastern Sea. It could not cause any waves. They could only search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts in the nearby sea area while waiting for more experts to arrive from the main family.","During this period of waiting, the number of elites brought by the Li clan increased from the original 3,000 to more than 10,000. In addition, the number of Cosmics increased significantly. Even the number of top Creators had increased.","This defeat didn’t make the Li clan give up on the plan to invade the Eastern Sea. On the contrary, it strengthened their determination to invade.","As more and more experts from the Li clan and Grand Xia arrived, the various major powers in the nearby sea region fell silent. They were unwilling to directly confront the Li clan.","With the support of a large number of experts, the Li clan began to collect all kinds of treasures again. Under the drive for profit, many people who were watching came to trade. After all, it was the Li clan who was robbed, not them. These people were naturally not afraid of anything.","Chu Yunfan could even feel that there were many experts lurking in the Li Mansion as if they were setting up an inescapable net. They were clearly waiting for Chu Yunfan to come back and die. Previously, there were not enough experts in the Li Mansion, so Chu Yunfan was caught off guard. Now, they were setting up an inescapable net for him. As long as Chu Yunfan dared to come back, he would face a thunderous blow.","However, since he knew their plan, why would Chu Yunfan appear again? Moreover, they had underestimated him. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan was a greedy person who would do anything for wealth. However, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan’s real goal was not wealth, but the core of the Li clan’s operation, Li Qianyuan."]},{"number":1918,"title":"Chapter 1918 Prince of the Eastern Sea","paragraphs":["1918 Prince of the Eastern Sea","On this day, more than a dozen enormous warships appeared on the surface of the sea around the island. Each of these warships was the size of a small mountain and was about ten stories tall. They floated on the surface of the sea. Wherever they passed, the rapid waves were calmed by a mysterious force and forcefully suppressed.","“This is the Grand Xia Navy?”","When many people saw these warships, they gasped in shock and awe. Although the power of Grand Xia wasn’t enough to rule the Eastern Sea, it still had absolute dominance in the coastal areas. They relied on their extremely powerful fleets to sweep away all the powerful enemies. Whether it was the itinerant cultivators on the Eastern Sea or the terrifying beasts in the deep sea, they could not withstand a single blow in front of those powerful fleets. It was said that the Grand Xia Navy had Divinity Breaker Crossbows that could kill a Creator with a single arrow. That was the true killing weapon.","“No, this isn’t the Grand Xia Navy. The fleet of Grand Xia is much more terrifying than this. Those warships are several tens of stories tall. Warships such as these were eliminated from the main naval fleet many years ago.”","If this was the Grand Xia Navy, it would be much more terrifying. A regular naval fleet of Grand Xia would be enough to flatten the entire island. Compared to the tens of stories-tall warships of Grand Xia, these just ten-story-tall warships were nothing.","Many people also came to their senses. To Grand Xia, the fleet in the Eastern Sea was a national treasure. It was the greatest guarantee to suppress the powers in the Eastern Sea, Northern Sea, and Southern Sea. Unless the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia personally gave the order, no one would be able to mobilize this fleet, let alone use it for personal gain. That would be equivalent to cutting themselves off from Grand Xia.","The Li clan was not that stupid, nor did they have that kind of power. Without a doubt, this was the Li clan’s personal fleet. If it was in the past, this would undoubtedly be seen as an attempt to rebel. However, these warships had long been rendered obsolete and were not enough to pose a threat to Grand Xia’s fleet. Many factions had obtained the blueprints through various methods and began to build warships in private.","However, this was still not something that ordinary forces could afford. Even the obsolete warships of Grand Xia cost more than five billion mid-grade spirit stones each. The cost was so high that the power of these warships was beyond doubt. A dozen ships were enough to suppress all-powerful enemies.","“What a big deal. The Li clan is really determined to get the inheritance.”","“That’s right. I think they’re a little embarrassed. That person’s action is equivalent to a slap to their face. How can the Li clan let it go?”","“It seems that the Li clan has decided to interfere with the interests of the Eastern Sea. Hmph!”","Many people were discussing animatedly, shocked by the terrifying foundation of the Li clan. Grand Xia occupied the Central Plains and was the wealthiest and most powerful of them all. Any power that could stand out among them would naturally be considered a major power in other regions.","The elites and experts of the Li clan boarded the warships. Not long after, these warships unanchored and set sail, cutting through the waves. The raging waves many powerful itinerant cultivators had to avoid were calmed down within a radius of several thousand meters of these warships. Powerful arrays were activated one after another. Even in the face of countless attacks, they were unable to shake these huge warships.","Behind this fleet, countless people followed them brazenly. The Li clan knew this, but they did not stop them. They knew that it was impossible to stop so many people. The Li clan did not have such strength in the Eastern Sea.","Among this group of people, a figure was quietly following behind the fleet. It was none other than Chu Yunfan. Looking at the tens of warships in the distance, which had the aura of a thousand soldiers and horses, he fell into deep thought.","The Li clan’s foundation was indeed shocking, although warships of this level could only be considered frigates in the current Grand Xia Navy. However, just being able to build and form the scale of this fleet proved a shocking foundation. These warships were undoubtedly money-devouring beasts. Not only did each need five billion mid-grade spirit stones to build, but they also needed to be serviced from time to time to maintain their combat strength. All kinds of expenses were more expensive than the cost of construction.","But to Chu Yunfan, it didn’t make a difference. The two sides had already shed all pretense of cordiality, and it was bound to be a life-and-death relationship.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry to catch up, so he just hung back. His purpose this time was to find and kill Li Qianyuan. Mixed in the crowd, he was not eye-catching at all. No one recognized him.","The fleet crossed the ocean. After half a day, Chu Yunfan, who had been hanging far away, saw chaos in front of him. Those who followed the fleet closely were also in chaos.","“What happened?” someone asked.","“It’s the marine folks!” someone shouted, and everyone’s expression changed.","The marine folks were the greatest opponents of Grand Xia in the Eastern Sea. It was precisely because of the existence of the marine folks that Grand Xia’s rule was limited to the coastal areas.","“Which marine race is it?” someone asked.","“The Sea Prince! It’s The Sea Prince who attacked the Li clan!” soon, someone in front of them sent a message.","“The Sea Prince? The one ranked fourth on the prodigy list?” someone exclaimed.","Everyone then recalled who The Sea Prince was."]},{"number":1919,"title":"Chapter 1919 Fierce Battlefield, Fishing in Muddy Waters","paragraphs":["1919 Fierce Battlefield, Fishing in Muddy Waters","On the prodigy list, Li Qianyuan was high and mighty, ranked first in the world. He was the number one master of the younger generation.","The Sea Prince was ranked fourth. Among the younger generation of experts in the Eastern Sea, he was undoubtedly the number one.","In the eyes of many people, the gap between the top few on the prodigy list was not big. It could be said that they were on the same level. Although Li Qianyuan was number one in the world, he was not so high that people felt that he was invincible.","Although he was the first to reach the Creation Stage, the rest of the people quickly followed suit. The gap between them was very small. Even if there was a certain gap, in the eyes of ordinary people, they should be on the same level.","Many people couldn’t help but gasp when they thought of this. Li Qianyuan, the number one in the world, had crossed the Eastern Sea like a fierce dragon crossing the river, while The Sea Prince, the number one in the Eastern Sea, had attacked the number one in the world.","What astonishing boldness!","“I remember that Li Qianyuan and The Sea Prince had never fought before because The Sea Prince had never traveled to Grand Xia. But now, is it time to determine the winner and the loser?” someone exclaimed.","“I think that Li Qianyuan is probably stronger than The Sea Prince since he’s ranked first on the prodigy list. The Sea Prince’s chances of winning against Li Qianyuan are slim.”","“Slim? I don’t think so. After all, this is The Sea Prince’s territory, not Grand Xia. Not to mention, this is a battle between two forces, not just a battle between Li Qianyuan and The Sea Prince.”","“But no matter what, from this battle onwards, I’m afraid that the competition among the younger generation will be endless. Which of the top prodigies who have cultivated to this level doesn’t have the confidence of being invincible? It may not be a good thing for Li Qianyuan to be the number one in the world. He’ll inevitably be targeted by all kinds of people.”","“That might not be the case. As long as the previous top rankers on the prodigy list were able to block all sorts of attacks and interference, their final achievements would be extremely shocking, far surpassing their peers.”","“But aren’t there still precedents of death?”","For a moment, all kinds of discussions exploded. The prodigy list was undoubtedly the most watched list among the younger generation. The prodigies who could enter the top 100 were all familiar names in everyone’s hearts, especially the top few. Almost every one of them was famous and illustrious. Any one of them would definitely attract countless gazes, let alone a big show where the fourth place led an army to attack the first place.","This was an extremely rare event.","However, what they didn’t know was that not only were the first and fourth on the prodigy list present but there was also another prodigy who was secretly hiding among them.","‘So, it’s The Sea Prince.’ Chu Yunfan’s eyes narrowed.","Even the prodigy list didn’t mention much about The Sea Prince’s origins. The marine folks were mysterious and unfathomable. It was only known that they had an extremely vast empire at the bottom of the sea, which was completely different from the humans in the Central Plains.","Experts within this race were as common as the clouds. Even with the strength of Grand Xia, they were suppressed to the coastal areas. Although it was because Grand Xia was surrounded by powerful enemies, to be able to do this meant that their strength was not inferior to the monsters, the Hus, the barbarians, and other powerful races. They were truly invincible.","It was because of this that Grand Xia turned a blind eye to the invasion of the Eastern Sea despite knowing that the various factions were advancing and even building powerful fleets. With their strength, it was not difficult for them to protect themselves and suppress the marine folks beyond the coastal waters. However, it was inevitable that they would be unable to expand their territory further. They could only rely on the strength of these aristocratic families and sects to expand their territory.","The Sea Prince was the number one expert of the marine folks in this generation. He could be said to be the number one expert of the Eastern Sea. He was very powerful and had defeated many famous old experts in the Eastern Sea. Although they didn’t know which type he belonged to, just from his nickname, they knew that he was probably from the imperial family of the marine folks. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be allowed to use such a flamboyant nickname.","‘The Sea Prince and Li Qianyuan? Interesting.’","Chu Yunfan did not show any fear or retreat in the face of the two top experts of the younger generation. On the contrary, he felt his blood boil. To be able to fight with such a top-notch expert was enough to comfort him.","Ordinary people would be very difficult to deal with if they encountered such a lineup, but Chu Yunfan didn’t think it was difficult, even if these two people were ranked above him on the prodigy list. He didn’t care in the slightest.","‘Let’s go take a look!’","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and disappeared into the crowd. Not far from him, figures rose up and disappeared into the void. The experts who had been trailing far behind also felt a sense of urgency and picked up their pace.","Everyone revealed their cultivation. Even the weakest among them had already reached the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. They were the best among the Cosmics. There were also many Creators.","Martial artists with lower cultivation did not even dare to think of taking advantage of the situation. In the confrontation between top experts, even the aftershocks of the battle were enough to blast them into pieces. These people naturally did not dare to go.","A moment later, Chu Yunfan arrived at the main battlefield. The moment he stepped into the main battlefield, a stream of light descended from the sky and shot past him.","Chu Yunfan saw that it was a bolt from the Divinity Breaker Crossbows. The bolt was wrapped in symbols. When it touched the surface of the sea, it exploded, setting off a small mushroom cloud. Its power was even greater than the heavy bombs of the Federation. Although Grand Xia did not take the path of scientific development, they still had powerful killing weapons.","The aftermath of the explosion swept toward Chu Yunfan like a tidal wave. However, just as it reached him, it was swept away by a sword light and turned into powder. It could not pose any threat to him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had the time to observe the entire battlefield. At this time, it was divided into two parts. The core was naturally the Li clan’s fleet. The dozen warships formed a battle formation. The Divinity Breakers continuously shot out beams of arrow light, sweeping out like a storm, protecting the warships tightly.","Opposite these dozen warships were endless deep-sea beasts."]},{"number":1920,"title":"Chapter 1920 Riches Come From Danger, Spatial Crack","paragraphs":["1920 Riches Come From Danger, Spatial Crack","One after another, the deep-sea beasts soared into the sky and pounced at the warships. Some of them were cruising under the ships. Fierce battles were also taking place in the water.","The Divinity Breakers installed at the bottom of the ship continuously shot out, and each arrow pierced into one ferocious beast. The powerful inertia brought about a terrifying force that pierced a ferocious beast into the deep sea.","Blood flowed everywhere. The blood of ferocious beasts flowed, dyeing the seawater red. The bloody aura attracted more ferocious beasts from the deep sea.","The battle on the surface of the water was even more intense. Although these warships were all obsolete models of the Grand Xia Navy, they were once the main warships of Grand Xia. Their power was naturally extraordinary.","Countless deep-sea beasts rushed forward, but they were unable to break through the dense rain of arrows. These Divinity Breakers were even more terrifying than the ones Chu Yunfan had used back at Baotai.","They killed wave after wave of the nearby deep-sea ferocious beasts, and the area within several hundred miles became a terrifying battlefield.","Those experts who were lagging behind stopped in their tracks. In front of such a terrifying battlefield, even with their strength, they did not dare to barge in. With their strength, they could easily sweep through a small-scale battlefield. An army of that level was not enough to pose a threat to them. Even the elite troops of Grand Xia would not be able to pose a threat to them.","However, when the scale of the battle had reached such a level, with all kinds of great killing weapons rampaging on the battlefield, even they did not dare to rashly barge in. Otherwise, they might die here.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze pierced through the entire battlefield. He could see many figures moving in the sea in the distance. They were different from humans. Although these people had hands and legs, many parts of their bodies were covered in scales.","These were the marine folks of the deep sea!","It was these marine folks who controlled these deep-sea beasts to continuously attack the fleet. This was a common tactic of the marine folks. They lived in the deep sea and often controlled many deep-sea ferocious beasts for their own use. Only by doing so could they contend against the four seas and Grand Xia.","“I didn’t expect that the Li clan would send out all their elites, but the marine folks wouldn’t be any weaker. I’m afraid that the Li clan’s matter has caused a huge commotion during this time. The marine folks must’ve made great preparations behind the scenes.”","Some people guessed the reason. This time, the Li clan’s ferocious dragon crossing the river had attracted the attention of many forces, and the marine folks were probably one of them.","The Li clan’s operation had been delayed for a long time because of Chu Yunfan. It was enough for the marine folks to mobilize a large number of experts and a large number of troops to stop them.","“Although the Li clan has clansmen serving in the Grand Xia Navy, they shouldn’t have any deep hatred for the marine folks. Why would the marine folks target the Li clan?” someone wondered aloud in confusion.","The Li clan had moved out with great fanfare to warn all the factions that were about to make a move. The Li clan placed great importance on this matter. If anyone dared to stop them, they would completely fall out with the Li clan. Under such circumstances, there was no need for the marine race to completely fall out with the Li clan.","“Of course, there is no need for the marine folks to completely turn against the Li clan. Although the marine folks and the Li clan should be enemies, don’t forget that the leader of this attack is The Sea Prince. To him, Li Qianyuan is the biggest obstacle to his ascension. Li Qianyuan can’t get it, but he can. Isn’t that the opposite?” someone said.","Everyone was enlightened. If they understood from this perspective, everyone would understand why The Sea Prince personally led the team to attack Li Qianyuan. The inheritance that Li Qianyuan and the Li clan valued so much must have been an amazing fortuitous encounter. If they could stop Li Qianyuan and let The Sea Prince obtain it, it would be possible for The Sea Prince to surpass Li Qianyuan.","The difference in strength between the various prodigies might just be the difference of a fortuitous encounter.","The Sea Prince was ranked fourth on the prodigy list. Li Qianyuan, who ranked first, must be the target of The Sea Prince. Li Qianyuan had never been to the Eastern Sea before, and the two sides had never fought. But now, a battle broke out.","Some people didn’t think much of it. They even felt that this was an unprecedented opportunity. If no one attacked, the Li clan’s strength was enough to block everyone from the inheritance.","Everyone’s eyes swept toward the center. At the intersection of the two sides, there was a huge spatial crack that lay across the ocean. Both sides were trying to rush into the spatial rift while blocking each other from reaching it.","“Why don’t I see Li Qianyuan and The Sea Prince?” Some people found that the battlefield was basically filled with the elite army of the Li clan and countless fierce beasts of the marine folks, but the real experts were not present.","Everyone understood that the experts on both sides had probably entered the spatial crack and entered the realm where the inheritance lay. Right now, the two armies were destroying each other and sealing off the battlefield.","Many people’s breathing began to quicken. Everyone knew that the fortuitous encounter was in this spatial crack.","“Riches come from danger. Something that can make two prodigies and two great forces compete for it must be something good,” a middle-aged itinerant cultivator said with a ferocious expression.","“That’s right. The opportunities and resources of us itinerant cultivators are already far inferior to those prodigies. If we can’t be more ruthless and desperate than them, how many years will it take for us to be on par with them?” another itinerant cultivator said.","To these itinerant cultivators, taking all kinds of risks was nothing. Their cultivation was a risk in itself. Whether it was resources or cultivation manuals, it was impossible for them to be arranged for themselves like those disciples of large sects. Their cultivation was smooth sailing.","They had to be more ruthless and hardworking than the disciples of these large sects and factions to have a way out and a future.","“I’m going in. Even if I have to snatch food from the tiger’s mouth, I’m going to give it a shot. If I have to continue to be mediocre, I’m going to go crazy!”","An itinerant cultivator roared and rushed into the battlefield like a ray of light.","The rest of the itinerant cultivators looked at each other, and most of them followed without hesitation, including Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1921,"title":"Chapter 1921 Meeting Li Qianyuan Again","paragraphs":["1921 Meeting Li Qianyuan Again","On the battlefield, the entire situation was turned upside down with the intrusion of this group. These experts might have ended up with a bitter end if they had barged into the battlefield alone. But when a group of experts who were at least at the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage and among them were even Creators, broke into the battlefield, the entire situation on the battlefield turned upside down.","These experts barged in, and wherever they passed, people were thrown into chaos. They headed straight for the spatial crack at the center.","“Stop them!”","Both sides of the battle had discovered the presence of these people. Both sides seemed to be prepared for this. They weren’t completely unprepared for these people. Immediately, they already reacted and launched attacks on the people who had broken in.","Rumble!","The entire battlefield was filled with loud explosions. Endless violent winds swept up huge waves that shattered everything. Some of the Cosmics who were unable to react in time were pierced by the Divinity Breakers and fell into the sea.","The Creators reacted quickly and swept across the battlefield. Wherever they passed, the deep-sea ferocious beasts that tried to stop them came over on the waves. They tried to resist, but the beasts were shattered. There was no way to stop these experts who were rushing forward.","“Get lost!” Chu Yunfan shouted and slapped down with his palm. A deep-sea beast that had just pounced on him and wanted to swallow him in one bite was directly smashed into pieces.","In terms of physical strength, Chu Yunfan was invincible. He was not afraid of these deep-sea beasts in the slightest.","After killing a deep-sea beast, Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed like lightning and appeared near the spatial crack. He took the lead and jumped in.","In a flash, Chu Yunfan appeared in an alternate dimension.","In this alternate dimension was a secret realm of mountains and rivers. It was like a blessed land with extremely dense spirit energy. Terrifying battles were breaking out between the mountains and rivers in the distance.","On one side were the experts of the Li clan. The experts with terrifying auras were stirring the void. Each of them raised their hands and raised their feet, almost piercing through the void.","On the other side, there was a group of marine folk experts whose bodies were covered in scales. These marine folks had strange appearances, but they were nonetheless terrifying. All kinds of water-type attacks burst out, sweeping across the sky and fighting with these experts of the Li clan.","The experts of the Li clan mainly focused on martial arts, while the experts of the marine folks could send out huge waves at any time with just a raise of their hands. These huge waves covered the sky and could sweep away almost everything.","However, the terrifying attacks from both sides did not cause the secret realm to collapse. The entire realm was extremely sturdy as if it had been reinforced layer by layer.","Chu Yunfan collided head-first with a nearby marine folk. A terrifying wave swept over with the force of a thunderbolt, wanting to severely injure Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan pulled out a sword and slashed down.","Slice!","The huge wave was slashed in the air and torn apart. The sword light’s momentum did not decrease, and it cut the marine folk who had just stepped into the Creation Stage into two halves.","“Arrggghh!”","This marine race expert had never thought that he’d be killed by a single sword strike. He was unable to resist at all.","“You’re courting death!”","The nearby marine folks revealed ferocious expressions and stared at Chu Yunfan, but they had no time to find trouble with him.","At this moment, a large number of itinerant cultivators followed behind Chu Yunfan. For a moment, the entire battlefield was divided into three parts. It was a mess.","However, Chu Yunfan vaguely noticed that both the Li clan and the marine race experts had begun to work together to deal with these itinerant cultivators who had suddenly barged in.","The two sides did not need to think to form a tacit understanding. They would first kill these people who were fishing in troubled waters to prevent others from taking advantage of the situation.","These itinerant cultivators quickly realized that both sides were secretly working together. At this moment, they became even crazier. They had already rushed here, and there was no reason to give up.","Not far away, an incomparably huge cave appeared in front of everyone. At this time, the experts on both sides were doing their best to block these itinerant cultivators from entering this cave. Everyone understood that the fortuitous encounter that the two forces were looking for was in this cave.","“We have to think of a way to rush through before they completely seal us off. Otherwise, it’ll be too late!” someone shouted.","Naturally, Chu Yunfan had realized this. He immediately used his fastest speed and turned into a bolt of lightning. In the next moment, he had rushed into the cave. Even the experts who were stronger than Chu Yunfan did not react in time.","“D*mn it!”","The experts of the Li clan and the marine folks were completely enraged. They had gone through painstaking efforts to stop them, and they even did not hesitate to fight. In the end, someone had taken advantage of the situation and rushed in.","“Kill all these pests!” a middle-aged man from the Li clan said coldly. He looked at these itinerant cultivators who came to cause trouble, his eyes filled with killing intent.","There were many itinerant cultivators—even seventh-level Creation Stage and peak Creators among them. However, when faced with the experts of both sides who had formed a battle formation, the itinerant cultivators did not have such tacit understanding. Although they had also formed a battle formation with their superb understanding of martial arts, the effect was completely different.","As both sides began to suppress the itinerant cultivators, the entire situation became a stalemate. The experts of the Li clan and the marine folks could not do anything to these itinerant cultivators for a while.","The three sides were locked in a fierce battle, and the weakest of them were the peak Cosmics. One could imagine how terrifying this would be. However, the entire secret realm seemed to be protected by layers of barriers. No matter how terrifying the aftershock of the battle was, it could not shake the realm.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had entered the cave, saw two great figures confronting each other. One of them was Chu Yunfan’s old acquaintance, Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia. The other was a young man with scales covering his entire body. His face was human-like, and he was handsome and had fair skin."]},{"number":1922,"title":"Chapter 1922 Wealth Worth Over 100 Billion Mid-Grade Spirit Stones","paragraphs":["1922 Wealth Worth Over 100 Billion Mid-Grade Spirit Stones","The identity of this person was obvious. He could challenge Li Qianyuan. He was the number one master of the younger generation of the marine folks, the Sea Prince.","Both of them carried extremely terrifying auras that far exceeded the cultivation of ordinary Creators. Chu Yunfan had not expected to see the two confronting each other as soon as he entered, especially since the confrontation between the Li clan and the marine folks extended from the outside to the inside.","Chu Yunfan had the time to check out the cave. There no light came into the cave, it was bright as day. The air was filled with a faint fragrance of lamp oil.","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized the faint fragrance of the lamp oil. ‘Horned Whale Oil?’","He realized that this was the same Horned Whale Oil in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. The Horned Whale was a terrifying ferocious beast that lived in the deep sea. As long as it grew to adulthood, it would at least be an existence above the Creation Stage.","In the ancient times, these Horned Whales were terrifying. However, these terrifying creatures had become the target of many people’s hunting and was pushed to the brink of extinction. It was because a kind of oil could be extracted from the Horned Whale, which was the Horned Whale Oil.","If this oil was used in an lamp oil, it would make people enter a meditative state. During cultivation, if Horned Whale Oil was used, the speed of one’s enlightenment would increase by more than double. Some people even said that the reason why the Horned Whale Oil had such an effect was that there were traces of the Great Dao in this oil.","For cultivators, cultivation itself was already very difficult, and they had even less time. There were never too many heavenly treasures that could increase their speed of comprehension, let alone more than double the speed.","Such a good thing was rare in ancient times. It could be said that it was precisely because of this characteristic that all the Horned Whales were hunted down. Even though the Horned Whales lived in the deep sea and rarely floated to the shallow sea, there were still people who were not afraid of the danger and went deep into the deep sea to hunt the Horned Whales.","Of course, those who dared to do so were definitely top-notch experts. After all, the Horned Whale itself was terrifying. In fact, most of them had already surpassed the Creation Stage. But even so, it was still very, very dangerous. Every year, many people died in the deep sea for the Horned Whale Oil. Those were all top-notch experts, not ordinary cats and dogs.","Even so, in modern times, the number of Horned Whales had gradually decreased to an extremely rare level. It could be said that the appearance of a single Horned Whale would attract the attention of countless experts. They wanted to hunt down this whale and extract its oil. Currently, any palm-sized jar of whale oil was worth more than 100 million mid-grade spirit stones. And even at that high price, there was no supply.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over and saw that there were many earthen jars sealed by arrays around the cave, and in the earthen jars was the Horned Whale Oil. He counted more than a thousand jars of Horned Whale Oil. Just this alone represented a wealth of more than 100 billion mid-grade spirit stones. Even for a behemoth like the Li clan and the marine folks, such wealth was an astronomical figure.","‘What a powerful inheritance!’ Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up.","No wonder the Li clan and the marine folks were fighting so hard to break in. Just the Horned Whale Oil in these earthen jars would recouped their costs, and they could even make a huge profit.","He did not know who the owner of this cave was, but there was no doubt that the person had been a top expert. Otherwise, they would not have been able to open up a secret realm that could withstand the chaotic battle of a large number of experts.","This secret realm was not formed naturally. Instead, it was a man-made secret realm established by an expert who had surpassed the Creation Stage. But although this secret realm was a type of subspace, it was very weak. Because it was not naturally formed, the entire space was weak. If it was a secret realm created by an ordinary expert, it would have collapsed long ago under the situation of so many experts fighting.","In addition to the extremely valuable Horned Whale Oil, there was also an ancient book floating in the depths of the cave. The ancient book was filled with a terrifying sword intent.","This was an ancient book on the sword path. The person who wrote this book had kept his sword intent in it. Even now, Chu Yunfan could still feel a threatening sharpness. One could imagine how amazing it was. This ancient book was undoubtedly priceless. If it was revealed, it would probably cause countless fights.","However, to Chu Yunfan, this was of relatively little value because he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. Among them was the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, and the various martial techniques and divine powers recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book were the best in the world.","Although this ancient book was hard to come by, the absolute arts recorded in it couldn’t be compared to those in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. After all, the latter was an ancient book written by a top-tier emperor with his lifetime of experience.","After Chu Yunfan came in, he hid inside the Mountain River Diagram. Neither Li Qianyuan nor the Sea Prince noticed him. Although the two of them sensed spatial fluctuations and swept their divine wills over, it was useless. They swept their senses into the air and could not discover anyone.","The two of them immediately retracted their divine wills. They were very confident that no one could hide under their noses.","“Sea Prince, how dare you ruin my business. You don’t know what’s good for you,” Li Qianyuan said coldly, staring at the Sea Prince with killing intent.","He had been planning for this inheritance for a very long time, but now it was ruined by the Sea Prince. He understood the Sea Prince’s thoughts. As long as he couldn’t get it, the Sea Prince would get it. Under this situation, his position might be surpassed by the Sea Prince. And this was something he absolutely could not tolerate.","On the contrary, the Sea Prince’s eyes flashed with an amazing fighting spirit. He and Li Qianyuan were both in the top ten of the prodigy list, but they had never really fought. In the case of never fighting, his ranking was lower than Li Qianyuan’s, and he was suppressed by Li Qianyuan.","He was very dissatisfied. In this battle, he wanted to take back the top spot that should belong to him."]},{"number":1923,"title":"Chapter 1923 The Conspiracy of the Two Great Prodigies","paragraphs":["1923 The Conspiracy of the Two Great Prodigies","No prodigy who could cultivate to their level would feel that their strength and talent were inferior to another person, even against Li Qianyuan, who had been firmly occupying the top position for a long time. In the Sea Prince’s opinion, it was nothing. He had absolute confidence in himself and was not afraid of Li Qianyuan.","After all, they had never fought before, and the ranking released by the Mysteries Pavilion was based on strength. However, in a battle, when the difference in strength was not large, any possibility could happen.","According to the calculation of the Mysteries Pavilion, the Sea Prince was not as strong as Li Qianyuan. However, his real strength was not only on paper. Even the Mysteries Pavilion couldn’t know everything. Otherwise, he would have been the top scorer long ago.","“Li Qianyuan, do you think you can defeat me?” The Sea Prince looked at Li Qianyuan in a challenging manner. “This is my territory. Although you’re a dragon crossing the river, in my territory, you have to coil up. If you are a tiger, you have to lie down.”","“You’re courting death!” Li Qianyuan spat.","The Sea Prince was very confident, but Li Qianyuan was even more confident. He had been at the top for a long time, so it was naturally impossible for others to surpass him.","“Since you want to die, I’ll send you on your way. It’s your biggest mistake not to have your protector follow you in to this cave today. From now on, your name will be removed from the Prodigy List!” Li Qianyuan thundered.","His expression was extremely cold. For others, the death of the Sea Prince would undoubtedly cause a great uproar. All the marine folks would be shocked. This was the best seedling of the next generation of the marine folks. However, he wasn’t afraid of the marine folks’ revenge. As Grand Xia’s Marquis Huntian, he was already enemies with the marine folks.","The more ruthless he killed, the easier it was for him to be promoted.","“Hahaha! Li Qianyuan, you’re too confident. My protector didn’t come in, and neither did yours. We’re the same. If you can beat me today, everything will be yours. If you can’t beat, I’ll chop off the head of Grand Xia’s Marquis Huntian and let everyone know my dignity.” The Sea Prince laughed. He knew that the protectors of both sides were not here. To be precise, they were both held back by each other.","“Today, I want the inheritance of Ocean Overlord!” The Sea Prince laughed.","Li Qianyuan’s protector and the Sea Prince’s protector were confronting each other outside. They were the real top masters. However, in a short time, there was no way to determine the victor.","“My protector? I don’t need them to kill you.” Li Qianyuan snorted coldly.","In an instant, Li Qianyuan attacked. The spear in his hand rose like a pillar, and it instantly swept toward the Sea Prince with lightning speed.","The Sea Prince was not to be outdone. He stomped his foot and endless seawater surged up from the bottom of his feet. It formed a monstrous wave, which set him off like a high and mighty god of the sea. He held a trident in his hand and clashed with Li Qianyuan, who was holding a spear.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The two top experts of the younger generation unleashed their most dazzling attacks. Spear shadows and trident lights collided in the void, tearing everything apart.","Both sides were not worried that this place would be smashed into pieces. They had clearly already tested it before. The space here was a little more stable than the outside. There were also layers of barriers protecting it. It would not collapse because of the two’s attacks.","‘Third level of the Creation Stage!’","Chu Yunfan watched the fight between the two. There was no doubt that both of them had reached the third level of the Creation Stage. However, the difference was that in his opinion, Li Qianyuan had already reached the peak and was only half a step away from the fourth level. The Sea Prince on the other hand had just reached the third level not long ago and had only just stabilized his foundation.","Even so, this was shocking. Not long ago, in the updated information on the Prodigy List, it was recorded that Li Qianyuan had only entered the second Creation Stage. At that time, he had already stunned his peers. Now, he had already reached the peak third level. It seemed like it was only a matter of time before he reached the fourth level of the Creation Stage.","Although the Sea Prince’s progress was slightly slower than Li Qianyuan’s, he was still in the same stage. Therefore, he was only slightly inferior to Li Qianyuan. This did not mean that the Sea Prince was not Li Qianyuan’s opponent. Although one’s stage was an important part of combat power, it wasn’t everything.","Although Chu Yunfan had long known that these top prodigies had the support of a great force, they could easily obtain all kinds of resources that others could not even obtain. Therefore, once they broke through a major stage, their cultivation would often advance by leaps and bounds.","If one’s talents were exhausted and they reached the peak of the world, their strength would not be able to advance by leaps and bounds. They could only increase it by grinding. Everyone had their limit, but everyone’s limit was different. Clearly, the top talents like Li Qianyuan and the Sea Prince were completely different from ordinary people.","‘No, something’s off about Li Qianyuan. His strength is enough to suppress the Sea Prince, but now he looks like he is fighting to a draw,’ Chu Yunfan ascertained.","The Sea Prince was not aware of this though. The more he fought, the more excited he became. He felt that he could finally prove that his combat strength was not inferior to Li Qianyuan’s. He was the number one expert of the younger generation, not just the number one in the Eastern Sea. In his opinion, all of this was naturally a matter of course.","However, Li Qianyuan’s actions could not escape Chu Yunfan’s perception. He could easily sense that Li Qianyuan was not using his full strength.","At this time, suddenly, another figure appeared in the air. It was Li Qianyuan who had been hiding in the void and did not really make a move. At the critical moment, when the first Li Qianyuan was holding the Sea Prince back, the second Li Qianyuan strode forward and appeared in front of the floating ancient book. Then, he reached out and put the book into his pocket.","“What? Li Qianyuan! How dare you trick me!” The Sea Prince immediately saw this.","How could he not understand that the attack earlier was just Li Qianyuan’s deliberate performance, making him think that Li Qianyuan had no spare power to seize the ancient book. Who knew that Li Qianyuan would take the ancient book away in the blink of an eye?"]},{"number":1924,"title":"Chapter 1924 First Attack, Suppressing Two Great Prodigies","paragraphs":["1924 First Attack, Suppressing Two Great Prodigies","‘It’s a puppet!’ Chu Yunfan instantly realized that the Li Qianyuan who had taken the book was a puppet. It had been hiding in Li Qianyuan’s spatial ring, so he could deceive the Sea Prince’s perception.","Li Qianyuan was relieved after he succeeded. “Hahaha! No matter what you do, the Ocean Overlord’s inheritance is in my hands!” He burst into laughter.","“The Ocean Overlord was once the ruler of Eastern Sea and was known as a top-notch expert. Back then, no one in the world could match him. After his death, his inheritance was hidden in Eastern Sea. However, you have been searching for it for many years and have never found it. It is fate that wielded it to fall into my hands.”","The more Li Qianyuan spoke, the more proud he became. The others only knew that the Li clan was going to find an inheritance on the sea, but they didn’t know that it was the inheritance of the Ocean Overlord. If they had known earlier, the Sea Prince would not be the only one who came to compete. There would even be more terrifying masters who would make a move, even those who surpassed the Creation Stage.","It was not that masters of that level did not exist in the Eastern Sea, but in their eyes, Li Qianyuan’s actions were just child’s play. They did not bother to compete with him.","That was based on the fact that they knew nothing about it. If they knew, no matter how magnanimous they were, they would never let Li Qianyuan have the slightest chance to take away the inheritance of the Ocean Overlord.","Different from Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan first valued the thousands of jars of expensive Horned Whale Oil. With Li Qianyuan’s family background, there would be a steady stream of cultivation resources prepared for him until he became the top master of the world.","The inheritance of the Ocean Overlord was different. Back then, the Ocean Overlord was invincible in the Eastern Sea with a treasure sword. No matter if it was the Eastern Sea’s itinerant cultivators, the deep-sea ferocious beasts, or the ferocious marine folks, they were nothing in front of him. It could be said that he had stolen the light of a generation. Throughout the entire world, he was one of the few experts.","His core inheritance was in that ancient book, so how could it be amazing?","As for Chu Yunfan, he had never lacked the inheritance of various core cultivation methods. He had various sword techniques that were far superior to the inheritance of the Ocean Overlord. However, he lacked sufficient cultivation resources. Even the Flying Celestials had not expected Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to fly like a rocket, far surpassing the cultivation speed of the chief disciple, Yang Dengxian.","What Chu Yunfan lacked was a vast amount of wealth and resources. As long as he had enough resources and wealth, with his ability, he could transform them into his combat strength at an astonishing speed. This was caused by the different environments of both parties.","The Sea Prince’s expression was ugly because others did not know Li Qianyuan’s purpose, but he knew that his branch of the marine folks had accidentally learned about the Li clan’s actions.","Like the Li clan, he chose to block the news and not let others know because he also understood that if others knew, it would not only be this few experts who came, but it would attract the attention of super big shots who surpassed the Creation Stage. In that case, even though he was known as the number one expert of the younger generation in Eastern Sea, he was still a junior. How could he stop these big shots from attacking?","This was a tacit understanding between the two sides.","“Now that teh Ocean Overlord’s inheritance is in my hands, Sea Prince, you can leave now. I will allow you to take half of the Horned Whale Oil.”","Li Qianyuan looked down at the Sea Prince. He was already satisfied and did not want to continue to tangle with the Sea Prince. Even with his strength, it was still not so easy to defeat the Sea Prince.","The Sea Prince gritted his teeth and looked at Li Qianyuan, who looked like a winner. He shouted, “Don’t even think about it!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Sea Prince’s figure flashed and he appeared in another corner. In that corner, there was an incomplete sword embryo. To be precise, it was a half-finished sword embryo.","It looked like a black ruler.","Although it was only a half-finished product, the sword embryo was still emitting an extremely intense sword intent. It was as if someone was continuously fusing their sword intent into it during the forging process. There was no doubt that it something great the Ocean Overlord had left behind.","“You’re courting death!” Li Qianyuan’s eyes flashed with an extremely cold expression. He had just caught the Sea Prince off guard, and now the Sea Prince was giving him a taste of his own medicine.","He immediately flew into a rage.","Suddenly, just as the Sea Prince was about to grab the sword embryo, a iron staff stretched out from the void and smashed into his arm.","Bam!","The sound of metal clashing was accompanied by the Sea Prince’s miserable cry. His entire arm hung limply and was covered in blood. This strike almost caused his entire arm to explode. Even though the Sea Prince’s arm was covered in scales, it did not give him any resistance.","“Who did this?!” The Sea Prince clutched his injured arm and circulated his power to quickly heal it. At the same time, he gritted his teeth and looked into the void.","He had been ambushed by someone. It was simply a great humiliation. Before this, he had not noticed the existence of anyone else in the cave.","The Sea Prince became fully alert. With his strength, he had did not noticed the other person. How terrifying was the strength of the person who came?","“It’s so lively here. May I join in?”","Suddenly, a tall middle-aged man about two meters tall walked out of the void. It was the middle-aged man that Chu Yunfan had transformed into.","He held a steel staff in his hand and had the power to look down on the world. With his strength alone, he could suppress the two prodigies present.","“It’s you!” Li Qianyuan’s eyes suddenly burst with a terrible killing intent, which was ten times more than the killing intent he had for the Sea Prince.","Of course, he had seen this man’s drawing before, so he recognized him immediately. It was precisely because this guy had disrupted his deployment that the Sea Prince had enough time to dispatch experts.","Chu Yunfan had killed many of his trusted followers, seized the Divine Flame Fruit that he was keeping till he broke through to a higher realm, and plundered an unknown amount of wealth from the Li clan’s treasury. All these things added up, and the two sides could be said to have a deep hatred that would not rest until one of them died.","Li Qianyuan was not surprised to see Chu Yunfan here, and at the same time, his killing intent erupted."]},{"number":1925,"title":"Chapter 1925 Suppressing the Sea Prince","paragraphs":["1925 Suppressing the Sea Prince","Chu Yunfan’s appearance instantly ignited the anger of the two prodigies.","In particular, the inheritance of the Ocean Overlord was originally being fought over by the two of them, but now someone had intervened. It was equivalent to someone barging into the middle of two fierce beasts who were fighting for food, and Chu Yunfan was immediately faced with the counterattack of the two fierce beasts.","Chu Yunfan could feel killing intent sweeping over like a storm. How proud and powerful were the two of them?","“You didn’t hide from me, and you actually dared to appear in front of me. How dare you!” Li Qianyuan suppressed his voice as if he was about to roar.","The entire atmosphere was condensed to the extreme as if Mount Tai was pressing down on them.","The Sea Prince, who was standing at the side, also reacted. He also knew Chu Yunfan’s identity. After all, the Li clan had been robbed and caused a commotion for a time. He had been paying attention to the Li clan’s matters, so it was impossible for him not to know.","At this moment, he was also on guard. If it was an ordinary person, just his identity as the Sea Prince of the marine folks was enough to scare them away. However, this person was different. He actually dared to attack the Li clan. Although the Sea Prince was secretly pleased, he also understood that this middle-aged man was probably not a fool.","If he dared to attack the Li clan, then to him, the deterrence of the marine folks might not be that strong. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had dared to attack him just now, which made him instantly vigilant.","“What is your true identity?” Li Qianyuan stared at Chu Yunfan. His divine will was completely locked on Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan made the slightest movement, he would immediately attack Chu Yunfan with lightning speed.","He knew that Chu Yunfan’s appearance was definitely not like this. He must have another identity, but he did not know what Chu Yunfan’s identity was. He knew that Chu Yunfan had a grudge against him, and he could feel that Chu Yunfan’s hostility was not a last-minute idea.","He had to figure out this powerful enemy’s true identity.","“You want to know? There’s no need. You’ll die here today. Today, the Prodigy List will change,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","He clenched the staff in his hand tightly, and the aura on his body was not weak either. Facing these two terrifying experts on the Prodigy List, he did not show any weakness.","“Very well. You’re really arrogant. In that case, don’t blame me for being rude. Wait until I break your limbs and break your transformation skill. Then, I’ll know who you are!”","Li Qianyuan’s expression became more and more indifferent, and his eyes carried an unimaginable cold light. His sight was extraordinary. They were not ordinary sight. Ordinary people’s disguises had no chance of success in front of him. However, he couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan’s disguise, which made him angry.","He couldn’t even think of anyone who looked like Chu Yunfan among all the people he had offended. Whether it was strength, appearance, or martial arts techniques, none of them were similar to Chu Yunfan. It was as if this person had completely jumped out of thin air and emerged from the cracks of the rocks.","This person was not in his memory at all.","However, he knew that all of this was just a disguise. Chu Yunfan definitely had a grudge against him because he could feel it. It was precisely because of this that he couldn’t allow a mortal threat like Chu Yunfan to continue escaping. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.","He had never expected that the person in front of him would be his mortal enemy, Chu Yunfan, whom he thought he had already dealt with. After all, with that lord personally taking action, even Li Qianyuan couldn’t escape, let alone Chu Yunfan.","It was almost impossible.","There were very few people in the world who could stand shoulder to shoulder with that person, and those who could escape from him were very few.","“Li Qianyuan, no matter what, this inheritance will either fall into your hands or mine. This person is a completely unrelated outsider. Why don’t we just finish him off first?” the Sea Prince said.","This was his suggestion after careful consideration. It should be known that although Chu Yunfan was most likely targeting Li Qianyuan, he should be able to benefit from the fight between Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan. He understood that since the other party had already made a move, it meant that he was determined to obtain it. He was afraid that even he would not be let off.","He was willing to lose to Li Qianyuan, but it would be a big joke if he was taken advantage of by such a nobody. It was better to join forces with Li Qianyuan to eliminate Chu Yunfan.","“All right.” Li Qianyuan nodded and was overjoyed. He had hoped that the Sea Prince would join hands with him to solve this problem.","“Hahahaha! You want to kill me? Just the two of you? The Prodigy List will be changed today. The first and fourth places will fall at the same time. I just don’t know what those people will think if the news spreads.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“How arrogant. Don’t think that you’re amazing just because you won the sneak attack just now,” the Sea Prince said coldly.","At this moment, his arm had already recovered to its original state. The recovery ability of the marine folks far exceeded that of humans, let alone an expert like him.","“In that case, I’ll kill you first. It’s the same either way.”","Chu Yunfan sneered as he rose into the air. In an instant, he disappeared from where he was and appeared in front of the Sea Prince.","Chu Yunfan waved his staff, bringing with it a force of 1,000 catties. It emitted a series of roars like a ferocious beast, like a huge ape. The Ape Demon King had smelted its will into the staff, making it even more powerful, but now Chu Yunfan had it easy.","“The aura of the demons?” The Sea Prince’s expression became cold. “No wonder you dare to be so impudent. I’m going to break your disguise and see if you’re a demon or a human!”","In the blink of an eye, a trident appeared in the Sea Prince’s hand. With the force of a thunderbolt, the trident stabbed fiercely at Chu Yunfan’s staff.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing rang out, and a terrifying tide rippled out, almost blowing out the entire cave. However, after leaving the two people’s side for 100 feet, it disappeared without a trace.","Thud!","A figure retreated from the tide. Li Qianyuan looked at it and couldn’t help but be shocked, because the person who retreated was the Sea Prince."]},{"number":1926,"title":"Chapter 1926 Come at Me Together, I’m in a Rush","paragraphs":["1926 Come at Me Together, I’m in a Rush","After the two sides collided, the person who retreated was the Sea Prince!","Li Qianyuan was very clear about the Sea Prince’s strength. It could be said that he felt that it was very troublesome. However, the first time he fought Chu Yunfan, he was knocked back by Chu Yunfan. This made Li Qianyuan go wide-eyed with shock.","After the Sea Prince retreated, he held the trident in his hands tightly. If one looked closely, one could see that the trident in his hands was trembling slightly. His eyes were filled with killing intent and shock. His killing intent was still the same, but his shock was also strong.","In terms of physical strength, he was at a disadvantage. He was part of the royal family of the marine folks. Their physical quality could be said to be the best among the best. Although their bodies were not big, they could fight the most ferocious beasts in the deep sea through the training of secret techniques without falling into a disadvantage. He could even fight several of them at once.","In terms of physical quality, he had never met anyone in his generation who could fight with him. Even if their cultivation levels were similar, they would still be easily defeated by him. Even against Li Qianyuan, he had not showed any weakness.","However, when he met Chu Yunfan, he was suddenly at a disadvantage. How could he not be shocked? Where did this monster come from?","“Hahahaha!” After Chu Yunfan defeated the Sea Prince with one strike, he waved the staff in his hand, and the storm that filled the sky suddenly calmed down. “This is interesting, Sea Prince, but that’s all there is to it. You guys can attack together. I’m in a hurry.”","Chu Yunfan grinned. Once upon a time, these prodigies on the Prodigy List had brought Chu Yunfan endless trouble, especially Li Qianyuan in particular. When he was in the Violet Thunder Prefecture, he was targeted and chased by Li Qianyuan many times.","After arriving at Grand Xia, he could only blame himself for not ending the pursuit. If he was just an ordinary person, even if he was just an ordinary genius, it would be impossible for him to survive.","Chu Yunfan had survived because of too many accidents. Even so, the terrifying existence of the demons had appeared in the end. Even an expert at the peak of the Creation Stage would theoretically not have survived, but Chu Yunfan had managed to.","Now, it was finally time for a counterattack. Chu Yunfan felt proud and relieved.","Once upon a time, in his eyes, Li Qianyuan was as terrifying as a divine dragon in the sky. Now, Chu Yunfan could fight two people without any pressure.","“What big words!” Li Qianyuan was angered.","The trident in his hand swept over in the air as if it had crushed the sky. This attack looked ordinary, and even the trident light was a little dim, but after this attack swept over, it felt as if it had pierced through the world.","The trident light was like a raging tide, completely drowning Chu Yunfan.","“Good!” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it and swung his staff down. His strength was enough to suppress everything with one hand.","Clang!","The staff and the trident collided. Two extremely terrifying martial wills collided to the extreme, reducing complexity to simplicity, and fusing into this simple attack. In an instant, it turned into the most terrifying tidal wave, sweeping out in all directions.","Swoosh!","Li Qianyuan finally understood why the Sea Prince, whom even he felt was troublesome, had suffered a loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","That terrifying power was like a mountain crashing down. It crossed the sky and landed directly on the Sea Prince’s trident. The protective barrier on his trident was instantly penetrated and destroyed. The pure strength made the trident tremble. His arms were shaking, and he almost lost his grip on his weapon.","‘How is he so powerful?!’ Li Qianyuan looked like he had seen a ghost. How could Chu Yunfan’s strength be so terrifying?","Beside him, the Sea Prince felt proud. He was suppressed by Chu Yunfan just now, and he saw a bit of disdain in Li Qianyuan’s eyes, which made him angry. However, he couldn’t open his mouth to explain. Now, he finally felt a sense of satisfaction. He made you look down on me just now. Now, you know how difficult it is to deal with him.","However, he was not going to just watch from the side. He knew that Chu Yunfan was difficult to deal with. He did not dare to let Li Qianyuan deal with Chu Yunfan alone.","Boom!","The trident in his hand suddenly stabbed over, bringing with it a monstrous tide. In this endless tide, countless ferocious beasts jumped out from the sea and opened their bloody mouths to bite Chu Yunfan. They did not let Chu Yunfan take advantage of the victory to pursue.","“You overestimate yourself!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at these sea beasts. He raised his staff and swept it down. A hundred-foot-long staff light swept down from the sky. In an instant, countless sea beasts were defeated and turned back into seawater. The seawater was annihilated by Chu Yunfan’s staff and disappeared in front of him.","However, the staff light did not slow down and hit the Sea Prince.","Spurt!","Blood spurted out of the Sea Prince’s body, and his right shoulder was a bloody mess.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","The Sea Prince panted heavily, and he couldn’t believe it. It was just one strike, and he couldn’t even be considered to have been completely hit by Chu Yunfan. At the critical moment, he had managed to avoid getting hit in his vital points. He could only be considered to have been hit by Chu Yunfan’s staff light a little, but it almost took his entire arm.","If he was hit directly, the consequences would be unimaginable. Half of his body might even be smashed into pieces.","‘What kind of monster is this person?’ The Sea Prince was in disbelief. It was not that he had never met a master since he started his cultivation, but even if the master faced him, he would be crushed with absolute strength. He had never seen someone like Chu Yunfan, whose cultivation might not be higher than his, but whose strength was enough to crush him.","Especially with the strength of his physical body, this was simply unimaginable. Not only was he at a disadvantage, he had almost died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“You’re still alive. You are indeed worthy of your name, Sea Prince,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","However, in the Sea Prince’s ears, these words were simply a great humiliation. To Chu Yunfan, he was not bad. He was just not killed by a staff. How humiliating was that?","At this time, Chu Yunfan’s eyes turned to Li Qianyuan. For him, Li Qianyuan was the target he must kill, and the Sea Prince was collateral."]},{"number":1927,"title":"Chapter 1927 The Fire God Physique","paragraphs":["1927 The Fire God Physique","He wanted to kill Li Qianyuan because of a personal grudge. The two sides were already irreconcilable enemies. If Chu Yunfan didn’t die, Li Qianyuan would die, and vice versa.","There was no room for mercy between the two sides. Chu Yunfan’s biggest advantage now was that Li Qianyuan was in the light while he was in the dark. He knew about Li Qianyuan’s existence, but Li Qianyuan didn’t know that he was still alive.","In other words, Li Qianyuan didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be still alive. After being attacked by such a big shot, Chu Yunfan managed to survive. Even the Prodigy List couldn’t find Chu Yunfan’s information. Chu Yunfan deliberately used the Mountain River Diagram to hide his aura.","If Li Qianyuan knew that Chu Yunfan was still alive, with his intelligence, it would not be difficult for him to guess that Chu Yunfan was still alive. At least, he would not be so clueless.","This was because he was in the dark, while Li Qianyuan was in the light. Next time, he could change his identity and attack Li Qianyuan directly. Li Qianyuan had no way to make arrangements against Chu Yunfan as he didn’t even know who to look for for revenge.","And unlike the Sea Prince, the marine folks had been enemies with Grand Xia for a long time. In the early years, the fleet of Grand Xia was not as powerful as it was today. Countless marine folks often commanded ferocious beasts to invade the coastline, and countless people died at the hands of the marine folks.","Compared to the Hus, the barbarians, and the demons, the marine folks had a deep blood feud with Grand Xia. Killing the Sea Prince, the hope of the future of the marine folks, was definitely a great achievement for Grand Xia. This would undoubtedly make Chu Yunfan a marquis. After all, his achievements were far greater than when Li Qianyuan was a marquis.","Although Li Qianyuan was the first marquis among the younger generation, he was not the only one. With the strength of these geniuses on the Prodigy List, as long as they were willing, it was only a matter of time before they were conferred the title of marquis.","“Li Qianyuan, if this is all you have, then today, your bloodline will be erased.”","Chu Yunfan felt his blood boiling. He could finally get rid of such an old enemy. Although Chu Yunfan had the intention to kill Li Qianyuan at the husband selection, since he had such an opportunity to kill Li Qianyuan in advance, he would not hesitate.","“D*mn it! You think that’s all I can do? You’re underestimating me too much!” Li Qianyuan’s expression was extremely ugly. His body then suddenly emitted a ball of fire and wrapped around his entire body.","“Do you think that’s all I can do? I have never shown this to anyone before. Now, I will let you see why I am the number one in the world!” Li Qianyuan burst into maniacal laughter.","In just a moment, he turned into a flaming man, like an ancient god of fire. He was wearing flaming armor from head to toe, emitting a huge sense of oppression. After entering such a state, Li Qianyuan’s strength suddenly soared to a higher level. It directly soared from the peak of the third level of the Creation Stage to the fourth level.","The pressure that Chu Yunfan felt had increased several times.","“the Fire God Physique!” Chu Yunfan looked at Li Qianyuan and instantly knew what technique this was.","“I didn’t expect you to recognize it. That’s right, this is the Fire God Physique, the king among the thousands of fire-type physiques!” Li Qianyuan said proudly, “I have never said that I have a special physique, because with my strength, it is enough to crush any strong enemy of the same generation. I don’t need the Fire God Physique. It is your greatest honor to die under the Fire God Physique.”","“I didn’t expect you to have the body of a Fire God. No wonder there are rumors that your physique is extraordinary. It’s just that no one has ever seen it before. Or rather, those who have seen it have all died, so there hasn’t been any new,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfan had collected a lot of information about Li Qianyuan. Some of the information mentioned that Li Qianyuan might have a special physique, and might even be a king-level physique.","However, this news had never been confirmed. At least, no one alive could personally confirm this news. Now the rumor had become true. Li Qianyuan did have a king-level physique, and it was the Fire God Physique, the best king-level physique.","Among the fire-type physiques, the Fire God Physique was undoubtedly one of the best. It was known as the flame controller and could control all kinds of flames. One possessing this physique had the ability to walk through flames. To others, it was a fatal flame, but to those who had the Fire God Physique, it was a great supplement. It could be said that fire-type divine abilities and martial arts were useless against him. Almost half of the martial artists in the world were restrained. This was because half of the martial artists in the world either cultivated fire-type or cultivated a part of fire-type.","This was extremely terrifying.","The reason Chu Yunfan was so clear about this was because there was a record of the Fire God Physique in the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. There was once a person who achieved great success in alchemy and had the Fire God Physique. Although that person was a little weaker than the Alchemy Emperor and had not achieved the same status as the Alchemy Emperor, they were still at the level of a king.","This was one of the most suitable physiques to become an alchemist. In terms of combat strength, it was also extremely tyrannical. And this was Li Qianyuan’s real trump card, but he had never used it. The strong masters were naturally dealt with by his protectors, but the masters of the same generation were not his opponents at all That was why it was only exposed now.","Seeing Li Qianyuan reveal his Fire God Physique, even the Sea Prince’s expression changed. He knew that Li Qianyuan must be using all his strength.","“Since it’s come to this, I won’t hide anymore!” The Sea Prince grinned. His teeth were extremely sharp and looked rather cold. There was an inexplicable glow in them.","Boom!","A terrifying aura spread out in all directions. It was none other than the Sea Prince. His body emitted waves of terrifying pressure, and his strength rose layer by layer. He rushed to the peak of the third level of the Creation Stage, and he was even one foot into the fourth level.","His entire body was wrapped in a blue water-type spirit energy, like blue armor. After suddenly transforming, the Sea Prince’s strength soared by a large margin."]},{"number":1928,"title":"Chapter 1928 Chu Yunfan Is a Monster","paragraphs":["1928 Chu Yunfan Is a Monster","It was obvious that the Sea Prince also had a special physique. It was only now that he finally erupted.","“Interesting!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","These people were able to rise up and become the best among their peers. However, if they wanted to suppress their peers, it was impossible to rely on their outstanding talent alone. Because what one had, others had too. There are countless people with outstanding talent, and there are many people with special physiques. Only those who have both at the same time could reach the end.","Innate aptitude and talent and acquired hard work were indispensable.","“The Sea Ruler Physique!”","Li Qianyuan glanced at the Sea Prince’s current state and recognized the Sea Prince’s special physique. Unlike his physique, the Sea Prince’s physique was famous throughout the world.","Normal physiques would appear sporadically among different people. It was difficult to form a scene where everyone in a family was like this. However, the Sea Ruler Physique was different. It was one of the few that could be inherited and form a large-scale king-level physique.","The Sea Prince’s family was a royal family among the marine folks. They relied on this special physique. All the direct descendants were like this. They were all geniuses. How could such a family not be strong?","The Sea Prince could feel the energy boiling in his body. This energy was originally sealed by him and never used. This was a method to temper oneself. By sealing one’s special physique and constantly suppressing and tempering it, one could obtain the greatest strength.","Once it was unsealed, one’s strength would be greatly enhanced.","This was a common practice of many people with special physiques. At the same time, it could be used as a trump card and foundation. It would not be known by others, and at the critical moment, it would explode with powerful strength to catch the enemy off guard.","Both Li Qianyuan and the Sea Prince were the same.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He didn’t hide his strength. On the contrary, he unleashed his combat strength to the maximum and trained himself in life-and-death battles. It was even more amazing.","“This feeling is indeed very good. You forced me to reveal my trump card and ruined my plans. I’ll use your blood to wash away my anger!” The Sea Prince stared at Chu Yunfan coldly. “Come and accept your death!”","“Hahahaha, as expected, you deserve death. You’re just the mere Sea Prince. What can you do?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He was not worried about the Sea Prince, who had the Sea Ruler Physique, in the slightest. He was calm and composed. Even though the two of them had a fundamental increase in their strength after releasing their special physiques, it was still nothing to him.","“Hahahahaha! You don’t know what’s good for you!”","The Sea Prince instantly made his move. His laughter was wild and cold, with a kind of spirit that said he would do it if he didn’t. He even dared to challenge Li Qianyuan, the number one in the world, let alone Chu Yunfan.","His pressure was released, almost suppressing the entire space until it collapsed. His entire body was made up of an azure blue color as if it was made up of topazes. He emitted an extraordinary aura.","“I’ve got you!”","After the Sea Prince shouted, he appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. The trident in his hand swept over at once. The divine power in his body surged and formed a dense multicolored light, which looked extremely terrifying.","Zzt!","When the trident came crashing down, it caused the entire void to explode and collapse.","Chu Yunfan did not even look at it though. He swung his staff with a backhand. The staff in his hand was extraordinary. There were mountains and rivers carved on it. It was as if the staff swept down and crushed the world.","Clang!","The two sides collided in the air, and the Sea Prince’s attack was blocked. Chu Yunfan easily blocked the attack with his staff in one hand. Sparks flew everywhere, and every spark seemed to set the world on fire.","“Ths Sea Ruler Physique? It’s nothing.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He was not lying. From the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan had seen countless amazing people. King-level physiques were all very ordinary. If it wasn’t for these physiques, the Alchemy Emperor wouldn’t even remember them. It was just that even king-level physiques were just the entry threshold. There were many emperor-level physiques that were above king-level physiques. The mere Sea Ruler Physique was nothing in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","He had the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique—both legendary physiques. How could the Sea Ruler Physique compare to them?","“You’re too arrogant!” The Sea Prince’s aura became even more violent. He looked down on the heroes of the world, and no one could match him. He was considered a supreme figure among his peers. Only by being invincible could he establish his belief of invincibility. He had never shown any weakness to any powerful enemy.","“I’m going to stop horsing around with you now.” Chu Yunfan calculated the time and decided to end this meaningless battle. Otherwise, when the protectors of both sides sensed that something was wrong and barged in, it would probably be another chaotic battle, and his goal would not be achieved.","Chu Yunfan made a simple move. It didn’t even have any martial arts skills. It was only fast, accurate, and ruthless. However, it exploded with amazing power in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The entire cave abode trembled. The divine abilities of both sides erupted into bursts of multicolored light that swept in all directions. The fighting spirit penetrated everything.","Spurt!","A stream of blood appeared out of thin air and splattered across the sky. After this collision, the Sea Prince hastily retreated. A large hole was smashed into the armor on his body that had erupted from the Sea Ruler Physique.","In the collision, he had suffered a huge loss. His attack was easily broken by Chu Yunfan, and then Chu Yunfan’s staff hit his chest. The Sea Prince’s eyes flickered with horror. He had already used all his strength, but Chu Yunfan had suppressed him to this extent with just one hand.","He couldn’t believe it. Chu Yunfan was a monster. To be able to reach such a level of physical strength, what else could it be if not a monster?","In the past, others had used such words to describe him, but now he used them on Chu Yunfan.","“Li Qianyuan, why aren’t you attacking?!” the Sea Prince shouted.","“I don’t need you to order me around!” Li Qianyuan shouted back.","Another Li Qianyuan then appeared and stabbed at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1929,"title":"Chapter 1929 The Sea Prince’s Death","paragraphs":["1929 The Sea Prince’s Death","This attack had been brewing for a long time, and its speed was extremely fast. It was almost impossible to see even an afterimage of this attack. The spear headed straight for Chu Yunfan’s neck, wanting to pierce through him.","Clang!","A massive explosion sounded out, followed by the sound of metal clashing and countless sparks flying.","The spear was unable to penetrate Chu Yunfan’s defense!","“What?! How is this possible?!”","Li Qianyuan was in disbelief. How could his attack not have any effect on Chu Yunfan? How amazing was his defense to be able to achieve such a degree?","Chu Yunfan’s reaction speed was even more astonishing. He swung his staff through the air.","Bam!","The staff hit Li Qianyuan head-on. He screamed, and his whole body cracked in the air, turning into a sky full of traps. This was not Li Qianyuan’s original body, but his puppet, which was smashed by Chu Yunfan’s staff.","Li Qianyuan’s expression was extremely cold, and his killing intent was even more turbulent. It should be known that although his puppet was only a puppet, it also had the strength equivalent to the Creation Stage. Even a Creator would find it troublesome to deal with this puppet, but it had been smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s staff.","The power of Chu Yunfan’s staff was too shocking.","At this moment, red and blue divine power peaks were formed in the cave, but Chu Yunfan remained calm and indifferent, suppressing his aura. However, the two of them did not underestimate Chu Yunfan in the slightest. This clearly meant that Chu Yunfan had controlled his strength to a limit, and they had not even forced Chu Yunfan to use his full strength.","At this moment, the two of them truly felt that Chu Yunfan was very troublesome. They had thought that they were the real opponents and that they had to fight for the inheritance. Now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan was the real scary one.","They dropped the idea of killing Chu Yunfan.","“We have to stall him. When our protectors come, it will be his death!”","The Sea Prince and Li Qianyuan looked at each other. They would rather share the harvest with each other than let Chu Yunfan benefit from it.","Chu Yunfan realized their plan. In an instant, the staff in his hand swept out an astonishing light and went toward the Sea Prince. At this time, the Sea Prince had already been seriously injured by him, so he naturally became the soft persimmon between the two.","The Sea Prince also realized this and felt that he had been completely underestimated by Chu Yunfan. It was a great humiliation. Even if he wanted to stall, with his pride, he would not allow himself to be like a stray dog. He simply roared, waving his trident and charging forward.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","Amid the incomparably loud explosions, the trident and the staff collided thousands of times in the void. Those who were not in the Creation Stage could not even tell how many moves had been executed. It was like all the moves and attacks had been condensed into one attack.","This was the ultimate battle where both sides called upon their life experiences.","Spurt!","After thousands of exchanges, the two of them passed by each other. Another stream of blood spurted out, and a figure trembled violently.","Li Qianyuan was about to attack and step in, but he saw a big hole in the Sea Prince’s chest. Chu Yunfan’s staff had pierced him.","The staff in Chu Yunfan’s hand was dripping with blood and glowed with a golden light. There was an amazing energy and transformation hidden in it.","Spurt!","The Sea Prince spat out a mouthful of blood. He felt dizzy. In the collision just now, there was no trickery. There was only a collision of absolute strength.","Whether it was speed or strength, he was completely suppressed. It was just a moment of distraction, but he was pierced by the staff and was instantly heavily injured.","He was severely injured in an instant. The fight between the two sides was too fast. Even with Li Qianyuan’s eyesight, he could only see the scene of the Sea Prince being pierced through in the last blow.","Li Qianyuan instantly reacted. He could not let Chu Yunfan continue like this. The spear in his hand pressed down on the sky, and the tip of the spear splashed with shocking spear light, sweeping across the void. He attacked the moment the Sea Prince was seriously injured.","He wanted to stop Chu Yunfan’s attack and buy time for the Sea Prince. They were clearly enemies before, but now they had to work together and give up their invincible dignity.","“You’re trying to stop me? That’s not going to happen?” Chu Yunfan sneered, and bursts of golden light burst out from his hand. The golden light turned into a huge barrier that blocked the spear.","The spear light swept through everything, but it was unable to advance an inch against this barrier.","Chu Yunfan raised his staff. The staff light crossed the sky and crushed everything. He then suddenly smashed it down on the Sea Prince.","‘How is he so strong?!’","Before the Sea Prince could react, he felt an astonishing killing intent for the back of his head. He hurriedly turned around and swept out with hi strident, wanting to block this staff.","Bam!","After a shocking explosion, the Sea Prince could no longer hold on to the trident. His thumb and forefinger were already covered in blood from the thousands of collisions. He had no time to heal before he received this fatal blow.","After sending the trident in the Sea Prince’s hand flying, Chu Yunfan’s staff did not lose its momentum and swept down from the sky.","Bam!","The Sea Prince was hit, and he couldn’t even dodge. The blue armor on his body shattered, revealing his original appearance. His head was smashed in an instant, and blood and brain matter burst out.","Boom!","The staff fell to the ground, and the Sea Prince’s head shattered. Half of his body exploded, and everything fell to the ground.","“It’s over,” Chu Yunfan said softly.","As the staff fell, the Sea Prince, who had erupted with the Sea Ruler Physique, was blown up by his staff. The Sea Prince was killed instantly. When he faced Chu Yunfan, he simply had no strength to fight back.","“The Sea Prince is nothing more than this.” Chu Yunfan grinned. “It’s your turn next. Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia—this name will also be removed from the Prodigy List!”","At this time, no matter how bright Chu Yunfan’s smile was, it was also a devilish smile in Li Qianyuan’s eyes. For the first time, there was a threat of death looming in his heart."]},{"number":1930,"title":"Chapter 1930 Li Qianyuan Is Blamed for the Death of the Sea Prince","paragraphs":["1930 Li Qianyuan Is Blamed for the Death of the Sea Prince","This was unprecedented. Ever since he showed his talent, he had received unprecedented attention from the Li clan. The whole clan regarded him as an opportunity for a clan revival.","He had always been under the strict protection of the Li clan. Although he had experienced bitter battles and fierce battles, he had never experienced a real battle that would kill him. Although there were top-notch experts who had attacked him previously, under the protection of the Li clan’s protectors, he had managed to escape.","There was almost nothing Li Qianyuan couldn’t handle. His opponents were mostly people of the same generation. With his talent and strength, people of the same generation were simply not his match.","Even if they weren’t of the same generation, it would be difficult for them to be his match. This made him firmly believe that as long as he grew to the peak, he would be invincible.","Even if he met the Sea Prince, it would be the same. The disciples of the real big families were all like this. They would not be nurtured like flowers in a greenhouse. They would definitely face all kinds of fierce battles and experience all kinds of things. Unless it was the last moment, the protectors would not appear.","These large families and factions naturally had their ways of nurturing their disciples.","Li Qianyuan was not inferior to the others, but compared to Chu Yunfan, he was different. Because for Chu Yunfan, there was no power to rely on, and his life was always in danger. He had gone through countless life-and-death battles.","The mentality of both sides was not on the same level. For Chu Yunfan, even if he was on the verge of death, he would not lose his composure. The extreme tempering between life and death was very important to him. The life and death battles he had experienced were the key to the attainment of his current level.","Every life-and-death battle was a process of surpassing one’s own limits, so Chu Yunfan’s limits far exceeded those of ordinary people.","At this moment, the outside world was in chaos. On the Prodigy List hanging outside the Mysteries Pavilion, the Sea Prince, who was originally ranked fourth, suddenly disappeared. When many people saw this scene, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. This was because they understood all too well why the names on the rankings had suddenly disappeared.","There were only two reasons. Either they had lost the reason to enter the Prodigy List, or they had been pushed down, or they had reached the age limit and did not have the reason to enter the Prodigy List. After all, the Prodigy List only recorded the top experts of the younger generation. Not all the experts in the world were listed. As long as they were of the right age or were not strong enough, they would be eliminated.","However, the Sea Prince was none of those things. There was only one possibility, and that was that the Sea Prince had fallen. This was the only possibility.","“How could the Sea Prince have fallen?”","Many people gasped. They couldn’t believe it. The Sea Prince’s strength was naturally not invincible. There were countless experts from all races in the world, and there were many who could kill the Sea Prince. However, having the ability to do so was a completely different matter. After all, everyone knew that the Sea Prince would have a large number of protectors around him.","To kill him under the protection of so many protectors was as difficult as ascending to the heavens. Under such circumstances, how could the Sea Prince die?","All of a sudden, everyone was stunned. The news of the Sea Prince’s death spread throughout the world at an even more shocking speed. This news spread very quickly. This news was simply too shocking. Even those who did not pay much attention to the Prodigy List previously received the news immediately.","In particular, the Prodigy List had gathered all the experts from all over the world. The rankings were updated simultaneously in the territories of all the races in the world. Any change in the rankings would attract the attention of many people.","Just like Chu Yunfan’s disappearance, many people were shocked. However, Chu Yunfan was different from the Sea Prince. Chu Yunfan was ranked in the lower dozens. Although he was considered outstanding among his peers, there was still a big gap between him and the top prodigies of the various races.","The Sea Prince’s death shocked everyone in the Eastern Sea.","“How could the Sea Prince be dead?”","“Where were the Sea Prince’s protectors? Did they all die?”","“Could it be Li Qianyuan?”","On the Eastern Sea, many people suddenly thought of Li Qianyuan. People in other places were not clear, but they were still very clear about what had happened. Li Qianyuan wanted to obtain the inheritance of a master of the East Ocean, while the Sea Prince wanted to attack them. If the Sea Prince had truly fallen, the only person who could do it and had such a force was Li Qianyuan.","To be able to kill all of the Sea Prince’s protectors, only the Li clan could do it at this critical juncture. They also had the motive to do this. Otherwise, no one else would have such a motive or ability.","All the evidence pointed to the Li clan.","“A storm is coming!” someone exclaimed.","Everyone fell silent. Everyone was of the same opinion. The Sea Prince was the hope of the marine folks. Although there were countless experts and geniuses among them, especially the tribe that the Sea Prince belonged to, the Sea Prince’s death still caused a huge shock.","If the Sea Prince died on the battlefield, everyone would have nothing to say. The marine folks would not seek revenge from Grand Xia because of this. Every year, countless geniuses from both sides would die.","However, it was a different matter to die in the hands of the Li clan. For the Li clan, who had just stepped into the Eastern Sea, it would be ten times more difficult to establish a foothold in the Eastern Sea.","“Let the Li clan pay with blood!”","“Kill them all!”","“Exterminate the Li clan!”","The marine folks roared angrily. When they received the news, they all thought that Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince. Other than him, no one else had the motive or ability to do so. Not to mention that the Sea Prince had brought people to attack Li Qianyuan, which was a reasonable speculation.","The elders of the marine folks roused from their secluded cultivation and clamored to uproot the Li clan. Fortunately, they still had basic rationality and did not set their sights on the entire human race.","After all, although the marine folks were extremely powerful in the Eastern Sea, the humans were not weak. If things really did not work out, they could still rely on the Grand Xia Empire. There was nothing to be afraid of."]},{"number":1931,"title":"Chapter 1931 The Outside World Is in Turmoil","paragraphs":["1931 The Outside World Is in Turmoil","To Grand Xia, there were many itinerant cultivators in the Eastern Sea, and there were countless demonic cultivators and evil cultivators mixed in. It could be said that they were one of the enemies of Grand Xia.","However, they were all humans after all. If the marine folks was forced into a corner, these itinerant cultivators on the Eastern Sea might join Grand Xia. In the future, with these local tyrants leading the way, with the military strength of Grand Xia, they could even enter the depths of the Eastern Sea. At that time, the Eastern Sea would no longer belong to the marine folks, and Grand Xia would definitely not limit its range of activities to the coastal sea.","The higher-ups of the marine folks clearly understood this point. Although there were some radical people who wanted to cause bigger trouble, they were quickly suppressed.","In the end, all the spearheads were pointed at the Li clan. A large number of marine folks troops commanded countless ferocious beasts in the deep sea to attack the islands, targeting the Li clan’s stronghold on the islands.","The various forces of the marine folks decided to use their absolute power to deter those who had evil intentions. After they began to work together, the Li clan was unable to stop such a crazy tide. Only Grand Xia was able to contend against a power of this level. The other powers were simply incomparable.","In just a short time, the forces that received the news didn’t even need the marine folks to take action. They took the initiative to chase the Li clan out and destroy their strongholds. They didn’t want the marine folks to attack the city because of the Li clan as their foundation would be destroyed.","As for the Li clan, they had no way out. In the sky, on the sea, in the sea, all the places where they could escape were blocked by the marine folks and deep-sea beasts. In a short time, the Li clan’s hundreds of years of arrangements on the Eastern Sea were destroyed and uprooted.","Although the Li clan had only just begun to march into the Eastern Sea, they had already begun to make arrangements hundreds of years ago. At that time, they had only set up strongholds to collect some resources unique to the Eastern Sea and gather some information.","At that time, the Li clan was not strong enough and could only slowly infiltrate the Eastern Sea. It was only now that they felt confident enough to establish a foundation in the Eastern Sea.","Who knew that in such a short time, their entire Eastern Sea foundation would be uprooted? Clearly, the Li clan’s foundation in the Eastern Sea had long been noticed.","In Grand Xia, the Li clan leader had just received the news. His face turned ashen, and he spat out a mouthful of blood. The Li clan’s hundreds of years of foundation had been uprooted. The losses were unprecedented. The elite backbone of the Li clan stationed in the Eastern Sea had been killed.","The Li clan’s hundreds of years of business in the Eastern Sea had also been occupied by various forces in the Eastern Sea. These forces had been coveting them for a long time, but they had not taken any action. This time, rather than saying that they were forced by the marine folks to hand everything over, it would be better to say that they were hitting them when they were down and taking advantage of the situation.","And all of this came from one piece of news—Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince and killed all of the Sea Prince’s protectors. The Li clan had completely shed all pretense of cordiality with the marine folks.","When this news was sent back to the Li clan by the comms talisman at the fastest speed, not to mention outsiders, even the people inside the Li clan believed that Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince. After all, Li Qianyuan had the strength and the motive.","If it was someone else who caused the Li clan to suffer such a great loss, he would not be able to escape punishment or even death. However, Li Qianyuan was different. He was the hope of the next generation of the Li clan. No matter how big the trouble was, the Li clan had to protect him.","“This is bad. Now that the marine folks has received the news, they will not let Qianyuan go. I will go to the palace to see the crown prince and ask him to open the royal teleportation portal. I have to use the teleportation portal to go to the Eastern Sea to pick him up or I will not make it in time!” The Li clan leader immediately realized this. “Pass down the order immediately. Tell the elders of the family to come out of seclusion and rush to the Eastern Sea immediately. Whether it was Qianyuan or not, we can’t let him be killed by the marine folks. I will also ask the crown prince to mobilize some of the royal family’s offerings. We can’t let anything happen to Qianyuan!”","The Li clan leader immediately made a decision. He was very anxious. If it was in Grand Xia, he was absolutely sure that he could protect Li Qianyuan. But now, it happened in the distant the Eastern Sea. No matter how powerful the Li clan was, it was a little beyond their reach.","No one had expected that it would eventually turn into a collision between two major forces.","However, he had made up his mind that no matter how much he had to sacrifice, he would not let anything happen to Li Qianyuan. The latter was the greatest hope for the rise of the Li clan.","It didn’t take long for the Li clan experts in the spatial crack to realize that the marine folks experts in front of them had gone crazy. They had held back at first, but now they were going all out. Every move was fatal. It was as if the marine folks wanted to die with them. This frightened the experts of the Li clan. They did not know what had happened.","But soon, there was news from the outside that Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince. The news spread quickly, and soon everyone knew.","“We can’t let them go in and hurt the Young Master. We’ll fight them to the death!”","After the Li clan learned about the matter, they naturally understood why the marine folks were so desperate. Naturally, they could not let them go in and hurt Li Qianyuan.","For a moment, the entire battlefield became even more frenzied, with countless casualties. At the same time, in Ocean Overlord’s cave, two people who were completely unaware of the chaos outside were confronting each other.","Li Qianyuan’s expression became serious. For the first time, his rationality suppressed his anger, because he knew that the terror of this person in front of him far exceeded the pressure that anyone had brought him before. Just like how he wanted to kill the other party, the other party also wanted to kill him,","“Although I don’t know who you are, if you offend the Li clan, you won’t be able to survive in the world,” Li Qianyuan said coldly.","“So what if I offended the Li clan? What can you do?” Chu Yunfan laughed. “Li Qianyuan, you are too conceited. Your family background, your physique, and your talent are the foundation of your arrogance. But you don’t know the meaning of someone is always better than you. Today, I will show you that your arrogance is useless.”","“Alright, I’d like to see how you’re going to show me!”","Li Qianyuan’s face was full of arrogance. In this regard, he was indeed proud. He had been invincible among his peers for too long, and no one was his opponent. If he faced those old monsters, he might not be able to catch them, but he had never been afraid of others."]},{"number":1932,"title":"Chapter 1932 Killing Li Qianyuan","paragraphs":["1932 Killing Li Qianyuan","Even though this person had just caused the Sea Prince to feel hatred, he did not feel the slightest fear. His strength was not something that the Sea Prince could compare to.","Boom!","In an instant, Chu Yunfan moved. He swept out with the staff in his hand. His divine ability poured into the staff light, and it turned into the shape of mountains and rivers in the air. This was the true power of the staff. It integrated the mountains and rivers into the staff.","As Chu Yunfan brandished the staff, the light from the staff transformed everything and killed all the powerful enemies.","Li Qianyuan’s reaction speed was extremely fast. The spear in his hand instantly pierced out like a comet sweeping across the sky as if it was going to set the entire cave on fire.","Fortunately, there was a barrier in the cave that kept these flames within a certain range. However, even so, these flames were still very shocking. They turned into a fire god and suppressed Chu Yunfan.","This was the result of Li Qianyuan’s Fire God Physique bursting out with terrifying power. Like a god of creation, the explosion of the Fire God Physique made Li Qianyuan burst out to a higher level of terrifying combat strength.","“Hahaha! Li Qianyuan, if it was the Sea Ruler Physique, it would be a bit tricky for me, but the Fire God Physique is simply a dead end.” Chu Yunfan grinned, and the endless mountains and rivers pressed down on the burning fire.","The mountains and rivers suppressed all the flames in an instant. Nothing could escape from this mountain and river.","Boom!","The two sides collided head-on. At this time, Li Qianyuan smiled ferociously. “Hahaha, you dare to collide with my flames directly. You will burn!”","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan realized that the flames were not suppressed. They were not ordinary flames. These were the original flames of the Fire God Physique. These flames were different from ordinary flames. It could be said that they could not be dispelled. As long as they were touched, one would die.","This was Li Qianyuan’s biggest guarantee and trump card. He had never used this move before, but he knew how terrifying it was.","“Hahahaha! Do you think I know of the Fire God Physique but not its methods?” Chu Yunfan also revealed a cold smile. These flames instantly burned through the mountains and rivers formed by the martial will, burning Chu Yunfan’s entire body.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t panic. His whole body burst out with golden light, and there was a black light in the golden light. The black light instantly swallowed everything. The flames that covered the area were swallowed clean.","“Impossible!” Li Qianyuan couldn’t believe it. How could Chu Yunfan swallow these flames just like that?","How could he do it to such an extent?! What kind of physique did Chu Yunfan have?","Li Qianyuan had thought of many different physiques, but none of them seemed to be able to do this. Even if it was a fire-type king-level physique, it should be impossible to absorb the original flame of the Fire God Physique.","The Fire God Physique was one of the best among the fire-type king physiques. To be this strong, it had to be an emperor-level physique. However, those kinds of physiques was hard to come by even in a thousand years. There were terrifying physique that could make one an emperor, so it was naturally extraordinary.","Chu Yunfan did not feel any discomfort after absorbing the Fire God Physique’s flames. Instead, he felt warm all over. These flames were not a burden to him at all. Instead, they were a great tonic. After all, this was the original flame of the Fire God Physique. Since it involved the origin, of course, it couldn’t be much. Li Qianyuan had nurtured it with his own power.","There was no doubt that their numbers were limited, but their power was astonishing. Unfortunately, they encountered Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, who had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, was the ancestor of fire. Not to mention that he now had a part of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physique, which was the source of all the fire in the world. It was almost equivalent to the level of an emperor. It was not something that the original flames of the Fire God Physique could hurt.","“Is this your strongest trump card? It’s useless. Watch me chop off your head!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a terrifying light. The grudge between him and Li Qianyuan that had lasted for so long could finally be ended now.","Boom!","The staff in his hand suddenly began to dance, and the power of mountains and rivers appeared once again. A burst of golden light erupted from his palm and surged into the staff.","Another attack smashed down with great force. There was no special staff technique. Just by relying on Chu Yunfan’s terrifying physical strength, this attack had the power to sweep away a thousand troops.","Buzz!","Li Qianyuan instantly felt that his eardrums were about to burst. A terrifying force was about to crush him. He was actually locked on by Chu Yunfan.","‘I have to go all out!’ Li Qianyuan understood that it was time to fight desperately. If he couldn’t resist, he would die here.","At this moment, he no longer had any hope of killing Chu Yunfan. His only hope was to stall for time until his protector came in and rescued him. In the past, many extremely dangerous battles had ended like this. He was just a little curious as to why not a single protector had barged in. He did not know that because Chu Yunfan had killed the Sea Prince, the outside world was already in a mess.","The news that he had killed the Sea Prince spread at an astonishing speed. He had helped Chu Yunfan take the blame. The masters of the marine folks were crazy. They desperately wanted to rush in and kill Li Qianyuan. The masters led by Li Qianyuan were desperately trying to stop these masters of the marine folks.","In their opinion, since Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince, he was probably searching the cave and obtaining the inheritance. He didn’t need their help or disturbance.","This gave Chu Yunfan the space to fight Li Qianyuan one-on-one.","“Come at me!” Li Qianyuan roared, and he suddenly grew taller. He was like a fire god in the world, facing the staff head-on.","Clang!","When Li Qianyuan’s spear touched Chu Yunfan’s staff, it was instantly sent flying. It turned into a stream of light and ruthlessly pierced into the wall of the cave. The spear kept crying out.","At this time, the staff did not slow down. It fell down and directly hit Li Qianyuan’s head, smashing it into pieces."]},{"number":1933,"title":"Chapter 1933 The Fight Ends","paragraphs":["1933 The Fight Ends","Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief when Li Qianyuan’s body cracked open.","It was as if a huge weight had dropped from his shoulders.","He and Li Qianyuan had been enemies for a long time. From the beginning, he was like an ant that Li Qianyuan barely even glanced at. Now, he could easily kill Li Qianyuan.","Only he knew how much he had experienced in between.","It was for this reason that after killing Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan felt relieved. No matter how confident he was, as long as Li Qianyuan didn’t die, it would be a big problem for Chu Yunfan.","“It’s finally going to end. Wait...” Chu Yunfan suddenly reacted.","In Li Qianyuan’s body, there should have been no life, but now there was.","Chu Yunfan instantly reacted, but Li Qianyuan reacted faster. He reached out and tore a scroll. In front of him, a portal appeared. Li Qianyuan escaped into the portal at lightning speed.","“Where do you think you’re going?!” Chu Yunfan’s staff swept out and hit Li Qianyuan.","Li Qianyuan screamed and almost collapsed. Blood flew everywhere, but he was not killed by Chu Yunfan.","“I will get my revenge!” Li Qianyuan’s eyes were filled with hatred. In the next moment, he disappeared into the portal, and the portal disappeared into thin air.","“He escaped!”","Chu Yunfan was curious. He was sure that attack should have killed Li Qianyuan, but if Li Qianyuan had died, how had he escaped?","Chu Yunfan then spotted a rag doll on the ground. He did not know what it was made of, but there was an ominous aura wrapped around the cloth. The entire rag doll revealed an ominous and strange feeling. Endless resentment and blood were wrapped around it.","“A Scapegoat Doll!”","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized what this doll was. He had seen a Scapegoat Doll before, but he had not expected Li Qianyuan to have such an item in hand.","Even in ancient times, the value of a Scapegoat Doll was immeasurable. This was because the refinement of the Scapegoat Doll was extremely difficult. The making of every Scapegoat Doll required the sacrifice of countless living beings. Later on, the sect that refined this Scapegoat Doll offended the public and was destroyed. Even the refinement method of the Scapegoat Doll was lost.","Therefore, the number of Scapegoat Dolls on the market could be said to be one less with each use. These Scapegoat Dolls were usually useless, but they could be used at a critical moment.","With this feature alone, no matter how expensive it was, there would be people who would buy it. Even Chu Yunfan could not resist this temptation. After all, this was equivalent to having another life. For experts like them, an extra life could directly turn the tide of a battle.","If Li Qianyuan didn’t have a strange thing like a Scapegoat Doll, he would have died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Chu Yunfan was a little crestfallen. However, this was the special characteristic of the Scapegoat Doll. If the Scapegoat Doll was so easily discovered, it would not have such a big reputation.","Although he was a little annoyed, he didn’t feel that it was a big deal. He had already surpassed Li Qianyuan in all aspects. If he could kill him once, he could naturally kill him a second time.","“Since you’ve run away, I’ll wait for the next time. If you dare to show up at the husband selection, I’ll kill you!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","He had wanted to kill Li Qianyuan here quietly and there would be no more trouble. But since he managed to escape, Chu Yunfan didn’t mind killing him again at the husband selection. Although he might have to face the Li clan and the crown prince, he was not afraid.","Some could retreat, while others could not. Since there was no way to retreat, then he would kill his way out and fight for the sky.","When he returned and handed over the heads of the experts of the monsters and the Demon God Sect that he had killed before, it was only a matter of time before he became a marquis. At that time, he would also have the title of marquis. Even if the crown prince wanted to make things difficult for him, it would not be that easy.","Those who could be conferred the title of marquis in Grand Xia must have made great contributions. At the same time, Grand Xia also protected these people from all sides. Although the crown prince’s faction was powerful, they could not bypass the Grand Commandant’s Office and attack him. At most, he would be targeted by the crown prince’s faction from the shadows, and what he was least afraid of such people.","After all, he was not a weakling who could not protect himself. He was confident that It would not be long before he entered the Creation Stage. At that time, he would be able to squeeze into the ranks of experts in the world. It would not be easy for the crown prince’s faction to target him. In addition, he had the support of the Flying Celestials behind him.","It was unknown who would win or lose!","Chu Yunfan immediately put away his staff and the Sea Prince’s corpse, and then began to put the thousands of jars of Horned Whale Oil into the Mountain River Diagram. With these thousands of jars of Horned Whale Oil, he had become rich overnight. This was his biggest harvest this time around.","In just a moment, all of this was completed. Then, Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram. At this moment, even the slowest person could sense that something was wrong in the cave. The protectors and top experts of both sides barged in and sensed that something was wrong.","This was completely different from what they had imagined. The masters of the marine folks had rushed in, wanting to kill Li Qianyuan and avenge the Sea Prince. Naturally, the people of the Li clan wanted to come in and protect Li Qianyuan.","Who knew that after the masters of both sides broke in, they found that all kinds of wealth and inheritance here had been swept clean? Li Qianyuan, who should have won, was nowhere to be seen. Even the Sea Prince’s corpse was nowhere to be seen.","There were only various kinds of blood and some pieces of flesh left on the ground. Both sides recognized that it was the Sea Prince’s and Li Qianyuan’s blood. It was full of the aura of the deep sea and fire power. In their eyes, there was no doubt that the two sides had a big fight.","“Li Qianyuan has crossed the line! He killed the Sea Prince and even took his body! Li Qianyuan deserves to die!”","The marine folks experts were furious. Their eyes were wide open with anger, and they immediately fought with the Li clan experts again.","The experts of the Li clan didn’t know what was going on. When they saw the experts of the sea rushing over, they had no choice but to fight them.","For a moment, the entire cave was in chaos. No one noticed that a particle had quietly left the cave in the midst of the chaos and disappeared into the horizon."]},{"number":1934,"title":"Chapter 1934 Watching the Great Battle on the Eastern Sea","paragraphs":["1934 Watching the Great Battle on the Eastern Sea","The Sea Prince died, Li Qianyuan escaped with serious injuries, and Chu Yunfan took advantage of the chaos to escape. The curtain had come down for Chu Yunfan, but for the Li clan and the marine folks, the fierce conflict had just begun. The part of the Li clan located in the Eastern Sea was uprooted and suffered heavy losses.","After receiving the news, a large number of marine folk experts and countless ferocious sea beasts rushed to the Ocean Overlord’s cave day and night in an attempt to kill the Li clan experts. At the same time, the large group of experts of the marine folks who had rushed over bumped into the experts of the Li clan who had been teleported over from the mainland.","A bloody battle unfolded without warning.","The dark clouds pressed down on the city, and countless deep-sea beasts rushed to the sea area where the Ocean Overlord’s cave was located under the command of the marine folks. They collided with the tens of thousands of Li clan troops and a fleet of Li clan allies who came to support them.","“Kill them!” someone shouted, and an arrow pierced through the air.","Blood splattered everywhere, and a ferocious sea beast was pierced through the throat by an arrow. Its huge corpse sank into the sea, and was divided up in a moment.","But with this arrow as the beginning, this bloody battle erupted.","Fresh blood flowed on the surface of the sea, and blood flowers bloomed continuously. Countless crossbow bolts swept through the sky like dark clouds. These crossbow bolts were wrapped in charms, and they exploded like missiles, piercing through the clouds and shattering the void.","At the same time, countless mountain-sized ferocious beasts leaped up. They shot water out of their mouths, covering everything like water guns.","Rumble!","Terrifying explosions could be heard everywhere as the two massive armies clashed, turning this place into an incomparably huge battlefield.","In the distance, many itinerant cultivators who had received the news only dared to watch from afar. They did not dare to step into the battlefield. They could feel the terrifying blood energy surging in everyone’s body. When the blood energy of these hundreds of thousands of terrifying experts gathered and shot into the sky, it blotted out the sky.","Anyone who got even remotely close to the battlefield would feel a complete sense of oppression. The expressions of those itinerant cultivators changed. Although they were a third party force in the Eastern Sea, they finally understood how terrifying the difference between them and a force with an organized army was.","On one side was the marine folks that dominated the Eastern Sea. They controlled countless deep-sea beasts and were almost invincible. On the other side was the alliance of the various Grand Xia military families—the backbone of the crown prince’s faction.","The two sides did not give in, and the terrifying sounds of fighting filled the sky. On a battlefield of this level, the strength of an individual was insignificant. Even Cosmics could not protect themselves. They could be shot in the throat at any time by an arrow that came out of nowhere. Even Creators could only protect themselves at most. It was impossible for them to exert their powerful ability to change the situation of a small battlefield.","“How terrifying. We have long known about the strength of the marine folks, but the Li clan is the truly shocking one. If a mere military family of Grand Xia is already so powerful, then how powerful are the ten major powers of Grand Xia? How powerful is the Eastern Sea Navy of Grand Xia?”","Many of the Eastern Sea cultivators gasped when they saw this scene, especially since Grand Xia’s the Eastern Sea Navy had not ventured deep into the Eastern Sea for many years. Many people’s impression of the Eastern Sea Navy’s strength only existed in their imaginations.","Now that they saw this scene, they felt the air in their lungs freeze as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","The warships controlled by the Li clan were outdated models of Grand Xia. Although their soldiers were elite, they were still not enough to compare to the Eastern Sea Navy. Whether it was quantity or quality, they were not on the same level. From this point of view, the Eastern Sea Navy of Grand Xia was probably ten times stronger.","Of course, everyone knew that this was just a small part of the conflict between Grand Xia and the marine folks. In Grand Xia, the Li clan was just one of the military aristocratic families. Even the crown prince’s faction was only a small part of Grand Xia’s power.","Similarly, the Sea Prince’s faction was only a part of the marine folks’s representatives. The marine folks’ influence was so great that it couldn’t be limited to this. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have dominated the Eastern Sea and firmly suppressed Grand Xia’s the Eastern Sea Navy in the Eastern Sea region.","For a moment, blood flowed.","The battle between the regular armies was full of all kinds of alliances. The scattered cultivators on the Eastern Sea were all dumbfounded, especially those forces who had previously driven out the Li clan. They were regretting it now. No one had expected the Li clan and its allies could mobilize such a huge force. It was not enough to be said to be invincible, but it was still a behemoth for most of the forces in the Eastern Sea.","If the Li clan won, they would return to the Eastern Sea with the power of victory. Almost no one could stop them. At this moment, many people hoped that the marine folks would win. At the very least, the victory of the marine folks would not change the current situation in the Eastern Sea.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan, who was dressed in a moon-white robe, was flying above the Eastern Sea. He was looking down at the two behemoths that had turned the sea area near the Ocean Overlord’s cave into a battlefield.","Even he didn’t understand how things had become like this. He didn’t know what kind of commotion he had caused after killing the Sea Prince, and what kind of changes he had caused at the same time.","The death of the Sea Prince had triggered a full-scale war between the Sea Prince’s marine folks and the Li clan.","It was not until a long time later that he learned the whole story of this battle. However, to him, both the Li clan and the marine folks were enemies. No matter who won or lost, they would undoubtedly weaken each other’s strength, which was of course, a good thing for him.","At the same time, he was also slightly shocked by the strength of the crown prince’s faction. The strength of the crown prince’s faction was indeed extraordinary. In such a short time, they could gather such a huge army. They were indeed not to be underestimated.","However, he was only a little surprised because these private armies could not openly appear in Grand Xia. They could only be used to expand overseas, which was why Grand Xia turned a blind eye to them.","“Who cares who wins? It’s a dog-eat-dog fight.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He didn’t have the time to watch the battle. He only needed to know the outcome.","Then, with a flash, he entered the Mountain River Diagram."]},{"number":1935,"title":"Chapter 1935 Both Wounded, the Great War Ends","paragraphs":["1935 Both Wounded, the Great War Ends","After entering the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan smelled a strange fragrance. Instantly, he could feel his mind clear up, and he could think twice as fast as before. The efficiency of his brain had doubled.","It was he who had ignited the Horned Whale Oil. The fragrance emitted by the Horned Whale Oil made him feel that his mind was agile, and the efficiency of his brain increased exponentially. This meant that his cultivation speed was twice as fast as originally expected. This speed was simply amazing.","Originally, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed was already unimaginable to ordinary people. He had grown like a rocket, but with the enhancement of the Horned Whale Oil, he could double his cultivation speed.","This speed was beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","Chu Yunfan now understood why in the ancient times, many emperors managed to reach enlightenment in the dozens, and there were many who reached that stage by the age of 100. Their innate talent was far beyond ordinary people. In addition, all kinds of good things were piled up. Also, training duing the ancient times were more more arduous than it was now. All of these urged these emperors to grow at the fastest speed.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged, and the sword embryo appeared before him. This sword that was half-formed looked quite wide, about the size of a person. It was completely black and did not look like a sword, but a ruler—a huge black ruler.","However, the sword exuded an astonishing sword intent. This sword intent was sealed in the sword body and could not break out. However, Chu Yunfan could feel that this astonishing sword intent could split the sky.","“It’s rumored that the Ocean Overlord’s swordsmanship swept across the Eastern Sea and was almost unrivaled. Now it seems that the rumors are true. Just a trace of this sword intent is already very shocking. This can even seriously injure a Creator.”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely solemn. He sent his divine will into the black sword, and moments later, he retreated with an ashen expression. The divine will he had used to infiltrate the sword was completely destroyed by the sword intent contained within.","“What a vicious sword!” Chu Yunfan could feel the endless ferocious aura that permeated the air. This treasured sword could be called a ferocious sword.","And it was not like what Chu Yunfan had thought, that it was an incomplete sword. On the contrary, this sword was already completed.","This sword was heavy but without a sharp edge, and Chu Yunfan learned the name of this sword—Ocean Overturner!","The Ocean Overlord had given this sword a name based on his own, and he had once swept away countless powerful enemies with it.","Now, it had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands, but he was unable to fully control the Ocean Overturner. There were a total of three layers of seals in the Ocean Overturner. Every time one layer was unsealed, the power of the Ocean Overturner would increase drastically.","At present, Chu Yunfan had only reached the minimum requirement to use the Ocean Overturner. Thinking of this, he no longer hesitated. He immediately used the refining technique in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book and began to refine the Ocean Overturner. With the Ocean Overturner, his combat strength would surely greatly improve.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye. Just as Chu Yunfan was practicing the Ocean Overturner with all his might, the conflict between the crown prince’s army and the Sea Prince’s army finally came to an end.","After three days of bloody battles, both sides had suffered heavy losses. Their losses had already exceeded 50%. Such losses could be considered heavy losses on the battlefield. To be able to persist until now without collapsing, it could be seen how elite the troops on both sides were.","Both sides held their breaths and wanted to take revenge. All kinds of terrifying killing weapons were thrown at each other. However, the strength of both sides was on par, and neither side had the complete advantage. Though the Sea Prince’s army had the geographical advantage, the other forces of the marine folks had no intention of interfering. They just watched from the side.","There were many spectators as both sides suffered heavy losses. Even many people in the marine folks had the same idea.","In these three days, both sides constantly added more troops and experts to the battlefield. The entire sea was dyed red with blood. It was no longer like seawater, but a pool of blood.","It was unknown how many experts from both sides had died. There were humans and marine folks, but most of them were deep-sea ferocious beasts that were not very intelligent but had huge bodies and were extremely powerful. Blood flowed everywhere. The countless casualties even scared the deep-sea beasts that were not under the control of the marine folks.","Usually, the killing on the Eastern Sea would attract the pursuit of these sea beasts. Now, the murderers in the sea that approached the battlefield were scared half to death. The powerful killing intent that erupted from both sides was not something that ordinary deep-sea beasts could withstand.","The battle lasted for three days before the Li clan and the crown prince’s faction finally began to withdraw from the battlefield. Although they were heavily injured and almost crippled, the elite troops of the Li clan still retreated from the battlefield in an orderly manner. However, they retreated quickly and did not even try to take away the bodies of their comrades who had fallen into the sea.","As for the marine folks, they had also suffered heavy losses. Their losses were no less than the combined forces of the Li clan and the crown prince. To be able to achieve this with just one family, it was naturally a great loss.","Previously, they had been holding back their anger to avenge the Sea Prince, but now, they had long since lost it. The loss was so great that the Sea Prince’s group of higher-ups wanted to cry but had no tears.","The losses of the deep-sea beasts under their control was already incalculable, not to mention that although the experts of the marine folks had been hiding at the back and allowing the deep-sea beasts to charge, they were still the main targets of the Li clan fleet. The attacks from the Divinity Breakers were aimed toward them, and from from time to time, there would be the deaths of the marine folks’ Creators.","The loss of Cosmics was even more incalculable. This battle had crippled this army. At this point, they were powerless to pursue the Li clan any further. They even hoped that the Li clan’s army would leave quickly. Otherwise, it was hard to say who would collapse first.","Soon, the reason why the Li clan withdrew their troops spread out. It was that Li Qianyuan, who had disappeared from Grand Xia, had reappeared."]},{"number":1936,"title":"Chapter 1936 The Roiling Eastern Sea, Three Months Pass","paragraphs":["1936 The Roiling Eastern Sea, Three Months Pass","During the three-day battle, in addition to the Sea Prince, who had been judged to have fallen, another protagonist who had received much attention.","Li Qianyuan, the Huntian Marquis of Grand Xia, was also missing.","If it weren’t for the fact that his name was still in the first place on the Prodigy List, many people would suspect that he had died like the Sea Prince. Li Qianyuan’s whereabouts were unknown, and in the eyes of many of the marine folks, he had fled with the Sea Prince’s body.","This made many masters of the marine folks furious. It was fine that the Sea Prince was killed, but the killer even took away the corpse. In their eyes, Li Qianyuan was a monster.","But three days later, Li Qianyuan finally reappeared. It was said that someone saw him covered in blood, almost dying at the steps of the Li clan stronghold. No one had ever seen him in such a sorry state—like a stray dog whose spine had been broken.","According to the rumors from the Li clan, Li Qianyuan was on the verge of death. After being unconscious for three days, he finally woke up from his coma. The first news he brought after waking up was that he was not the one who had killed the Sea Prince.","When this news came out, the entire Li clan was shocked. When the news of the Sea Prince’s death spread, even they were sure that Li Qianyuan had killed the Sea Prince.","Except for Li Qianyuan, who else had the motive and ability to kill the Sea Prince?","Therefore, they tacitly agreed to all of this. For this reason, they did not hesitate to fall out with the marine folks. The Li clan’s hundreds of years of foundation in the Eastern Sea was also uprooted.","They even had to make many promises to the other allies within the crown prince’s faction and give up many benefits in exchange for the other allies to take action. Although they were allies and were under the crown prince’s banner, the various families were still in a competitive relationship. It was naturally not that easy to get them to contribute. The price they had to pay was enough to make the upper echelons of the Li clan feel very pained.","However, to save the Li clan’s greatest hope of rising in the future, they did not hesitate to pay any price.","However, the news brought by Li Qianyuan was that the Sea Prince was not killed by him, but by someone else. Even Li Qianyuan was seriously injured and suffered heavy casualties.","The entire Li clan was furious. It was that guy again!","Previously, that guy had invaded the Li clan’s stronghold and raided their treasury. He had also taken away the Divine Flame Fruit that the Li clan had obtained through great difficulty. This made the Li clan furious.","To find that guy, the Li clan even delayed the search for the Ocean Overlord’s cave. This led to the Sea Prince’s ambush, which turned from a surprise attack to a war of attrition.","Now, that guy had the evil intention to take advantage of the battle between Li Qianyuan and the Sea Prince. He killed the Sea Prince and made Li Qianyuan take the blame. This triggered a shocking war between the crown prince’s faction and the Sea Prince’s marine folks. Both sides suffered heavy losses.","In three days, the Li clan’s losses were shocking. The Li clan’s strength had regressed by decades almost overnight. Countless experts had died out on the Eastern Sea, and this was definitely not what the Li clan wanted to see.","However, they were now told that all of it was fake.","For a moment, the entire Li clan was completely furious, and this news spread at the fastest speed.","“It wasn’t Li Qianyuan who killed him, but a nameless person. Are all nameless people so powerful now?”","“The pictures that are circulating now are definitely not his original appearance. It’s just that no one can see through his disguise, so we can only chase him according to the pictures. However, I don’t think it will be effective.”","“I wonder which senior expert made a move. Hahaha, isn’t the Li clan always arrogant and not give a d*mn about us? Now let them see what else they have to say!”","“That’s right. The Li clan has suffered a great loss this time. I don’t think they will have the ability to march into the Eastern Sea in the next few decades.”","“It’s not just the Li clan. According to the news from the Li clan, even the marine folks suffered a loss. They all thought that Li Qianyuan killed the Sea Prince and fought with the Li clan to avenge the Sea Prince. Who knew that this was simply a mistake?”","“That man toyed with two giants in the palm of his hand. This person is simply terrifying. I wonder who he is?”","“However, I don’t think it’s true. The Li clan isn’t a loose force. They spread this information as quickly as they could to show the marine folks what it’s really about.”","Many smart people could tell that the Li clan had deliberately spread the news in such a short time. The Li clan was a military family of Grand Xia. Naturally, they would not lower their heads to the marine folks. However, they were also unwilling to be the scapegoat for others. In the future, the Li clan would have to enter the Eastern Sea again. If they did not explain clearly, the Li clan might be attacked by the marine folks at any time and it would be impossible for them to stand firm.","In Grand Xia, they were extremely powerful. However, in the Eastern Sea, they were nothing.","And things were just as many people expected. After receiving the goodwill of the Li clan, the marine folks immediately gave up and did not continue to encircle and suppress the Li clan.","After this battle, the Li clan and the crown prince’s faction successfully established their dignity. They were indeed powerful enough. Unless the entire marine folks attacked, it would not be easy to destroy them. Therefore, the higher-ups of the marine folks quickly made a decision not to continue fighting with the Li clan.","Immediately after, all the marine folks issued a reward for the Sea Prince’s killer. Although they also knew that the appearance of that monster was most likely not his original appearance and that the probability of finding him by relying on such a drawing was very low, the marine folks could not care less in their anger.","Even a large number of experts of the marine folks began to seal off the famous islands in the Eastern Sea to search for the killer. Experts with such strength, as long as they were on the marine folks’ list, were found one by one.","For a time, the entire the Eastern Sea was in chaos.","Three months passed by in a flash.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged. His aura became more and more mellow as if he had become one with the world of the Mountain River Diagram."]},{"number":1937,"title":"Chapter 1937 Peak of the Cosmos Stage, Striking for the Creation Stage","paragraphs":["1937 Peak of the Cosmos Stage, Striking for the Creation Stage","Within the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan had faintly merged with the environment inside. This was a sign that his cultivation had advanced further. In fact, his cultivation had indeed improved in the past three months.","Three months ago, he had only just entered the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. Now, he had merely pushed the boat along with the current and stepped into the peak of the Cosmos Stage.","Although he had yet to break through the limits of the Cosmos Stage, his current cultivation was completely different from before. It could be said that his combat strength had at least doubled. If he were to meet the Sea Prince and Li Qianyuan again, he would be able to determine the winner in an instant. The difference in strength between them was really too great. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","Chu Yunfan was able to improve his cultivation in just three months. Other than the help of the Horned Whale Oil lamp, which doubled his hearing and vision, the most important thing was the help of the Brahma Fruits.","After plundering the Li clan’s wealth, Chu Yunfan no longer lacked spirit stones. He immediately used all his strength to ripen the Brahma Fruits.","With enough spirit stones, in addition to the many Creators that Chu Yunfan had killed previously, all their blood was used to water the Brahma Tree. Naturally, they were all turned into nutrients for the Brahma Tree.","During these three months, two Brahma Fruits on the Brahma Tree had ripened. With the support of the Brahma Fruits’ huge medicinal strength, Chu Yunfan managed to skip several years of bitter cultivation and entered the peak of the Cosmos Stage from the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage.","According to his original cultivation speed, although it was already much faster than ordinary people, it would still take ten years of bitter cultivation to cultivate the peak Cosmos Stage.","But now, he had skipped several years. Therefore, it was absolutely correct to say that cultivation was about the accumulation of resources. How could a lone itinerant cultivator compare to those disciples from large families and sects?","However, just the ripening of these two Brahma Fruits had already consumed a large portion of spirit stones. It was a gold-devouring beast. If Chu Yunfan had not plundered a handful of the Li clan’s wealth, he would not have been able to support such a shocking consumption.","“I’ve already reached the Cosmos Stage, but there’s still half a month before the husband selection. I still have time to break through to the Creation Stage.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were gloomy. He definitely couldn’t miss the husband selection event in half a month. He couldn’t give Tang Siyu to anyone else.","With his current cultivation, Chu Yunfan naturally had absolute confidence. Even Li Qianyuan was defeated by him, so he had nothing to fear from others.","However, if it was possible, he wanted to try to break through to the Creation Stage. Although his current combat strength was shocking and ordinary fourth-level Creators were no match for him, the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage were two different concepts. Once he stepped into the Creation Stage, his combat strength would leap up and reach the fifth level of the Creation Stage.","He would then be invincible.","At that time, there would be very few people who could be his match among Creators. Even if he encountered an expert at the peak of the Creation Stage, like those experts from the Demon God Sect or the demon race, it would be impossible for them to kill him one-on-one.","Among the younger generation, he truly stood at the peak. It wouldn’t be long before he could contend with the older generation’s experts.","In Chu Yunfan’s line of sight, there was a crystal-red fruit that was delicate and alluring. It emitted waves of medicinal fragrance. It was a Brahma Fruit.","This time, Chu Yunfan had killed those Creators and poured their blood onto the Brahma Tree. It bore a total of three fruits, and this was the third. The size of this fruit was at least ten times larger than the ones Chu Yunfan had obtained before. It towered into the clouds as if it were a divine tree from ancient myths.","The Brahma Tree was not only able to produce Brahma Fruits. As one of the wood-type divine trees, it contained the supreme divine power of the wood attribute. With the Brahma Tree as the foundation, Chu Yunfan could choose to cultivate wood-type divine powers. Many of them possessed world-shocking power.","The Brahma Tree could also be used as a defensive treasure. It could be used to protect Chu Yunfan from an invincible position. Unless one’s cultivation level was far higher than Chu Yunfan’s, it was impossible to break through the Brahma Tree’s defense.","Of course, Chu Yunfan couldn’t do that yet. He was still waiting for the Brahma Tree to truly mature. Now, the Brahma Tree was about to pass the peak of its growth period and enter the mature period.","When that time came, the Brahma Tree would be more than ten thousand feet tall. It would be like a stairway to heaven and truly possess the power of a divine tree. Now, Chu Yunfan was feeding the Brahma Tree to speed up its growth.","Only a small portion of the blood of the experts killed by Chu Yunfan was used to produce the Brahma Fruits. Most of it was absorbed by the tree itself and turned into nutrients.","This was what Chu Yunfan was happy to see. Once the Brahma Tree entered its mature stage, the effects it could display were not something that a few Brahma Fruits could compare to.","As a wood-type divine tree, it was enough to suppress the heavens!","“Then let’s give it our all. Ten days is the limit. If I can break through, then I break through. If I can’t, I’ll just leave,” Chu Yunfan said to himself through gritted teeth. He was not in a hurry to break through, but he had to rush to the husband selection.","Chu Yunfan plucked the Brahma Fruit. As he circulated the Emperor Method, he swallowed the Brahma Fruit. It then turned into a ball of energy and spread out. It melted in his mouth and turned into a huge amount of energy that spread into his limbs and bones.","Chu Yunfan immediately circulated the Emperor Method and transformed this energy into a terrifying force that charged toward the Creation Stage. His spirit spread out in an instant, trying to fuse with the world.","Chu Yunfan’s spirit floated and became one with heaven and earth. It was as if countless Great Daos were faintly displayed in front of him, but he could not see them clearly. He even had a feeling that as long as he wanted to, he could become one with heaven and earth. It was the best way to be carefree and blissful.","Suddenly, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind emitted a burst of rainbow light. Chu Yunfan instantly woke up from the feeling of being in a daze.","He broke out in a cold sweat. He had almost lost himself in the Great Dao. If he had not woken up in time, he would have completely fused with nature, turned into a rainbow light, and become a part of nature.","That wasn’t what Chu Yunfan wanted!","However, after this experience, Chu Yunfan’s desire to pursue the Dao did not weaken. On the contrary, he became even more determined.","“Even if I became one with the Dao, I should be the master!”"]},{"number":1938,"title":"Chapter 1938 Breaking Through to the Creation Stage","paragraphs":["1938 Breaking Through to the Creation Stage","After his heart was re-established, Chu Yunfan’s eyes were clear and there was no longer any confusion.","Reverse the universe and seize fortunes!","These six words describe the profound meaning of the cultivation of the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage.","The cultivation of the Cosmos Stage depended on one word: Rebelling!","It was like a boat sailing against the current. Every step forward was very difficult, and every step created a new history.","However, the Creation Stage was different. The cultivation of this stage was about seizing—seizing the fortunes of the world!","One would plunder the fortunes of heaven and earth that originally did not belong to them and strengthen themselves. At this stage, it could be said that every step of cultivation was not only going against the heavens but fighting against the heavens.","Fight for a chance, fight for fortune!","When Chu Yufnan was at a lower stage, he was already sailing against the current and fighting against the heavens. However, he was not like this at the Creation Stage. He could almost feel that every step he took was fighting against the heavens for a tiny sliver of life.","Heaven and earth were impermanent. If one followed the heavens, there would be disasters, not to mention going against the heavens and competing with the heavens for opportunities and good fortune.","This was because experts who had cultivated to this stage could be said to be incredible creatures. They were people blessed by the great fortune of heaven and earth. People often called people with great fortune people “the fated ones.”","Fate was the combination of opportunities, luck, and resources. An individual’s fate was nothing before the fate of the world. It was necessary to plunder the fate of the world to make up for the lack of fate.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan’s thoughts became clear. Using himself as the core, it was impossible to follow the heavens. Just like when he was comprehending the Great Dao just now, the consequence of following the heavens could only be to continuously comprehend the core of Great Dao.","Although his cultivation would increase at an astonishing speed, and it would not even be a dream for him to reach enlightenment in a day, his physical body might also soar and dissipate between heaven and earth. His muddle-headed consciousness would drift through the world, slowly fusing with the Great Dao and becoming a part of it.","Just thinking about that scene made Chu Yunfan’s hair stand on end.","Cultivators naturally regarded those who reached enlightenment as their leaders. Although Chu Yunfan admired the spirit of learning the Dao in the morning and dying in the evening, he could never become like that.","At the same time that he comprehended the Great Dao and almost transformed into the Great Dao, the divine ability in his body did not stop. It began to break through crazily endlessly.","To break through to the Creation Stage, Chu Yunfan had already made enough preparations. Whether it was his comprehension of the Creation Stage, his breakthrough in divine ability, or the transformation of his physical body, he had already completed them all.","All he needed was to pierce through this window paper. Otherwise, he would not have the confidence to complete his breakthrough within ten days.","Li Qianyuan spent at least half a year in seclusion to break through from the peak of the Cosmos Stage to the Creation Stage. It was finally completed, but Chu Yunfan spent much less time than him.","However, even though Chu Yunfan had made countless preparations before this, when it came to breaking through at the last moment, even Chu Yunfan himself was not fully confident that he could complete the breakthrough. There was not much time left for him, so he did not have time to cultivate endlessly.","Time passed day by day. The divine ability in Chu Yunfan’s body was boiling like boiling water. It surged wildly, but it was controlled by Chu Yunfan within a certain range. He kept breaking through to the Creation Stage.","The mana was like huge hands that wanted to grab the world and add all the good fortune in the world to themselves.","Finally, on the tenth day, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly burst out with a burst of rainbow light. Chu Yunfan, who had been stuck at the last step and blocked by the last barrier, suddenly seemed to have completed a transition.","Boom!","The divine ability in Chu Yunfan’s body was finally no longer blocked. Instead, there was an outlet for it to flow out like a flood.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had reached the Creation Stage, and he completed the transition of his life essence. At this point, he could feel a faint sense of oppression coming from heaven and earth. Of course, he understood the origin of this feeling. It must be known that the world was impermanent and treated all living things as ants. In other words, the world treated all living beings equally and gave each their own fate.","Now, Chu Yunfan wanted to break free from the fate arranged by heaven and earth. He wanted to fight against the heavens and seize his own fate. It was like a mutated cancer cell had appeared in his body, seizing the fate of heaven and earth for his own use.","To Chu Yunfan, it was to strengthen himself, but to the world, it was like a malignant tumor. Naturally, it would be rejected by the entire world.","As one’s cultivation increased, this rejection would become stronger and stronger. There was even a theory of karma that said that these powerful cultivators would encounter all kinds of disasters. It was a method used by heaven and earth to remove malignant tumors.","After this step, it would be a whole new stage. The cultivators had gone from being favored by heaven and earth to becoming a malignant tumor in the world. This feeling was completely different.","If he wasn’t a prodigy, he wouldn’t have had the chance to cultivate to this level. However, if he took another step forward, he would completely exceed the limits that heaven and earth could withstand. He would turn from a target of praise to a target that was targeted.","Among the experts who could cultivate to the Cosmos Stage, less than one percent of them could enter the Creation Stage. One could imagine how difficult it was. Most of them could not withstand the malice of heaven and earth. Their willpower was too weak and not firm enough.","After all, the cultivation of these prodigies was usually smooth sailing without any twists and turns. It was impossible for Chu Yunfan to fight for his life at almost every stage, and every realm was accompanied by intense fighting.","This was the difference in cultivation environment, which resulted in different lives. The smoother one’s cultivation was in the past, the more they would suffer when they reached the Creation Stage.","If one’s willpower was not firm enough, any flaw could become a fatal flaw in their journey to enlightenment.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s body crackled and emitted waves of golden light. After his cultivation broke through to the Creation Stage, his body transformed as well. It was a simultaneous transformation. The physical body was the boat for cultivation to cross the sea of bitterness. If the boat was not strong enough, once it encountered a storm, it would be the beginning of cultivation failure.","In the golden light, there were traces of lightning and flames.","This was a comprehensive breakthrough to the Creation Stage!"]},{"number":1939,"title":"Chapter 1939 Strength Increase, Time to Return","paragraphs":["1939 Strength Increase, Time to Return","Chu Yunfan’s own accumulation was indeed deep enough. Countless divine powers condensed in his body and spread into every cell. It was enough to support his Imperial Physique to further improve.","However, before Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level made any new breakthroughs, his Imperial Physique wouldn’t make any new breakthroughs either.","At this moment, the Imperial Physique was completely different from when Chu Yunfan first cultivated it. It had integrated with a part of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physique and the Thunderclap Physique. Chu Yunfan was now in possession of three top physiques. This was the key to his ability to easily defeat Li Qianyuan despite being at a lower stage than Li Qianyuan.","At this time, as Chu Yunfan’s cultivation stage increased, the power that restricted his breakthrough in the physical realm no longer existed, so he began to break through crazily. Powerful energy burst out of his every cell, tearing apart all of them, but at the same time, they were reassembling.","After a whole day, Chu Yunfan finally stopped this transformation. At this moment, Chu Yunfan was all bloody as if he had just been fished out of a pool of blood. This blood had all flowed out during his transformation. There was even a hint of black in the blood. They were all toxins that had been expelled.","The transformation of the body was far more difficult than the transformation of cultivation. The poison hidden in the body was constantly expelled, and the transition of the essence of life was continuously completed.","Chu Yunfan trembled slightly. The blood instantly hardened and then fell off, revealing white and tender skin like that of a baby underneath. Chu Yunfan now seemed even more youthful. Originally, he seemed like a young man in his twenties. Now, he was as youthful as a teenager.","His face, which was delicate and pretty, was completely different after the continuous jump of his life level. Although his appearance didn’t change much, his spirit and energy had long transformed. Just a slight change was enough to make a person’s appearance change as if he had been reborn.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was dressed in a moon-white robe. He was as youthful as a teenager, his posture was tall and straight, and he was strong and fit. He had a certain aura about him.","“It’s finally done. Time to go.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","After breaking through to the Creation Stage, his combat strength increased by several times. Even before he broke through, his combat strength was already comparable to the Creation Stage. He was already powerful enough.","This breakthrough though was equivalent to an instant increase in combat strength by dozens of times. Compared to the past, this transformation was simply an earth-shattering change. His efforts to break through to the Creation Stage were not in vain.","With his Creation Stage cultivation, he could now stand shoulder to shoulder with those geniuses in terms of cultivation. Not to mention his combat strength, he far surpassed these geniuses. Even a fifth-level Creator would not be able to block his attacks. In this stage, he could sweep through everyone. He could even escape unscathed from sixth-level Creators. Seventh-level Creators were not enough to kill him. The only threat was peak Creators.","However, with the new Imperial Physique protecting him, even if he couldn’t win, he could still escape. Chu Yunfan, who had just broken through, had a feeling that he owned the world.","“Li Qianyuan, you’d better show up. I will eradicate you!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes glowered as if he could see through the layers of void and see Li Qianyuan. Around him, the Ocean Overturner Sword, which looked like a huge black ruler, revolved around Chu Yunfan.","The Ocean Overturner was covered with a faint layer of sword intent. Its terrifying power made one’s heart palpitate. Even Creators would be immediately killed if they were to take a hit from the sword.","After more than three months, Chu Yunfan finally refined the first layer of seal on the Ocean Overturner and was able to unleash its power. Although his cultivation was still limited, if he was not careful, even sixth-level Creators would be severely injured and killed by Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, as time passed, his cultivation became stronger and stronger, and the number of seals he could unseal would also increase. In the future, it would not be difficult for him to regain the glory of the number one expert in the Eastern Sea.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t manage to snatch the Ocean Overlord’s sword scripture, he didn’t take it to heart. There were many sword scriptures recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, and there were sword scriptures created by emperors. When cultivated to the extreme, one sword could cut down an entire world. When used, its power was stronger than the Ocean Overlord’s sword scripture inheritance.","Now, he realized that the Mighty Emperor Battle Book was a supreme treasure trove. As time passed, his cultivation base kept increasing, and he could cultivate many of the divine techniques that he couldn’t cultivate before.","Many of them were classics left behind by emperors, recording the cultivation experiences of many emperors. In this era, not to mention the ancient times when the emperors stood side by side, just emperors were already a legend. It was impossible to even see one.","Any one of the cultivation manuals and books recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book could cause a bloody storm if they were to be leaked. Moreover, the people who participated in the competition were not ordinary. On the contrary, they were the top masters of the world. Even some old monsters who lived in seclusion could come out because of this.","With such a treasure trove, Chu Yunfan naturally did not feel that the Ocean Overlord’s sword scripture was very important. What he lacked was not cultivation manuals, but various resources.","“It’s time for everyone to hear my name once again,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","In the past few months, Chu Yunfan was not completely ignorant of the outside world. He had gone out to inquire about it. Naturally, he knew that because of him, the Li clan and the crown prince’s alliance army had fought with the marine folks of the Sea Prince’s army.","Both sides suffered heavy losses, and the Li clan retreated.","The marine folks soon received the news and flew into a rage. They looked for Chu Yunfan everywhere, but they only knew what he looked like after changing his appearance. They didn’t know who Chu Yunfan really was. This was destined to be an unsolved case.","Chu Yunfan was happy for a long time when he saw the two sides fighting each other.","With a thought, he disappeared from the Mountain River Diagram. In the next instant, he appeared above the Eastern Sea. He stepped on a streak of light and headed toward the Central Plains. In a moment, he had disappeared into the horizon."]},{"number":1940,"title":"Chapter 1940 The Serene Immortal Mountain, the Elder Princess’ Birthday","paragraphs":["1940 The Serene Immortal Mountain, the Elder Princess’ Birthday","After a day and a night, Chu Yunfan approached the coastal regions of the Central Plains. After stepping into the Creation Stage, his flying speed was even faster. Moreover, he learned a new movement technique called the Prismatic Traveller.","At the peak of cultivation, it was not difficult to travel ten thousand miles in an instant using this technique. This movement technique had a very high requirement on one’s strength. Chu Yunfan had only dared to use this divine ability after reaching the Creation Stage.","Of course, with Chu Yunfan’s current strength, it was impossible for him to reach 10,000 miles in an instant. Under normal circumstances, he could only reach 100 miles. That was why it took him a full day and night to reach the coastal regions of the Central Plains.","His body flashed continuously, covering hundreds of miles with every flash. This was the performance of extreme speed. Every time he stopped to take a breath, his body would be revealed. Even so, he only stopped for a moment, as if he had teleported.","Chu Yunfan stopped and took a few deep breaths. The vast amount of divine ability he had consumed had almost recovered. On the way here, Chu Yunfan barely stopped. He continued to use the Prismatic Traveller, which naturally consumed a lot of divine ability.","However, after he stopped, he recovered most of his strength in an instant. His basic combat strength had returned to its peak. This kind of recovery ability was indeed amazing. Unless he encountered a top-notch expert like a demon who could kill Chu Yunfan with a single slap, if someone wanted to fight a battle of attrition with Chu Yunfan, they would only be dragged to death by Chu Yunfan.","In front of him, the endless sea was like an ancient well. There were no waves as if there was a powerful force suppressing the waves on the sea. On the surface of the sea, ordinary people couldn’t see anything, but people like Chu Yunfan had already cultivated to the point where they didn’t need to open their Dharma Eyes to have the effect of opening their Dharma Eyes. Naturally, they could see faint mountains floating on the surface of the sea.","The mountains were like the legendary immortal mountains. They floated on the sea and were surrounded by immortal energy. It was like the legendary paradise on Earth.","There were celestial mountains overseas and immortals in these mountains. It seemed to be right in front of him, but Chu Yunfan knew that it was just an illusion. The mountains were stacked in layers of space, and they seemed to be right in front of him, but Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to reach them even if he flew for a year.","This was the concept of a horse running to its death. Only by finding the true entrance and exit could one enter, or use absolute strength to break through the spatial barrier to enter. Chu Yunfan knew that this was something that could only be done if one had a certain level of comprehension of the spatial laws.","He took a closer look. Indeed, in the layers of space, a rainbow bridge suddenly appeared in the sky, connecting the immortal mountain and the world outside.","‘As expected. The bridge connecting the outside world and the Serene Immortal Mountain should be this one,’ Chu Yunfan thought.","This was the destination of Chu Yunfan’s trip—Serene Immortal Mountain.","Although the spirit energy in the Central Plains was very dense, much denser than that of the Kunlun Realm and Earth where the Federation was located, it was only at an ordinary level. In the Central Plains and its surroundings, there were all kinds of places with rich spirit energy. In ancient times, there were many heavenly passages and blessed lands. And this Serene Immortal Mountain was one of the legendary blessed lands!","All the major powers in the world had a winter or blessed land that was ranked among the best. Only in this way could they have a good environment and continuously nurture powerful disciples.","The original owner of the mountain was the Serene Sect. It was so powerful that it was almost on par with the current top ten sects. It was a giant overseas and had an amazing influence in the Eastern, Northern Sea, and Southern Seas.","Later on, they brazenly interfered in the fight for the throne of the previous generation, supporting one of the princes to fight for the throne. This was a taboo of Grand Xia. After the current king ascended the throne, the first battle he presided over was the destruction of the Serene Sect.","Although the Serene Sect was considered one of the best among the many overseas unorthodox sects, they were completely powerless against a colossus like Grand Xia.","The current emperor had just ascended to the throne, he needed to establish his might. Furthermore, the entire royal court hated the interference of the foreign powers in the throne war.","All of Grand Xia was united, and with the Grand Commandant as the leader, the empire sent out its army. In less than three months, they broke through Serene Immortal Mountain, killing many disciples of the sect. From the sect leader to the grand elders, ordinary disciples and outer disciples, they were either killed or captured. The once powerful Serene Sect was uprooted in a single night, completely exterminated.","All the resources in the sect were plundered clean, and all kinds of books were sent into Grand Xia’s arsenal, allowing those who had contributed to the empire to browse through them.","In this battle, Grand Xia had truly established its prestige, scaring the heretical sects of the overseas regions. Even a colossus comparable to the ten great sects of the Central Plains had been destroyed in a single battle, unable to even last a year, let alone the others.","After that, Serene Immortal Mountain was given to the Elder Princess, who had made great contributions in the war, and became the Elder Princess’ cultivation paradise. To be able to monopolize a blessed land by herself was unique in Grand Xia. From this, one could see how favored the Elder Princess was.","Chu Yunfan saw that the Elder Princess’ strength was probably no different from the legends. She might even be the number one expert of the royal family. Otherwise, Serene Immortal Mountain which was isolated overseas could be attacked at any time.","Even the Eastern Sea Navy of Grand Xia might not be able to provide support in time. If the Elder Princess was not strong enough, she would have been captured long ago. It was impossible to rely on the protection of Grand Xia.","In the distance, people could be seen passing by in groups of two or three. They went toward the rainbow bridge and were all guests from all over the world.","For Chu Yunfan, the most important thing was the husband selection ceremony that the Elder Princess was going to hold. However, for outsiders, the most important thing was the Elder Princess’ birthday. Choosing a son-in-law was just a matter of taking advantage of the birthday.","Because the Elder Princess’ birthday would attract all kinds of young talents, choosing a husband for Tang Siyu was just pushing the boat with the current.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over them. These people were either experts who looked like tigers, or young and handsome men who looked elegant and had their own bearing. It could be said that each of them was a dragon among men. They looked extraordinary and had a powerful background.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan no longer hesitated and went straight to the rainbow bridge."]},{"number":1941,"title":"Chapter 1941 The Clash in Front of the Rainbow Bridge","paragraphs":["1941 The Clash in Front of the Rainbow Bridge","In front of the rainbow bridge, a group of young disciples in moon-white robes were blocked. Anyone with discerning eyes could tell that these people were disciples of the Flying Celestial Sect, and they were wearing the moon-white robes that were the Flying Celestials’ specialty.","“Why can’t we cross the rainbow bridge?” a Flying Celestial disciple said gloomily.","These disciples of the Flying Celestials were naturally extraordinary. Those who were qualified to attend the birthday celebration were at least true disciples and above. Their cultivation had crossed the Cosmos Stage. It could be said that each of them was a famous figure in the Flying Celestials. But now, they realized that they couldn’t get on the rainbow bridge. As soon as they stepped on it, they slid down.","Everyone’s expression was a little ugly. With their intelligence, they naturally understood that it was not that there was a problem with the rainbow bridge, but that their cultivation was not enough to step onto the rainbow bridge.","This was a test. Those who couldn’t cross the rainbow bridge were not qualified to participate in this birthday celebration.","“If there really is no other way, we can only send a letter to the elders of the sect to come out and pick us up,” another disciple said unwillingly.","Stepping on the rainbow bridge and getting the elders to come out and pick them up were two different concepts. This was especially true for the true disciples who came from the Flying Celestials. To be able to make a name for themselves in the Flying Celestials, all of them were peerless talents. How could anyone be willing to admit their failure like this?","“Hmph, they’re just a bunch of trash. The Flying Celestials are known as one of the top ten sects of the righteous path, but it seems that the disciples they teach are not very good.”","Suddenly, a cold snort came from the distance. A ball of flame swept across the sky and arrived in front of everyone. It was a young man wearing a red robe that looked like a burning flame. This young man had an arrogant expression, and there was a hint of evil charm in his eyes.","Not long after, another large group of people came flying over. These people were all dressed as attendants and were all following this young man. It was just that their cultivation could not keep up with this young man.","“Red Flame Demon Sect!”","The disciples of the Flying Celestials all had ugly expressions on their faces. This young man’s crimson flame robe commanded attention. Among so many sects, the standard robes of the Red Flame Demon Sect looked like this.","As one of the top ten sects of the righteous path, the Flying Celestials had fought with the Red Flame Demon Sect, an old demonic sect from overseas, for a long time. Many of their disciples had died at the hands of the other party. Now that they met, it could be said that enemies were on a narrow road. When enemies met, their eyes would turn red.","“How dare you. This is the Elder Princess’ cultivation ground. How dare you evil people appear here. Aren’t you afraid of death?” A true disciple of the Flying Celestials sneered.","“Evil?” This young man laughed. “Do you think this is Grand Xia? The rules of your empire can’t control this place. The Elder Princess has a wide network of friends, not only in your ten great sects but also with the seniors of my sect. Today is her birthday, so why can’t we come?”","The Flying Celestial disciples then recalled the many rumors about the Elder Princess. She had never been a person who followed the rules. There were even rumors that the Elder Princess had fallen out with the royal family back then and had used her own strength to support the Serene Immortal Mountain. She had not borrowed the power of Grand Xia.","The Elder Princess was both good and evil, and she had a wide network of friends. Not only were they limited to the masters of the virtuous path, but she also had many good friends in the demonic paths. With her cultivation, as long as she wanted, there would naturally be many people willing to make friends with her.","“Moreover, everyone knows that the Elder Princess is going to choose a husband for her beloved disciple, Princess Gushe. She never said that she was going to find a husband solely among those in Grand Xia. All the heroes in the world who are interested have come.”","The young man grinned coldly. “I, the Junior Flame Master, naturally came for this. I know why trash like you are here. However, don’t get cocky. Do you think the Elder Princess will just allow you to sit in a row and choose one of you? Only a top expert can be chosen to be worthy of Princess Gushe. What do you trash think? You haven’t even been on the Prodigy List, and you still dare to daydream. Today, I’ll show you the difference. Don’t bother stepping onto the Rainbow Bridge. Don’t drag us down.”","“Junior Flame Master, don’t go too far. Even if you’re an expert on the Prodigy List, aren’t you afraid that our Eldest Senior will settle the score with you if you dare to attack us?” a Flying Celestial disciple said angrily.","He naturally understood that his cultivation was far from the Prodigy List. Even if he was only ranked 100th on the Prodigy List, he had almost defeated the entire Flying Celestials on his own last time. If Chu Yunfan had not intervened in time, it was very likely that the Eldest Disciple, Yang Dengxian, would have to intervene to solve this problem.","“Your Eldest Senior? Yang Dengxian’s ranking is only slightly better than mine. If he dares to cause trouble for me, then who’s going to cause trouble for whom?” the Junior Flame Master said with a sinister smile.","His ranking on the Prodigy List was slightly lower than Yang Dengxian’s, but he wasn’t afraid of Yang Dengxian. In his opinion, they were just about the same. Whoever won or lost couldn’t be discerned from just data on paper. It also depended on their performance on the spot and the trump cards they had prepared.","“Forget it. Why am I even bothering to talk about this with trash like you? I’ll just cripple you!” Junior Flame Master grinned hideously. He had no intention of showing respect to any of these Flying Celestial disciples.","He looked arrogant, but he knew very well in his heart that these people were the pillars of the Flying Celestial Sect. The Flying Celestials’ strength would be weakened if one of them was missing. Usually, it was not easy to see so many Flying Celestial true disciples moving in groups.","This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","“Junior Flame Master, you’re going too far!”","The Flying Celestial disciples roared and launched an attack on the Junior Flame Master. They slapped out one after another with the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. In the air, these attacks condensed into a big hand and pressed down, almost piercing through the sky.","“Petty tricks!” The Junior Flame Master sneered and attacked.","“The Flying Celestial Palm Strike is just an empty name. It’s not comparable to my sect’s Red Flame Demon Saber!”"]},{"number":1942,"title":"Chapter 1942 Chu Yunfan Reappears, Everyone Is Shocked","paragraphs":["1942 Chu Yunfan Reappears, Everyone Is Shocked","The Junior Flame Master pulled out a red saber. The blade was not made of refined iron but of raging flames. The red color carried a dense demonic aura.","As soon as the Red Flame Demon Saber was unsheathed, it unleashed a raging flame that filled the sky. In an instant, the entire sky was turned into a sea of fire.","Boom!","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike exploded in the air.","Puff!","Bang!","Boom!","After a series of explosions, these true disciples of the Flying Celestials were sent flying. They spat out a mouthful of blood and were instantly heavily injured.","“The Creation Stage!”","The Flying Celestial disciples were dumbfounded. Even if they joined forces, they were still not a match for the Junior Flame Master as he had already stepped into the Creation Stage. Although the Junior Flame Master’s ranking on the Prodigy List wasn’t high—only around the top 40—to them, he was still a terrifying existence.","They were just ordinary true disciples. In the Flying Celestials, they were big shots but in the world, they were simply nothing. The difference between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage was evident from this.","Although they had long known, they had never fought against a Creator before. They had never thought that even with so many of them working together, they would not be able to withstand a casual attack from a Creator.","“This is too scary. The Junior Flame Master seems to be stronger than before!”","“After such a long time, let alone the Prodigy List, some of the geniuses below the Prodigy List have already stepped into the Creation Stage.”","“The younger generation is getting more and more powerful!”","At this moment, many people had unknowingly gathered in the surroundings. Many of them were itinerant cultivators from the Eastern Sea. There were many Creation Stage giants who had come to congratulate the Elder Princess. They stopped in their tracks and did not reveal themselves.","They weren’t surprised by this. Unlike the Central Plains, this was the homeland of Grand Xia. There were no demons or devils who dared to act so wantonly in the Central Plains. Once such a person appeared, they would definitely face a full-powered attack from Grand Xia.","However, it was different in the Eastern Sea. In addition to a large number of itinerant cultivators, there were also many evil, demonic, foreign, and unorthodox forces mixed in.","The Red Flame Demon Sect was one of the famous demonic sects. It was proof that they could nurture a top-notch prodigy like the Junior Flame Master who was on the Prodigy List. The reason why the Prodigy List was valued by the various large factions was largely related to this. If one could not nurture a prodigy who could make it to the Prodigy List, they would stand at the top of the world.","At this moment, many people were watching the disciples of the Red Flame Demon Sect and the Flying Celestial Sect clashing. Although the Red Flame Demon Sect was slightly smaller than the Flying Celestials, this was the Eastern Sea. No matter how powerful the Flying Celestials were, they were powerless here.","The Red Flame Demon Sect was not afraid of the Flying Celestials.","“Hmph, the Flying Celestial Palm Strike of the Flying Celestials is nothing. It’s far inferior to the Red Flame Demon Saber of our Red Flame Demon Sect.” The Junior Flame Master sneered.","His expression was extremely proud. In the blink of an eye, he slapped a few of the Flying Celestial disciples. It was obvious that he wanted to cripple their martial arts.","“Because it’s the Elder Princess’ birthday, I won’t kill you. However, I will cripple your martial arts and let you know what is called power.”","“Who said that the Flying Celestial Palm Strike is inferior to your Red Flame Demon Saber?”","Suddenly, a clear voice was heard, followed by a shocking sword light that swept across the sky, almost instantly exploding the huge hand.","“Who is it?” The Junior Flame Master’s expression turned cold. Behind him, the expressions of his followers also changed drastically.","Immediately after, a figure arrived in front of everyone.","“This is impossible... Senior Chu!”","When the true disciples of the Flying Celestials saw Chu Yunfan in a moon-white robe, their expressions immediately changed. They were in complete disbelief.","It was Chu Yunfan!","Some time ago, the news of Chu Yunfan’s death had caused an uproar. At first, no one believed this, but soon, the Demon God Sect announced to the public that they would take responsibility for this matter. For the Demon God Sect, killing a prodigy like Chu Yunfan, who was on the Prodigy List, was naturally a great thing. There was nothing to hide.","The Flying Celestials were naturally furious. Almost immediately, they sent a large number of experts to the scene to investigate, but the conclusion was that Chu Yunfan could not have survived such an attack.","Chu Yunfan’s name was no longer on the Prodigy List.","Everyone tacitly agreed that Chu Yunfan should have already died. Many people could not help but sigh. Chu Yunfan was like a meteor in the night sky. He appeared too fast, but the speed at which he disappeared was also extremely fast. Before many people could even familiarize themselves with this name, Chu Yunfan had already been confirmed dead.","After half a year, many people had long forgotten about Chu Yunfan. After all, he was just one of many failures and was meaningless. In their eyes, he was extremely glorious when he was still alive and had created a series of records. But so what? It was not who laughed the loudest who laughed the best, but who laughed the last.","Chu Yunfan, who had fallen in advance, did not have such qualifications.","Everyone in the Flying Celestials knew about Chu Yunfan’s death. Even the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials were furious. It was not easy for Chu Yunfan, a genius who could stand shoulder to shoulder with Yang Dengxian, to appear. Who would have thought that he would die before he could display his strength?","Such a loss was simply unbearable. In many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was someone who could assist Yang Dengxian in the future and make the Flying Celestials flourish. In the future, though he wouldn’t be the sect master, Chu Yunfan should be the head supreme elder.","And such a person had died. The Flying Celestials were incomparably furious. They attacked several times and took turns to wipe out the Demon God Sect’s branches in various places.","The Demon God Sect had clearly expected this and had already escaped, leaving behind an empty shell. This made the Flying Celestials’s upper echelon feel as if they had been slapped in the face.","These true disciples of the Flying Celestials naturally knew the truth. Who would have thought that when they thought that they could not escape the calamity, a person they thought had already died would appear again?"]},{"number":1943,"title":"Chapter 1943 I’ll Kill You to Save the Common People From Misfortune","paragraphs":["1943 I’ll Kill You to Save the Common People From Misfortune","It was why they were in disbelief. It was as if they had seen a ghost. The first thought in many people’s minds was that someone was impersonating Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, how could there be an identical person?","Chu Yunfan’s reappearance had shocked them to the core!","“Senior Chu! It’s really Senior Chu!”","Soon, they confirmed that the person who appeared before them was not an imposter. It was really Chu Yunfan. After all, no one would want to impersonate him at this time, and there was no need to. They didn’t know how he had survived, but there was no doubt that seeing Chu Yunfan at this time was like seeing a savior.","“You’re Chu Yunfan?” At this time, the Junior Flame Master also revealed a somewhat surprised expression. Although he had never met Chu Yunfan, it was naturally impossible for him not to pay attention to the movements of the other ninety-nine people on the Prodigy List.","How could he not know that Chu Yunfan’s death had caused such a huge incident? He just didn’t take it to heart. It was just a meteor that came and burnt out in a hurry.","He thought that people like Chu Yunfan were too arrogant and fell into the trap of others. No matter how amazing their talent was, no matter how talented they were, it didn’t matter.","However, he had not expected to see the person he thought had fallen here.","“That’s right. It’s me.”","Chu Yunfan’s words caused a huge uproar. In the surrounding sea, many pairs of eyes were watching this scene. When they heard that Chu Yunfan personally confirmed this, there was a huge uproar.","“It really is Chu Yunfan? He’s still alive?”","Many people gaped in disbelief. They couldn’t believe that the person standing before them was Chu Yunfan.","“How is this possible? Even his name was removed from the Prodigy List. How did he achieve this?!”","“Who is Chu Yunfan? Why do you all seem to be familiar with him?”","Some of the older experts had been in seclusion all year round. They had only come out of seclusion because of the Elder Princess’ birthday. They had never heard of Chu Yunfan. After asking around and learning about his deeds, they could not help but exclaim in wonder.","They had thought that Chu Yunfan had already died, so they could ignore him. After all, no matter how amazing a dead person was, he was still dead. But if Chu Yunfan was still alive, everything was completely different.","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but this did not affect Chu Yunfan and the Junior Flame Master, who were in front of the rainbow bridge.","“You’re still alive?” The Junior Flame Master looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. His expression changed from shock to arrogance and indifference. ” don’t know how you’re still alive, but so what? Your ranking is lower than mine. You were still far from the Creation Stage before. Although I don’t know how you got on the Prodigy List, I’ll let you know that even if you are, the Creation Stage and the Cosmos Stage are completely different.”","The Junior Flame Master’s eyes were filled with murderous intent. Although he did not know how Chu Yunfan survived, he was not interested. However, he knew one thing, and that was that he was going to kill Chu Yunfan.","Some people only knew Chu Yunfan as the Great General of Grand Xia. He was a first-grade official and a general of the empire. However, these people knew more. There was one thing that made them, the prodigies, feel that it was very difficult to deal with.","However, for many of the prodigies who were interested in winning the competition, Chu Yunfan’s existence was like a fishbone stuck in their throats. After all, if Tang Siyu made a scene of refusing to marry, the scene would be ugly.","If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary commoner, he would have died countless times. However, Chu Yunfan did not die. Under the suppression of Li Qianyuan, he became stronger and stronger until he was almost on equal footing with them.","If this continued, it would be terrible.","“The Demon God Sect and the demons are trash. They dared to announce to the public that they killed you. But it doesn’t matter. Since you’re not dead, I will kill you myself now.”","The Junior Flame Master Young Master smiled coldly. He knew through secret channels that the Elder Princess was not satisfied with Chu Yunfan, but this did not need any secret channels at all. He only needed to analyze it a little to know. After all, Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were engaged, but the Elder Princess still ignored Chu Yunfan and was about to hold a husband selection ceremony. This was clearly completely ignoring Chu Yunfan.","The Elder Princess probably looked down on Chu Yunfan. Therefore, if he killed Chu Yunfan now, he would not offend the Elder Princess. Instead, he would make her happy.","“Kill me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “A piece of trash like you? I’ve really been away for too long. Any Tom, Dick, or Harry dares to clamor in front of me. You’re just a dog of the demons. How dare you appear before me. I’ll kill you so that you won’t bring disaster to the common people.”","“Such arrogance!” the Junior Flame Master roared. In an instant, he made his move. His body seemed to tear out a bloody figure in the air and instantly rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","He had unleashed a power ten times more terrifying than before. He had not unleashed his full strength when he was dealing with the Flying Celestials’ true disciples. The difference between the Creation Stage and the Cosmos Stage was more than ten times. He did not need to use his full strength.","And now, it was time for him to show his true strength.","The Flying Celestial disciples found it difficult to breathe. It was as if a large hand was grabbing their throats and silencing them.","“You dare to clamor in front of me with your insignificant skills?!” Chu Yunfan shouted and took a step forward, breaking the Junior Flame Master’s astonishing aura. Then, he punched out.","Boom!","The fist force was like a monstrous wave that swept everything and instantly smashed toward the Junior Flame Master."]},{"number":1944,"title":"Chapter 1944 Killing the Junior Flame Master With One Punch","paragraphs":["1944 Killing the Junior Flame Master With One Punch","The fist force was like a strong wind, sweeping over like a tidal wave.","Rumble!","The fist force shattered everything, and it felt as if it was suppressing the myriad worlds with one punch. It was vast and mighty, and the Junior Flame Master felt as if the heavens had collapsed. His pupils constricted slightly. He felt as if his entire body was being crushed by a terrifying force.","“No!” the Junior Flame Master roared and rose into the air. A Red Flame Demon Saber appeared in his hand. The saber light swept across the sky. Before the saber light landed, a terrifying crack that was more than ten thousand feet long was cut into the sea.","“As expected of the ultimate technique of the Red Flame Demon Sect, the Red Flame Demon Saber!”","“As expected of a figure at the top of the Prodigy List. With just this attack, the Junior Flame Master lives up to his reputation.”","In the distance, many experts hidden in the void saw this scene and exclaimed in admiration. Even the big shots in the Creation Stage were amazed by the attainments of this saber attack.","Not to mention the experts of the younger generation, even many of the older generation Creators might not be able to slash out such a saber.","“This generation’s prodigies on the Prodigy List have grown up. If the Junior Flame Master is already so powerful, how powerful is Li Qianyuan who is ranked first?”","“Some people say that Li Qianyuan is on the same level, while the others are on another level.”","“That’s right. Wasn’t it rumored that Li Qianyuan killed the Sea Prince?”","“But it’s confirmed that he didn’t. It was just a rumor. It’s not true.”","The saber light swept out and broke through the sky. In an instant, it swept down and smashed toward Chu Yunfan’s fist.","Boom!","The fist force tore through everything and shattered the saber light. The saber light that could shatter the vacuum was shattered inch by inch. Then, the force of the fist did not decrease. It was a simple attack that tore everything apart and blasted in the direction of the Junior Flame Master. During this process, terrifying collisions and explosions continuously erupted.","Layers of barriers and restrictions appeared. They were the defensive barriers of the Junior Flame Master’s defensive precious artifact. At this moment, they were torn apart layer by layer. Hundreds of layers of defense were shattered by one punch. There was no way to block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“Aaggh!”","The Junior Flame Master screamed and coughed up a mouthful of blood. His eyes were wide open and he was completely in disbelief. His entire body was trembling.","Everyone saw that there was a huge hole in his chest. Blood splattered from the hole. It was a bloody hole.","The Junior Flame Master struggled for a moment and fell from the sky. He could not maintain his flight and fell directly into the sea, dyeing a large area of the sea red in color.","Everyone was dead silent. They didn’t even need to scan with their divine wills to know that the Junior Flame Master was dead.","When warriors started at the Divine Abilities Stage, they would develop some divine abilities. These divine abilities were instinctive and did not need to be maintained at all. They operated them almost instinctively, and flying was an extremely important aspect. It could even be said that this was instinctive.","Divine abilities were different from martial arts techniques. They were inconceivable, unreasonable, and against common sense. Moreover, for a figure who had cultivated to the Creation Stage, there was only one possibility that they could not maintain their flying ability, and that was to die.","“He... He’s dead!”","Regardless of whether it was the disciples or the Creation Stage powerhouses, they all watched this scene with their mouths agape. Even the Flying Celestial disciples, who had been very confident in Chu Yunfan could not believe that he killed the Junior Flame Master who had injured so many disciples in one move.","The Junior Flame Master, who had monstrous demonic flames, could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. He was killed in a single punch. It didn’t seem to be any harder than crushing an ant.","Everyone was dumbfounded. In their opinion, whether it was in terms of cultivation, inheritance, or status, the Junior Flame Master should not have been defeated so miserably. How could he be easily crushed? It was just like how the Junior Flame Master had easily taken care of these ordinary Flying Celestial disciples. They were almost powerless to fight back.","Many of the geniuses of the younger generation who were allowed to attend the Elder Princess’ birthday celebration were proud geniuses. Even if they couldn’t compare to the top geniuses on the Prodigy List, they still considered themselves to be people of their own regions.","However, the Junior Flame Master’s attack from earlier completely shattered their understanding. Their cultivation was only about the same as the true Flying Celestial disciples, but they were easily defeated by the Junior Flame Master when so many of them joined forces. If they were not lucky enough to be saved by Chu Yunfan, they would probably have died.","The Junior Flame Master’s attack made them truly understand how far they were from the legendary figures on the Prodigy List. But even such a big shot couldn’t withstand a single punch from Chu Yunfan. How was this possible?","“Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t die, his ranking is lower than the Junior Flame Master. How did he do this?”","“So strong. This is simply unbelievable. Has the gap between the prodigies reached this level?”","“No, it’s not that the Junior Flame Master isn’t strong enough. He’s stronger than many veteran Creators, but he couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s punch. This can only mean that Chu Yunfan is too strong.”","The Flying Celestial disciples started exclaiming.","“He’s too strong. As expected of Senior Chu!”","“The Junior Flame Master was arrogant just a moment ago, but now he was killed with a single punch!”","“They’re too arrogant. So what if they’re from the Red Flame Demon Sect? They’re still not our match.”","The Flying Celestial disciples burst into laughter. Chu Yunfan had killed the Junior Flame Master with a single punch, which made them feel proud and relieved.","However, on the contrary, many of the itinerant cultivators in the Eastern Sea had ugly expressions on their faces. They all remembered the arrogance of the Red Flame Demon Sect.","The Flying Celestials were very powerful, but this was the Eastern Sea. In these parts, the strength that the Red Flame Demon Sect could display was above the Flying Celestials. Now that their strongest descendant had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, one could imagine how angry they would be.","They had all witnessed the scene of the marine folks falling out with the Li clan because of the Sea Prince’s death. It could be said that they were terrified.","Now that the Junior Flame Master was dead, the battle between the Flying Celestials and the Red Flame Demon Sect was just around the corner. After all, it was not easy to nurture a disciple who could enter the Prodigy List."]},{"number":1945,"title":"Chapter 1945 The Dominator of the Next Era","paragraphs":["1945 The Dominator of the Next Era","Even a behemoth like the marine folks would go to war, let alone the Red Flame Demon Sect. Their base was far away from the Central Plains, so they were not afraid of the Flying Celestials, which could cover the sky with one hand.","“I’m afraid there will be more trouble from now on.”","“That’s right. These young geniuses have finally grown up. According to past experiences, after these young geniuses have grown up, they will inevitably undergo a cruel elimination battle. Only after continuous and cruel elimination will the remaining geniuses become the top figures of this generation.”","Many people thought to themselves that from past experience, the elites of each generation were often not included in a single Prodigy List. As the older generation reached the age limit, a new Prodigy List would be designated, and there would be an endless stream of new generations.","The various prodigy battles would not stop either. It would be good if only one-third of the hundred people on the Prodigy List remained. There was an endless stream of prodigies rising together. The Prodigy List would be updated four or five times to completely represent an era.","Every time the Prodigy List was updated, it meant that there was a cruel prodigy battle. Only those who remained would be the rulers of the next era. And this was only one of the prodigies on the Prodigy List. Many people realized that as this generation’s prodigies grew up, another bloody storm was about to arrive.","After Chu Yunfan killed the Junior Flame Master with a single punch, he sneered and took the corpse away. If it was in the past, he would not have been so calm even if he had killed a prodigy on the Prodigy List.","After all, he was the top genius of their generation. But now he had even killed the Sea Prince, who was ranked fourth. Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first, was killed by him. He was just lucky to escape.","With these achievements as a foundation, even if others didn’t know, Chu Yunfan didn’t care much about them. No one in his generation could compete with him.","“You...You killed our young master. The Red Flame Demon Sect won’t let you get away with this!”","The followers of the Red Flame Demon Sect shouted with ashen faces and charged at Chu Yunfan. Although these people knew that they were no match for him, they were all servants at the lowest level. They had long been cursed and had to protect the Junior Flame Master with their lives.","Now that the Junior Flame Master was dead, even if they were alive, they would not be able to escape death. Their entire family would even be implicated and their entire clan would be destroyed.","After all, the Red Flame Demon Sect was a demonic sect. These people were well aware of the sect’s unreasonable and tyrannical behavior. The only way to prevent their families from being dragged down by them was to die in battle.","At this moment, they were all determined to attack Chu Yunfan. There was even a third-level Creator demon among them. His mana and demonic flames surged into the sky, and his cultivation was even stronger than the Junior Flame Master’s.","A Red Flame Demon Saber appeared in his hand. This was condensed from divine ability, and its power was even stronger than that of the Junior Flame Master’s.","Boom!","The saber light slashed down, wanting to blast a huge hole in the sea, heading straight for Chu Yunfan’s head.","“Petty tricks.” Chu Yunfan sneered and waved. A large golden hand appeared and grabbed the saber light.","Crack, crack, crack!","The saber light was crushed inch by inch by the golden hand in the air. The demonic energy contained in it scattered.","However, Chu Yunfan suddenly attacked. With a wave of his hand, the fragments of the saber light swept out like a meteor shower.","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","The terrifying saber light blasted the Junior Flame Master’s followers into a bloody mist that filled the sky. Even the Creator demon was no match for Chu Yunfan. His chest was pierced by a saber light fragment and his life was cut off.","The Creator demon was dumbfounded. He looked at everything in front of him in disbelief. He failed to block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","In an instant, the Junior Flame Master’s followers were wiped out. Everything was done so cleanly, just like how Chu Yunfan had easily killed the Junior Flame Master. Whether it was the Junior Flame Master or his followers, the lineup that ordinary people could not kill so easily was like paper in Chu Yunfan’s hands. They were not a match.","“Just in time for me to eliminate all of them at the same time. Troublemakers. How dare you appear in front of me? You really have a death wish.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and swept his gaze across the void. Although many people were hidden in the void and did not reveal themselves, they could not hide from his eyes. Many of them were simply monsters.","However, Chu Yunfan did not make a move. In the Eastern Sea, there were countless itinerant cultivators. Among them, there were countless evil cultivators and many people who cultivated demonic martial arts. Of course, he couldn’t kill them all. He didn’t have the ability to do so. If it was that easy, Grand Xia wouldn’t have allowed them to exist in the Eastern Sea.","Chu Yunfan just wanted to use this incident to warn them that although he was a newcomer, he was not someone who could be easily bullied. This was a warning.","And it was obvious that the effect of killing the chicken to warn the monkeys was very good. When the itinerant cultivators on the Eastern Sea saw Chu Yunfan, they all avoided his gaze. There were only a few who dared to look at Chu Yunfan in the eye. Basically, they were all masters in the Creation Stage.","Many of them were the big shots of a sect or even the sect leader. For example, Tertius, who was Princess Yun Yang’s sword servant, was one of these monsters. Later, she was subdued by Princess Yun Yang and became a sword servant.","“Thank you for saving our lives, Senior Chu!”","The Flying Celestial disciples came to their senses. After tidying their robes, they came to Chu Yunfan and bowed to him.","“It’s nothing. The Junior Flame Master sure was bold. He even dared to cripple the cultivation of a Flying Celestial disciple. Killing him today is his retribution,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly as he waved.","The more he didn’t care, the more these Flying Celestial disciples felt Chu Yunfan’s strength. Even someone as strong as the Junior Flame Master couldn’t block Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Chu Yunfan killed the Junior Flame Master just like that.","Nobody would dare call the Flying Celestials a noob now. Other than Yang Dengxian, there’s no one else."]},{"number":1946,"title":"Chapter 1946 Tang Siyu’s Amazing Battle Record","paragraphs":["1946 Tang Siyu’s Amazing Battle Record","Although the Flying Celestials was one of the ten great sects and could be said to be extremely powerful, they naturally had the advantage over ordinary small sects. They could even order the sect masters of ordinary small sects around.","However, Yang Dengxian couldn’t manage so many things on his own. Even if he took action, he hadn’t heard of anyone beating up a prodigy on the Prodigy List. Getting back at him was just a matter of beating him up. It was basically impossible for Chu Yunfan to easily punch him like that. The whole process was smooth.","More importantly, Yang Dengxian was the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials. Any action he took had to take into account the Flying Celestials’ reputation and influence. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could kill people as he pleased. What could the Red Flame Demon Sect do?","What was domineering? This was domineering. If they didn’t like you, they would crush you to death. This was undoubtedly more in line with the wishes of these young true disciples.","“It doesn’t matter. We’re all Flying Celestial disciples, so it’s only natural for us to help each other. Moreover, the Junior Flame Master was courting death. How dare he say that the Flying Celestial Palm Strike of the Flying Celestials is inferior to the Red Flame Demon Saber of the Red Flame Demon Sect?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “The Flying Celestials has a long history and is a famous sect. The Red Flame Demon Sect is nothing. How dare the evil demons compare themselves to the Flying Celestials.","“I thought the Junior Flame Master had some skill. I didn’t expect him to be unable to block even one of my punches. He’s just so-so. He doesn’t deserve his reputation. It’s a great humiliation to think that I was as famous as such a person before.”","Chu Yunfan’s words were full of ridicule, and many of the demons on the Eastern Sea were not comfortable listening to him because they were also the evil demons that Chu Yunfan mentioned. However, at this time, Chu Yunfan had just killed the Junior Flame Master with a punch, so it could be said that he was in full swing.","They didn’t know what Chu Yunfan’s strength level was, so they naturally didn’t dare to act rashly. Moreover, these devils were selfish, so how could they stand up for the Junior Flame Master?","“Forget it, let’s not talk about trash like him. Today, all of you are here to attend the Elder Princess’ birthday banquet. I’ll bring all of you in.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he waved. These Flying Celestial disciples found themselves on the rainbow bridge. They couldn’t even step on it before, because they would immediately slide away. But now, they were standing steadily in Chu Yunfan’s footsteps. The rainbow bridge was activated, and in an instant, Chu Yunfan and the others appeared in the layers of space on the Serene Immortal Mountain.","“What dense spirit energy!” One of the disciples sighed.","Although the place where the Flying Celestial Sect was located was one of the top blessed lands and its ranking was higher than the Serene Immortal Mountain, that location supported many many disciples at the same time. It could not be compared to Serene Immortal Mountain. Although the Elder Princess’ faction, too, had many disciples, worshippers, followers, and attendants, the core of the sect was established by the Elder Princess. The number of people in Serene Immortal Mountain was less than one percent of the Flying Celestials. The amount of spirit energy consumed was naturally not comparable to the Flying Celestials.","Therefore, everyone could feel that the density of the spirit energy in any place in the Serene Immortal Mountain was probably only enjoyed by prominent figures like them in the Flying Celestials.","“It’s normal for one’s cultivation to improve by leaps and bounds by cultivating in such a place. In addition, with the Elder Princess’ careful guidance, it’s no wonder Princess Gushe’s cultivation is earth-shattering. She killed three demon elites in a row and was able to escape from the Demon Region unscathed,” a true disciple said.","He then suddenly remembered that the other protagonist of this matter was Chu Yunfan and instantly shut up. Everyone else suddenly remembered the matter between Chu Yunfan and Princess Gushe, Tang Siyu. Although this matter wasn’t exactly a secret, it was only spread among a few people. However, after Chu Yunfan disappeared and Princess Gushe came out of seclusion, it was instantly exposed.","“Princess Gushe once came out of seclusion to kill a demon prodigy?” Chu Yunfan asked, a little stunned because he didn’t know about this.","At this moment, everyone started talking. After a while, he finally figured out what was going on. It turned out that not long after he was ambushed by the Demon God Sect and the demons, severely injured, and fled thousands of miles away, falling into a life-and-death crisis, he used the Mountain River Diagram to block the sensing of the Mysteries Pavillion, causing everyone to think that he had died.","After becoming the Elder Princess’s disciple, Princess Gushe, Tang Siyu, who no one had seen her fight, suddenly came out of seclusion and charged into the Demon Region. She found three demon prodigies on the Prodigy List and killed them one after another. None of these three could withstand more than a hundred moves from her. They were easily killed by Tang Siyu. In the end, she found the number one female prodigy in the demons, Hu Qingxuan.","The two sides fought for a thousand moves, and Hu Qingxuan was defeated. She almost died at the hands of Tang Siyu. If it wasn’t for the important figure of the Green Fox clan being alerted at the critical moment—saving Hu Qingxuan in time and scaring away Tang Siye—Hu Qingxuan, the legendary female prodigy of the demons, would have fallen at Tang Siyu’s hands/","In fact, this important figure of the Green Fox clan had even disregarded their reputation and chased after Tang Siyu, vowing to kill her. In the end, Tang Siyu had used all sorts of methods to calmly escape from the Demon Region and return to Grand Xia.","This battle had made her famous!","After her battles, everyone realized that Tang Siyu deserved her reputation and was extraordinary to be valued by the Elder Princess and regarded as her successor."]},{"number":1947,"title":"Chapter 1947 Everyone Was Shocked That Chu Yunfan Was Alive!","paragraphs":["1947 Everyone Was Shocked That Chu Yunfan Was Alive!","After killing several prodigies in one battle, Princess Gushe became famous and shook the world. Before this, everyone had vaguely heard that the Gushe Princess was the Elder Princess’ last disciple and had a revered status.","However, that was all. No one thought that Princess Gushe was very powerful. After all, Princess Gushe had only been under the Elder Princess for a few years, not even ten years. It was said that she was a disciple the Elder Princess had taken in from the Violet Thunder Prefecture and that her cultivation wasn’t all that great.","Who would have thought that in just a few short years, she would reach such a level and kill three prodigies in a row? No matter how much everyone had underestimated her before, they did not dare to underestimate her now.","After this battle, the Prodigy List was updated. Tang Siyu rushed into fourth place and the top ten in one go, replacing the deceased Sea Prince. She had absolutely shocked the world.","However, everyone’s understanding of Tang Siyu was still quite limited. Though the Mysteries Pavilion had released the Prodigy List, it was impossible for everyone to know about her. There were still many things that they did not know. There were even rumors that Tang Siyu also had a special physique, which was why she was favored by the Elder Princess.","She had to at least have a king-level physique. Otherwise, it would be impossible for her to catch up to these geniuses on the Prodigy List in just a few years, or even surpass them. However, they were only guessing. There was no evidence to prove this.","Chu Yunfan found out that Tang Siyu had stirred up a storm when he was missing. She even became one of the top prodigies on the Prodigy List. It was obvious that Tang Siyu had not sat idle during his disappearance. On the contrary, her cultivation had also increased at an astonishing speed.","Others were shocked, but Chu Yunfan didn’t find it strange because they didn’t know what kind of physique Tang Siyu had. She had the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique after consuming the Arcane Sky Spirit Fruit. There was once an emperor-level expert with this physique, the Arcane Sky Empress. It was a genuine emperor-level physique.","Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first on the Prodigy List, had caused endless storms with just his king physique. His name shook the world and he became the first of his generation. Tang Siyu had an emperor physique, and her aptitude was even more amazing. It was only a matter of time before she caught up with the group of prodigies. If she was given some time, Li Qianyuan would fall at her hands. What she lacked now was time.","In addition, with the guidance of a top-notch expert like the Elder Princess day and night, and the continuous accumulation of all kinds of resources, it was only natural for Tang Siyu to have reached such a level.","She would be able to create more miracles as time passed.","A moment later, a woman dressed in a palace dress descended from the sky and arrived before everyone. After looking at everyone, she said, “Are you all disciples from the Flying Celestial Sect? Please report your names. Once I’ve checked on them, I will lead you to a place to rest.”","After everyone reported their names, Chu Yunfan reported his. The woman in the palace dress looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of surprise. She clearly knew Chu Yunfan, but this surprise was only for a moment before disappearing.","“Please follow me,” the woman said.","Everyone followed behind the woman and entered the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain. There was a small town at the foot of the mountain. It was a primitive town with mountains, rivers, and lakes. At this moment, many experts from all over the world had come to this town.","Almost all of these experts were young experts. However, every one of these people was an outstanding figure of the younger generation. The weakest among them was a Cosmic true disciple of a large sect. Some of them even had fluctuations that made the Flying Celestial’s true disciples tremble in fear. These were auras that belonged to Creators.","The suppression of the level of life was enough to make them tremble in fear. However, when they walked beside Chu Yunfan, they felt as if they were bathed in a spring breeze. They naturally understood that he had isolated the aura that the Creators had unintentionally released.","They had seen this kind of scene many times. When they walked past a group of elite disciples at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage, it was the same. Some of the elite disciples with stronger perceptions could feel the suppression from the level of life.","The arrival of these Flying Celestial disciples attracted the attention of many people. However, when they saw that the person in the lead was Chu Yunfan, they gasped.","“How is it him?”","“Isn’t he already dead?”","“What’s going on?”","Almost everyone was shocked and gasped as if they had seen a ghost. Many people knew that Chu Yunfan had been ambushed by the Demon God Sect and the demons, but not many people knew the truth. They were all the best among the younger generation of each sect, so they were naturally qualified to know the truth.","They all knew that Chu Yunfan had been killed by a supreme figure of teh demons with great divine powers. It was impossible for him to survive. The fact that Chu Yunfan’s name had been removed from the Prodigy List was proof of this. Now, they actually saw Chu Yunfan appear again. If this wasn’t seeing a ghost, what was it?","“It’s really him. There’s no mistake. It’s not a ghost, it’s a living person!”","Soon, someone confirmed Chu Yunfan’s identity. He was definitely not an ominous thing that had been left behind by some means, not to mention that he had the Flying Celestial true disciples following behind him. If it wasn’t, how could these Flying Celestial disciples be willing to follow behind him?","Chu Yunfan’s arrival attracted the attention of many people, especially those who came here to attend the birthday celebration. Their goal was to be chosen as Tang Siyu’s husband, so it was naturally impossible for them not to know about Chu Yunfan. As Tang Siyu became famous in one battle, some things that not many people were interested in became information that everyone had.","Most importantly, her fiancé was Chu Yunfan.","“Please wait here. When the birthday celebration begins, someone will come and lead you to the location of the banquet,” the woman in the palace dress said as she bowed.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re alive!”","Suddenly, a surprised voice came from behind Chu Yunfan.","He turned around and saw Princess Yun Yang, whom he hadn’t seen for some time."]},{"number":1948,"title":"Chapter 1948 It’s Time to End Li Qianyuan!","paragraphs":["1948 It’s Time to End Li Qianyuan!","When Princess Yun Yang saw Chu Yunfan, her eyes were no longer as calm as before. On the contrary, there was a hint of surprise. His appearance was clearly also a great shock to her.","Back then, Chu Yunfan’s death was endorsed by the two behemoths, Grand Xia and the demons. Both of them confirmed that he had died. However, now she saw Chu Yunfan. With her cultivation, she could tell that this was not an imposter. Appearances could be imitated, but the aura of a strong person and their unique temperament could not be imitated.","That was why she was so shocked. Chu Yunfan was still alive when everyone had already sentenced him to death. Her mood was no different from the others. It was as if she had seen a ghost.","However, she was a princess who had the fate of a true dragon and wanted to fight for the throne. Facing the strange situation of Chu Yunfan’s resurrection, she was only slightly shocked before she immediately recovered her calm expression.","“It’s been some time, Princess. It feels like a lifetime.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Although it hadn’t been that long since they last met, it felt like a lifetime to him. He had escaped from the hands of the demon big shot. It was as if he had escaped from hell, even though he had escaped from the pursuit at the critical moment. Thinking about the situation back then, he might have been beaten to death if he was not careful.","“I didn’t expect you to be able to escape death under such circumstances. Could it be that you’re really the chosen one?” Princess Yun Yang smiled. With her status, she naturally knew more than ordinary people. She even knew which supreme figure of the demons had attacked.","Although the Grand Commandant’s Office had kept this matter a secret, it still had to be presented to the king. As the most outstanding children of the king, they naturally had various ways to obtain the information they wanted.","That terrifying figure of the demons was an existence that even the Grand Commandant had a headache over. His status in the demons was not much inferior to the Grand Commandant’s status in Grand Xia. An expert of that level could scheme against others. If he wanted to kill someone, other than a few people in the world, no one else could escape.","However, Chu Yunfan had narrowly escaped death. Just this experience alone would shock the world and make him famous in one battle.","“I was just lucky. I will get back at them sooner or later,” Chu Yunfan said with a calm expression.","After experiencing this narrow escape, he was like a phoenix. To him, it was like his soul had experienced another transformation. Even if the other party was a top-notch expert in the world, Chu Yunfan was not afraid.","Princess Yun Yang smiled. She didn’t take Chu Yunfan’s words seriously. In her opinion, the place Chu Yunfan was talking about should be those people who cooperated with the Demon God Sect and the demons to ambush Chu Yunfan.","Or rather, it was directed at the mastermind behind the scenes, Li Qianyuan.","In reality, the Grand Commandant’s Office had stirred up a storm of blood in Grand Xia, uprooting many of the powers that had participated in this matter. However, everyone knew that they were only peripheral existences. The real core of this was Li Qianyuan. It was just that there was no direct evidence, which allowed him to escape.","Although Li Qianyuan was a famous young genius in the Grand Xia Army and was ranked first on the Prodigy List, he was part of the younger generation. In the eyes of the Grand Commandant, he was still nothing.","“Li Qianyuan is here too,” Princess Yun Yang said as she smiled. “I’m afraid it won’t be easy for you to win the selection.”","“It’s good that he’s here. I’ll finish him off once and for all,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“You overestimate yourself and boast shamelessly.”","At this moment, a cold snort suddenly came from nearby.","Chu Yunfan turned his head and saw a handsome young man of about 27 or 28 years old striding over. He carried a saber on his back and his body carried a sharp saber aura.","“I didn’t expect you to still be alive, Chu Yunfan. But it’s all well. I can now avenge my previous humiliation,” the young man said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“Who are you?” Chu Yunfan pursed his lips and was barely bothered to look at the man.","“I am Yang Lan of the Godly Sabers.” The young man’s eyes burst out with an astonishing sharp light as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“The Godly Sabers?” Chu Yunfan recalled that when he had just entered the 100th place on the Prodigy List, he had experienced his first Prodigy List battle. The person who had attacked him at that time was none other than the disciple of the Goldy Saber Sect, Lin Dingtian.","At that time, Lin Dingtian was ranked 99th, and Chu Yunfan was ranked 100th. That was his first time experiencing a prodigy battle, so he had a deep impression of it.","“That’s right. Do you still remember how you killed Lin Dingtian, the chief disciple of my sect?” Yang Lan asked coldly.","“I’m sorry, I’ve killed too many people. I don’t have any impression of that person,” Chu Yunfan replied nonchalantly as he leisurely studied his fingernails.","Of course, he remembered who Lin Dingtian was. However, he had not shown any mercy to Lin Dingtian because Lin Dingtian had appeared under Li Qianyuan’s order. It was clear that Lin Dingtian was there to kill him, and facing such an enemy, Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t be soft-hearted.","“You bullying b*astard!” Yang Lan gritted his teeth in anger. “I heard that you also said the Godly Sabers are trash. Today, I’ll show you how powerful my sect really is. Don’t think that you can underestimate my sect because you defeated Senior Lin. Today, I’ll show you the difference between you and the Creation Stage!”","In the blink of an eye, the long saber on Yang Lan’s back was unsheathed. The saber’s light streaked across the sky and slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","Yang Lan had reached the realm of becoming one with the saber. In terms of strength, he was more than ten times stronger than Lin Dingtian back then.","After all, Lin Dingtian was only at the peak of the Cosmos Stage back then and had yet to enter the Creation Stage. Now that Yang Lan had entered the Creation Stage, he was more than ten times stronger than Lin Dingtian’s.","The terrifying momentum of a Creator soared into the sky, shocking almost everyone. Many Cosmics present found it difficult to breathe. It was as if every breath they breathed carried a sharp saber intent that wanted to cut them into pieces."]},{"number":1949,"title":"Chapter 1949 The Horror of One Finger","paragraphs":["1949 The Horror of One Finger","It was completely different from Lin Dingtian’s time. The peak of the Cosmos Stage was only a step away from the Creation Stage. However, the actual difference was like a natural chasm.","When one cultivated to the Cosmos Stage, one would be called an expert. However, only when one cultivated to the Creation Stage could one be called a giant. Most sect masters and supreme elders cultivated in this way.","Yang Lan had crossed a natural barrier at such a young age. Although he did not make it onto the Prodigy List, he was definitely one of the strongest people below the Prodigy List and was a strong candidate for the Prodigy List.","He could enter the Prodigy List at any time. Although he would be in the last few places, it was still very impressive. To ordinary geniuses, he was still an unattainable figure.","After Lin Dingtian died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, the Godly Sabers pushed Yang Lan up, wanting to push him onto the Prodigy List. It proved that the Godly Sabers had not declined and was still the top existence under the top ten sects.","“It’s over. I’m afraid this won’t be easy for Chu Yunfan to deal with.”","Many people’s expressions changed when they saw this scene. Although Yang Lan was not on the Prodigy List and Lin Dingtian was on it back then, Yang Lan was ten times stronger than Lin Dingtian back then.","Chu Yunfan was able to defeat Lin Dingtian previously because Lin Dingtian was only at the peak of the Cosmos Stage, and Chu Yunfan had been at the same level. Although such a battle record was shocking, it was still within the scope of everyone’s understanding.","However, Yang Lan was different. No matter how Chu Yunfan struggled, he had yet to pass the Cosmos Stage. He was just a trapped beast fighting in vain.","“Sigh, Chu Yunfan’s legend has come to an end. No matter how impressive he was when he was in the Cosmos Stage, and even when he entered the Creation Stage in the future and might be able to dominate the Creation Stage, his greatest weakness is that he hasn’t broken through to the Creation Stage!” A Creator prodigy sighed.","Chu Yunfan’s legend would come to an end here. The person who had spoken had truly stepped into the Creation Stage, so he was all too clear about the huge gap between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage. It was not something that could be closed by hard work.","“It’s uncertain yet who will win and who will lose...” Princess Yun Yang, who was at the side, said indifferently. “Yang Lan is seeking his own death. The Godly Sabers has nurtured him for nothing.”","Princess Yun Yang’s expression was indifferent because she had seen Chu Yunfan kill Huyan Zhuo. Compared to Huyan Zhuo, Yang Lan was no match for Chu Yunfan.","“You’re the new head disciple of the Godly Sabers? However, after today, your sect will have to choose another one.” Chu Yunfan sneered. His voice was extremely cold. He didn’t dodge Yang Lan’s attack.","Bam!","The saber light slashed at Chu Yunfan. Just when everyone thought that he was going to be cut in half, Yang Lan’s eyes suddenly narrowed as if he had seen something extremely terrifying.","This was because he realized that the saber light was not able to cut Chu Yunfan in half. It was different from what he had expected. In his opinion, as long as Chu Yunfan had not entered the Creation Stage, he would not be able to withstand a single blow from him. No matter how powerful he was in the Cosmos Stage, it was meaningless.","This was because the Creation Stage had already broken away from the Cosmos Stage. It was like an ant transforming into a heavenly dragon. They were existences on completely different levels.","However, what had happened now told him that he was wrong. Chu Yunfan’s terror seemed to have surpassed the Cosmos Stage and killed his way into the Creation Stage.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Chu Yunfan raised his arm and formed a huge finger in the sky. It was like a pillar that supported the sky and crushed down. Although it was just a finger, and many people could not feel any pressure, Yang Lan’s expression had already changed greatly. Unlike him, Chu Yunfan’s control of divine ability had long reached the peak.","The pressure pressed down inch by inch. With every inch he went down, the terrifying aura doubled. In almost no time, Yang Lan felt that it was difficult to breathe. Just like the pressure he exerted on the Cosmics, it became more and more terrifying.","“How is it so powerful? Break!”","Yang Lan immediately entered the state of becoming one with the saber. All the mana in his body condensed, and his cultivation at the peak of the first Creation Stage instantly erupted. He naturally did not have such strength in vain. At this point, he could only fight to the death.","Yang Lan seemed to have transformed into a divine blade that could cut through the sky, slashing everything and creating a new world. When many Creators saw this scene, they could not help but nod their heads. Yang Lan’s saber move had indeed displayed his elegance and was extraordinary.","However, most people were dumbfounded. At this moment, even the true disciples of the Cosmos Stage could see how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s finger was. They couldn’t even feel any fluctuation of divine ability, but it had forced Yang Lan to this extent. One could imagine that this finger was definitely not that simple. It was just that they could not sense the danger within it. This showed that Chu Yunfan’s control over his divine ability had reached a shocking level.","“How is Chu Yunfan so strong? Hasn’t he reached the Creation Stage yet, right?”","“Yeah, I’ve never heard of him being so powerful.”","“Although Yang Lan isn’t an expert on the Prodigy List, he’s probably not much weaker than those experts ranked at the bottom of the Prodigy List. He could get on the list at any time, but now he’s facing Chu Yunfan. How could he be so vulnerable?”","“After Chu Yunfan disappeared, his strength seems to have taken another leap.”","“This is terrifying!”","At this moment, everyone saw the saber intent on Yang Lan’s body crack inch by inch. He instantly retreated from the state of being one with the saber. He screamed and blood came out of his entire body. Everyone focused their eyes and saw that his muscles were cracking inch by inch.","Spurt!","Finally, Yang Lan couldn’t hold on any longer. He spat out a mouthful of blood and flew away like a kite with a broken string. He fell to the ground fiercely, and it was unknown whether he was dead or alive."]},{"number":1950,"title":"Chapter 1950 Cripple Your Martial Arts, the Godly Sabers Has to Chose Another Chief Disciple","paragraphs":["1950 Cripple Your Martial Arts, the Godly Sabers Has to Chose Another Chief Disciple","In an instant, everyone fell into a deathly silence. Just a finger had caused a Creator to be heavily injured and unconscious. What kind of ability was this? It was simply unimaginable.","Even those prodigies who had already stepped into the Creation Stage were so shocked that their eyes almost fell out of their sockets, let alone the ordinary Cosmic true disciples. They simply could not imagine how Chu Yunfan had done this.","A Creator might be able to do this to them, but with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was actually able to force a Creator to this extent. How strong was Chu Yunfan?","At this time, when they looked at Chu Yunfan, they had already changed their views of him. It was not like before. Although they had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name, most of them thought of him as only Tang Siyu’s fiancé.","Chu Yunfan had briefly appeared on the Prodigy List before, but his ranking was not considered high. Moreover, he had relied on his shocking combat strength to get on the Prodigy List.","No one took him seriously. At that time, only Li Qianyuan had entered the Creation Stage among the prodigies. The rest were basically at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. Although there was a certain gap between them, the difference was not big, so Chu Yunfan could rush into the top 30. However, as the group of prodigies entered the Creation Stage one after another, Chu Yunfan’s original advantage became his biggest disadvantage. If he could not enter the Creation Stage, his combat strength would be unable to cross the gap with the others.","But now, they realized that Chu Yunfan had already made up for this gap and even jumped ahead of them.","“Although Lin Dingtian died by my hands, it was a fair and square challenge. Fists and kicks have no eyes, so even if you die, it would be in vain. If you still want to avenge him, you must be prepared to die at my hands. Originally, you would not be able to escape death, but since today is the Elder Princess’ birthday, I will spare your life and cripple your martial arts. The Godly Sabers will have to choose another chief disciple,” Chu Yunfan said calmly as he stood with his hands behind his back as if he was not the one who had attacked ruthlessly just now.","For him who had been training overseas for so long, this was really nothing. He had experienced countless massacres in a place that these prodigies could not imagine. What was a mere Creator? Many peak Creators had fallen at his hands, and he had even killed countless Creators. A Creator was no different from a Cosmic in his eyes.","Everyone kept quiet out of fear as if they had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan’s words made them feel as if he was looking down on the world. Although the Godly Sabers were not as powerful as the top ten sects, the fact that they could push their successor onto the Prodigy List was enough to prove the strength of the Godly Sabers. Under the ten behemoths of the top ten sects, they were still one of the few first-rate sects in the world.","Now, Chu Yunfan had asked the Godly Sabers to choose another chief disciple. How domineering was this? Although he didn’t kill Yang Lan, crippling his martial arts was equivalent to becoming a cripple. For cultivators like them, it was probably even worse than killing him.","For the Godly Sabers, this was also an unbearable burden. Even if they could heal him with great effort, the time wasted in the process was enough to widen the gap between Yang Lan and his peers.","Now, the prodigies on the Prodigy List were chasing after each other. Every minute and second was precious. It was impossible to catch up after a few years. Not everyone was like Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu who managed to overtake everyone. Although Yang Lan’s talent was strong, he would never have the possibility of reaching the top.","“What powerful strength! What a domineering style.”","Many people present could not help but narrow their eyes. They felt as if they were not facing a prodigy on the Prodigy List, but a terrifying existence that could affect the entire world.","As for the Flying Celestial disciples, they did not have so many scruples. Soon, everyone heard their unrestrained cheers.","“He’s so strong. As expected of Senior Chu!”","“That’s right. This Yang Lan dares to make a ruckus in front of Senior Chu. He’s really doomed!”","“Even the Junior Flame Master had died at Senior Chu’s hands. What’s a mere Yang Lan?”","The Flying Celestial disciples felt proud. Although the Flying Celestials were powerful, they were still ordinary true disciples. None of them had a lower status than them. There were many people who made things difficult for them on a daily basis. There were also many people who ridiculed the Flying Celestials for not being worthy of the status of the top ten sects.","Now, they had completely vented their anger, especially when Yang Lan dared to challenge Chu Yunfan. It was simply a slap to the Flying Celestials’ face on the spot.","“What? The Junior Flame Master died at Chu Yunfan’s hands?”","At this moment, everyone present found out for the first time that the Junior Flame Master had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Originally, they were amazed that Yang Lan could not fight back against Chu Yunfan and was beaten up by a finger.","But now, when they heard that even the Junior Flame Master had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, they were suddenly speechless. Many people had heard about the Junior Flame Master. Although he was a member of the demonic path, his strength was indeed extremely shocking. He was a genuine prodigy on the Prodigy List.","Although Yang Lan was impressive, he was incomparable to the Junior Flame Master. They were not on the same level. So if the Junior Flame Master had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, it was not strange that Yang Lan’s martial arts were crippled.","“How did Chu Yunfan become so powerful?”","“Chu Yunfan is about to explode. I thought he was planning to use his status as Tang Siyu’s fiance to stop the selection. Now it seems that other than being legitimate, his cultivation is also world-shaking. He has a chance of winning even if he competes with absolute strength.”","“Tyranny without strength is simply courting death. But with his strength, no matter how tyrannical he is, what can anyone do? The Red Flame Demon Sect is an evil demon. The Godly Sabers are not as strong as the Flying Celestials. I’m afraid even if they die of anger, they won’t be able to do anything to Chu Yunfan.”","“There’s going to be a good show this time!”","Many true disciples of the Cosmos Stage were here only to watch the show. Only the young geniuses who had already entered the Creation Stage were grim. They were the ones who were truly qualified to participate in this husband selection.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan’s powerful attack had announced the appearance of an extremely powerful competitor."]},{"number":1951,"title":"Chapter 1951 Killed in One Strike","paragraphs":["1951 Killed in One Strike","Chu Yunfan became the number one enemy in the eyes of many people because his identity was naturally the biggest advantage, not to mention the strength he had displayed. Without a doubt, he would become the biggest threat.","Chu Yunfan could clearly feel the hostility in the eyes of many prodigies, but he did not take it to heart. He knew that the Elder Princess did not seem to like him, but he still came. He only had one belief.","There was no retreat. Even if there were thousands of people, I would still go!","Moreover, the threat of these people was insignificant to him. Only he knew it best. Even the Sea Prince, who ranked fourth on the Prodigy List, died in his hands. Li Qianyuan almost died at his hands too. How could he care about these people?","He even couldn’t wait to meet Li Qianyuan and take advantage of this opportunity to completely solve this scourge.","These gazes looked at him with obvious hostility.","“Chu Yunfan, no matter what, you fought on the Elder Princess’ birthday and killed the Junior Flame Master. Aren’t you afraid that the Elder Princess will punish you?” someone in the crowd spoke.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a man in black. There was a cold smile on his face, and it was also a little cold.","Sure enough, everyone’s gaze became more and more unfriendly. Everyone had thought of this point. The Elder Princess did not like Chu Yunfan, and this was a place where she could play tricks.","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan. You have to give an explanation!”","“Chu Yunfan, don’t even think about getting away today!”","Everyone was filled with righteous indignation.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. “You are blinded by greed and overestimate yourself. I know why you are here, but I have already returned. Do you think your plan will succeed? I might as well say it directly. I’ll give you one chance. Withdraw from this selection. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude.”","“Choose. Think about your own abilities. If you lose your life, that will be the end of you.”","Chu Yunfan’s words were filled with an extremely cold aura. Even those who were determined before couldn’t help but start to hesitate. Many people knew that they didn’t have much hope. But now, with Chu Yunfan’s return, everything was completely different.","Originally, if they could not compete, it was just that they could not compete. They would not form a life-and-death feud. However, it was different now. The feud of stealing his wife was irreconcilable.","At the thought of this, all the Cosmics took a step back, indicating that they would withdraw from this competition. They had no hope, and they knew it. Therefore, even if they withdrew, they did not feel that it was a pity.","However, there were still more than 20 Creation Stage prodigies left. Some of them were on the Prodigy List, while the rest were the best in their respective sects even if they were not on the Prodigy List.","“The rest is up to you to choose. Retreat or die.” Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold, and his eyes flashed with terrifying killing intent. He had already given these people a chance. If these people were still blinded by profit, then they couldn’t blame him for being rude.","Chu Yunfan’s words were not polite, angering these Creators. However, they remembered how Chu Yunfan had easily crippled Yang Lan’s martial arts and killed the Junior Flame Master. Such strength made them tremble in fear. Even they couldn’t tell what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had.","Thinking of this, many people made up their minds. In an instant, most of them took a step back. There were only five people left. Each of these five people was a Creation Stage prodigy—the best among them.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can cover the sky with one hand? Choosing a husband for Princess Gushe is the Elder Princess’s order. Do you plan to go against the Elder Princess?” a middle-sized young man suddenly spoke.","“Stubborn.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Even if the Elder Princess intends to choose a husband for her disciple, trash like you are not qualified. You are not worthy.”","In a flash, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of the middle-sized young man. The young man was shocked. He felt his hair stand on end as if he was being stared at by a primordial beast. His cultivation had already entered the Creation Stage, which was even stronger than Yang Lan. However, when he faced Chu Yunfan who suddenly appeared in front of him, it was as if he had met his natural enemy.","“Sh*t!” The middle-sized young man instantly reacted. However, he discovered that his body seemed to be suppressed by a divine mountain. A terrifying aura suppressed him tightly. He couldn’t escape!","Thinking of this, the middle-sized young man’s expression changed. A fierce expression appeared on his face. A sword had appeared in his hand at some point. The sword light swept across the sky. Wherever the sword light passed, the sky was filled with a cold wind, turning the surroundings into a country of ice.","“As expected of the Sky Swords’ Frost Sword Li Xuan. Although he’s not targeting us, he makes us feel like we’re about to be frozen!”","Many people gasped. They could feel that the air they inhaled was almost freezing their lungs. The strength of the medium-sized young man, Li Xuan, was too terrifying.","The speed of this attack was too fast. Chu Yunfan was right in front of him. He didn’t even need to cross the sky. He directly tore the sky apart, bursting out the sound barrier and setting off a sound wave that almost pierced everyone’s eardrums.","“Die!” Li Xuan roared and the sword in his hand pierced into Chu Yunfan’s mind.","However, before he could let out a happy smile, he realized that his sword could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. It pierced the surface of Chu Yunfan’s skin, causing sparks to fly everywhere.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan attacked. He didn’t move, but he pointed his finger out.","This finger instantly broke through the frozen sky and pointed toward Li Xuan.","Li Xuan’s sword technique was offensive but not defensive. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to counterattack under such circumstances. Chu Yunfan pierced through his forehead and instantly killed him."]},{"number":1952,"title":"Chapter 1952 A Lot of Sects Has to Replace Their Chief Disciples!","paragraphs":["1952 A Lot of Sects Has to Replace Their Chief Disciples!","“So this is the Sky Sword Sect? They should really replace their true disciple.”","“How did this happen?” Li Xuan was dumbfounded, but his brain was already starting to die and he could not think. He fell from the sky immediately.","Chu Yunfan knew from the words of the people around him that this middle-sized youth was this Sky Sword generation’s top disciple. Moreover, the sect was also a first-rate sect under the top ten sects. They possessed extremely powerful strength and had countless swordsmen, and they produced sword immortals in every generation.","As their disciples cultivated the sword path, they were extremely powerful. Even their sword light had extremely terrifying destructive power. With Li Xuan’s cultivation, one sword strike was enough to split a divine mountain into two.","Unfortunately, he had met Chu Yunfan. His attack couldn’t even penetrate Chu Yunfan’s astonishing defense, and he could not fight back against the opponent’s attacks. It could be said that he had met his nemesis.","As no one ever had abilities like Chu Yunfan’s, whether it came to attacking or defending, he was impeccable and had no weaknesses.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “You overestimate yourself!”","When everyone saw this, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air, especially since although Li Xuan was not on the Prodigy List, he was still a famous existence in their hearts. These people were the so-called Prodigy List substitutes. Although Li Xuan was not on the list yet, he could be promoted at any time and place for various reasons. In the eyes of many people, his strength was not inferior to those geniuses ranked at the bottom of the Prodigy List.","In the end, Li Xuan was killed by Chu Yunfan with a single finger. How powerful was this man?","“What level has his physical body reached? He’s practically indestructible!”","Many people were shocked, realizing that they didn’t seem to know Chu Yunfan at all. They thought that they knew a lot about him, but now it seemed that they didn’t know anything at all. Moreover, it did not help them understand the current situation at all.","Someone said, “Including the Junior Flame Master who died before, Chu Yunfan has already killed or crippled the chief disciples of three sects. Although these sects are not as powerful as the Flying Celestials, even they have to think twice before angering those three sects.”","At this moment, everyone suddenly remembered that those experts who were killed and crippled by Chu Yunfan were the top disciples of the various large sects. Usually, the death of just one person was enough to cause a commotion, let alone so many people dying together. Thinking of the boundless waves caused by Sea Prince’s death in the Eastern Sea, it was obvious that these sects would not let it go easily.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to notice their worries. He just looked at the remaining four people coldly.","The remaining people finally understood had Li Xuan had felt. It was as if they had been targeted by a vicious beast, and that terrifying feeling made their scalps go numb.","“It’s your turn. Looks like a large number of sects will be replacing their chief disciples today.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","“Your greed really extends to no bounds. For the sake of benefits, you are willing to die. I admire your courage,” Chu Yunfan said in admiration, but there was a mocking smile on his face. This made the remaining four peoples’ expressions turn extremely ugly.","In their respective sects, which one of them wasn’t considered a high and mighty chief disciple? Although they weren’t behemoths like the ten great sects, they still had a respected status. Even if they came to a place like the ten great sects, these behemoths still had to treat them with courtesy.","If they wanted to work in the Imperial Court, their future path was already paved. As long as they followed the assigned steps, they would definitely become top-notch figures and influence the entire world.","However, Chu Yunfan did not care for them one bit. He treated them like ants, which completely angered them.","He wanted to let everyone know that there might be some things that could be discussed, but when it reached this point, he would never compromise, no matter who it was. No matter who was behind them, whether it be a prince or a faction, anyone who dared to touch him would die. These peoples’ heads were undoubtedly the best warning he could give.","“How arrogant. Do you really think you’re invincible?” At this moment, a tall man who seemed to be dyed in golden yellow strode out from among the four.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the man and said, “Are you a member of the Jin clan?”","He could instantly tell the man’s background. He should be a member of the Jin clan, another military family in Grand Xia. In the entire empire, only this clan had golden skin because of their martial arts. Only by cultivating to the extreme could they return to their normal appearance.","Although the Jin clan wasn’t as powerful as the Li clan, they were still considered one of the most powerful military families in Grand Xia. Their family had many ancestors who had fought for Grand Xia and made countless contributions. Their influence was extremely vast.","“That’s correct. Jin Yong wishes to learn your martial arts!”","The tall man had a sinister smile on his face. Others might be afraid of Chu Yunfan’s amazing physical defense, but he was not afraid. The Jin clan was famous for their physique techniques, and that was how they got their golden skin colors. Ever since his debut, no matter what kind of strong enemy he met, he would beat them to death. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was no exception.","“If you dare to underestimate me, I’ll beat you to death!”","Jin Yong’s entire body was like a rampaging tank, sweeping across the sky. His fists were like golden hammers, fiercely smashing toward Chu Yunfan.","Zzt!","The entire sky exploded in an instant, turning into a golden tide that swept toward Chu Yunfan. In an instant, Chu Yunfan was drowned in the golden tide."]},{"number":1953,"title":"Chapter 1953 Slapping Jin Yong to Death in One Palm","paragraphs":["1953 Slapping Jin Yong to Death in One Palm","The terrifying golden tide drowned Chu Yunfan in an instant.","Jin Yong’s face revealed a sinister expression. Only he himself knew how terrifying his fist force was. After all, one of the sharpest and most unstoppable metal-type powers surged within it.","The Jin clan was invincible on the battlefield because of their divine skills. They did not need any divine weapons because their bodies itself was a weapon. They were extremely rare physique cultivators.","Physique cultivators had extremely terrifying physical cultivation, in which divine and martial arts were nothing to them. They could tear those kinds of practitioners apart with a casual move. Even if a person’s cultivation base had reached a certain level, it would be very difficult for them to deal with experts whose cultivation base was higher than theirs. In short, they were invincible on the battlefield.","The others were afraid of Chu Yunfan, but Jin Yong was not. Even if Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was higher than his, it would be difficult for Chu Yunfan to do anything to him, let alone others.","The metal-type power was like a raging tide, enough to destroy everything. However, when it swept past, everyone saw that Chu Yunfan did not move. He allowed the power to pass by, but it could not do anything to him.","“You overestimate yourself. Although physique cultivators are rare, do you think that everyone can’t do anything to you?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. He was well aware of how powerful these body cultivators were, but his body was even more terrifying.","However, although he seemed to be a physique cultivator, he actually wasn’t. It was just that many of his methods were similar to those of a physique cultivator.","To Chu Yunfan, body, divine power, alchemy, and so on weren’t his paths. His route was for all-round development without any weaknesses. His martial arts, divine power, cultivation mastery, all of them were top-notch skills. Therefore, when an expert of the same level encountered him, they could not even block a single finger from him, just like Yang Lan before. Even an expert of a higher stage would not be able to withstand a single blow when facing him.","“Impossible!”","At this moment, Jin Yong’s expression already changed. However, it was naturally impossible for him to be captured obediently. He pushed his cultivation to the limit, and his entire body erupted with waves of golden light. It was as if he was a general made of gold.","The divine power emitting from his body was extremely powerful and divine. His cultivation level was finally revealed at this moment. He had even surpassed Yang Lan and had already stepped into the second level of the Creation Stage. It could basically be said that he was no different from the prodigies on the Prodigy List. After all, an expert of this level could enter the list at any time.","He was unimaginably powerful.","In addition, he had always been a tyrannical physique cultivator. Even when facing the prodigies from the Prodigy List, he would not be at a disadvantage. To many people, he was probably much more difficult to deal with than the Junior Flame Master.","“World-Shocking Fist!”","Jin Yong’s entire body emitted bursts of golden light as if the sky was filled with rainbow light, making him look like a gold-covered general. His fists were like two huge hammers that smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“You think too highly of yourself.” Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely cold, neither sad nor happy. He stretched out his hand that emitted traces of lightning and blocked the two hammers falling down on him.","Clang!","A loud sound of metal clashing rang out as if two huge pieces of iron had collided. It set off a huge storm.","“He blocked it?!”","Many people present saw that Chu Yunfan had blocked Jin Yong’s move, and they couldn’t help but be amazed. The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was too shocking. He was like a god who would kill anyone in his way. He had even defeated Yang Lan of the Godly Sabers, Li Xuan of the Sky Swords, as well as a bunch of others. In addition to the Junior Flame Master that he had killed earlier, it could be said that he had almost made everyone fall into depression.","They were all on the Prodigy List, but Chu Yunfan had let the other party know what despair was and the gap between them. After all, not all of them deserved to be on the list. Both sides were on the same level and in the same stage, not to mention that the vast majority of people even felt that the Prodigy List was out of their reach.","Chu Yunfan’s strength initially rose to a certain level in their hearts. But now that he had met someone stronger than him, he didn’t seem as invincible anymore.","However, just as everyone was about to laugh out loud, they suddenly saw Jin Yong’s face reveal a horrified expression. Then, he spat out a mouthful of blood. Immediately after, cracks appeared on his face. They spread all over his body like a spider web, densely packed.","Fresh blood seeped out from the cracks, and the terrifying scene made everyone gasp.","“I can’t accept this!” Jin Yong screamed.","For the first time, his eyes were filled with fear as he understood the difference between him and a top-notch prodigy. He and Chu Yunfan were like heaven and earth. Perhaps to others, he was already powerful enough, but to Chu Yunfan, he was just a slightly stronger ant.","Bam!","As soon as Jin Yong finished speaking, his entire body exploded into pieces, turning into a golden light that filled the sky and mixed with his blood and flesh. Everyone couldn’t help but gasp. They saw how Chu Yunfan had smashed Jin Yong into pieces.","“The Jin clan’s golden body has always been strong. Even on the battlefield, it couldn’t be easily torn apart by even the most powerful beast. Its physical strength is almost comparable to that of the ancient demon clans. However, it couldn’t even withstand Chu Yunfan’s single attack!”","“There was neither any divine nor martial art used, but it was just a single slap. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it even if I were beaten to death!”","“Is he a monster? He can’t be human. Or does he have some special physique? That should be impossible. The Jin clan’s golden body shouldn’t be so easily defeated!”","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with shock in their eyes as if they had seen a ghost. The Jin clan’s physique technique had always been strong, and it was well-known in Grand Xia. When trained to the extreme, it could compete with a king-level physique.","Without this fact, Jin Yong wouldn’t have been so arrogant. But now, the golden body that everyone thought was impossible to break was easily destroyed by Chu Yunfan. It was as if he had casually pierced through a piece of paper with no difficulty whatsoever.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was no longer a human, but a monster in human skin. They didn’t even know what kind of inheritance he had and how he could be so amazing.","“This is why you should never bark up the wrong tree,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, then he looked at the remaining three people. “It’s your turn next. I’ll send you all on your way.”"]},{"number":1954,"title":"Chapter 1954 Geniuses?","paragraphs":["1954 Geniuses?","At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked at the remaining three people. Each of them was tall and straight, and they all carried auras that ordinary people could not imagine. They could all be labeled as young behemoths. They can even establish their own sects with their cultivation!","Under Chu Yunfan’s gaze, they all revealed a bit of fear, but that soon turned into anger. What kind of people were they? They were the top disciples of their respective sects, and they were geniuses. Now, they actually revealed a timid expression when Chu Yunfan looked at them. It was simply a great humiliation.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve killed so many people and offended many sects. Are you going to be enemies with the world?” the leader among them spoke. He was dressed in a crimson robe that looked like flames, resembling a Fire God.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the man and said, “Divine Flames’ Shen Fan?”","The Flying Celestial disciples had already told Chu Yunfan the identities of these three people. Things had already reached this point. Although they also felt that they had caused big trouble, they were already grasshoppers on the same rope as Chu Yunfan. Naturally, they could not support others instead of their own people.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know these people’s identities. What he knew was only limited to the people on the Prodigy List. There were only 100 of them on the Prodigy List, but there were several times more people outside of it who could enter at any time. Of course, Chu Yunfan didn’t know everyone.","The Divine Flame Sect was one of the strongest sects within the ten great sects. It was located in the desert northwest of Grand Xia as a guardian there. It could be said that the number of experts there amounted to as much as the clouds.","To be able to nurture their chief disciple to such a level, one could imagine how powerful they were. Their fire techniques were famous around the world.","The strength of these first-rate sects below the top ten sects was not much different. Whether or not a disciple could enter the Prodigy List in each generation depended on their luck. If the talent of this generation’s successor of a sect was stronger, they would naturally be able to enter the Prodigy List.","However, even if they couldn’t make it onto the list, there was not much difference. Basically, there would still be inheritors who could approach the Prodigy List and even enter it.","Other than Shen Fan, there was also a young man with a spear in his hand. His entire body emitted an irrepressible sharpness as if he were a spear that could support the heavens.","Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows at the man’s background. He was one of his old rivals, the chief disciple of the Iron Spear Gang, Zhang Heng.","At that time, there were many people in the Iron Spears who followed Li Qianyuan. They even used their sect’s power to try and kill Chu Yunfan. Both sides had long-running grudges with each other.","However, the current situation was completely different from the past. Back then, Chu Yunfan had to do his best to deal with just one of the Iron Spears’ top disciples. But now, even if he was facing their chief disciple, he was not afraid in the slightest.","On the contrary, under Chu Yunfan’s gaze, Zhang Heng showed a bit of fear.","The last person was different from the others, exuding a dark aura. Although he stood there, he gave off a feeling that people could almost forget about him. He was from one of the three great assassin organizations in the world, the Blood Evil Tower’s gold-medal assassin, Unseen.","No one knew Unseen’s background. They only knew that he was the youngest gold-medal assassin in his organization. The Blood Evil Tower itself was one of the few killer organizations in the world. It could be said that they were a thorn in the side of countless forces. They had killed many leaders, and they had even once angered some of the top ten sects. Those forces tried to surround and suppress the Blood Evil Tower with all their might, but they haven’t been able to uproot this organization.","The organization’s influence spread all over the world, accepting all kinds of missions. Except for a small number of forbidden ones, there was almost no mission that they did not dare to accept, and there was no one that they did not dare to kill.","The craziest time was when they attempted to assassinate the previous Grand Xia Grand Commandant. After that, the empire was enraged and surrounded them from all sides. The Blood Evil Tower hid for a long time and suffered a great loss. However, they also became famous after that battle. From then on, their reputation rose, standing out from the many organizations and becoming one of the three great assassin organizations.","Although there was little information about Unseen, being able to become a gold-medal assassin was enough to explain everything. The Blood Evil Tower’s standard was that only after successfully assassinating a Creator could one be qualified to become a gold-medal assassin and be ranked among the top people in the organization.","Moreover, Unseen’s strength had clearly reached the Creation Stage as well.","In the eyes of many people, he was much more difficult to deal with than ordinary geniuses. This kind of assassin could be dedicated to tracking a person for ten years in a row, just to find a trace of weakness from their target and kill them.","It was not that the members of the Blood Evil Tower hadn’t done this kind of thing before. As the saying goes, you can be a thief for a thousand days, but there is no reason to guard against thieves for a thousand days.","It was precisely because of this that ordinary people also avoided the Blood Evil Tower’s experts like the plague.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t worried and only looked at Wuhui coldly. Ordinary people were afraid of these assassins, but he didn’t feel any fear. It was impossible to find his flaws with the godhead in his mind. He was always in a state of enlightenment and was always aware that it could be said that he was these assassins’ nemesis.","Moreover, in his opinion, as long as they were not ambushed, these assassins’ ability to fight head-on was too weak. They wouldn’t be able to withstand a single blow.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can cover the sky with one hand? Even the mighty Destiny Sect can’t achieve that.” Shen Fan looked at Chu Yunfan with a fierce expression on his face. At this moment, he was already regretting his decision to stay. He had been blinded by the benefits of meeting Tang Siyu, so his thoughts were disturbed.","At this moment, he felt like he was in extreme danger. Chu Yunfan had no mercy at all.","Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Geniuses, huh? Haha! Didn’t I give you a chance to retreat before? Since you guys are so stubborn, then don’t blame me for what I’m about to do.”","Suddenly, the divine power in his body surged. The three people opposite him instantly felt their hair stand on end as a terrifying aura swept over them."]},{"number":1955,"title":"Chapter 1955 Since I’m Lawless, so What if I Cover the Sky With One Hand?","paragraphs":["1955 Since I’m Lawless, so What if I Cover the Sky With One Hand?","Only then did the three of them truly know what fear was. Just now, Chu Yunfan had scared them without even using his full strength, let alone now when he made them feel despair.","His power alone had subdued the three of them!","“Fight him to the death! I don’t believe that he can continue doing whatever he wants!” Shen Fan roared. His scarlet robe began to erupt with flames. Like a volcanic eruption, it formed a pillar that soared into the sky.","The other two didn’t say a word, but they had the same thoughts. Zhang Heng put on silver armor, looking as if he had stepped onto a battlefield. The spear light around his body stirred up the wind and clouds above. Unseen merged into the void and disappeared without a trace. However, everyone knew that his current state was his true terrifying form as an assassin.","“Hmph, am I lawless for covering the sky with one hand? Since I’ll be lawless forever, so what if I can really do that?” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. His gaze swept across his entire surroundings, forcing the geniuses present to avoid his gaze. They did not dare to look at him at all.","At this moment, he suddenly attacked. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and energy surged up and swept out in an instant, transforming into the Eight Heavenly Dragons.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","The technique swept in one direction, representing the eight most powerful Gods in the heavens. In an instant, it broke through the sky.","At this moment, a figure fell out from within. Everyone looked at it and wondered who it was if it wasn’t Unseen.","Everyone was shocked. Although they had never seen the Blood Evil Tower’s methods, they had heard of them before. It could be said that they were extremely low-profile. They always paid attention to escaping a thousand miles away whenever an attack failed.","If Unseen didn’t have a powerful aura-concealing technique, how could he approach his target without anyone noticing and then carry out the assassination?","There were even people who had surpassed the Creation Stage among those who were killed. If the Blood Evil Tower’s aura concealment technique was not strong enough, they would have died countless times.","Just now, many of them had also used their divine sense or opened their Dharma Eyes to find Unseen. Although they couldn’t detect him, they still wanted to know how he did it. Just in case they offended these assassins in the future, it was better for them to be well-informed.","However, the result was, of course, nothing. With Unseen’s level, he could even assassinate a Creator and hide in the void. Unless a person’s cultivation had exceeded his level, no one could easily see through him.","However, they didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to discover Unseen’s existence so easily and force him out with a punch.","“Impossible!” Unseen’s eyes revealed a bit of disbelief as if he had seen a ghost.","After he concealed his aura, he had never been discovered by anyone. This was his specialty. If he was discovered, with his current strength, he wouldn’t be a match for experts on the same level as him.","Suddenly, he felt a strong threat. The eight dragons formed by the Eight Astonishing Punches had no intention of stopping after tearing the entire surroundings apart. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s fist momentum did not decrease and blasted toward Unseen.","“Let’s go all out!” A dagger appeared in Unseen’s hand. It flickered with a blue light, which was the manifestation of poison. He slashed the dagger toward the fist energy.","However, it was futile. Unseen couldn’t even block the attack, and his dagger shattered inch by inch. Although it was also a high-grade magic weapon, it was useless against Chu Yunfan. It broke from a simple punch.","Bam!","The fist landed on Unseen’s chest. He didn’t even have time to react, getting pierced through as his blood sprayed out. In the next moment, he exploded in the air, turning into blood clots that filled the sky.","One punch, one kill!","At this moment, everyone was completely dumbfounded. They had yet to recover from the earlier battle. All of this took a long time to process, but it had only happened in an instant.","Many people had only just realized that Chu Yunfan had found Unseen.","Chu Yunfan had discovered Unseen and killed him with a single punch.","“You’re just a mouse hiding in the shadows. How dare you appear in front of me openly?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","Unseen and his Blood Evil Tower were truly bold. Blood Evil Tower was basically a wanted target among all the forces in the world. Because their business range was very broad, it was spread all over the world and involved all kinds of races. Naturally, they would be viewed with hostility by various factions. As long as they were discovered, they would get beaten to death.","Usually, the tower’s assassins wouldn’t appear in front of the public openly. But this time, it was different. The Elder Princess’ birthday banquet did not seem to prohibit these criminals who were usually wanted by Grand Xia from coming.","First of all, there was the Junior Flame Master of the Red Flame Demon Sect, and now there was the Blood Evil Tower’s gold-medal assassin.","Chu Yunfan was really dealing with a group of demons dancing around!","Chu Yunfan sneered. He had long heard that the Elder Princess had a wide network of friends. However, he did not expect her to be so brazen.","As expected, only when he was truly powerful could he make everyone worry. Only then could he be truly fearless and do what he wanted to do.","The Blood Evil Tower had been unable to be exterminated for so many years. It was likely that many forces behind it required the tower’s existence to eradicate some forces that they couldn’t take out by themselves.","There were many such forces in the Federation. Chu Yunfan was already used to it.","After killing Unseen with one punch, he went straight to Zhang Heng and Shen Fan.","Shen Fan was shocked. He wasn’t prepared to see Chu Yunfan kill Unseen with a simple and neat punch.","“Chu Yunfan, take this move of mine. Fire Lotus of Annihilation!”","A flaming lotus flower the size of a millstone appeared in Shen Fan’s hand. A terrifying pressure and destructive aura released from it, as if it could really destroy the world. In an instant, he aimed the lotus toward Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1956,"title":"Chapter 1956 Terrifying Invincibility","paragraphs":["1956 Terrifying Invincibility","The lotus flew toward Chu Yunfan. It almost burned a hole in the sky with its extraordinary flames.","Even a powerful Creator could die in his hands if he was not careful.","Unfortunately, the person he met was Chu Yunfan, who possessed the Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physique. Chu Yunfan could be said to be the ancestor of fire, not to mention that he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. The Alchemy Emperor’s comprehension of the flame path could almost be said to have reached the peak.","Shen Fan couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan, largely because all his powers were restrained in front of Chu Yunfan. There was no secret behind his loss at all.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the incoming Fire Lotus of Annihilation. He stretched out his hand and grabbed the lotus.","“You’re courting death!” Shen Fan roared loudly, his face revealing a hint of joy.","Chu Yunfan dared to directly use his hands to grab it. Wasn’t he just asking for trouble?","Shen Fan immediately formed a seal and roared, “Explode!”","The lotus drew in terrifying force and exploded, almost turning the entire mountain into dust.","“Oh no!”","At this moment, the Creators present were the first to react. Many of them felt a terrifying fluctuation that seemed to be able to destroy the world.","The experts present, regardless of their cultivation, were all people who had experienced hundreds of battles. It was just that their reaction speed was different according to their cultivation. However, they all felt extreme danger in an instant. They had already taken a defensive stance and condensed layers and layers of defensive barriers in front of them.","The Cosmics retreated thousands of meters away in an instant, assuming a defensive stance. The energy contained in this Fire Lotus of Annihilation made them feel a huge threat. However, the next moment, they were shocked to find that the crazy explosion they had imagined did not happen.","This was because Chu Yunfan had grabbed the lotus with one hand. It exploded, continuously releasing terrifying attacks. However, Chu Yunfan’s hand was like a big net that firmly held the lotus.","No matter how it exploded, it could not escape his grasp.","Many people were dumbfounded when they saw it.","“How is he doing this?”","When they saw this scene, they were scared silly. The lotus’ power could easily kill a Creator, but such a terrifying thing was actually in Chu Yunfan’s hand.","“That’s all?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He ruthlessly extinguished the lotus. In an instant, it disappeared without a trace.","The energy from the explosion failed to break through his palm’s defense and ended up being destroyed.","He had more than a hundred layers of defensive barriers before him as he knew the power of the technique he had released. It could be said that it was the most terrifying fire technique he could release at the moment. Even he didn’t dare to be swept by it. That was why he could only focus on defense.","Shen Fan still wanted to resist, but there was no time. Lightning enveloped Chu Yunfan’s fingertips, and a shocking sword light shot out. It swept across the sky and instantly headed in Shen Fan’s direction.","Slash!","The sword light instantly pierced through all of Shen Fan’s defenses with lightning speed. In an instant, it blasted through all of his barriers and through his throat. He had no strength to retaliate, just like an ant. Shen Fan fell on the spot, fresh blood spurting out.","Chu Yunfan had done all of this so casually that it was almost effortless.","“He’s too strong. This is the attitude of someone that is invincible in the world!”","“Some people said that Chu Yunfan was lucky to be able to enter the Prodigy List, but now I want to see just who is the actual lucky one!”","“How did he become so terrifying? What happened to him after he was chased?”","When many people saw this, they all sucked in a breath of cold air as if they had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan’s strength was too terrifying.","At this moment, only one of the five geniuses was left, and that was Zhang Heng, the Iron Spears’ chief disciple.","At this time, Zhang Heng’s mana had been condensed to the extreme. When Chu Yunfan had just killed Unseen and Shen Fan, he had already brought his spear energy to the extreme and reached the form of being one with the spear.","Moreover, he had already adjusted to this form. On the battlefield, there was no opportunity for his enemies to fight back. Usually, when he attacked, it would be a one-hit kill. Therefore, he had no intention of saving the other two. They were his competitors anyway. If they died, so be it.","“Chu Yunfan, this time, I’ll settle the score with you for killing a disciple of my gang!” Zhang Heng roared and jumped up. In an instant, he released a pillar-shaped spear light that pierced toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The sky shattered, and everything broke down. The spear’s power had already surpassed the first level of the Creation Stage and directly rushed to the second level. Although it was only a small difference, it was twice as powerful as the power that Zhang Heng could display previously.","“Again, you think too highly of yourself. You think you can do that with just you?” Chu Yunfan shouted and took a step forward. He opened his hand and the spear hit his palm.","To everyone’s horror, they saw that Zhang Heng’s spear light hit Chu Yunfan’s palm and then cracked inch by inch. There was no way to break through Chu Yunfan’s palm defense.","Boom!","In the next moment, everyone saw the spear light shatter into pieces."]},{"number":1957,"title":"Chapter 1957 Everyone Has Underestimated Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1957 Everyone Has Underestimated Chu Yunfan","“Here! Take it back!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","“Sh*t!” Zhang Heng reacted immediately. In the blink of an eye, he unleashed another barrage of spear lights, blasting the incoming shards into pieces. However, before he could catch his breath, he saw that Chu Yunfan had already appeared before him. It was like Chu Yunfan had teleported in an instant.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and the terrifying force from it created a whirlwind.","In an instant, the attack tore the entire sky apart and blasted toward Zhang Heng.","The spear in Zhang Heng’s hand became like a long dragon, aiming toward Chu Yunfan.","“Let’s go all out!” he roared, and the spear’s aura transformed into a sky full of cavalrymen, turning the entire place into a huge battlefield. The aura he brought out was the cavalrymen itself.","Countless of them covered the sky and earth. In an instant, they wanted to tear apart all of their enemies. Even a Creator would feel a headache when faced with this kind of expert who had completely manifested his martial will.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. The fist energy from the Eight Astonishing Punches turned into eight dragons. They tore through the sky, shattering the entire bloody battlefield. The cavalrymen that enveloped the stratosphere actually shattered inch by inch.","The fist energy shattered everything and hit Zhang Heng. His armor shattered, unable to block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Spurt!","Zhang Heng spat out a mouthful of blood, his body breaking into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“I... I didn’t know he actually...” His eyes flashed with horror. If it were before, he would never have thought that he would die in such a sad way.","Chu Yunfan was the Iron Spears’ enemy. He had killed their top disciple, so the consequences wouldn’t be simple. If it weren’t for the fact that Chu Yunfan had been slapped to death by a big shot of the demons before, even Zhang Heng would’ve hesitated to take action.","However, who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would kill him with a single punch?","The information he had gathered on Chu Yunfan was like two different people. He didn’t seem like the same person on the intel. But no matter how much regret he had, it could not change the fact that he was killed in one punch.","The five geniuses who dared to stop Chu Yunfan all died!","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept across the entire arena. Many people were frightened and did not dare to look at him, while the geniuses who had entered the Creation Stage felt as if they had escaped death.","One had to know that some of them were still very conflicted about whether they should make a move or not. However, they now had completely reached a conclusion to not make a move.","This Chu Yunfan was not a normal person at all, but a monster in human skin.","This was especially true for prodigies like them who had stepped into the Creation Stage. They could be said to be high and mighty dragons among men. Moreover, they were not afraid even when facing prodigies on the Prodigy List. Even if they were facing Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first on the list, although there was a gap, they wouldn’t be so terrified.","“Ridiculous. You’re still using Chu Yunfan’s previous ranking on the Prodigy List to measure his skills. You should know that the Junior Flame Master, whom Chu Yunfan had killed, was previously ranked higher than the latter. In the end, he got killed. Therefore, the Prodigy List has long been inaccurate. At least, it has never been accurate on Chu Yunfan’s skills.”","Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly had already surpassed the ranking given to him on the Prodigy List. It had even far exceeded that limit. If any random person from the list could be this terrifying, then what was the point of people fighting any of them? By logic, it would be impossible for them to even enter the list.","“However, Chu Yunfan’s killing spree is only temporary. I’m afraid he’ll be in big trouble in the future. The Godly Sabers, Sky Swords, Divine Flames, the Red Flame Demon Sect, the Jin clan, and even the Blood Evil Tower. Which one of them is easy to provoke? No matter how powerful the Flying Celestials are, if these forces want to join forces to pressure the Flying Celestials, even that sect will have to seriously consider angering them.”","“That’s right. Which of these sects doesn’t have an old monster who has hidden away from the world? Previously, they were restricted by the taboos that everyone agreed on. But now, their chief disciples that they had nurtured with all their are dead. I’m afraid the Flying Celestials will be forced to make a move now.”","“Now, we’ll have to see what the Flying Celestials think. Will they do their best to protect Chu Yunfan? If they don’t do anything now, he will probably die.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Many people could see that Chu Yunfan had offended many sects. These organizations had spent a lot of effort to nurture their top disciples, and now they all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. How could they let this go?","While everyone was discussing, the disciples of the Flying Celestials had recovered from the excitement of seeing Chu Yunfan’s massacre. Although he was very powerful, the sects he had offended were not simple. The Flying Celestials could not ignore any of them, let alone the fact that if they all joined forces to pressure their sect, unpredictable consequences would arise.","On the side, Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan with inexplicable shock. Although she had hoped that he would interfere and prevent the Crown Prince’s faction from succeeding, in her opinion, his identity was only used to disrupt the situation and bring the husband selection ceremony to failure.","However, who would have thought that his performance far exceeded her imagination and preparations? She didn’t know how Chu Yunfan killed the Junior Flame Master, but she had seen how he had killed all the top prodigies on the Prodigy List.","Chu Yunfan did it easily as if he was chopping melons and vegetables!","At this moment, she suddenly realized that she had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Or rather—everyone had underestimated him, including her aunt, the Elder Princess."]},{"number":1958,"title":"Chapter 1958 Crushing All Those Who Don’t Have as Much Resources as He Does","paragraphs":["1958 Crushing All Those Who Don’t Have as Much Resources as He Does","Everyone had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s talent and ability. Compared to the other famous prodigies, he did not have any prominent background, nor did he have any shocking physique. It seemed that compared to everyone else, he was unremarkable.","Without any decent resources to support him, he managed to counterattack many prodigies. Although they didn’t know how Chu Yunfan compared to a genius like Li Qianyuan, it was an indisputable fact that he had surpassed most of the others.","In Princess Yun Yang’s opinion, even though Chu Yunfan had joined the Flying Celestials, the resources he had obtained from the sect were pitifully little. Although he had already obtained a lot in the eyes of ordinary people, it was no different from not getting any help in her view.","People like them were born with extraordinary talent. They had been tested very early on and their talent was shocking. Moreover, they had shown their talents at the age of a few years. Their talent was valued by the higher-ups in their clan and their sect.","All kinds of resources would pile up like mountains and seas. With the guidance of the best teachers, from the Physical Stage to the Creation Stage, all the roads were paved. As long as one cultivated according to the prescribed steps, they would be at the peak of the world and a first-class influence.","Whether it was Li Qianyuan, Yang Dengxian, the Junior Flame Master, or even the other geniuses Chu Yunfan had defeated, they were all the same.","As the princess of the royal family, Princess Yun Yang had shown her talent and ambition since she was young. The resources she received were much more than those of these geniuses. In her early years, she had made a great name for herself. However, she had restrained herself over the years. Although everyone knew that her cultivation could not be underestimated, no one knew how far she had reached.","Compared to these proud geniuses, what Chu Yunfan had obtained was not worth mentioning. It was like the flowers and plants in his home that had been taken care of and the weeds in the forest that had been destroyed by the wind.","However, even with such a huge gap, he had actually grown up. In Princess Yun Yang’s opinion, his cultivation had already surpassed Yang Dengxian’s.","This was simply unbelievable!","After all, in terms of talent, Yang Dengxian was top-notch. His physique was also extraordinary. Although Princess Yun Yang didn’t know what kind of physique he had, she knew that he had at least a king-level physique. Otherwise, it wouldn’t make sense for the Flying Celestials to go through so much trouble to nurture him.","Moreover, he was extremely talented and had an expert teacher to teach him. The sect did not lack any cultivation techniques. In addition, there were many resources piled up. However, Chu Yunfan was still able to catch up to him.","In Princess Yun Yang’s eyes, this was Chu Yunfan’s most terrifying aspect. She knew that he must have some shocking secrets that others didn’t know. Otherwise, those who were overtaken by him would have lived like dogs.","But even so, she knew that after this battle, there would be another top young master in the world, an existence that was enough to make the world look sideways. Of course, the premise only worked if Chu Yunfan could survive. At this time, he had offended many people.","Everyone was frightened by Chu Yunfan and kept quiet out of fear. Even the Flying Celestial disciples did not dare to speak to him.","Only Princess Yun Yang stepped forward and said, “General Chu, may I have a word with you?”","“Sure.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The two of them took a few steps forward. Although they didn’t walk far, they formed a barrier around themselves to block out prying ears and eyes. The others couldn’t even see the two of them clearly. It was impossible for them to even lip-read what they were discussing.","“Congratulations for escaping death and advancing your cultivation, General Chu. You are invincible!”","Princess Yun Yang said with a smile.","She smiled and said, “Today, when I saw you, I realized that what Siyu said was right. She said that you wouldn’t die so easily, even if the one who attacked was one of the demons. Now, it seems that she was right. My understanding of you is far inferior to Siyu’s.”","Tang Siyu had learned about Chu Yunfan’s secrets, including the Mountain River Diagram. He had escaped death several times before this, so it was not surprising that she had confidence in him.","Even if these were just Tang Siyu’s self-comforting words, it did not matter. After all, he had returned safely.","“People always have some secrets. It’s normal for me to have some tricks up my sleeve. Why make a fuss over this, Princess?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“I’m the one who’s fussing over nothing. But speaking of which, it’s true. You came from a remote and uncivilized land, and you didn’t even have a teacher to guide you, General Chu. For you to be able to reach this point, you’re naturally not an ordinary person.” Princess Yun Yang nodded.","Chu Yunfan smiled. Everyone thought that he didn’t have a teacher to guide him, but little did they know that the Alchemy Emperor’s memories in his mind consisted of the world’s top teachers. Compared to them, the teachers of the current prodigies were not even worth mentioning. It wasn’t that Chu Yunfan looked down on them, but they were simply incomparable. Even if there were good teachers out there, did one exist where he could preserve his memories like the Alchemy Emperor?","They all thought that Chu Yunfan had defied the heavens and reached his current state when he was lacking in everything. He knew about this speculation, but he didn’t care. How could there be such a magical thing in the world?","It seemed like Chu Yunfan had used an absolute disadvantage in terms of resources to counterattack, but in fact, he had used an absolute advantage in terms of resources to crush everyone who was inferior to him.","In terms of talent, all of his bloodlines and physique techniques were emperor-level physiques. His Imperial Physique was even one of the best among all. Moreover, his Immemorial Dark Phoenix Physique came from one of the ten ferocities, and his Thunderclap Physique was the ancestor of thunder in this world.","In terms of teachers, the others were even more incomparable. They were instantly turned into dregs. Li Qianyuan and the others didn’t lack various cultivation techniques, but did Chu Yunfan lack them?","Chu Yunfan had stronger techniques in his mind than Li Qianyuan and the others. He didn’t even care about the Sea-Overturning Sword Scripture that Li Qianyuan wanted to take away.","The only thing he lacked was all kinds of natural treasures needed for cultivation, so the lack of resources that he faced was not as serious as ordinary people thought.","On the contrary, what he had was far beyond their imagination!"]},{"number":1959,"title":"Chapter 1959 The One Who Should Be Careful Isn’t Me, but Them","paragraphs":["1959 The One Who Should Be Careful Isn’t Me, but Them","Princess Yun Yang said, “Even so, you should be careful. Li Qianyuan is here as well.","Chu Yunfan’s face was expressionless, but his heart was bursting with joy. Others didn’t know what the reason was, but how could he not know?","The person who had seriously injured Li Qianyuan was none other than him. If Li Qianyuan hadn’t been lucky, he would have died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. It was so strange that he couldn’t react immediately and let Li Qianyuan escape. Otherwise, Li Qianyuan would have died on the spot.","However, he did not care about Li Qianyuan now. Even if that man had made progress, how could he compare with Chu Yunfan’s progress? After his cultivation broke through to the Creation Stage in one breath, this peerless overlord who once made Chu Yunfan sleepless day and night was no longer worthy of his attention.","If Chu Yunfan met Li Qianyuan at this time, he could kill him with one punch. Not to mention one Scapegoat Doll, even ten Scapegoat Dolls would not be enough. After all, their difference in strength had long become larger. It was just that ordinary people did not know that.","“Besides Li Qianyuan, Meng Tianran from the Virtuous Academy, who is ranked fifth on the Prodigy List, is also here.” Princess Yun Yang told Chu Yunfan about the information she had obtained.","“Meng Tianran?” Chu Yunfan remembered the person he had met once. Back then, to him, Meng Tianran was a high and mighty existence that he could not compete with.","Before this, Meng Tianran had severely injured a Cosmic with a single stroke. At that time, Chu Yunfan had thought that it was unbelievable. However, now that he thought about it, with Meng Tianran’s cultivation, he was probably a little careless back then. Otherwise, how could he have let his opponent escape?","However, all that was nothing to Chu Yunfan now. After all, the Sea Prince, who was ranked higher than him, had already died in his hands. So what if he had to face Meng Tianran?","Princess Yun Yang saw Chu Yunfan’s expressionless face as if he didn’t care. She didn’t know whether he was really confident or he was just pretending. If it were before, she would only think that Chu Yunfan was pretending. In front of these top geniuses, he was at most a troublemaker.","However, after this series of battles, she no longer dared to say that he was just a troublemaker.","On the contrary, he was a peerless genius who truly had the strength to compete for first place.","Princess Yun Yang continued, “Other than that, there’s also the 11th-ranked demon prodigy, Flying Tiger.”","“Even demons are around. Ot seems that there are really a lot of ghosts and monsters!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “That big shot of the demons was afraid that I would grow up, so he actually disregarded his status and attacked me. Since that’s the case, don’t blame me for being impolite. I will use Flying Tiger’s head as a qualification for my promotion.”","Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan in astonishment. She didn’t know if he really didn’t know or if he was just pretending to not know. Let alone Flying Tiger, even if it was another big shot of the demons, even if an ordinary person was lucky enough to escape death, they would still keep a low profile and be careful afterward. How could they dare to act like Chu Yunfan? It was obvious that Chu Yunfan wanted to provoke that big shot.","She paused for a moment before saying, “It’s good to have such an idea, but don’t underestimate Flying Tiger. He’s the young leader of the Winged Tiger Tribe, one of the demons’ royal tribes. He’s also one of that tribe’s prodigies. You know them, right? To become a royal tribe there, one’s physique must be comparable to a king-level physique. Flying Tiger’s talent is unparalleled, almost invincible among the demons. There are very few people in his generation who can stand shoulder to shoulder with him.”","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew about the Winged Tiger Tribe. It was recorded in the book “The World’.” It was said that they had the bloodline of the ancient white tiger. Later on, they fused with the bloodline of other ferocious beasts and slowly evolved into winged tigers. Their bodies turned into what resembled tigers, and they grew wings on their ribs. They were born with the ability to automatically control the wind. Even if they did not cultivate, they could easily get to the Creation Stage using their bloodlines.","They were a tribe that was destined to stand at the peak!","The Winged Tigers were the strongest among the demons, and they were also the vanguards who invaded Grand Xia. They were infamous among the demons, and countless human experts had died in their hands.","It could be said that they were an existence that many people in Grand Xia wanted to eliminate as soon as possible.","They were a major existence among the demons, and no one was willing to provoke them.","Chu Yunfan said indifferently, not taking Flying Tiger to heart.","“Other than Flying Tiger, there’s also the young master of the southern barbarian’s Fire Cloud Cave, Meng Potian. He’s a very troublesome existence who is ranked 15th on the Prodigy List. All those who can enter the top 20 of the list are extremely terrifying beings,” said Princess Yun Yang, “I don’t think I need to tell you anything more about this.”","“The southern barbarians, the monsters, and the demons are a mess.” Chu Yunfan frowned. “However, are there only these people? Could it be that only the crown prince’s faction has taken action?”","“Of course not.” Princess Yun Yang shook her head. “Of course, my other brothers aren’t easy to deal with. They all have candidates and some of them are quite powerful. However, in my opinion, they are no match for you, so there’s no need to mention them at all. The real threats to you are these four people, so you must be careful.”","Chu Yunfan laughed and said, “Hahahahaha! Princess, I think you’re mistaken about something. The ones who should be careful are not me, but them. It’s not certain which side is in more danger.","“This is a good opportunity. These people are all ranked above me on the Prodigy List, so it’d be great if I could take them down all at once. It’s time to reshuffle the Prodigy List!”","A confident expression appeared on Chu Yunfan’s face. All those prodigies on the list wouldn’t be able to withstand a single blow from him."]},{"number":1960,"title":"Chapter 1960 First Meeting With the Elder Princess","paragraphs":["1960 First Meeting With the Elder Princess","Princess Yun Yang didn’t know whether to call Chu Yunfan arrogant or confident. If he had said this before, she would have thought that he had gone crazy. He actually thought that the top 20 on of the Prodigy List could be defeated in a single blow and that the ones who needed to be careful were them.","Despite that, she didn’t say anything. It was a big taboo to go too deep into certain topics.","“General Chu, you’d better inform the elders of the Flying Celestials to come and protect you. Otherwise, after killing so many people in one go, I’m afraid you won’t be able to leave Serene Immortal Mountain,” Princess Yun Yang advised, “Within these mountains, you are under my aunt’s protection. Even if people dislike you, they wouldn’t dare to act rashly. However, once you leave, I’m afraid they will immediately target you.”","Chu Yunfan was now sure that Princess Yun Yang had good intentions and didn’t want him to be targeted. However, if she could consider this, how could he have not thought of it before?","Despite that, since he had already decided to use these people’s heads to establish his might, these were all within his consideration.","“I would like to ask you for a favor, Princess,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Go ahead. For Siyu’s sake, I’ll do anything I can. I’ll even mediate for you,” Princess Yun Yang immediately said because she realized that this was the best way to make Chu Yunfan owe her a favor.","She knew very well that these top experts were all more arrogant than the last. It was not that easy to subdue them. It could even be said to be very difficult. These people had everything they wanted. It was almost impossible to take out something that would grab their attention. Only under such circumstances could she start a friendship with these people by sending charcoal in the snow.","For this reason, she did not care even if she had to fall out with the other sects because she was more and more optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s future. As long as he could gain the Elder Princess’ recognition, no one could underestimate his future.","“No need for that.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “I have a list of medicinal herbs here, and I hope that you can help me get them, Princess. I’m afraid that people have long monitored my movements, so it’s inconvenient for me to come out. I hope that you can help me get them before the end of the birthday celebration.”","As he said that, he handed over a jade slip that contained a list of medicinal herbs.","Princess Yun Yang glanced at the list. She did not know much about alchemy, so she could not see the connection between all these herbs. However, from Chu Yunfan’s look, it seemed that he had placed all his hopes on the items on this list. Clearly, they were not ordinary.","She was stunned for a moment. Then, a faint smile appeared on her face. “Of course, that won’t be a problem. Since you’re the one asking for them, it’s just a small matter.”","Princess Yun Yang smiled like a flower and continued, “However, if you need me, you can look for me at any time. I believe that I can command some respect and can help you tide over this crisis.”","Chu Yunfan was slightly stunned. He realized that he had underestimated Princess Yun Yang. She could even resolve the people’s deep resentment after he killed their chief disciples. It seemed that her power behind the scenes was far from what she showed on the surface, and it was probably just the tip of the iceberg.","Princess Yun Yang didn’t know that her suggestion had allowed Chu Yunfan to discover clues and infer many things.","As the two of them were talking, a pale golden light suddenly swept out from the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain. It broke through the barrier and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan and Princess Yun Yang.","It was a woman around 27 or 28 years old. She was wearing a long, lotus-green palace dress. Her figure was slender and her face was exquisite and flawless, but there was a coldness that ordinary people could not get close to.","“Chu Yunfan? Please follow me. The Elder Princess wishes to see you,” the woman said in a lofty tone that did not allow for rejection.","Chu Yunfan frowned. Then, he learned from Princess Yun Yang through telepathy that the woman was the Elder Princess’ personal maid, Ruoxi. Although she was called a maid, she was actually the Elder Princess’s first disciple.","Each of those maids had extremely high cultivation, and this Ruoxi was one of the best. Her cultivation had long surpassed the Creation Stage, and she was probably even stronger than Li Qianyuan.","Ruoxi glanced at Princess Yun Yang and replied, “I don’t know either, Princess. It’s just that the Elder Princess wants to see him. Please follow me.” She then turned around and stepped out in a streak of light.","Chu Yunfan followed and entered Serene Immortal Mountain’s depths.","On top of a huge floating mountain peak, the peak had been shaved off, forming a flat ground. Within the pavilions, dense fog lingered around.","Chu Yunfan was led by Ruoxi to the top. He looked over and saw a figure looming in the layers of mist.","Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and greeted, “Greetings, Elder Princess.”","“How dare you kill people in my place? Do you even take me seriously?”","From inside the dense fog, the figure spoke. Her voice was crisp and pleasant to the ear, but it carried a layer of heavy aura.","Her tone carried a kind of arrogance that looked down on the world. Although it was not clear, it was clearly a power that could only be cultivated by those who had been at the top for a long time.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Elder Princess, I just removed some unworthy people.”","“Aren’t you afraid that I’ll kill you?” From the dense fog, the Elder Princess continued to speak.","Chu Yunfan replied, “If you wanted to kill me, you could’ve done it when I killed the Junior Flame Master.”","He knew that with the Elder Princess’ strength, he couldn’t hide things from her. She just didn’t stop him because she did not want to. She probably wanted to use him to eliminate some people who didn’t pass her qualifications."]},{"number":1961,"title":"Chapter 1961 I’ll Prove to You Who Doesn’t Have the Right","paragraphs":["1961 I’ll Prove to You Who Doesn’t Have the Right","“With such presumptuous speculation, you must be very arrogant!”","“I’m just reporting the truth,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Don’t think you’re smart. My thoughts are not something you can guess!” the Elder Princess said coldly. “Are you dissatisfied with me?”","Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows. “That’s right. You are Siyu’s master and should be considered my elder, but you have insisted on choosing a husband for Siyu despite knowing that I am her fiance. Are you using your power to pressure me and force me to submit?”","“So what if I use your my to suppress others?” the Elder Princess shouted.","Suddenly, a terrifying pressure pressed over. In an instant, Chu Yunfan felt as if an archaic divine mountain was pressing down on him. Just the aura alone could cause huge pressure on him. Anyone could imagine how shocking the Elder Princess’ strength was.","Suddenly, at this moment, the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind emitted a rainbow light, instantly turning this pressure into nothingness.","“Hmm?” The Elder Princess didn’t expect him to be able to neutralize her aura so easily. “You may have some skills, but do you think you can fight me with just this?” Her voice was cold and indifferent.","“I have no intention of going against you, Elder Princess. If possible, I don’t even want to have anything to do with you,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","As soon as he said that, even Ruoxi’s frosty expression changed. There were not many people in the world who dared to speak to the Elder Princess this way.","“As long as you allow me to leave, I will be extremely grateful,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What’s wrong? Do you think I’m imprisoning Siyu?” The Elder Princess said faintly.","“Of course not. When Siyu and I got separated and Siyu was in trouble, it was you who helped us. I am extremely grateful, but that is not a reason for you to break us up. I’d rather tear down ten temples than break up with Siyu,” Chu Yunfan continued in a neither servile nor overbearing manner.","“You don’t have the right. You’re not worthy of Siyu,” The Elder Princess said, “Her future is limitless. She might even reach a level that you can’t even imagine. You don’t deserve her.”","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but laugh when he heard this. “If you think that anyone is more qualified than me, or stronger than me, then let them come forward. Besides, we don’t need others to interfere in our relationship.”","“Then prove it to me.” The Elder Princess’ voice boomed. It was extremely indifferent, still without any joy or anger.","“I will. Goodbye for now.” After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he turned around and left.","“Your Highness,” Ruoxi said as she watched Chu Yunfan leave. “This person has disrespected you. Should we punish him?”","The figure said in the dense fog, “It’s fine. Let him be. If he can’t defeat Li Qianyuan and the others, he will only be asking for humiliation. If he defeats them, he will have the right to say such words. I also want to see what is so great about this person who Siyu admires so much.”","“Is this a test?” Ruoxi’s eyes lit up.","The Elder Princess’s voice became more and more ethereal.","Chu Yunfan waved his sleeves and left. However, he did not look angry. On the contrary, he heaved a sigh of relief.","The argument with the Elder Princess seemed to be intense, but in reality, it was just a test. He could finally come to a conclusion. Although the Elder Princess did not like him, she did not have any thoughts of marrying Tang Siyu to anyone. She just did not like him and wanted to choose a husband worthy of Siyu. She was not biased to anyone yet, so Chu Yunfan had nothing to worry about. The only thing left was to rely on his strength to win.","When he returned to the small town at the foot of the mountain, he was informed that the Elder Princess’ birthday celebration had just begun. Under a maid’s guidance, Chu Yunfan rushed to a huge square in the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain. At this time, everyone had already arrived. They were in groups of three to five according to their status and different circles. It was a lively scene.","Chu Yunfan didn’t pay much attention to them and just found a random place to sit down. However, when he did, he immediately felt many eyes on him.","He looked calm and unwavering under these people’s angry gazes.","“How is this possible? How is he still alive?”","At the top, Li Qianyuan sitting in the middle of the crowd looked at Chu Yunfan as if he had seen a ghost. He had just received the news that Chu Yunfan was alive. However, hearing the news and seeing it with his own eyes were two completely different things.","No one knew better than him that Chu Yunfan had been ambushed by the demons and Demon God Sect. This was because he was involved in cutting off the communication channel of the Faraway Army, forcing Chu Yunfan to go alone and step into the trap.","For this, he had paid an extremely painful price. Many forces loyal to him and the crown prince were uprooted by the Grand Commandant’s Office in a fit of rage, and their families were exterminated.","Such a loss could be said to be extremely heavy, almost implicating him. If it weren’t for the crown prince’s guarantee, the Grand Commandant’s Office would never have let it go.","However, he felt that it was worth it to pay such a huge price. As long as he could get rid of this mortal enemy, everything would be worth it.","Since a long time ago, he could not ignore Chu Yunfan like an ant.","He could even feel this man’s threat level growing. For this reason, he did not hesitate to form a tacit agreement with the Demon God Sect and the demons.","Who would have thought that the person who should have died would suddenly appear here again?","Li Qianyuan’s first reaction was to see if Chu Yunfan was a human or a ghost. However, after he activated his Dharma Eye, Chu Yunfan still looked the same. He was indeed a living person, not a dead ghost.","At this moment, his heart was filled with mixed feelings. He was completely in disbelief. After paying such a huge price, he actually failed at the last step.","In the next moment, two extremely sharp killing intents burst out from his eyes.","“You’re still alive? Since you didn’t die before, I’ll just kill you in front of everyone. I don’t believe you have nine lives!”","With Chu Yunfan’s appearance, the square was filled with noise."]},{"number":1962,"title":"Chapter 1962 Showing His Power During the Celebration, Casually Tearing the Enemy Apart","paragraphs":["1962 Showing His Power During the Celebration, Casually Tearing the Enemy Apart","“He’s alive?”","“How is that possible? Even if he didn’t, how did he hide from the Mysteries Pavilion?”","“He definitely has a magic treasure that can isolate him from the Mysteries Pavillion.”","The moment Chu Yunfan appeared, the noise was endless. In everyone’s eyes, he was able to return alive after being sentenced to death by the Mysteries Pavilion. They were all very surprised.","Among the people present, many of them looked at him with a bit of resentment. Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over them. Judging from their clothes and their divine ability fluctuations, it was not difficult to judge their skills.","They were all experts from the Red Flame Demons, Godly Sabers, and other sects that Chu Yunfan had beaten up. There were Cosmic disciples and Creator elders. All of them glared at Chu Yunfan.","This was especially true for the Creator elders. At this moment, terrifying killing intent rose from their bodies. They wanted nothing more than to tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","Even they did not expect this to happen. Their sect’s supreme geniuses, their hopes for the next generations, had been killed by Chu Yunfan just like that. Especially the Godly Sabers, who had two of their chief disciples killed by Chu Yunfan in a row. At this moment, they were even more furious. Previously, Chu Yunfan had killed Lin Dingtian, which had already caused the entire Godly Sabers to feel a deep pain in their hearts. It was not easy to promote Yang Lan, the new generation’s chief disciple, but before he could sit in the position, he had already died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This enmity was irreconcilable!","Rays of fierce killing intent swept over and directly enveloped Chu Yunfan. Everyone stopped drinking and looked at him.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you kill so many of our chief disciples! Do you think you’re so great just because you’re a disciple of the Flying Celestials?”","At this moment, an elder saw that Chu Yunfan was calm and did not seem to be disturbed by them. He could not help but shout angrily.","“So what if it’s your chief disciple?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Everyone knows that Tang Siyu is my fiancee, and the hatred of stealing my wife is irreconcilable. Since they know this, they still dare to fight with me. They deserve to die.”","“Arrogant!”","When the Creator elders of the various sects heard this, they could not help but huff and glare at him. They had never seen such an arrogant fellow. After killing someone, he even stepped on his victims. He was simply going too far.","“Hahaha, not bad, well said!” Suddenly, an old man in a moon-white robe stood up. “Those people’s deaths are not worth regretting. If you’re not satisfied, feel free to find trouble with the Flying Celestials!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the old man. Although he had never seen him before, this did not prevent Chu Yunfan from guessing his identity. He should be a Grand Elder of the Flying Celestials. He carried a powerful aura, much stronger than the current Chu Yunfan.","One had to know that Chu Yunfan’s current strength was enough to sweep away fifth-level Creators. It could be said that even the vast majority of the Flying Celestial Sect’s Grand Elders were not his match. Only a small number of people could suppress him.","These people were all the best among the best in the elder group, and this old man was clearly one of the elites. His cultivation was not inferior to a seventh-level Creator and was extremely powerful.","Chu Yunfan nodded with a smile as he looked at the old man.","The latter smiled at him and said, “I don’t care what you think. If it’s a junior’s matter, let them settle it. But if you want to interfere, I think it’s a little too much.”","“The Flying Celestials is so meddlesome. In Grand Xia, it’s one thing for you to be able to control the wind and rain with one hand, but this is the Eastern Sea. Do you even want to meddle with my Red Flame Demon Sect?”","Suddenly, a demonic shadow rushed out. Almost in an instant, it had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan and stretched out its monstrous claws to grab him.","A third-level Creator!","This shadow’s cultivation was at least at the third level of the Creation Stage. Compared to the Junior Flame Master, this person was at least twice as powerful. They were a true top-notch expert.","“You’re courting death!” The white-robed Grand Elder was furious. This guy was simply provoking him on the spot and slapping his face.","Although the Flying Celestials wasn’t ranked high among the top ten sects, it was still an existence on their level. How could they provoke them?","However, when he wanted to help, it was already too late. He did not know when, but he realized that there were actually several powerful auras that had locked onto him. The masters behind each aura were not inferior to him. These few people joined forces, and their auras sealed him like a wall.","Obviously, there were more than one or two people who wanted to get rid of Chu Yunfan with the help of this phantom. They all made a tacit judgment in an instant to interfere with the white-robed old man’s attack.","With just a moment of carelessness, the demonic shadow had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could even see a sinister smile in the shadow. It was obvious that it was very confident in its own strength.","Although it was not considered much among Creators, there was no doubt that it was not difficult to deal with the prodigies of the current generation who had just grown up.","Ordinary prodigies on the Prodigy List were simply no match for him. Even if he were to face the first ranker, he would not be afraid.","Just as the demonic claw was about to kill him, Chu Yunfan finally moved. He casually tore the void, and a golden light burst out from the fingertips of his hands. It seemed to have formed a golden hand that grabbed the demonic shadow and pulled it fiercely.","Rip!","Before the shadow could react or attack Chu Yunfan, it was torn into two. Blood splattered everywhere as it was caught in mid-air by a strange force. In an instant, even its corpse was put into Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram.","The entire place was deathly silent. Everything had happened too quickly, and no one present had time to react. Even the white-robed Grand Elder, who had wanted to help, was stunned.","He had hoped that Chu Yunfan could hold on for a few more breaths so that he could rush over to support him. Who knew that in the next moment, Chu Yunfan would tear the other party apart and kill the demonic shadow?"]},{"number":1963,"title":"Chapter 1963 I Have No Respect for You","paragraphs":["1963 I Have No Respect for You","Chu Yunfan dealt with the Grand Elder from the Red Flame Demon Sect too quickly. In almost an instant, he killed the opponent. Not a single drop of blood flowed out as Chu Yunfan had completely absorbed it into the Mountain River Diagram, pouring it onto the Brahma Tree.","Especially for those who were waiting to watch a good show, their eyeballs were about to pop out.","They were all waiting to see Chu Yunfan make a fool of himself. After all, in everyone’s eyes, the top experts of this generation had only just entered the Creation Stage. They should be barely able to compete with the Grand Elders of the various sects.","After all, the elders were once geniuses who ruled the world. If these new generation kids wanted to contend with them, it would probably take a few more years. If they wanted to surpass them in all aspects, it would still take a lot of time.","But now, Chu Yunfan had given them a hard slap in the face. The younger generation’s growth far exceeded their imagination.","A Grand Elder of the Red Flame Demon Sect could not even block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Among the experts present, most of their cultivation levels were inferior to the Grand Elder who was killed. At most, their cultivation levels were similar to his.","Seeing Chu Yunfan casually tear him apart to death, many people could not help but feel a sense of sorrow. They even felt a sense of horror.","“The younger generation has finally grown up!”","Many people sighed in their hearts.","However, after a short period of time, the entire arena was filled with a wave of curses.","“Arrogant!”","“How audacious! You dare to kill people here!”","“You’re courting death!”","“Take him down!”","Waves of curses instantly spread throughout the entire place, and all kinds of hostile gazes covered the sky.","The news that Chu Yunfan had just killed the chief disciples of many sects had already spread. The experts of these sects glared at him. If it weren’t for the fact that this was the Elder Princess’ territory, they would have attacked him a long time ago.","There were even a few terrifying auras rising from within enveloping Chu Yunfan, wanting to kill him on the spot. Suddenly, at this moment, a strong beam of light shot out from the depths of Serene Immortal Mountain, turning into a rain of light that filled the sky.","Everyone’s eyes turned over and saw a woman in a milky-white palace dress stepping on a flying light. She appeared in front of everyone in the rain of light.","This woman was around the age of 20. Her skin was as fair as snow and she was extremely beautiful. Compared to ordinary women, she had a domineering aura.","“It’s the Elder Princess!” someone said in a low voice.","The person who had come was none other than the elder sister of the Grand Xia Empire’s current ruler, the Elder Princess.","Everyone stood up and bowed.","Chu Yunfan looked past the Elder Princess but did not see Tang Siyu. He could not help but feel a little disappointed.","Everyone bowed and said, “Greetings, Elder Princess.”","Even the unruly Li Qianyuan and the others lowered their heads in front of the Elder Princess because they all knew how powerful she was. When she appeared in front of them, they realized that all the previous legends were wrong. Even with their cultivation, they still felt unfathomable when facing her.","“Everyone, please take a seat.”","At this moment, the Elder Princess sat on a throne in the clouds. She was high above, like a legendary god looking down on all living beings. However, no one was dissatisfied. This was the status and power that she should have.","Many people looked at her expectantly, hoping that she would come forward to punish Chu Yunfan.","With her strength, it would be strange if his previous performance could be hidden from her. Everyone was waiting for the Elder Princess’ punishment.","The birthday celebration had just begun, and Chu Yunfan had killed several people in a row. This was simply provoking the Elder Princess. Even the sect master of the Flying Celestials did not dare to be impudent in front of her. In everyone’s eyes, she should have no intention of letting Chu Yunfan go.","However, the Elder Princess did not punish Chu Yunfan as everyone had hoped. Instead, she simply said, “It is my honor to have all of you here to attend my birthday.”","Then, she changed the topic and continued, “However, what I want to say next has nothing to do with this. I believe everyone should know that this invitation is not only for my birthday but also to choose a husband for my last disciple, Princess Gushe. Anyone who is interested can participate. The winner will become her husband.”","Immediately, many people present became excited. After all, they had come here for this matter. Even the Grand Elders of many sects had come personally to escort their sects’ young elites.","At this time, many people turned to look at Chu Yunfan. After all, everyone knew that he was Tang Siyu’s fiance. Many people even hoped that he would flare up so that the Elder Princess would get rid of him.","In just a moment, more than 20 people had already stood on the field. Each of them had an imposing appearance with unfathomable mana. They looked like dragons and phoenixes among men and were extremely powerful.","Among these people, the weakest was an expert who had just entered the Creation Stage. They weren’t on the Prodigy List, but they were existences below that were very likely to enter the list.","They were the current generation’s outstanding talents.","Chu Yunfan also stood out in front with everyone.","“In that case, who wants to go up on stage first to accept the challenge?”","All of a sudden, the Elder Princess tore at the sky, a secondary space appearing above. There was a huge arena inside it. It was obviously the space where the geniuses would fight.","Everyone looked at each other. Clearly, they were not willing to be the first to enter. Everyone wanted to watch first.","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure stepped on a flying light and entered the arena in the secondary space.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that this person was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“Why is Chu Yunfan the first to come out?”","“It’s not wise to be the first to come out at this time.”","“He dares to be the first. Could it be that he is confident that he can stop all the prodigies from taking turns to fight?!”","Chu Yunfan went to the arena and swept his gaze across the group of prodigies. He cupped his hands and said, “Everyone, Princess Gushe is my fiancee, so I hope everyone here will respect that. It’s not too late to retreat now.”","“I have no respect for you, so I guess I’ll just have to snatch her!”","Suddenly, an arrogant voice rang."]},{"number":1964,"title":"Chapter 1964 Go to Hell, Sweet Potato Spirit","paragraphs":["1964 Go to Hell, Sweet Potato Spirit","At this moment, a figure directly swept up and landed in the arena.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a young man dressed in a purple robe with purple hair.","“Where did this sweet potato spirit come from?”","Chu Yunfan’s words almost made the young man spit out a mouthful of blood.","Sweet potato spirit?","Everyone couldn’t help but burst out laughing at Chu Yunfan’s unexpected words. Although many people wanted to tear him into pieces, they couldn’t help but laugh.","The young man was also stunned. Then, he became furious and shouted, “D*mn it, Chu Yunfan! How dare you mock me!”","Before this, no one had ever ridiculed him as a sweet potato spirit. He was not born like this, but the cultivation method he cultivated was like this. The darker the color was, the more it showed that his cultivation was profound.","“Hahahahaha, I’m dying of laughter. The Thousand Poisons Sect’s junior leader, Chang Rui, got called a sweet potato spirit!”","“Hahahahaha, I remember that this should be his unique appearance after cultivating his sect’s supreme technique, the Thousand Poison Heaven Extinguishing Technique. In that case, doesn’t that mean that everyone in the Thousand Poison Sect is a sweet potato spirit?”","“Hahahahaha, I reckon that the entire sect is going crazy from anger right now!”","Chu Yunfan pointed at Chang Rui and said, “So what if I’m mocking you? How dare you jump out with such a face, you sweet potato spirit. And if you have no respect for me, I’ll just beat you to death.”","In an instant, a terrifying aura exploded from Chu Yunfan’s body and enveloped Chang Rui. The aura caused many Cosmics present to feel terrifying pressure. They almost vomited blood.","“Kill me? You?” Chang Rui was furious.","Suddenly, the arena was filled with a black poisonous fog. It was unknown when this fog had appeared in the arena and spread in all directions at an even more shocking speed.","On the birthday, many people even instinctively began to condense a barrier around their bodies.","The Thousand Poisons Sect had a notorious reputation in the cultivation world. Almost all sects were wary of their ability with poison.","In fact, many times, the Thousand Poisons Sect had already completed their poisoning skills without them realizing it. Many experts stronger than them had even died at their hands.","However, they soon discovered that the layer of poisonous fog was blocked by a faint barrier just as it was about to flow out of the alternate dimension.","Everyone reacted, noticing that it was probably the Elder Princess who had made a move. Only then did they finally heave a sigh of relief. Even they were extremely wary of the Thousand Poisons Sect’s venom. It was a terrifying method that could even wipe out their entire group if they were not careful.","At this moment, everyone was in the mood to pay attention to Chu Yunfan’s situation.","All of a sudden, they saw a shocking sword light sweep out from the poisonous fog, cutting through its layers. Everyone saw that the fog did not seem to pose any threat to Chu Yunfan. It fell on his body, but it could not enter at all.","The poisonous fog that could corrode an entire mountain did not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan at all.","“Is this the only method the Thousand Poisons Sect has?!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly. His eyes were ice-cold as he looked at Chang Rui. “No one can save you today, sweet potato spirit!”","Chang Rui was so angry that he almost vomited blood. His eyes flashed with a sharp light as he shouted, “Thousand Poison Ghost Claw!”","In the sky, poisonous fog appeared and began to condense into a huge claw. Then, it aimed toward Chu Yunfan’s direction.","“What a powerful move. To be able to cultivate this ability to this extent, Chang Rui’s strength is at least at the second-level of the Creation Stage!”","“That’s right. Chang Rui does have the strength to be on the Prodigy List. Although he’s a little behind Chu Yunfan, their differences aren’t too big.”","Many people remembered that compared to Chu Yunfan, who had almost a legendary existence, Chang Rui’s limelight was not as great, but he was indeed a figure on the Prodigy List. Although his ranking was a little lower than Chu Yunfan’s, he was still ranked 78th. In the eyes of many people, his cultivation was not much different from Chu Yunfan, who was ranked 50th.","“What bullsh*t is this?” Chu Yunfan casually pointed his finger, and in an instant, a shocking sword light condensed on his fingertip. The power of lightning wrapped around it, and in an instant, it had already rushed toward the Thousand Poison Ghost Claw.","Stab!","The sword light containing lightning power tore through the sky and blasted into the claw. The mighty claw was not a match for this sword light. It was as if it had encountered its nemesis. Wherever the sword light passed, the poisonous fog evaporated.","The huge Thousand Poison Ghost Claw dispersed under everyone’s eyes, turning into a poisonous light that scattered in all directions. On the other hand, the sword light didn’t lose its momentum and directly swept toward Chang Rui.","Boom!","After a loud explosion, it devoured everything and created a huge crack in the arena’s hard ground.","As for Chang Rui on the other side, no one could see his figure anymore.","In that instant, Chang Rui had been devoured and disappeared without a trace.","The entire place was dead silent!","Even when Chu Yunfan killed the Red Flame Demon Sect’s Grand Elder, he did not cause this big of a commotion. When the Grand Elder attacked, no one even knew who he was. They only knew that he was an elder of the Red Flame Demon Sect. How could they be more shocked by that than watching a prodigy on the Prodigy List be struck to death in front of them?","“This is... This...” Some people were dumbfounded and could not even say a complete sentence.","“This is impossible. Even if Chu Yunfan’s ranking was higher than Chang Rui’s, Chang Rui couldn’t have been defeated so easily. Although the Thousand Poison Sect isn’t very good at direct combat, this shouldn’t be the reason why he was defeated so easily!”","“What a terrifying attack, but what’s even more terrifying is that Chu Yunfan didn’t even use his full strength!”","“He’s too strong. No wonder he dared to go up first. It’s not that he’s overestimating himself, but that he does have such strength!”","“How are we going to beat him? Others are just throwing bricks to attract jade. If he directly offers the jade, I’m afraid he’ll scare off a large number of people!”","The crowd discussed animatedly."]},{"number":1965,"title":"Chapter 1965 The Winged Tiger Tribe?","paragraphs":["1965 The Winged Tiger Tribe?","Chu Yunfan killed Chang Rui with a clean and simple slash.","Under such circumstances, before they could even figure out Chu Yunfan’s strength, they were already shocked.","They didn’t dare to step forward.","“Is there anyone else who wants to come up and die?” Chu Yunfan glanced at everyone.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, many people were furious. He wasn’t bothered by them at all. He acted as if he was high and mighty. However, his tyrannical attitude of killing Chang Rui with a single blow was still in their minds. They could not forget that scene.","“Arrogant human. I’ll fight you!”","At this moment, a figure came with a whistling sound. He rushed into the arena with lightning speed.","Everyone looked up and saw a man with disheveled hair dressed in a white robe with a hint of arrogance and unruliness appeared in the arena.","“It’s the Winged Tiger Tribe’s Flying Tiger. Now, we finally have a heavyweight expert!”","Many people saw Flying Tiger and exclaimed in their hearts. Chu Yunfan was probably in trouble now.","Flying Tiger’s strength was obviously much stronger than Chang Rui’s, and his ranking was far different. Although many people didn’t like his arrogance, this did not stop them from wanting to see him cause trouble for Chu Yunfan.","“Even if Chu Yunfan’s strength has increased beyond the expectations of the Prodigy List, I’m afraid he’s on par with Flying Tiger.”","“That’s right. No matter how strong Chu Yunfan is, he’s only in the top ten.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but they were still not very optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s strength. Now that he had used the Mountain River Diagram to block the Mysteries Pavilion’s investigation, everyone was unsure of his strength.","Chu Yunfan continued to defeat powerful enemies that everyone thought he could not defeat. This also made their evaluation of him rise step by step. Even now, their judgment of him had already reached a level comparable to the top ten of the Prodigy List. This had already surpassed the Flying Celestials’ current chief disciple, Yang Dengxian.","In everyone’s opinion, this evaluation was not low.","Chu Yunfan looked at Flying Tiger coldly.","Flying Tiger looked at Chu Yunfan and revealed a sinister smile. He said, “Before I came, I heard about you. I didn’t expect that you didn’t die even after that lord attacked. It seems that you are really tough. But today, you will definitely die in my hands.”","As he spoke, Flying Tiger’s eyes suddenly turned red. A sharp killing intent erupted from his body. “One of the people you killed back then was my uncle. Do you still remember him? If you had died back then, it would have been fine. Since you’re still alive, then the heavens have eyes, and let me take revenge personally!”","Chu Yunfan thought of the shocking battle back then. He was ambushed by many experts of the demons and the Demon God Sect. In the end, their big shots personally attacked him, almost killing him.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a cold smile. “I’m sorry. I’ve killed too many people. I don’t have any impression of your uncle.”","The uncle who was killed by Chu Yunfan had grown up with him. It could be said that their relationship was very good. They were like father and son. In the end, he had only gone to ambush a human prodigy and had actually died at that human’s hands.","If Chu Yunfan had died, he would have been furious, but he wouldn’t have been able to find someone to vent his anger on. But now, Chu Yunfan had returned.","“Do you think I’m interested in the selection ceremony? I originally heard that Tang Siyu was your fiancee. I wanted to marry her and torture her to death. However, I didn’t expect to meet you before I could achieve this goal. This is great. I can take revenge myself!”","Flying Tiger laughed loudly and revealed his purpose. He had no interest in a human princess and only wanted to take revenge on Chu Yunfan.","“Are you provoking me? You’re courting death!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a cold smile. Tang Siyu was his bottom line. In his eyes, Flying Tiger was already a dead man.","“Provoking you? Who do you think you are? You’re just a lucky guy who hasn’t died!”","Flying Tiger roared. In an instant, an endless gale swept over. The clouds followed the dragon, and the wind followed the tiger. This characteristic was vividly reflected on him.","In this gust of wind, no one could see his movements clearly. In the next moment, Flying Tiger had already rushed in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Rrraaagggh!” He roared as his claws tore the sky apart. He released a terrifying wind ability, and almost in an instant, it was about to tear Chu Yunfan apart.","However, in the next moment, the wind was unable to tear Chu Yunfan’s body apart. It actually made a sound like metal clashing.","“Petty tricks. The Winged Tiger Tribe? Give me a different junior leader!” Chu Yunfan shouted, clenched his fist, and threw a punch.","It was just a simple punch, but it blasted through the violent wind that filled the sky. There was not even any fluctuation of divine ability, yet it pierced through the wind attack.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on Flying Tiger’s body. The latter screamed and flew backward, spitting out a mouthful of blood.","“You’re not dead. Interesting!”","Chu Yunfan saw that he couldn’t kill Flying Tiger with one punch, sneering. After his first attack succeeded, he attacked again and shouted, “Mountain Wrap Seal!” He formed a seal with both hands and turned into a divine mountain in the air.","“Roar! It’s not that easy to kill me!” Flying Tiger roared repeatedly. His voice actually changed in the air, turning into a white-fronted tiger with a pair of wings that looked as if it represented the wind itself.","Swoosh!","In the next instant, Flying Tiger disappeared from where he was. However, when he reappeared, he was horrified to find that the divine mountain seemed to have eyes and fell down on him."]},{"number":1966,"title":"Chapter 1966 Why Don’t You Guys Just Attack Together?","paragraphs":["1966 Why Don’t You Guys Just Attack Together?","“How can I not escape?!”","Flying Tiger was instantly shocked. His clouds came from the dragon and his wind came from the tiger. His tribe’s physical strength was extremely powerful, but their speed was even faster to the extreme. Ordinary people could not keep up with such speed. Even when facing Li Qianyuan, who ranked first, he was confident that his speed alone was enough to be invincible.","But now, the facts proved that he was ridiculously wrong. Chu Yunfan’s divine will seemed to have locked onto him. No matter how he tried to escape, he could not avoid Chu Yunfan’s Mountain Wrap Seal.","“Let’s go all out!”","At this moment, Flying Tiger could only fight with all his might. Terrifying divine ability surged out of his body and surged into his mouth, turning into a terrifying energy tide that headed toward the Mountain Wrap Seal.","Boom!","A terrifying magical wave swept out, and the wind divine ability spread out and turned into a gale. However, everyone could clearly see that it couldn’t shake the Mountain Wrap Seal at all. Instead, it was suppressed bit by bit. In just a moment, the terrifying energy tide collapsed in the air.","Bam!","The Mountain Wrap Seal smashed into Flying Tiger’s huge body. He seemed to have suffered a heavy blow as his mountain-like body fell to the ground fiercely. He let out a sorrowful cry. The huge arena shook violently and a huge pit was smashed out.","Flying Tiger still wanted to struggle, but how could he? A sword light descended from the sky and beheaded him. His huge head rolled to the side. The top prodigy ranked 11th on the Prodigy List, Flying Tiger, was dead!","Countless drops of blood quickly filled the entire arena, looking like a pool of blood.","“This... Isn’t he too strong? Even Flying Tiger isn’t his match?” Someone could not help but gasp. “With such strength, I’m afraid he has the ability to compete with Li Qianyuan!”","Many people couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air when they thought of this. Chu Yunfan’s power had clearly exceeded their previous expectations.","“That shameless old monster ambushed me. This is just the beginning.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a cold light.","The supreme existence of the demons had disregarded his pride and personally attacked Chu Yunfan, almost causing him to die. Chu Yunfan wasn’t a broad-minded person, so it was not an exaggeration to say that he would seek revenge for the smallest grievance. Not to mention his hatred from almost dying. If he did not take revenge, he would not be a human.","It was only then that everyone remembered that Chu Yunfan had been ambushed by the demons and the Demon God Sect, and that a supreme existence of the demons had even personally attacked him.","In fact, it was precisely because they knew that the supreme figure had personally made a move that everyone was certain that Chu Yunfan would die.","There was almost no one in the younger generation who could escape from that person. Even Li Qianyuan, who ranked first on the Prodigy List, did not have the possibility of escaping.","In fact, their guess was not wrong. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s strength was enough to challenge Li Qianyuan, but if he really did face the latter, he would definitely die in that battle.","It was impossible for him to escape death!","“Junior Leader! How dare you kill my Flying Winged Tiger Tribe’s junior leader!”","At this moment, the three members of the Winged Tiger Tribe below were completely enraged. The number of members of this tribe could not be considered to be many. They relied on the fact that every one of them was an elite and a genius to be able to establish themselves in the world.","Even so, in every generation, there were still very few people who could make it onto the Prodigy List. After all, the list ranked the many geniuses from sects around the world. It was already difficult for one to make it onto the list, let alone obtain such a high ranking.","Almost all the clansmen regarded Flying Tiger as the hope of their tribe’s rise. Who would have thought that he would die in Chu Yunfan’s hands?","The three tribesmen were furious. They instantly burst out with a terrifying aura and attacked Chu Yunfan.","These people’s strength was far stronger than Flying Tiger’s. They were at least fifth-level Creators.","Even Chu Yunfan had to be serious with them.","“How dare you!”","Suddenly, the Flying Celestials’s Grand Elder was enraged. Just as he was about to stop them, a white palm swept across the sky and grabbed the three members of the Flying Winged Tiger Tribe.","“You dare to break the rules set by me right in front of me? You overestimate yourself!”","Bam!","With this cold snort, the three experts of the Winged Tiger Tribe were completely unable to resist. They were crushed into a rain of blood that filled the sky on the spot, and then they were wiped away by a ray of light.","The surroundings fell into dead silence. Everyone remembered that although Chu Yunfan’s performance was very shocking, the real host of this birthday celebration was the Elder Princess.","She was faintly known as the number one expert within Grand Xia’s royal family and one of the most powerful experts in the world. She had set the rules for the selection ceremony. These three experts must have a lot of guts to dare cause trouble on her birthday.","“Is this the strength of a top-notch expert? Three Creators were actually crushed into a rain of blood with a single palm!”","“That’s right. It’s time to teach these demons a lesson. Although the Winged Tiger Tribe is a powerful royal family in the Demon Region, what are they in our Eastern Sea?”","“Kill them just like that. There’s no need to be afraid of the tribe’s revenge. A real man should do this!”","After a short period of dead silence, everyone suddenly exploded in amazement.","“So strong!” Li Qianyuan’s pupils contracted.","Even he was not a match for the three masters of the Winged Tiger Tribe. However, in front of the Elder Princess, they were completely vulnerable and were crushed to death with one palm. No wonder the crown prince wanted him to marry Tang Siyu. He wanted to win over the Elder Princess. Such a top-notch existence was indeed qualified for the crown prince’s faction to rack their brains to rope her in.","But then, Li Qianyuan’s eyes burst out with an amazing fighting spirit. A real man should be like this. Sooner or later, he would surpass the Elder Princess.","In addition to him, everyone suddenly understood that although the Elder Princess might not like Chu Yunfan, she would never allow anyone to break the rules she had set.","However, with her strength, she indeed had the qualifications for her position.","“It’s too troublesome to attack one by one. Why don’t you all just attack together?”"]},{"number":1967,"title":"Chapter 1967 LI Qianyuan, Let’s Settle Our Grudges!","paragraphs":["1967 LI Qianyuan, Let’s Settle Our Grudges!","Hearing this voice, everyone looked up and saw Chu Yunfan putting Flying Tiger’s huge corpse into the Mountain River Diagram as he spoke. There was a hint of indifference in his eyes, as well as a hint of cold killing intent.","Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back, stepping in a pool of blood. He had an indescribable heroic spirit and even a kind of power that looked down on the world. Everyone looked at the remaining Meng Tianran, Meng Potian, and Li Qianyuan.","At this moment, Meng Potian put up his hand and said, “I forfeit.”","Dressed in beast skin, he looked like a dragon and a tiger, and his body carried a valiant aura that ordinary people could not imagine.","However, the first time he spoke, he wanted to withdraw, which surprised everyone. However, they soon understood why he would make such a choice. Meng Potian was only ranked 15th on the Prodigy List, and there was a gap between him and Flying Tiger. Even if the two of them were on par, it wouldn’t be difficult to imagine that Meng Potian would die just by looking at Chu Yunfan’s terrifying cultivation.","Although he looked wild and unruly, he was one of the few smart people. Otherwise, he would not have been able to cultivate to this extent.","“I came to the Central Plains to gain experience and see the heroes of the world. Now that I’ve seen them, I’ve achieved my goal.” Meng Potian cupped his hands. “Besides, a gentleman doesn’t take away what others love. Since you are still alive, I can’t take away your woman, Brother Chu. This time, I’ll withdraw.”","Although Meng Potian was dressed like a barbarian, his tone was rather humble and did not seem like someone who had come from a barbaric land.","“Rumor has it that Meng Potian once concealed his identity and entered Virtuous Academy to study. They said he’s unlike any other southern barbarian. Now, it seems that the rumors are true.”","“That’s right. Even I have heard of this rumor. Back when he was in Virtuous Academy, he was very famous. He was hand-picked by a few teachers and could become Grand Xia’s pillar in the future. Unfortunately, he’s a barbarian.”","“However, the Fire Cloud Cave he’s in is also a top inheritance among the southern barbarians. It’s not inferior to the Virtuous Academy. With the peerless inheritance from the two sects, Meng Potian’s future is bound to be limitless.”","The crowd discussed animatedly. Only now did many people know that Meng Potian, who looked like a barbarian, actually had such a strange learning experience. He was actually able to hide from the teachers of Virtuous Academy who had profound cultivation and sneak in to study. It was an amazing feat in itself.","“I forfeit too.”","At this moment, on the other side, Meng Tianran spoke. He was dressed in a scholar’s robe and holding a Seasons Brush.","“Although I admire Princess Gushe, I also know that a gentleman doesn’t take beauties from others/”","Meng Tianran didn’t seem to be angry at Chu Yunfan’s words just now and only smiled faintly.","Chu Yunfan was a little surprised. Meng Tianran and Meng Potian had withdrawn. Although he did not really take the two of them seriously, it was always good to have two fewer competitors.","Once he made a move, it would be a massacre. At that time, he would push the two top inheritances to the opposite side.","Even though he had already gotten used to it, he didn’t want to cause any more trouble. Seeing that the two of them had left, he couldn’t help but smile and nod at them to express his gratitude.","“Even Meng Tianran and Meng Potian are too scared to participate. This Chu Yunfan is so powerful!” someone couldn’t help but say.","Even Flying Tiger was easily killed by Chu Yunfan. If it were them, they would not have an easy time either. Meng Potian would definitely lose, and Meng Tianran might have a difficult time. Except for Li Qianyuan, who had a deep grudge against Chu Yunfan, anyone would choose to retreat after seeing Chu Yunfan’s strength, not to mention the other prodigies.","At this time, everyone’s eyes fell on Li Qianyuan, who was the only one who hadn’t made a choice.","Chu Yunfan said, “Li Qianyuan, we can end our grudges here. Of course, if you are afraid, you can also turn around and leave. I won’t stop you.”","Li Qianyuan’s face showed a hint of anger when he heard this. Once upon a time, he had looked down on Chu Yunfan just like this. However, he never thought the tables would turn like this one day, getting looked down on by Chu Yunfan as if he were an ant. It was simply too much.","“Your provocation method is not brilliant,” he said coldly to Chu Yunfan.","He could tell that Chu Yunfan was just trying to provoke him. Everyone had seen the outcome of the three Winged Tiger Tribe members who had broken the rules without permission. Chu Yunfan naturally couldn’t break the rules under such circumstances. He could only think of a way to lure Li Qianyuan into it.","This was not a conspiracy at all. To be precise, this was an open scheme. However, Li Qianyuan had to admit that it was very effective. He knew that it was a trap, but he had no choice but to step into it.","“However, you still succeeded in infuriating me. Do you think that you can fight me after killing Flying Tiger? What a joke!” As soon as Li Qianyuan finished speaking, he had already appeared in the arena. His speed was so fast that no one could even react.","“I don’t need you to reel me into doing this. Just as you said, it’s time to settle our grudge!”","“Li Qianyuan has accepted the challenge. Will this be the competition for the strongest genius?”","“I’m afraid so. I think Chu Yunfan’s strength is about the same as Li Qianyuan’s. Even if there is a gap, it’s not much!”","“Who do you think will win?”","“I think it will be Li Qianyuan. After all, he is the number one on the Prodigy List. For many years, countless people have wanted to catch up, but they didn’t have the ability to do so. He has always been steadily suppressing them.”","“That’s right. I also think highly of Li Qianyuan. Although Chu Yunfan is strong, he lacks some foundation.”","This was what many people thought. After all, Li Qianyuan’s legend of being the strongest had been written for more than ten years and had never changed."]},{"number":1968,"title":"Chapter 1968 Accidentally Killing You Wouldn’t Be Fun, Would It?","paragraphs":["1968 Accidentally Killing You Wouldn’t Be Fun, Would It?","Li Qianyuan had been an outstanding genius of the younger generation for more than ten years. It was widely known that even those who were unhappy with him had to admit he was indeed superior to his peers in terms of strength.","“I disagree. If it were before today, my opinion would probably be the same. However, this time, I think that Chu Yunfan will win.”","“Yes, I think so too. Although Li Qianyuan’s strength is strong, can he easily kill Flying Tiger?”","“Li Qianyuan’s strength is still within our expectations, but Chu Yunfan has obviously exceeded this limit. He came prepared today.”","Although most people supported Li Qianyuan, there were also some others who were more optimistic about Chu Yunfan. It was because his previous performance was too amazing. They didn’t see it with their own eyes when he killed the Junior Flame Master and the others, but they saw him kill Chang Rui and Flying Tiger. Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength made them tremble in fear.","Li Qianyuan’s eyes seemed to have a world of life and death, which was extremely terrifying. Waves of powerful divine ability fluctuations burst out from his body.","“The peak of fourth-level Creation Stage! How is this possible? How can his strength improve so quickly?” someone exclaimed.","Everyone could tell that Li Qianyuan’s strength was actually at the peak of the fourth-level Creation Stage. In such a short time, he wasn’t held back by his serious injury from before that put him on the verge of death. Instead, he had improved further on his foundation.","He had reached a stage that made everyone gasp in amazement!","When the Creator Grand Elders from various sects saw this, they could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. Previously, they had been extremely confident that the younger generation was still far from them. However, with Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan around, they could not help but feel a great threat.","The younger generation had reached this stage!","Among the crowd, those prodigies were even more stunned, because they were even more shocked by Li Qianyuan’s strength progress.","Chu Yunfan’s attacks were decisive and efficient, and he didn’t use a lot of moves to beat Chang Rui and Flying Tiger. Therefore, even if they knew that he was very strong and could be said to be unfathomable, they couldn’t measure what level his strength was at.","It was far less shocking than what Li Qianyuan had done to them now.","“How can he be so strong?”","Many young prodigies felt a sense of despair. After Li Qianyuan reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage, most of them had already reached the seventh-level of the Cosmos Stage, or even the peak of the stage itself. At that time, the gap between them and Li Qianyuan seemed to be very close.","However, when they finally entered the Creation Stage, Li Qianyuan had already reached the fourth level of that stage, leaving them far behind.","At this moment, they finally understood one thing. Some people scored 100 points because they could only reach 100 points, while others scored 100 points because they were limited to 100 points.","It looked the same, but in reality, there was a huge difference.","Even Meng Tianran, who originally had a faint smile on his face and looked like a gentleman, could not help but show a solemn expression when he saw Li Qianyuan’s strength. He was only a few steps behind Li Qianyuan, so of course, he had always regarded Li Qianyuan as a target to catch up with. However, the strength the man displayed now made him have to look askance.","Even Princess Yun Yang, who had always been indifferent, couldn’t help but frown when she saw this. The sudden increase in Li Qianyuan’s strength made these people feel a huge sense of crisis. It was just like the sensation caused when he was the first to enter the Creation Stage.","Although Li Qianyuan had the Fire God Physique, which was a king-level physique, he was worthy of being the Prodigy List’s number-one person for many years. He suppressed many geniuses around the world and was indeed worthy of his reputation.","Li Qianyuan said coldly, “Chu Yunfan, you will regret this. You thought that you had lured me into a trap, but in fact, this was my goal. Our grudges have lasted for many years. It’s time to put an end to it!”","This ant that wasn’t even qualified to look at him before actually grew the ability to challenge him now. Even he had to admit that the world was unpredictable. However, no matter what happened in the past, everything had to end today.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Li Qianyuan, where’s your Fire God Physique? Use your full strength, or it’ll be boring.”","“What? Li Qianyuan’s special physique is the Fire God Physique?”","Many people exclaimed. Few people knew about this. After all, this was Li Qianyuan’s trump card. The fewer people who knew about this trump card, the better. After all, once someone found out, they would be targeted.","Therefore, among the many geniuses, there were countless people who kept their special physiques a secret, and Li Qianyuan was one of them. Everyone was sure that he had a king-level physique, but no one knew which one it was.","“How did you know my special physique?” Li Qianyuan narrowed his eyes. It was a bit strange. How did Chu Yunfan know that his special physique was the Fire God Physique? He rarely used it, so even the Mysteries Pavilion didn’t know this. How did Chu Yunfan know?","“Why do you care how I know? Just use it. Otherwise, I might accidentally kill you. That wouldn’t be fun, would it?” Chu Yunfan grinned. His expression was extremely cold, making people feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“Hahahaha, accidentally killing me?” Li Qianyuan laughed in a wild and unruly manner. His black hair fluttered in the wind and he looked like he had gone crazy. “No one has ever dared to say that. You will be the first and the last!","“Since you dare to be so arrogant now, let me see what you’re capable of!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Li Qianyuan made a move."]},{"number":1969,"title":"Chapter 1969 LI Qianyuan, Do You Understand the Gap Between Us Now?","paragraphs":["1969 LI Qianyuan, Do You Understand the Gap Between Us Now?","Boom!","Li Qianyuan’s aura swept toward Chu Yunfan like a tidal wave.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s body also erupted with a terrifying aura to retaliate. He did not give in at all. They continued to collide, erupting with boundless light.","Li Qianyuan’s mana fluctuations were red like flames, enveloping the entire surroundings. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan’s mana carried endless thunder, sweeping out electric snakes. This was the strongest power that their special physiques could unleash.","Everyone looked at Li Qianyuan and knew that what Chu Yunfan said about the Fire God Physique was true. Such a rich fire power was unimaginable.","The lightning power contained in Chu Yunfan’s divine ability was also an eye-opener for everyone. However, according to the information they had received before, he was very likely to have a lightning-type king-level physique. Otherwise, how could he surpass the top geniuses with his current talent and physique? That would be a real joke!","Bam!","Li Qianyuan stomped on the ground, making the entire arena shake violently. Enormous divine ability spread out from under his feet, almost burning the ground.","In the next moment, Li Qianyuan’s expression was cold. He rose from the ground like a golden-winged eagle, his whole being resembling a lightning bolt as he flew toward Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, a black ancient sword suddenly appeared in his hand. The sword looked simple in shape, but it had amazing sword light fluctuations on it. In an instant, the hundreds of feet thick and thousands of feet long sword light rushed into the sky. This terrifying sword light slashed down from above, splitting the air in half.","Someone cried out in surprise, “What a terrifying sword light! What kind of technique is that?!”","The terrifying roar that erupted from the light was as if every sword strike could slash one’s divine soul. It was extremely terrifying.","“That’s the Ocean Overlord’s Sea-Overturning Sword!”","A very old Grand Elder immediately recognized the origin of the sword light that Li Qianyuan displayed. He seemed to remember that a long time ago when he was younger, he had once accidentally seen that same terrifying attack.","It was the exact one!","However, Li Qianyuan’s current power was certainly not comparable to the Ocean Overlord himself, who was once the Eastern Sea’s number one master. However, he was already quite skilled.","Someone exclaimed, “It’s really the Ocean Overlord’s inheritance. There were rumors that Li Qianyuan had obtained the Ocean Overlord’s inheritance, and it seems that the rumors are true!”","Everyone remembered those rumors. However, the more shocking news was that the Li clan and the marine folks had completely fallen out. Both sides had fought, and there were casualties and corpses everywhere. Not only did the marine folks suffer countless casualties, but the Sea Prince also died a tragic death. The murderer had yet to be found.","At that time, the Li clan also suffered heavy losses. Their foundation in the Eastern Sea was uprooted, and countless experts died in the process. Even Li Qianyuan, the clan’s biggest hope, almost died in that turmoil. Therefore, although there were rumors that he had obtained the Ocean Overlord’s inheritance, it did not attract so much attention.","Now, all of this has been dug out from the corner of their memories. Everyone finally remembered that such an event actually happened.","The sword light streaked across the sky and transformed into a huge wave. In an instant, it rolled back and crushed everything.","Chu Yunfan sneered and shouted, “Li Qianyuan, I told you! You’re nothing to me if you don’t use your Fire God Physique!”","After saying that, he disappeared in a flash. His entire body was surrounded by lightning, resembling lightning jade itself as he emitted a crystalline treasure light. It was as if he was a heavenly treasure himself. He had a sharp power that swept out in an instant.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. He charged forward and clenched his fists. In an instant, he punched out, its force directly transforming into eight heavenly dragons. The wind brought about by their movements almost shattered the sky.","This punch went up against the sword light that came crashing down. It almost shattered the ten thousand feet light with one punch. Afterward, the fist’s momentum did not decrease. No one could stop it at all.","In an instant, it crushed and shattered everything.","Boom!","The fist force spread out, and the entire arena space shook violently.","Li Qianyuan was sent flying, blood flowing out of the corner of his mouth. Everyone saw that he was wearing golden armor on his chest, and on its surface was a huge fist print. Chu Yunfan had left a terrifying mark.","From this, anyone could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan’s punch was.","A sect’s Grand Elder could not help but sigh. “One punch could actually make Li Qianyuan, who was wearing armor, fly and vomit blood. The younger generation is really formidable. What kind of physique does Chu Yunfan have?”","More people were shocked. Chu Yunfan seemed to be on par with Li Qianyuan and even had the upper hand.","What kind of joke was this? Before this, even the craziest person alive had never expected this crazy result.","Chu Yunfan really came prepared. His arrogance was backed by his strength. In other words, he had never been arrogant, but confident. After all, he did have such strength.","Even after Chu Yunfan easily killed Flying Tiger, most people still thought his strength was slightly inferior to Li Qianyuan’s. At most, they could be compared to each other. That in itself was already very impressive.","However, Chu Yunfan had basically slapped them on the face with an iron-like fact that they thought too much. His strength was indeed above Li Qianyuan’s, and he had always been confident.","Seeing this, Li Qianyuan’s supporters’ expressions changed drastically. They had never seen him in such a sorry state before when competing with his peers. In the past, when he fought with others, everyone’s highest expectation for the other competitors was that they could withstand at most 300 moves from Li Qianyuan without falling into a disadvantage. Anyone who managed that much was already an outstanding person among their peers.","Now, Li Qianyuan was at a disadvantage, which was unprecedented in the competition between his peers.","“Li Qianyuan, do you understand the gap between us now?” Chu Yunfan knocked the other party back with a punch, but he didn’t take advantage of the victory to pursue. Instead, he stood with his hands behind his back."]},{"number":1970,"title":"Chapter 1970 Number One on the Prodigy List?","paragraphs":["1970 Number One on the Prodigy List?","Chu Yunfan stood high in the sky, like a god looking down at the ants on the ground.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s gaze was really annoying!","It was as if a divine dragon was looking down at an ant. Li Qianyuan once had such a gaze, so he knew the meaning behind it. It made him feel extremely embarrassed and angry. Not long ago, he was the one who gave his opponents such a look. When had others looked at him in that way?","Chu Yunfan didn’t take advantage of his victory to continue pursuing Li Qianyuan. In his opinion, that was a humiliating act. Since he had absolute confidence in his strength, he didn’t bother to fight any further because it was unnecessary.","“Chu Yunfan, no one has ever dared to underestimate me like this!” Li Qianyuan exploded. The pride of being the Prodigy List’s top made him explode. “Man and Sword Combination!”","Li Qianyuan turned into a long sword and rushed out. Sword light went everywhere, and there were even runes on it, which resembled the world’s ancient swordsmanship. The sword light carried a mighty divine light and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","“I told you, it’s useless.” Chu Yunfan sneered. His lips curled up into a cold smile. Then, he shouted, “Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Just as the sword light was about to hit him, he stepped forward.","Boom!","The entire place shook, and the sword light that could split the world seemed to have been suppressed. A terrifying power spread out from under Chu Yunfan’s feet, turning into netherworld water and sweeping across the sky.","Someone asked in confusion, “What terrifying footwork! What kind of divine power is this? It’s so strong!”","Chu Yunfan’s footwork was like a martial art, but it also resembled divine power. However, its strength was unquestionable. With just one stomp, it suppressed the sword light.","Boom!","With another loud explosion, Chu Yunfan took a second stomp against the sword light. This one was even more shocking as if it was thunder on the ground. Everyone felt as if their hearts were about to be crushed.","It was as if Chu Yunfan’s foot had not stomped on the void but on their hearts.","The first stomp had already suppressed the sword light, and by the second one, everyone clearly saw Li Qianyuan’s sword light was actually forced to retreat.","Boom!","The third stomp followed. Everyone saw when Chu Yunfan took this step, a crack appeared on the sword light. Like a spider web, it was instantly covered with cracks, as if it had suffered a heavy blow.","Boom!","By the fourth stomp, the sword light finally collapsed and turned into a rain of light that scattered in all directions. Among them, Li Qianyuan’s figure was revealed.","Li Qianyuan spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward as if he had been hit hard. Everyone found that not only the sword light but also his golden armor was covered in cracks. The terrifying scene sent chills down their spines.","Many people were shocked. They were all experts, incomparably powerful existences. Just from a name, people could deduce a lot of information. However, this surprised everyone even more.","The complete footwork would require nine stomps, but Chu Yunfan had forced Li Qianyuan to this extent with just four. If he did all nine, how amazing would it be?","“Li Qianyuan received the inheritance of the number one master of the Eastern Sea, the Ocean Overlord. His luck is amazing, and he succeeded in practicing the Ocean Overlord’s inheritance in a short time. It’s really amazing. Moreover, he’s ranked first on the Prodigy List. However, the one who is truly shocking is Chu Yunfan. I don’t know where he came from, but I’m afraid that he probably also had a fortuitous encounter. Otherwise, where did he learn these powerful martial skills? It’s obviously more amazing than the Ocean Overlord’s Sea-Overturning Sword!”","Everyone was extremely shocked. Just the tip of the iceberg was enough for them to speculate about many things that they had never known before.","It was enough for them to completely overturn their previous judgment. Previously, they thought that whether it was inheritance or resources, Li Qianyuan should have the upper hand. But now it seemed that this was not the case. At least in terms of inheritance, Chu Yunfan completely crushed Li Qianyuan.","This discovery completely changed many people’s views, and they all couldn’t help but judge Chu Yunfan’s victory and defeat instead of Li Qianyuan’s.","The more terrifying thing was that when Li Qianyuan displayed his cultivation, Chu Yunfan was still at ease. Obviously, Li Qianyuan’s level was far from the upper limit of Chu Yunfan’s strength. At this moment, many people finally understood why Chu Yunfan could easily tear the Red Flame Demon Sect’s Grand Elder to pieces.","The two sides were not on the same level at all!","That elder had no idea how powerful the younger generation had become. He couldn’t even defeat Meng Tianran, Meng Potian, and the others, let alone Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan.","Many people realized an even more terrifying fact.","“This battle isn’t just a battle of life and death between the two of them. It might even affect the change in the Prodigy List’s top ranking. I’m afraid that the first rank in that list, which has never changed in more than ten years, will switch for the first time!”","At the thought of this, everyone’s spirits were shaken as they looked at the arena.","At the side in the dense fog, the Elder Princess, who had been expressionless all this time, saw this scene and finally revealed a playful smile on her face.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps? It seems that you have really obtained an impressive inheritance!”","She seemed to have thought of something, but then her face returned to her usual look as if she was not moved by the two people’s shocking strength.","“Hey Number one Prodigy, is that all you’ve got?” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back and sneered. “I don’t know where you got the confidence to compete with me. If I had cultivated for the same amount of time as you did, killing you would be like crushing an ant.”"]},{"number":1971,"title":"Chapter 1971 Fire God Physique? Get Wrecked!","paragraphs":["1971 Fire God Physique? Get Wrecked!","Chu Yunfan’s words shocked the heavens itself. When everyone heard his words, they couldn’t help but look at him. What kind of astonishing confidence and dominance was this?","Who was Li Qianyuan? He had been the number one expert among his peers for more than ten years. He was destined to be one of the world’s top experts in the future.","Not to mention that his peers cultivated at the same time he did, many of them had practiced longer than him, but he still caught up to them. It was clear that his talent was indeed extraordinary and rare.","However, compared with Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation time was probably not more than half of his, but he had achieved many feats and completely overtook Li Qianyuan. Such talent and strength made everyone speechless.","However, what shocked them more was that the target of Chu Yunfan’s current high and mighty attitude was Li Qianyuan, whom everyone had once perceived as unreachable.","“You dare to humiliate me?”","Li Qianyuan’s eyes were fierce, like a wounded ancient beast that had gone mad and exploded.","All of a sudden, his body began to burn. Flame spread fiercely, making him look like a flaming beast. His entire body grew from nearly two meters to more than four, almost twice as tall as Chu Yunfan.","“So forcing my Fire God Physique out was your goal? However, you will regret it. No one has ever been able to survive under my physique technique before!” Li Qianyuan yelled, his voice piercing through the sky.","Chu Yunfan sneered and exposed Li Qianyuan’s lie, “Is there really no one who can survive against your Fire God Physique? Didn’t you get beaten up and run away in a sorry state when you used that same physique previously?”","Li Qianyuan suddenly remembered the time when he was beaten like a stray dog by that mysterious man. If he hadn’t run fast and had the Scapegoat Doll, he would have died long ago.","In an instant, his eyes turned red. He gritted his teeth and yelled, “Go to hell!”","He screamed and punched out. Endless flames burst out and instantly formed a sea of fire, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","“Destroy.” Chu Yunfan calmly stomped down, and the netherworld water under his feet instantly annihilated the sea of flames without a trace.","“Overturning the Sea and Flipping the Heavens!” Li Qianyuan roared, and a black ancient sword appearing in his hand.","The sword light directly lifted the sky and swept out. It cut across the atmosphere and turned into a monstrous wave. However, this wave wasn’t made of seawater, but flames.","Even Chu Yunfan had to admit that Li Qianyuan was indeed a genius. In just a short time, he had integrated the Ocean Overlord’s Sea-Overturning Sword with his Fire God Physique, creating a completely different martial art.","Someone exclaimed, “That’s the fifth level of the Creation stage!”","After Li Qianyuan stopped suppressing his Fire God Physique, his combat strength increased by another level, from the peak of the fourth Creation Stage to the fifth Creation Stage.","That kind of strength was inconceivable!","However, what shocked many people even more was that even Li Qianyuan, who had erupted with such strength, was actually at a disadvantage in the fight with Chu Yunfan. This terrifying scene made many people look at each other in dismay. Their worldview was about to collapse.","However, their thoughts only relaxed for a moment before they immediately focused again. This was because this battle did not allow them to be calm in the slightest. Since it had gone up to this stage, everyone knew that it had reached a critical moment. It was a battle that would determine who would be ranked first on the Prodigy List in the future.","Chu Yunfan sneered. “Interesting. You’re only qualified to interest me after you display your Fire God Physique.”","Boom!","The two sides collided head-on. Facing Li Qianyuan, who had equipped his Fire God Physique, Chu Yunfan was fearless. With a terrifying aura, his body was like a primordial beast that had been revived. He rushed into the sword light.","Boom!","The sword light cut Chu Yunfan’s body. In an instant, he moved. His hands extended, and a burst of lightning erupted from his hands.","“Break!”","At that moment, the sword light was torn into pieces. Chu Yunfan resembled the most terrifying beast. With his powerful body, he could sweep across the whole world.","“Again!” Li Qianyuan roared.","At this time, he was no longer in the mood to lament Chu Yunfan’s strength. He was fully immersed in the battle. This time, he really felt a sense of extreme danger. He had never seen a power that could threaten him like this before.","Among his peers, he was invincible, but today, this legend was broken. He no longer thought about how to kill Chu Yunfan. He could only lower his goal to be on par with Chu Yunfan. The change in his mentality was unnoticeable, and even he himself did not notice it. Everything happened so naturally.","Another sword light rose up in the air and slashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Whether it was Meng Potian or Meng Tianran, their faces suddenly changed. Although they were both on the Prodigy List, Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan’s strengths had surpassed them by at least one level.","Thinking of this, they couldn’t maintain their indifferent expressions. Just as they were shocked, they saw Chu Yunfan make a seal using the back of his hand and directly smash it into the sword light. Chu Yunfan rushed toward Li Qianyuan at an even faster speed.","Bam!","He seemed to be slow, but in fact, he was fast. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of Li Qianyuan. Everything went down like flowing water. He turned his hand and used the Mountain Wrap Seal, which evolved into a divine mountain. This mountain hit Li Qianyuan’s chest on the spot with lightning speed.","Spurt!","Li Qianyuan let out a miserable cry as he was sent flying and fell to the floor of the arena."]},{"number":1972,"title":"Chapter 1972 Forced Into a Dead End","paragraphs":["1972 Forced Into a Dead End","Seeing Li Qianyuan being sent flying, several masters of the Li clan couldn’t sit still. At this time, even if they had confidence in Li Qianyuan, they could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above Li Qianyuan’s.","When they came, they had thought that Li Qianyuan was invincible. Even if there were a few masters who were ranked very high on the Prodigy List, they could only cause some trouble. They were not enough to pose a threat to Li Qianyuan.","However, who would have thought that Chu Yunfan, who should have died, would pose a huge threat to Li Qianyuan? Even after Li Qianyuan unleashed his proud Fire God Physique, he was still not Chu Yunfan’s opponent.","Shock flashed across their eyes. This had far exceeded their expectations. In their opinion, this was simply impossible But Chu Yunfan had done it, and they couldn’t sit still anymore. There were people who wanted to intervene in the battle. This was a very normal thing for them. Only a fool would believe in true fairness.","However, they endured it. There was no other reason. They had already seen the outcome of the few elders of the Winged Tiger Tribe who dared to break the rules earlier.","It was simply unbearable to look at. With just a simple attack, those few elders of the Winged Tiger Tribe were crushed to death. This reconfirmed that the Elder Princess was the number one expert of the Grand Xia royal family. Although they didn’t know if this was true or not, at the very least, her strength was something that they couldn’t match. This was something that was beyond doubt. In the Elder Princess’ eyes, these people were probably no different from ants.","However, the anxiety in their eyes still explained everything.","“What are the Flying Celestials trying to do? Do they want to completely fall out with our clan? Hurry up and stop Chu Yunfan!” an elder of the Li clan said.","“Haha!”","To this, the people of the Flying Celestials only laughed. Although the Flying Celestials were considered ordinary among the top ten sects, it was only compared to the top ten sects. The Li clan may have been a military aristocratic family and had a deep-rooted position in the military, but there was still a world of difference between them and the Flying Celestials.","The elder of the Li clan immediately realized that something was wrong. He was just too anxious just now, so he said such words. He was forced into a dead end by Chu Yunfan.","The others were also shocked by the situation in the arena. Chu Yunfan was too strong and obviously suppressed Li Qianyuan. The scale of victory and defeat had begun to pour out.","“The Fire God Physique is just so-so.” Chu Yunfan sneered. His aura did not decrease. He chased after Li Qianyuan and stomped down.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Netherworld water emanated from under Chu Yunfan’s feet. It was so heavy that it was enough to crush the void.","At this time, Li Qianyuan was dizzy. In the one-on-one competition, he was suppressed by Chu Yunfan, but he would not give up easily.","“Let’s go all out, Chu Yunfan! It won’t be that easy for you to defeat me!”","In an instant, a healing pill appeared in Li Qianyuan’s hand and he swallowed it. Suddenly, the injury that had been inflicted by Chu Yunfan healed. This was a sacred healing treasure. Even as the young master of the Li clan, Li Qianyuan could not obtain more. If Chu Yunfan had not forced him to this point, he would not have used it.","At that moment, Li Qianyuan roared and tried to block Chu Yunfan’s stomp with both hands.","Boom!","“Aaaahhh!”","Swoosh!","In the next moment, Li Qianyuan disappeared from where he was. Chu Yunfan’s foot stepped on the arena floor and a huge hole appeared.","“Struggling on the brink of death. You’re like a trapped beast fighting.” Chu Yunfan looked at Li Qianyuan coldly.","Li Qianyuan escaped from the disaster and was panting heavily. He was almost trampled to death by Chu Yunfan, but his injuries were also recovering at an amazing speed. The healing pill had played its role.","“Chu Yunfan, you want to kill me? How is that possible? I will kill you with my hands today. It’s time for us to end our grudges!”","Li Qianyuan roared and grabbed a green pill from the void. He immediately swallowed it. In an instant, the green pill turned into a torrent of energy and spread into his every cell.","Boom!","The power in Li Qianyuan’s body burst out. After he used the Fire God Physique, he surpassed the peak of the fourth level of the Creation Stage and reached the fifth level. But now, his strength was approaching the peak of the fifth level. Moreover, it was increasing at every moment.","“Chu Yunfan, this pill cost me 30 years of my life. I never thought it would come in handy one day, but now, it’s worth it to exchange 30 years of my life for yours!” Li Qianyuan roared.","Meng Potian, Meng Tianren, and Princess Yun Yang—the three masters with the highest cultivation among the younger generation present—all changed their expressions because their situation was similar to Li Qianyuan’s. However, it was also because of this that they understood that if they were not in an extremely dangerous situation, they would not easily use such a move that would consume their lifespan.","In a situation where there was no way to make up for it, it was equivalent to consuming one’s potential, making it impossible for one to reach the peak that one could have reached.","And Li Qianyuan, the number one on the Prodigy List, was forced to this extent. Chu Yunfan’s strength was simply unimaginable.","“Thirty years? You think you have 30 years?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Li Qianyuan roared and jumped up. He slashed out with his sword. The sword light was more than twice as powerful as before.","Boom!","The sword light fell fiercely toward Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1973,"title":"Chapter 1973 Li Qianyuan Finally Dies","paragraphs":["1973 Li Qianyuan Finally Dies","“Is this all you have? If I kill you now, you should die without regrets.”","It was a crystal clear white palm. The palm slammed down and hit the sword light.","Boom!","The sea of fire that swept out from the sword light and the boiling power of lightning on the palm condensed together and collided with each other, almost causing the entire world to collapse. Compared to before, the battle between the two sides had clearly escalated, and its power had increased by at least several times.","“So strong. This is really a competition for the number one person in the world. No matter who wins or loses, there’s no doubt that these two people’s strength is a level higher than everyone else.”","Everyone felt the air in their lungs froze. Such a confrontation was too terrifying. The collision between the two of them was like a divine drum. The terrifying rumble was like thunder in the sky. None of them could be compared to those geniuses.","This wasn’t just a battle for the first place on the Prodigy List, but also a battle of life and death between the two. The grudges between them over the years would be resolved here.","What surprised many people even more was that Chu Yunfan had kept up with Li Qianyuan, who had grown to such a level. He did everything so easily.","“Li Qianyuan is fine. He relied on so many secret methods and pills. It’s normal for him to have such a performance. But how is Chu Yunfan doing this?”","“No wonder Chu Yunfan is not scared of any prodigy. I’m afraid only Li Qianyuan can exchange a few moves with him. The others will only die if they come up.”","At this time, even the young masters could only admit that Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan had pulled far ahead of them. This gap was very likely something they would never catch up in their lifetime, but it was also because of this that Chu Yunfan was terrifying.","The battle was still going on. Chu Yunfan’s white palm smashed the sword light into pieces, and then the momentum did not decrease. It was like a huge wheel, falling toward Li Qianyuan.","This slap could separate Yin and Yang and decide life and death. Compared with Li Qianyuan’s full strength, Chu Yunfan’s movements seemed to be so easy, as if everything was under his control. Sometimes he used divine powers, sometimes he used martial arts, and most of the time, just a casual attack had great power, forcing Li Qianyuan to deal with it with all his strength.","It was clear who was stronger and who was weaker. Even in the face of Li Qianyuan, who was constantly increasing his strength, it was still nothing for Chu Yunfan.","Li Qianyuan’s expression darkened. Even at this level, he was still not Chu Yunfan’s opponent. He quickly retreated. In an instant, he avoided Chu Yunfan’s terrifying slap.","Boom!","The entire arena was smashed into pieces by Chu Yunfan’s slap. Everyone could not help but be shocked. The material of the arena space itself was very strong, not to mention the layers of enchantments that had been strengthened. Now, it was shattered by a single slap.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was too shocking.","Li Qianyuan’s eyes narrowed. This scene undoubtedly scared him. If he hadn’t dodged in time, the consequences would have been unimaginable. His gaze was extremely cold, and in an instant, he had slashed at Chu Yunfan again.","Boom!","Swoosh!","Two flashes of sword light surrounded Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was not afraid in the slightest. With a wave of his sleeve, he swept away the sword light that filled the sky into ashes. Although Li Qianyuan’s strength had increased dramatically, he could barely fight with Chu Yunfan.","There was still a gap. In fact, the gap between them didn’t decrease much.","Chu Yunfan raised his arm, turned around, clenched his fist, and threw a punch.","Bam!","This punch shattered the sky, tearing out a huge crack, and then suddenly slammed into Li Qianyuan’s side.","Li Qianyuan turned pale with fright and instantly reacted. He turned into a divine fire and retreated. When he reappeared, he was already thousands of meters away from Chu Yunfan. However, his condition was very bad. Half of his body had been smashed.","A look of horror flashed across his eyes. If he had not dodged the fatal attack just now, he would have been finished. He was lucky that he wasn’t hit directly. If he was hit by Chu Yunfan’s punch, it was likely that either half of his body would explode or his entire body would explode. There would be no room for recovery.","“Still alive?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","In the next moment, he appeared in front of Li Qianyuan. His speed was so fast that Li Qianyuan couldn’t react in time. He was like a fairy in the sky. His clothes fluttered and his hands were like hammers. It was extremely terrifying.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan swept out. Another simple punch directly shattered the sky.","At this time, Li Qianyuan had no other choice but to shout, “Come at me!”","Li Qianyuan put his hands in front of him and condensed a thousand layers of enchantment, but these layers of enchantment were shattered by Chu Yunfan in an instant. After breaking Li Qianyuan’s defense with a punch, Chu Yunfan’s momentum did not decrease and hit Li Qianyuan squarely in the chest.","Bam!","Li Qianyuan’s chest caved in, and he flew out of the arena as if he had been hit hard.","“Li Qianyuan, I want to see if a Scapegoat Doll will save you now,” Chu Yunfan said in a low voice that only he and Li Qianyuan could hear.","“It was you...” Li Qianyuan’s eyes widened.","He finally understood something. He roared and was about to call out Chu Yunfan’s identity when he saw a sword light fall from the sky and cut off his head."]},{"number":1974,"title":"Chapter 1974 Appearing Weak to the Enemy and Killing in One Strike","paragraphs":["1974 Appearing Weak to the Enemy and Killing in One Strike","Li Qianyuan was dead.","His entire head was sent flying and rolled to the side.","Li Qianyuan’s eyes were still wide open. Probably until he died, he never thought that Chu Yunfan was the guy he had always wanted to kill. The person who had once defeated him and forced him to the brink was Chu Yunfan. If he hadn’t been lucky enough to carry a Scapegoat Doll with him, he would have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands much earlier.","Li Qianyuan had suspected many people, but he had never suspected that it was Chu Yunfan. To his knowledge, Chu Yunfan had died a long time ago. Who would suspect a dead person? This was the blind spot of thinking. Therefore, he had never thought that it could be Chu Yunfan.","Not to mention, in his impression, Chu Yunfan’s strength had always been far inferior to his. The reason why he felt that Chu Yunfan was his mortal enemy was because Chu Yunfan’s growth speed made him feel threatened. In Li Qianyuan’s opinion, Chu Yunfan’s growth speed would make him feel troubled sooner or later.","However, that was all. As for whether Chu Yunfan could surpass him? That was simply impossible. There was no such expert among his peers. However, this most impossible existence had finally become a reality. Chu Yunfan was the culprit who had humiliated him and caused the Li clan to suffer heavy losses.","Li Qianyuan’s severed head had not completely lost consciousness, but he did not even have the strength to shout out and reveal Chu Yunfan’s identity.","Everyone was stunned and silent. Although Li Qianyuan had completely fallen into a disadvantage, no one expected that Chu Yunfan would not even give Li Qianyuan a chance to surrender.","“This shouldn’t be. No matter what, Li Qianyuan should have a chance to surrender,” someone said in disbelief.","“He fell for it. Chu Yunfan set a trap and lured him in step by step, making him think that he has the ability to protect himself.” The Elder Princess gasped. Her gaze was extremely deep, and a hint of suppression flashed through her eyes.","She knew what had happened. Chu Yunfan’s actions couldn’t be hidden from her, but she also just figured out the reason why he had let Li Qianyuan go several times. It was not what many people thought, that it was just to humiliate Li Qianyuan.","Li Qianyuan wasn’t stupid. If Chu Yunfan had shown such cultivation from the beginning, then Li Qianyuan would have chosen to avoid him. After all, although Li Qianyuan was conceited as the number one in the world, he did not think that he was invincible. Otherwise, Li Qianyuan would have died countless times. Not to mention the past, even now, there were still many giants that Li Qianyuan, the Li clan, and the crown prince’s faction could not afford to offend, such as the Elder Princess.","However, Chu Yunfan had lured Li Qianyuan into the trap step by step. He had let him go several times when he could have pursued him. On the surface, it was to humiliate Li Qianyuan and defeat him in his strongest state.","However, it was probably to make a trap to kill Li Qianyuan. Step by step, he made Li Qianyuan think that he had a chance of winning. At the very least, he had the power to protect himself. Even if he was defeated, he could withdraw in time.","This was an unprecedented defeat for Li Qianyuan. No one in his generation had ever defeated him or even stood shoulder-to-shoulder with him. But now, someone had done it. It was a huge blow, but no matter how big the blow was, it was better than being killed by Chu Yunfan.","“Well done, Chu Yunfan,” the Elder Princess said softly, and only Ruoxi, who was beside her, heard it.","Ruoxi was stunned. She could not recall the Elder Princess praising any junior this way. The Elder Princess was a prodigy of her generation and had the title of the number one expert in the royal family. Her standards were extremely high. How could ordinary people earn the Elder Princess’ approval?","After the Elder Princess’ words, Ruoxi finally reacted. This Chu Yunfan had long planned this. He didn’t just intend to defeat Li Qianyuan. He wanted to kill Li Qianyuan.","However, he was afraid of scaring Li Qianyuan and letting him escape. On this birthday, all the rules were the rules set by the Elder Princess. No one could change them.","However, it was precisely because of this that everyone had to act within the scope of this rule. Those who did not follow the rules were all casually slapped to death. And Chu Yunfan made good use of this rule.","Li Qianyuan was the number one of the Li clan and the crown prince’s faction. He had to be accompanied by a large number of masters at all times. Even his protectors were stronger than one another because they had to prevent other forces from suddenly attacking him.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any top-notch experts backing him up, and the Flying Celestials couldn’t possibly fall out with the crown prince’s faction completely because of him. That price to pay was too high. If Chu Yunfan wanted to kill Li Qianyuan, he had to do it himself. He had to use all means to complete it.","And now he had done it, leading Li Qianyuan to death step by step.","At this time, Ruoxi understood this and could not help but gasp. Because everyone’s judgment was wrong. Not only did most people tend to think that Li Qianyuan was stronger and would win, but more importantly, almost everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had crushed Li Qianyuan from the beginning to the end.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was deliberately showing weakness?","Appearing weak and being arrogant. Although it was strange to use this phrase in this battle, it was completely correct.","Everyone quickly thought of this. They were not stupid. They quickly understood the crux of the matter and sucked in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan looked unyielding, but he was actually shrewd and resourceful. This kind of person was the most terrifying.","“But is this necessary? Even if Chu Yunfan attacked from the beginning, it was enough to kill Li Qianyuan!” someone said in confusion.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan’s strength had an overwhelming advantage even when facing Li Qianyuan after his outburst. It was a high probability that he could easily kill Li Qianyuan.","“That’s right. Even so, he wasn’t 100% sure that Li Qianyuan could escape. So, he was testing whether Li Qianyuan had a trump card to let him escape. After he showed his weakness step by step and confirmed that Li Qianyuan couldn’t escape, he killed him with one blow. What a ruthless method!”"]},{"number":1975,"title":"Chapter 1975 The Husband Selection Is Over, a Storm Is Coming","paragraphs":["1975 The Husband Selection Is Over, a Storm Is Coming","At this time, many people finally understood. The wonderful battle just now was not a life and death battle in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. It was just a trap to make Li Qianyuan lose his mind. At the same time, it was also to test how many cards Li Qianyuan had.","“How big of a grudge does Chu Yunfan have to be to try so hard to kill Li Qianyuan?” someone said with emotion.","Everyone realized that Li Qianyuan was completely different from the others Chu Yunfan had previously killed. Chu Yunfan was like a high and mighty god. He didn’t care about any of these challengers. Whoever jumped out would be crushed to death.","However, Chu Yunfan was not interested in killing those who did not jump out. Just like Flying Tiger and Meng Potian, the different ending between Meng Tianren and Meng Potian was the clearest result. Only Li Qianyuan was different. Even though Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above Li Qianyuan’s, his killing intent toward Li Qianyuan had never decreased. He had racked his brains to find ways to kill Li Qianyuan. He regarded Li Qianyuan as someone who had to be killed.","However, the people present were not ordinary people. It could be said that they were all the upper echelons of this world. Soon, they thought of the resentment between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan, especially Li Qianyuan who had repeatedly targeted Chu Yunfan. This wasn’t really a secret. It was just that it hadn’t been made public, but those who should know basically knew.","In the end, the Demon God Sect and the demons joined forces to target Chu Yunfan, almost causing him to die a tragic death. Li Qianyuan was behind this, which even angered the Grand Commandant’s Office and almost implicated Li Qianyuan. If the crown prince hadn’t come forward, Li Qianyuan would have been implicated.","When everyone thought of this, they were enlightened. When Li Qianyuan was strong, he tried to get rid of Chu Yunfan. He didn’t let Chu Yunfan go just because he was weak. Now, the offensive and defensive situation was different. Chu Yunfan had the upper hand, so he naturally had to find ways to eliminate Li Qianyuan.","If he missed this opportunity, Li Qianyuan, who was under the protection of many guardians, would not be alone for a long time. Only now could Chu Yunfan catch the opportunity. Without a doubt, this was the best opportunity.","Chu Yunfan was like an old hunter who guided Li Qianyuan into a trap and killed him in one blow. This scheming made everyone tremble in fear. However, it also made everyone wonder why Chu Yunfan was so cautious. This was simply not the kind of caution that someone his age should have.","Chu Yunfan looked at Li Qianyuan. After confirming that he would not be resurrected and had used a Scapegoat Doll, he breathed a sigh of relief. The enemy in front of him had tried to kill him many times since many years ago. Only he knew how many life and death crises he had encountered because of Li Qianyuan. Now that he had killed Li Qianyuan, this mortal enemy was finally dead and would not be resurrected.","Although he had missed the best opportunity to kill Li Qianyuan secretly and had killed Li Qianyuan in front of everyone, even Grand Xia could not pursue his responsibility. Once people entered the ring, they automatically signed a life and death contract. Life and death were determined by fate!","Although there would probably be a lot of secret attacks in the future, it did not matter to him. As long as it was not done openly, what was there to be afraid of?","Chu Yunfan heard the crowd’s discussion. In fact, they had already guessed his thoughts. After all, the strength of the people present was different, but there was no doubt that they were all the smartest people in the world. It was not difficult to guess Chu Yunfan’s thoughts, so it was normal for them to guess.","Chu Yunfan had lured Li Qianyuan into the trap step by step and then killed him in one blow, but no one knew why Chu Yunfan was so careful. The real reason was only known to Chu Yunfan. He had the opportunity to kill Li Qianyuan earlier, but Li Qianyuan had deceived him with a Scapegoat Doll and escaped.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had been testing Li Qianyuan’s cards. Although Chu Yunfan knew that the Scapegoat Doll was very precious and the probability of him having a second one was not high, he did not dare to gamble because he knew that this was the only chance for him to kill Li Qianyuan. He had no choice but to proceed carefully. Such a good opportunity was rare.","In the end, he confirmed that Li Qianyuan did not have a second Scapegoat Doll, so he finished Li Qianyuan with one blow. Even Li Qianyuan had not expect to not escape from Chu Yunfan’s hands. Compared to the last battle in the Eastern Sea, Li Qianyuan’s strength had improved a lot, but Chu Yunfan’s improvement was even more amazing. The rhythm of the battle was under Chu Yunfan’s control from the beginning to the end.","He was so careful, not because Li Qianyuan was much stronger than the others, but because Li Qianyuan was too dangerous. He was the spokesperson of the crown prince, and the power behind him was something that even Chu Yunfan had to look at.","As long as the others did not jump out and get in the way, Chu Yunfan was not interested in finding trouble with them. However, Li Qianyuan was different. If he did not come out, Chu Yunfan would bait him to come out.","‘Killing Li Qianyuan is just the beginning. The real storm is just about to begin,’ Chu Yunfan thought. He knew that killing Li Qianyuan was not the end of everything, but the beginning of a series of storms.","Including Li Qianyuan, the Junior Flame Master, Flying Tiger, and others who were killed by him, all of them had high hopes. Now that they had all died in Chu Yunfan’s hands, how could these forces let it go?","“You’re an animal, Chu Yunfan! You’re courting death!”","“Kill him!”","The faces of these Li clan experts turned ashen. They thought that they would win this selection, but who knew that it would turn out like this. The Li clan’s greatest hope of rising had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","These elders of the Li clan almost fainted, and even Li Qianyuan’s protector was among them. A terrifying aura locked onto Chu Yunfan, who was a terrifying existence at the peak of the Creation Stage.","He was Li Qianyuan’s protector, who had helped Li Qianyuan resolve countless death situations. Who would have thought that Li Qianyuan would be killed right under his nose? It was simply a slap in his face."]},{"number":1976,"title":"Chapter 1976 A Thousand Accusing Fingers, Enemy of the World","paragraphs":["1976 A Thousand Accusing Fingers, Enemy of the World","In any force, not every descendant had a protector. Only the most promising prodigies with outstanding talent who could beat their peers could have a protector to protect them.","For protectors, it was not only to protect the hope of their family’s rise, but it was also closely related to themselves. Such top-notch experts would lower their status and do nothing but protect a prodigy for decades until that person rose to become a top-notch expert themselves.","The benefits the protectors would obtain were naturally self-evident. Just the gratitude of these prodigies who had risen to become top experts brought countless rewards, bringing huge gains to the protector and their descendants.","Becoming a protector of a certain prodigy was not a difficult task, but a lucrative job that many people fought for. This was especially true for those older figures who had already reached the upper limit of their cultivation and had no way to advance. They would fight for such an opportunity with all their might.","Some of forces even had their direct ancestors personally come forward to protect their descendants. Under such circumstances, to protectors, prodigies were their future hope, and even the hope of their lineage. One could imagine that Li Qianyuan’s death was like his protector’s future being cut off by a knife. The anger in his heart instantly burst out. However, he still endured it.","Although he was already a top expert in the Li clan, compared to the Elder Princess, he was nothing. He had seen texperts of the Winged Tiger Tribe being crushed to death with a single slap. Among them was even the protector of the Winged Tiger Tribe. Their strength was not inferior to his, and it was because of this lesson that he did not dare to act rashly. He could only stare at Chu Yunfan, wishing he could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“Li clan people, what are you trying to do? Why are you being such sore loser?”","The experts of the Flying Celestials also stood up one after another, blocking the way of the experts of the Li clan. The elder of the Flying Celestials was especially at full strength, fighting against the Li clan’s protector.","“Chu Yunfan was too ruthless. He killed the chief disciple of our sect for no reason. He needs to explanation himself. We can’t just let this go!”","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan has committed an unforgivable crime. His martial arts should be crippled!”","“If he doesn’t die, the hatred in our hearts won’t be appeased!”","Following the words of the Li clan’s expert, the experts of the sects who had their chief disciples killed by Chu Yunfan also began to clamor. In an instant, it felt as if the entire world was the Flying Celestials’ enemy.","Chu Yunfan had offended too many people. Even if the people he killed were not the chief disciples of the various large sects, they were the best of the best in their respective sects. They were not much different from the chief disciples.","Even the remaining forces did not have any disciples killed by Chu Yunfan were probably not happy to see Chu Yunfan rise like this. Before this, Chu Yunfan was still a pursuer and a junior. But now, after Chu Yunfan killed Li Qianyuan, he was the number one person of the younger generation in the world. His status would change from challenger to the challenged. He had become a thorn in many people’s eyes!","The pressure that Li Qianyuan had once endured was now overwhelming Chu Yunfan. For a moment, there were thousands pointing fingers at him. However, Chu Yunfan did not seem to see it. He was calm and there was a faint coldness in his gaze. He had stood at the top of the world more than once, so he was naturally not unfamiliar with this feeling.","When a person stood at the peak, they would have to face the open spears and hidden arrows of various factions. This was normal. Chu Yunfan could now see the true faces of the various forces and their motives.","In this world of great conflict, thousands of boats were racing against each other. Everyone was fighting for the chance to transcend. If one person was strong, they would occupy more resources, while others would have fewer opportunities. Naturally, they would block the path of others and become a thorn in everyone’s eyes.","The people of the Flying Celestials, who were under great pressure, couldn’t help but smile bitterly. They hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to make such a big move. They never thought that he could kill Li Qianyuan. What kind of shocking strength was this?","The Flying Celestials was one of the top ten sects and had never lacked experts who could be ranked on the Prodigy List. However, it had been many years since a person had been able to rank first on the Prodigy List. The last one was more than a thousand years ago. It was so long ago that people had almost forgotten that the Flying Celestials had once been glorious.","And now, another one had appeared. They had seen Chu Yunfan’s strength, so they were naturally very meticulous. Even the true disciples who were of the same generation as Chu Yunfan were very happy. When a person was slightly stronger than them, it might arouse their jealousy. However, when a person was so powerful that they could only look up to him, then this jealousy would turn into admiration.","If Chu Yunfan’s level was similar to theirs, then Chu Yunfan’s rise would undoubtedly be another competitor for them. However, Chu Yunfan stood at a very high level, and he was not on the same level as them. There was no competition between the two sides. No matter how thick-skinned they were, they were too embarrassed to say that they were Chu Yunfan’s competitors.","Without competition, there was no longer any conflict of interest. Naturally, Chu Yunfan was much more pleasing to the eye. Moreover, they knew that their future wealth was tied to the Flying Celestials. The stronger the Flying Celestials was, the more limitless their future would be. A powerful Flying Celestials needed a leader with immeasurable potential like Chu Yunfan to lead it.","At this moment, they all knew that they absolutely could not take even half a step back under the pressure of the crowd, especially the elder in the lead. He understood what it meant for the Flying Celestials to have a disciple ranked first on the Prodigy List.","“Even if all of us die in battle, we will not let you have your way!”","For a moment, the atmosphere in the arena froze. Both sides were at loggerheads. A great battle was about to erupt,","“Enough. Do you have no respect for me?!”","Suddenly, the Elder Princess’ cold shout came from the side. Everyone immediately shivered. Only then did everyone remember that there was a terrifying existence here that suppressed everyone. Everyone’s life and death were in her hands.","Immediately after, a huge pressure crushed the entire scene. The aura released by everyone’s bodies collapsed and disappeared without a trace.","No one dared to resist. They all turned to look at the Elder Princess to see how she would deal with this matter. A matter of life and death could be decided with a single word."]},{"number":1977,"title":"Chapter 1977 We Can Die, but Chu Yunfan Can’t!","paragraphs":["1977 We Can Die, but Chu Yunfan Can’t!","“Elder Princess, please uphold justice!”","“Life and death are decided by fate in today’s battle. Anyone who comes here must be prepared to die!” the Elder Princess declared from the thick fog. Her voice was indifferent and ethereal, with a hint of coldness.","This caused the experts of the Flying Celestials to reveal excited expressions. However, the Elder Princess’ next words immediately made the people of the Flying Celestials feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“In my Serene Immortal Mountain, no private fights are allowed. Now that the birthday celebration is over, you can decide whether you want to stay or leave. Outsiders are only allowed to stay here for three days.”","This sentence immediately made the eyes of the experts of the various large factions light up. They could hear that the Elder Princess was implying that they were not allowed to act casually in Serene Immortal Mountain. Otherwise, it would be breaking the rules she had set. However, outside Serene Immortal Mountain, there was no such restriction.","Outsiders were only allowed to stay here for up to three days to make preparations. Once Chu Yunfan left Serene Immortal Mountain, he would become a turtle in a jar.","“We accept your orders, Elder Princess.”","Everyone said one after another. Even though the Flying Celestials were depressed, they did not dare to disobey the Elder Princess’ orders. When they raised their heads, they realized that the Elder Princess had disappeared without a trace.","“I didn’t sense any fluctuations from the Elder Princess’ departure. Could it be spatial teleportation?”","Chu Yunfan looked at the figure in the mist that had disappeared. Unlike the others, he had never thought about those things. He sighed at the Elder Princess’ amazing means. She had already touched the level of space. This was a level that Chu Yunfan could not possibly come into contact with at the moment. As expected of the top expert in the world.","“Hmph, just you wait. You will die in three days, Chu Yunfan,” the Li clan’s protector said as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Hahaha, Heaven is fair. We’ll see where you run to in three days!”","“Without the Elder Princess’ protection, you will not escape death!”","At this moment, many experts who wished they could skin Chu Yunfan alive looked at him with hatred, wishing they could tear him into pieces. Everyone in the Flying Celestials was worried. Very soon, these people flew away from Serene Immortal Mountain and disappeared. However, it was obvious that they had surrounded Serene Immortal Mountain.","The power of one family could not achieve this, but it was possible to do it with the power of each family. Moreover, with the help of other forces behind the scenes, these forces were happy to see Chu Yunfan die here. It could be said that he was the enemy of the world and was condemned by thousands of people. Therefore, everyone in the Flying Celestials had worried expressions. How could they not guess the plans of the various major factions? They could even imagine most of it.","However, it was impossible for them to give up on Chu Yunfan. For them, no matter how stupid they were, they could see that Chu Yunfan was the key to their future rise. The Li clan had to protect Li Qianyuan at all costs, and now it was the Flying Celestials’ turn to protect Chu Yunfan at all costs.","Previously, Yang Dengxian was ranked 20th on the Prodigy List. Although his ranking was not low, it was not very high either. Although the Flying Celestials had done their best to nurture him, it was not like how they treated Chu Yunfan. They could all die, but Chu Yunfan could not be harmed. It was not until now that Chu Yunfan had truly enjoyed the treatment of a prodigy.","If possible, the Li clan would rather have eight or ten protectors die than let Li Qianyuan make the slightest mistake.","“What should we do now? The forces will seal off the area around Serene Immortal Mountain. It’ll be impossible for us to leave,” someone said with a worried expression.","“Exactly. Moreover, as time passes, I’m afraid that more and more people will receive the news and come. At that time, it will be even more difficult for us to leave.”","“That might work.”","“No, although they are at their weakest now, our strength is also at its weakest. We’re only here to celebrate the Elder Princess’ birthday. We didn’t know that such a thing would happen, so many experts didn’t come,” another elder pointed out.","There was only one elder, a few elders, and a group of Cosmic true disciples in the Flying Celestials’ team. Such a lineup was very powerful for many people. It was even enough to wipe out an ordinary sect. However, it was not enough for those powerful enemies outside who were like wolves and tigers. Such a lineup had no chance of winning against them.","“The only way now is to ask the sect for help,” someone concluded, “But with the enemy’s methods, I’m afraid that a barrier has already been set up. It’s impossible for us to send out a message.”","Many people were regretting not sending out word earlier. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have fallen to such a state.","“If nothing works out, we can only fight to the death. I’ll bring up the rear, and everyone will protect Chu Yunfan with all their might. Although I’m unwilling to sacrifice all of you, you’ve enjoyed the protection of the Flying Celestials, so you naturally have to work for the Flying Celestials. I don’t need to say anything more.” The elder’s gaze was like an eagle as he stared at the crowd.","Although everyone was somewhat unwilling, they understood that at this time, they had no choice but to agree. If the news spread back and the sect knew, they would have no place to stand. For them, the sect could sacrifice ordinary disciples, but for Chu Yunfan, for the future of the Flying Celestials, the sect could also sacrifice them.","If they sacrificed themselves for the sect, their families would naturally be rewarded after their deaths. Therefore, they did not have many choices left. After all, even the elder had stood up to protect the rear. What else could they say? They could not refuse.","“Listen to me, everyone,” Chu Yunfan spoke up."]},{"number":1978,"title":"Chapter 1978 Chu Yunfan That Grew up in the Wilderness","paragraphs":["1978 Chu Yunfan That Grew up in the Wilderness","Everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan. When everyone had made up their minds to protect Chu Yunfan, no one knew what Chu Yunfan was going to say.","“This is not the time to act on impulse, Chu Yunfan. The other party is clearly not going to let you off. This is the most dangerous time. It doesn’t matter if we sacrifice ourselves. The Flying Celestials has many old men like me, but you are the future of the sect. We can’t lose you,” the elder of the Flying Celestials said with a solemn expression.","As for the others, whether they were willing or not, they all knew that this was fate. Unlike Chu Yunfan, who grew up in the wild, they relied on the resources and support of the Flying Celestials. They wouldn’t be where they were now without the sect. To nurture them, the Flying Celestials had put in a lot of effort. All kinds of resources were at their disposal, and at the critical moment, they had no choice but to sacrifice themselves. In the past, it was others who sacrificed for them. Now, it was their turn to sacrifice for Chu Yunfan.","The true disciples were silent and did not speak. They tacitly agreed to the elder’s words.","“I’m not acting on impulse. I have my plans. I’m not someone who doesn’t know what’s good for me. I’ve already made all the preparations before this. Even if they surround Serene Immortal Mountain, they won’t be able to do anything to me,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Everyone’s eyes widened. They wanted to know what Chu Yunfan had prepared.","However, Chu Yunfan had no intention of explaining, because this involved the biggest secret in his heart—the Mountain River Diagram. As long as he hid in the diagram, even if those people surrounded the world, they would not be able to do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan would just hide inside and wait for their patience to run out.","This was his biggest trump card. With the Mountain River Diagram, he would dare to charge into even the dragon’s pool and tiger’s den. So far, as long as he hid in the diagram, no one could do anything to him.","Previously, the difference in strength between him and Li Qianyuan was too big. Li Qianyuan only noticed the fluctuation when he entered the Mountain River Diagram. However, after he had entered the diagram, Li Qianyuan could not do anything to him.","This was the Alchemy Emperor’s personal artifact. Even if the Alchemy Emperor’s strength was not considered top-notch among the many emperors of old, in terms of strength, he was enough to crush any of the current experts. In the current world, there was no existence that could match up to the Alchemy Emperor, not to mention destroying the Mountain River Diagram to force him out. That was simply impossible!","Previously, when Chu Yunfan was ambushed by the bigshot of the demons, the attack had come too suddenly and he didn’t even have time to hide in the Mountain River Diagram. If he had managed to, he wouldn’t have been beaten to the point of death. Therefore, the encirclement of those people outside was a dangerous situation for others. To him, if necessary, he could completely avoid the sharp edge.","Without the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan would have died countless times. Although the Flying Celestials were his pillar of support, he had never truly treated it as such. He was the only one he could truly rely on. Moreover, it was not as if he had not made any preparations!","“Don’t worry, everyone. Just wait for three days. After three days, we will know the result. Don’t worry. Please believe me, I won’t joke around with my life,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Everyone understood that Chu Yunfan didn’t intend to tell them his secret. However, they knew that this was probably related to his ability to settle down. Everyone thought about it and understood. Unlike them, Chu Yunfan grew up in the wild. To be able to reach this step without relying on the Flying Celestials, his performance was simply shocking. This was why the elder was willing to die to protect Chu Yunfan.","If Chu Yunfan didn’t have any life-saving skills, he would have died long ago. When everyone was certain that Chu Yunfan was dead, he came back alive. This must have something to do with his inheritances.","The true disciples heaved a sigh of relief. If they had not been forced to the extreme, who would be willing to die like this? Especially as true Flying Celestial disciples, their status was extraordinary and their future was limitless.","“In that case, we’ll wait for three days. However, if things can’t be done, we have to make a decision as soon as possible. The longer we wait, the more experts the other party will send. At that time, there will be no chance of survival,” the elder said.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the elder. Although Chu Yunfan was mostly roaming outside the sect, the other party was sincere in saving him. He was moved and said, “Thank you for defending me. May I know your name?”","The elder looked at Chu Yunfan, stroked his beard, and said, “My name is Hu Dingtian. I travel outside all year round, so it’s normal that you haven’t seen me. I heard that another genius has risen in our sect, but I haven’t had the chance to meet you. Later, I heard that you have fallen. I felt that it was a pity, but Heaven is merciful and allows you to escape death. It seems that Heaven wants the Flying Celestials to rise.”","However, it was normal after thinking about it. The elders of the Flying Celestials held high positions of power and authority. They were all important figures in Grand Xia. How could the Flying Celestials possibly restrict them? Unless the sect leader, Situ Xuan, personally summoned these elders, they were invisible.","“Thank you for your concern, elder.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","“You’re welcome. You deserve it.” Hu Dingtian stroked his beard."]},{"number":1979,"title":"Chapter 1979 Recruiting Followers","paragraphs":["1979 Recruiting Followers","Hu Dingtian looked at Chu Yunfan and spoke with certainty. Chu Yunfan naturally understood what he meant. It was because Chu Yunfan had shown enough talent that Hu Dingtian chose to fully support him. If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary true disciple, it would be impossible for Hu Dingtian to be so concerned.","And only Chu Yunfan could do this!","In the past, only Yang Dengxian was far ahead of the rest of the sect, and there was no decent opponent at all, just like Li Qianyuan’s position among the younger generation in the world. Naturally, no matter whether they were willing or not, they could only choose to rely on Yang Dengxian to obtain everything they wanted.","But now, Chu Yunfan had appeared. There was no doubt that this was a brand new opportunity, one that no one had ever had before. Before this, Chu Yunfan was basically a wild card. Although the Flying Celestials had helped him, it was not worth mentioning compared to Chu Yunfan’s current growth.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan could abandon the Flying Celestials at any time and place without affecting himself in any way, because his growth did not rely on the sect. The Flying Celestials had only provided him with a certain degree of protection.","Under such circumstances, in Hu Dingtian’s eyes, Chu Yunfan had naturally become a hot potato. Although Chu Yunfan had already amassed a certain amount of power, in Hu Dingtian’s eyes, it was just a small fight—child’s play. They were just a group of inner disciples and elite disciples who could not even be considered true disciples.","If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary true disciple, this lineup would be enough. But now, Chu Yunfan’s talent was astonishing. In the future, he would definitely be nurtured by the Flying Celestials. At the very least, the resources he received would not be inferior to Yang Dengxian’s.","Under such circumstances, such a lineup was simply not enough. Chu Yunfan needed the support of the elders and even the support of many Cosmic true disciples. Only by creating momentum could Chu Yunfan possibly contend with Yang Dengxian and even compete for the position of sect leader.","In Hu Dingtian’s opinion, this was the best opportunity to place a bet. How could adding icing on the cake be more memorable than sending charcoal in the snow? Although it was not exactly sending charcoal in the snow now, it was better than getting close to Yang Dengxian.","Not only Hu Dingtian, but even a few elders and the Cosmic true disciples instantly understood this point. Chu Yunfan, who had just risen up, did not have many people around him. Now was the best time to board the ship. They could occupy the most advantageous position.","Once Chu Yunfan rose to power, his followers would spread throughout all of Grand Xia, let alone within the Flying Celestials. Even experts from the outer realms would come to follow him. Whatever momentum and grandeur Li Qianyuan had in the past, Chu Yunfan would soon have the same momentum and grandeur.","Thinking of this, many people looked at Chu Yunfan with a fiery gaze. There was no doubt that he was their greatest hope for the future. One should not think that these true disciples and elders were immortal. On the contrary, they had their plans and desires. It was just that ordinary people could not satisfy their desires.","Of course, this was only possible if Chu Yunfan survived the encirclement.","Chu Yunfan understood the meaning of Hu Dingtian’s words. He thought to himself that he had just risen to power. Although he had killed Li Qianyuan in one fell swoop and rewritten the situation of the whole world, in the end, his foundation was still too shallow. He was not like Li Qianyuan, who had a behemoth like the Li clan behind him.","There were many things that Li Qianyuan did not need to worry about. Many of those followers were selected from a young age to serve Li Qianyuan. Chu Yunfan didn’t have such conditions, so he could only recruit followers.","He also understood what everyone was thinking. They wanted to push him to the top and compete with Yang Dengxian for the position of sect leader of the Flying Celestials. Once Chu Yunfan ascended to the position, everyone would follow the dragon to attack the city, and it would be easy for them to develop in the future.","However, Chu Yunfan’s ambition wasn’t here. Although he understood their plan, he didn’t agree. However, he did not expose their thoughts. Even if he didn’t want to be the leader of the Flying Celestials, with such a powerful group of followers, many things would be much easier to handle.","“No matter what, I am grateful for your friendship today. When I return to the Flying Celestials, I welcome you all to visit me often,” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone’s faces were filled with joy. Chu Yunfan had relented and was going to openly recruit followers. Without a doubt, they would be the first batch.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t even received the Flying Celestials’ great nurturing, but he had already become the number one in the world. If he received the additional resources from the Flying Celestials, how strong would he become? No one dared to imagine.","Hu Dingtian nodded in satisfaction. “In that case, we won’t disturb you anymore. We’ll think of a way to contact the sect. If we can, then you don’t have to take the risk.”","Everyone had their own thoughts. Then, under Hu Dingtian’s lead, they left and headed to the residences Serene Immortal Mountain had prepared for them. Chu Yunfan was about to leave too when the Elder Princess’ attendant, Ruoxi, came before Chu Yunfan.","“Miss Ruoxi, why are you looking for me?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“There is something here that Princess Gushe instructed me to give you,” Ruoxi said.","“Siyu...” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself, but he did not act pretentiously. He accepted a jade box from Ruoxi’s hands."]},{"number":1980,"title":"Chapter 1980 Breakthrough, Second Creation Stage","paragraphs":["1980 Breakthrough, Second Creation Stage","Chu Yunfan opened the jade box. There was nothing else inside except for a green dew-shaped object. It was about the size of a thumb. Even though it was sealed by layers of barriers, Chu Yunfan could still feel a dense life force from this item.","With the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan had the support of a top emperor. There were very few things in the world that were unknown to him.","Not to mention, it was the Wood Spirit Essence. Even the Alchemy Emperor did not have much Wood Spirit Essence back then. Wood Spirit Essence was the purest wood power in the world that could only be born under extremely special circumstances.","This Wood Spirit Essence was extremely precious. Just one drop could extend a person’s lifespan by 20 years, and this was only one of the functions of the Wood Spirit Essence.","The Wood Spirit Essence could greatly strengthen a person’s life spirit, completing a complete transformation. If a pregnant woman swallowed a drop of Wood Spirit Essence, then the child she gave birth to would be born with a Wood Spirit Physique. At the very least, it would be comparable to a king-level physique. If there were a few more drops, it could even be comparable to an emperor-level physique.","For cultivators, this item could greatly enhance their life force and increase their cultivation for decades. To peerless geniuses, this was the key to their cultivation being able to rise like a rocket in an extremely short period. These top-notch resources that ordinary people could not see.","“You are very knowledgable, Young Master Chu.” Ruoxi was stunned. She had not expected him to recognize the Wood Spirit Essence. After all, even she had never heard of such a top-notch cultivation resource.","“This item was obtained by the Elder Princess during her travels. It was reserved for Princess Gushe’s cultivation, but Princess Gushe never used it. Now, she is giving it to you. I hope that Young Master can understand Princess Gushe’s intentions, Young Master Chu,” Ruoxi said.","Chu Yunfan held the box tightly. Of course, he understood the intentions without Ruoxi’s special explanation. He was not pretentious. He could be pretentious with anyone, but there was no need to be pretentious with Tang Siyu. If it were him, he would do the same.","“Miss Ruoxi, may I trouble you to help me pass a message to her? Tell me to wait for me, and I will one day give her a grand wedding,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Understood, I will pass on the message,” Ruoxi said, “The princess is at a critical juncture in her cultivation and can’t come out of seclusion. However, even we can see her concern for you, Young Master.”","“Thank you, Miss Ruoxi.”","After sending Ruoxi off, Chu Yunfan was led by a servant to a residence on the Serene Immortal Mountain that was used to entertain guests. After entering the courtyard, Chu Yunfan immediately stepped into the Mountain River Diagram. Then, he impatiently opened the jade box and broke the seal on the Wood Spirit Essence.","Chu Yunfan opened his mouth and inhaled the drop of Wood Spirit Essence. Suddenly, he felt a huge amount of energy flowing into his limbs and bones. However, it was completely different from the pills that he had taken to increase his strength. This energy was warm and gentle, and there was not even a trace of violence.","Chu Yunfan could feel that the life force that he had burned to fight against the bigshot of the demons was being replenished bit by bit. One had to know that the power brought by burning one’s life was extremely powerful, but at the same time, it would also bring shocking damage to the martial artist’s body. Even if the injury recovered, the injury would always exist.","Therefore, under normal circumstances, no one would use such an extreme move. Chu Yunfan was forced into a corner and had no choice but to use such a move. However, Chu Yunfan was different from ordinary people. He had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and countless pill formulas in his mind. Some of them could make up for this kind of injury. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t use it so easily. Every time he used it, it would damage his foundation and even make it impossible for him to reach the peak that he should have been able to reach.","And now, the Wood Spirit Essence was repairing Chu Yunfan’s damaged soul, which even Chu Yunfan’s healing pills could not heal. After healing these injuries, he could feel that the hidden danger in his body was gone. He didn’t have to worry about his efforts going to waste.","In addition, Chu Yunfan’s appearance was already very young. Now, under the nourishment of the Wood Spirit Essence, he looked younger by a few years, looking like a sixteen or seventeen-year-old youth. His vitality had been greatly restored, and his lifespan had increased by several decades.","This was only because Chu Yunfan was still very young. If it were anyone else, the old man might have turned back into a middle-aged man, and the middle-aged man might have turned back into a young man. That would be a big change and shocking enough.","The increase in one’s lifespan was extremely important to a martial artist. This was without a doubt. Without enough time, even a top genius could not cultivate to the extreme. Not to mention achieving the goal of countless cultivators in the past, to truly transcend and live forever.","However, no one had ever been able to break the boundary between life and death and live forever. This was the reason why the descent of the godhead had triggered a desperate battle between the emperors. This was because this might be the only hope of reaching enlightenment. If they missed it, there would be no other.","Other than these two points, Chu Yunfan felt that his cultivation was increasing bit by bit. At his level of cultivation, his strength was as deep as the vast ocean. It was very difficult to sense an ordinary increase.","But now, as the Wood Spirit Essence continued to circulate in Chu Yunfan’s body, a part of it turned into waves of energy and was finally refined into power.","This power continued to grow. In just a moment, it pushed Chu Yunfan to the peak of the first level of the Creation Stage. Then, it continued to push at an even more shocking speed.","It was different from the previous time when Chu Yunfan broke through. Almost every time, he had to use all his strength to break through. It was as if he pushed the boat with the current and the water flowed smoothly. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation strength smoothly grew and broke through in such a calm sprint.","The second level of the Creation Stage!"]},{"number":1981,"title":"Chapter 1981 Princess Yun Yang’s Visit","paragraphs":["1981 Princess Yun Yang’s Visit","‘I broke through so easily?’ Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. His breathing became a little hurried. This was the easiest breakthrough he had ever had since he started cultivating.","However, it was different now. He had not felt anything. The second level Creation Stage barrier that blocked him disappeared without a trace, allowing him to easily complete his breakthrough.","“As expected of the Wood Spirit Essence!”","Although Chu Yunfan had long known about the effects of the Wood Spirit Essence, this was the first time he had used such a top-notch cultivation resource. The effect was simply amazing. He broke through from the peak of the first level of the Creation Stage to the second level of the Creation Stage without any difficulty. He had not even encountered any difficulties. This was an unprecedented experience. This proved how powerful the Wood Spirit Essence was.","This item could only be produced in extreme environments. Only in places where the wood energy was extremely abundant, locked by the invisible power of heaven and earth, and after countless years of evolution, could the Wood Spirit Essence be made.","Just one drop of the Wood Spirit Essence was priceless. Of course, it couldn’t be compared to the Brahma Tree. After all, the Brahma Tree could continuously produce Brahma Fruits, so its value couldn’t be compared to a drop of the Wood Spirit Essence.","The fact that the Elder Princess was willing to leave such a good thing to Tang Siyu was enough to prove that she truly treated Tang Siyu as her last disciple. The Elder Princess was not the slightest bit stingy with resources. Even for an expert like her, a drop of Wood Spirit Essence was still very useful.","This made Chu Yunfan’s dissatisfaction with the Elder Princess lessened slightly. Although she did not like him, she was very generous with Tang Siyu. She threw all kinds of resources at Tang Siyu as if they were free and even personally guided Tang Siyu. It could be said that the Elder Princess valued Tang Siyu as much as she despised Chu Yunfan. It was understandable that she thought Chu Yunfan was not worthy of her disciple.","However, that was all in the past. Now, even the Elder Princess had to look at Chu Yunfan in a new light. She did not dare to treat him as a nameless ant.","After Chu Yunfan’s cultivation reached the second level of the Creation Stage, only a small portion of the Wood Spirit Essence had been digested. It would probably not be long before his cultivation reached the peak of the second level. It was even only a matter of time before he reached the third Creation Stage.","All he needed was time, but what Chu Yunfan lacked the most was time. Although his cultivation was increasing at a rapid pace—so fast that he could clearly feel the growth of his own cultivation—it would take at least half a month to break through to the next stage.","This speed was extremely fast, but it could not keep up with Chu Yunfan’s needs. This was because he would be expelled from Serene Immortal Mountain in three days. The reason was that Serene Immortal Mountain was the Elder Princess’ territory, and it was not suitable for an outsider to stay there for a long time.","No, to be precise, there should be two days left. Even though Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had been unstoppable all the way until he broke through to the second Creation Stage, he had spent more than a day.","He did not have much time left.","‘Time to see what happens.’ Chu Yunfan frowned.","To him, there was no need to worry about protecting himself. It was impossible for those people to kill him. They could not break the defense of the Mountain River Diagram. It was almost impossible to find the particle formed by the Mountain River Diagram in the vast world.","However, that was not his goal. These people were trying to surround Chu Yunfan and kill him, which made him want to kill them. He had given those people he killed a chance to stand down, but they were blinded by the benefits of being related to the Elder Princess. Especially for Li Qianyuan who had deliberately tried to eliminate him, Chu Yunfan would certainly not let him go. They had brought this upon themselves.","Chu Yunfan didn’t wait in vain. After half a day, Princess Yun Yang arrived at Chu Yunfan’s residence. “I’m back, General Chu,” she called out.","“Have you found the things I asked, Princess?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up, but his expression was calm.","“I’m glad I didn’t fail you.” Princess Yun Yang nodded. “Here are all the herbs you wanted.” She handed over a spatial bag.","“Thank you, Princess.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and thanked her.","Princess Yun Yang went straight to the point. Although these herbs were expensive, they paled in comparison to the benefits she had received after Chu Yunfan cut off the crown prince’s arm. Li Qianyuan’s strength was naturally not the strongest in the crown prince’s party, but his title as number one on the Prodigy List was enough to attract many potential followers for the crown prince. Not to mention, it would not take many years for Li Qianyuan to become one of the top masters in the world. There was no doubt about it.","Many princes and princesses wanted to lay their hands on Li Qianyuan, but none of them succeeded. She was the only one who succeeded through Chu Yunfan’s hands, so she was naturally happy.","“Yes, I killed Li Qianyuan, but it had nothing to do with you, Princess. It was just an old grudge,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","How could he not hear that Princess Yun Yang wanted to rope him in and make him work for her? However, Chu Yunfan had no interest in getting involved in these royal affairs, so he did not want to be implicated.","“I’ve troubled you, Princess, but I don’t have much to give you in return. Please accept this manual as a reward.” Chu Yunfan waved, and a golden book appeared in mid-air and instantly entered Princess Yun Yang’s body."]},{"number":1982,"title":"Chapter 1982 Three Days End, a Great Battle Is About to Begin","paragraphs":["1982 Three Days End, a Great Battle Is About to Begin","It was a manual Chu Yunfan had condensed using his own divine power. After entering Princess Yun Yang, it disappeared without a trace. In her mind, a manual made up of golden words appeared.","Originally, Princess Yun Yang did not take the Exquisite Steps to heart. After all, she was from the imperial family of Grand Xia. Even though the ten great sects of Grand Xia were the most powerful sects in the world, the true experts all knew that the most powerful sect in the world was none other than the imperial family of Grand Xia.","The other sects were all developed by a single family. However, Grand Xia was different. It was the true leader of the heroes. From the day the empire rose to power, it had fought many wars and wiped out countless powerful enemies. Many rare orthodoxies were preserved in the imperial family.","This was also the reason why the imperial family had countless experts and was able to nurture loyal ministers and countless experts in the army. In terms of foundation, the imperial family of Grand Xia was undoubtedly the number one in the world. Otherwise, the ten great sects would not have been so obedient under Grand Xia’s rule. Could it be that all of them were loyal and never had any rebellious people?","That was naturally impossible. The main reason was that the strength of the imperial family and the Imperial Court of Grand Xia was enough to suppress all enemies.","Born in such a family, Princess Yun Yang had learned all kinds of martial arts. Any one of the martial arts she had learned was enough to cause countless people in the world to fight for it.","They had learned many king-level martial arts. One had to know that king-level martial arts were created by king-level masters. Any one of those martial arts could create a branch in the Flying Celestials, one of the ten great sects. If it was an ordinary small-scale sect, it could rise and enter the ranks of first-rate forces.","Moreover, she had experienced many such martial arts. Those experts within the imperial family each had many ancient martial arts, which was not something that outsiders could imagine.","However, when Princess Yun Yang finished analyzing the Exquisite Steps, she was shocked. It was a king-level martial art, and it was the best of the best. She had seen many movement techniques, and she too had learned a king-level movement technique. However, compared to Chu Yunfan’s Exquisite Steps, the technique she had learned previously was clearly not on the same level.","The value of such a martial art was immeasurable. It was very beneficial to her, but judging from Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression, it was clear that he did not care much about this extremely powerful martial art.","Princess Yun Yang then knew that she had underestimated Chu Yunfan. The secrets behind him were far beyond her imagination.","“This reward is too precious,” Princess Yun Yang said.","“This is nothing to me. Besides, you’ve helped me. Your favor may have been a small one on your part, but it’s very big to me,” Chu Yunfan replied.","Princess Yun Yang thought for a moment, then said, “If that’s the case, then it would be impolite of me to refuse. However, you don’t have much time left. More and more experts from all over the world are coming. The more time passes, the worse the situation you will face.”","“It’s fine. They’re just a bunch of clowns. Let them jump around for a while.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly, and the iciness in his eyes intensified.","“Then I’ll take my leave first.” Princess Yun Yang could not wait to study the Exquisite Steps. Although it could not directly increase her cultivation, it could undoubtedly greatly increase her combat strength.","Learning this movement technique would make her practically invincible.","After Chu Yunfan watched Princess Yun Yang leave, he returned to the Mountain River Diagram. He took out the Mountain River Cauldron and began his old profession—alchemy.","He had asked Princess Yun Yang to collect the herbs for him as a trump card. He seemed to be bold and daring, but there were only a few people who would fight without any preparation. Most of the time, he knew what to expect. Since he dared to kill someone, he naturally thought of the consequences. He did not panic at the last moment.","If the Flying Celestial disciples were to step in, those forces would not let them off easily. However, Princess Yun Yang was a blind spot for them. Even if they felt that something was wrong, they did not dare to stop her. After all, everyone knew that the person in Serene Immortal Mountain was the Elder Princess of the imperial family. Naturally, they would not sit idly by.","With his cultivation level, he was currently at the second Creation Stage. In terms of combat strength, ordinary sixth-level Creators were no match for him. Even if he encountered a seventh-level Creator, he would not be afraid.","He wanted the world to see him in a new light!","He was planning to make a medicinal pill called the Minor Dracotiger Rejuvenation Pill. Even a Creator could increase their cultivation greatly in a short period with this pill. However, compared to the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, the medicinal effect was not as violent and shocking.","Of course, the effect could not be compared to the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, but Chu Yunfan needed the Minor Dracotiger Rejuvenation Pill. He no longer had any Six-Stripe Gold Pills, so his previous technique would not work unless he could make another one. However, just thinking about the precious herbs needed to refine it was enough to make Chu Yunfan’s finances collapse. It was impossible.","Time flew by in the blink of an eye. Three days passed. Above the Eastern Sea, waves that were tens of thousands of feet tall slammed into the sky, and the sea breeze whistled. In the layers of space, Serene Immortal Mountain was like a paradise, attracting the attention of countless people passing by.","However, this time, countless gazes in the void stared at Serene Immortal Mountain as if they were expecting something. All of a sudden, a figure stepped out from Serene Immortal Mountain as if it had met everyone’s expectations.","“Chu Yunfan is finally out!” someone shouted, and everyone’s attention was immediately attracted.","Everyone focused their eyes on him. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?"]},{"number":1983,"title":"Chapter 1983 The Appearance of a Previous Prodigy","paragraphs":["1983 The Appearance of a Previous Prodigy","“It’s him!”","“Where are the others from the Flying Celestials?”","“I see them! The Flying Celestials and the others are breaking out from another direction!”","“Forget about them. They’re not important. Even if they spread the news now, it’ll be too late. By the time the Flying Celestials experts arrive, it’ll be too late.”","“That’s right. However, we should take down Chu Yunfan as soon as possible. This place is too close to the continent. Once the Flying Celestials receive the news, they’ll be here shortly.”","“It’s fine. There will be enough time.”","Chu Yunfan’s appearance was like lighting up a big firecracker. Everyone was boiling with excitement. Many experts had waited for three days. Finally, Chu Yunfan appeared. Many malicious gazes and terrifying auras enveloped Chu Yunfan as if he would be torn into pieces with just a word.","“Didn’t you want to kill me? Since you’re here, why don’t you show yourself?” Chu Yunfan smiled. “If you don’t show up, then I’ll leave.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he pretended to leave. Suddenly, at this moment, beams of demonic light descended from the sky. Behind these demonic lights, they represented powerful demonic cultivators and demons who killed people like flies.","“Red Flame Demon Sect!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes narrowed as he recognized the identity of these demonic lights. There were more than 20 powerful experts, and each of them was at least at the fifth level of the Creation Stage. Chu Yunfan even saw peak Creators among them.","“You want to leave? It’s not that easy. You killed the chief disciple of our sect. Today, you will pay for that with your life!” a Red Flame Demon Sect elder said coldly.","“That depends on whether you have the ability,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","After the Red Flame Demon Sect, another wave of extremely terrifying saber light arrived in the air. They were the masters of the Godly Sabers. There were more than 20 top masters, and there was not even an ordinary Creator. Obviously, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan was powerful, and ordinary Creators were probably not his match.","Each of these 20 or so experts of the Godly Sabers carried an extremely terrifying aura of the saber path. Each of them had their saber path domain, and it was as if they could crush the heavens.","Behind the Godly Sabers, figures surged up from the sea. Each of these figures was covered in scales and looked extremely ferocious. They weren’t even humans, but members of the marine folks.","Chu Yunfan’s first reaction was that the fact that he had killed the Sea Prince had been exposed. However, after thinking about it, he knew that it was impossible. Otherwise, there would be more than this lineup. It should be that the marine folk also wanted to join in and kill the young talents of Grand Xia. After all, not only did Grand Xia fight to the death with the demons, but they also had a huge grudge against the marine folks.","In the past, the top ranker of the Prodigy List would definitely be under heavy protection. Even if the marine folk wanted to make a move, it would be difficult for them to have a chance, not to mention doing it so publicly. That was almost something that had never happened before.","The marine folk naturally wouldn’t let go of such a good opportunity.","Behind the marine folks, a dozen figures with extremely ferocious auras appeared in the distance. These people had human bodies, but each of them had the head of a white tiger. They were the top experts of the Winged Tiger Tribe.","The leader of the group had reached the peak of the Creation Stage. He looked at Chu Yunfan with hatred in his eyes. If not for Chu Yunfan, their clan would not have lost so many experts. Not only was Flying Tiger, the junior leader, who had high hopes for him, killed, but the peak experts who had come to participate in the birthday banquet were also killed. The Winged Tiger Tribe did not dare to vent their anger on the Elder Princess, so they could only choose one of the soft persimmons, Chu Yunfan.","Just these experts in front of him were terrifying enough. Such a lineup was more than enough to destroy a first-rate force. In this world, other than the behemoths of the ten great sects, who could resist the encirclement of such a lineup?","Suddenly, a cold voice was heard. A young man in a luxurious robe stepped forward. He looked at Chu Yunfan with unfriendly eyes, and at the same time, his expression was filled with arrogance and pride.","“The so-called number one in the world is just a monkey claiming to be king when there is no tiger in the mountain. You are also considered talented, but your legend ends today.”","Everyone discussed animatedly. They did not know who this person was to actually speak so arrogantly.","“Li Weiyuan? That’s right, it’s him!” someone immediately recognized the young man’s identity, and everyone exploded into an uproar.","“Isn’t that the Li clan prodigy from the previous Prodigy List? It’s said that he went to travel the world. His appearance is unexpected. To kill CHu Yunfan, even Li Weiyuan was called back. The Li clan is really determined to kill Chu Yunfan.”","“That’s right. Li Weiyuan was a famous person in the previous Prodigy List. Of course, his reputation can’t be compared with Li Qianyuan’s, but his cultivation years are not something that Chu Yunfan can compare with. I’m afraid Chu Yunfan will die.”","“This is indeed an inescapable net. I’m afraid Chu Yunfan won’t be able to escape!”","Everyone discussed animatedly and revealed the identity of the person who came.","Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan’s ranking was certainly not the first time the Prodigy List had been published. In fact, before this, there were many other lists, and each was enough to include almost all the current heroes in the world.","Li Qianyuan and Chu Yunfan were naturally the best in this year’s Prodigy List. However, before Li Qianyuan and the others rose up, it was Li Weiyuan and the others’ world. With the rise of Li Qianyuan and the others, everyone’s eyes were attracted to the newcomers, and they gradually forgot about these people. However, this did not mean that these people had died. On the contrary, these people were hibernating one by one and devoted themselves to cultivation. Their cultivation was unfathomable.","Even someone like Li Weiyuan, who wasn’t considered outstanding in the previous Prodigy List, still had an overwhelming advantage over the current Prodigy List."]},{"number":1984,"title":"Chapter 1984 The Appetizer—the Death of Blood Evil Tower’s Experts","paragraphs":["1984 The Appetizer—the Death of Blood Evil Tower’s Experts","For cultivators, talent was important, but the time of cultivation was also important. Even if Li Qianyuan was as talented as Li Weiyuan, he was not as strong as Li Weiyuan because of the lack of time. No matter how strong one’s talent was, it was just talent. It was useless if one could not walk to the end.","Li Weiyuan looked at Chu Yunfan with contempt. It seemed that Chu Yunfan was already the top existence of the younger generation. However, that was only relative to Li Qianyuan and the others. Compared to him, Chu Yunfan was still far behind. Even if Chu Yunfan was talented, he would never have the chance to grow to that level.","“Li Weiyuan, your clan has joined hands with these heretics. Aren’t you afraid of the Imperial Court’s wrath?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Join hands with heretics? What does it have to do with me if they want to kill you?” Of course, Li Weiyuan didn’t want to leave any evidence for Chu Yunfan. “Besides, who do you think you are? You’re a lowly dead general of the External Army.”","Li Weiyuan, who was born in a military family, naturally had no respect for the External Army even though Chu Yunfan was a first rank official. In Grand Xia, there were countless first rank generals. Cultivators generally had long lifespans. In addition, Grand Xia was never peaceful. The Hus, demons, barbarians, marine folks, and other foreign races ran amok in all directions. It could be said that if one joined Grand Xia’s army, as long as they were willing, one would have a lot of opportunities to be promoted. It was not strange for a person to be promoted to a first rank general.","There were many geniuses on the Prodigy List who led troops in the army. Many of them were first rank generals. Li Qianyuan was the first marquis of the younger generation. To the commoners, a first rank general was a powerful person, but Li Weiyuan didn’t think that it was anything. As long as he was willing, it was only a matter of time before he became a marquis.","“That’s true. It doesn’t matter. I’ll just kill them all!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","In Grand Xia, all kinds of dark sides were rampant, let alone in the Eastern Sea, which had no rules and was completely chaotic.","In the blink of an eye, a dagger appeared out of thin air. It was only a centimeter away from Chu Yunfan’s eyes. It could be said to be as fast as a hair. It was just a little bit away from piercing through his head. All of this happened too quickly and without any warning.","However, the dagger was unable to advance any further because a hand was firmly grasping the air. In the air, an arm appeared, followed by a human figure. It was a man dressed in blood-red clothes. The man’s originally cold and emotionless face revealed a look of disbelief.","How had Chu Yunfan sensed his existence?","“It’s an assassin of Blood Evil Tower!” someone cried out in surprise.","Who else could this man in blood-red clothes be but an assassin of Blood Evil Tower?","Previously, Chu Yunfan had killed one of Blood Evil Tower’s top assassins. How could they let him go? Revenge for the smallest grievance was Blood Evil Tower’s style.","Boom!","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan threw a punch. Without any extra movements, the Creator assassin of Blood Evil Tower was punched through by Chu Yunfan. Although the other party was a Creator, the experts of Blood Evil Tower were more skilled in assassination. When they encountered a physique cultivator expert like Chu Yunfan, it was simply courting death.","With a single punch, his body was pierced through and he died.","“Too weak. Does Blood Evil Tower only have this level of gold medal killers?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He took the dagger and threw it into the air. The dagger was like a soaring dragon, cutting through the sky without making a sound. This was a dagger specially made by Blood Evil Tower. It could be used in a special way. It could be said that it could kill people invisibly.","Stab!","Above the sea, countless people’s breathing quickened. Chu Yunfan had casually killed two of Blood Evil Tower’s top assassins. His strength was not much different from the rumors. He was really brutal.","Chu Yunfan sneered. “The appetizer has been served. Now, who wants to go first? Or should I say, you guys should go together.”","For ordinary people, they were most afraid of Blood Evil Tower’s assassins, who appeared and disappeared like ghosts. But for Chu Yunfan, he was least afraid of Blood Evil Tower’s people who played tricks. With his three emperor-level physiques, Chu Yunfan’s sensitivity to aura was far beyond everyone’s imagination. Furthermore, even the slightest spatial fluctuation could not escape his perception.","Under such circumstances, the assassins of Blood Evil Tower thought that no one knew about their approach, but in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was as if someone was using a high-powered searchlight to approach in the dark.","“Arrogant and conceited. Attack!” the leader of the Red Flame Demon Sect roared.","More than a dozen experts from the Red Flame Demon Sect took the lead to attack. Each of them had demonic flames surging on their bodies. In fact, they were more than half of Red Flame Demon Sect’s main force.","The Red Flame Demon Sect’s power was enough to compete with the Flying Celestials, but the premise was that most of the main experts of the Flying Celestials could not come.","These dozen or so Creators were already more than half of the Red Flame Demon Sect’s combat strength. Unlike ordinary Creators, each of these dozen or so Creators was above the fifth level of the Creation Stage.","It was precisely because they had seen the battle between Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan that many people had already calculated that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was comparable to a fifth level Creator. In other words, ordinary Creator elders could not do anything to him.","These dozen or so fifth level Creators were already all the combat strength that the Red Flame Demon Sect could gather for the expedition in such a short time."]},{"number":1985,"title":"Chapter 1985 Killing Three People Consecutively","paragraphs":["1985 Killing Three People Consecutively","“Whoever jumps out first will be killed first. I’ll start with you guys!”","In a flash, Chu Yunfan appeared among the experts of the Red Flame Demon Sect. At some point, a pitch-black sword that looked like a huge steel ruler had appeared in his hand.","Boom!","The huge sword slashed down, and the entire sky shook violently. In front of him, an expert of the Red Flame Demon Sect roared and pulled out the Red Flame Demon Saber. A ball of demonic flames burned fiercely and turned into a demon saber, facing the black sword.","Clang!","A huge explosion sounded, and the entire ocean was in chaos.","Spurt!","The moment he clashed with the sword, the Red Flame Demon Sect expert spat out a mouthful of blood. If one looked carefully, one could see that his hands were trembling violently.","“What kind of monster are you? How can you be so terrifying?”","This expert almost lost his grip on the saber in his hand and was cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s sword. His eyes were filled with disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s casual sword strike had made him unable to resist even with his two-handed saber.","Chu Yunfan was simply a monster among monsters. Without fighting him, there was no way to truly understand how terrifying his strength was.","The huge demonic saber trembled violently. Suddenly, in the next second, everyone saw cracks appear on the saber. The cracks spread inch by inch and spread all over at lightning speed. In the next moment, the saber shattered. The Red Flame Demon Sect expert could nto defend himself.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s sword light didn’t slow down and cut the expert of the Red Flame Demon Sect in half. The heavy sword had no edge, and the skill was crude. These words were completely reflected in Chu Yunfan’s hands. With his strength, he easily suppressed this fifth level Creator from the Red Flame Demon Sect.","The strength of this Red Flame Demon Sect expert was no stronger than Li Qianyuan’s outburst. Even Li Qianyuan was not Chu Yunfan’s opponent, let alone this Red Flame Demon Sect expert.","He was easily cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s sword. Although this heavy sword looked like an unfinished steel ruler, the sword light contained in it was incomparably sharp.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was already comparable to the sixth level of the Creation Stage. Now that he held the Ocean Overturner, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had increased further. He did not care about the fifth or sixth level Creators. He could even fight a seventh level Creator, and if that person was not careful, they would suffer a loss.","“You’re courting death!”","Chu Yunfan had killed this expert of the Red Flame Demon Sect, which immediately aroused the anger of the other Red Flame Demon Sect experts. All kinds of attacks were thrown at Chu Yunfan as if they were free. In an instant, he was bombarded.","“He will die for sure. Even an emperor will die. An emperor isn’t invincible,” someone muttered to themselves.","However, the scene that appeared in the next moment was a slap to their face. They saw Chu Yunfan standing in place without any injuries. The attacks just now could not do anything to him, and above his head, the Mountain River Cauldron was spinning, its defense unparalleled.","With the Mountain River Cauldron, Chu Yunfan was almost invincible. He had never been afraid of group attacks. Unless it was a super expert who far surpassed the Creation Stage, he was not afraid.","“I don’t believe that this cauldron can protect him forever!” a Red Flame Demon Sect expert roared angrily. However, as soon as he finished speaking, a black sword swept across the sky and landed in front of him.","Slice!","Almost without any suspense, another fifth level Creator of the Red Flame Demon Sect died tragically at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","An expert at the fifth level of the Creation Stage was considered a top expert among Creators. They were not weaklings who had just entered the Creation Stage. However, in front of Chu Yunfan, it was only a matter of a sword.","“Get into formation! This guy is even stronger than what we’ve heard!”","An expert from the Red Flame Demon Sect came to his senses. Chu Yunfan’s strength seemed to be stronger than the rumors. Everyone thought that a fifth level Creator could contend with Chu Yunfan and that the best among them could kill him.","Who would have thought that they could not even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan? Clearly, Chu Yunfan’s strength was even stronger than the rumors said.","In addition, Chu Yunfan still had the protection of the Mountain River Cauldron above his head. Their attacks could not do anything to him. Under such circumstances, they suddenly felt that they were at a disadvantage, which was completely different from what they had originally thought.","There were many people but it was useless. Numbers were useless against Chu Yunfan. The number of people became a disadvantage because Chu Yunfan could attack them at any time, and they were evenly distributed. Not everyone could resist Chu Yunfan.","‘As expected of an existence who could kill the number one on the Prodigy List!’","This thought appeared in everyone’s minds. They understood that although the experts on the Prodigy List were slightly weaker than them, if they were existences of the same level, any famous existence on the Prodigy List could probably contend with three to five or even more experts.","Chu Yunfan had even killed the original number one on the Prodigy List. It would be strange if such a person was easy to kill, but it was normal if he killed easily. It was just that everyone’s resentment toward him had overshadowed all other thoughts. Now that several Creators had died in succession, everyone finally calmed down a little.","However, just as the experts of the Red Flame Demon Sect were forming the formation, another sixth level Creator of the Red Flame Demon Sect was stunned for a moment before Chu Yunfan seized the opportunity and beheaded him with a sword.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a killing god who killed people on the battlefield. Killing Creators was as easy as eating and drinking. Even the most arrogant people knew that they had completely underestimated Chu Yunfan, especially the Red Flame Demon Sect. The price they had paid for underestimating Chu Yunfan was the death of three powerful elders.","It had to be known that even in the Red Flame Demon Sect, elders who could reach the Creation Stage were still very rare. Three of them had died in one go. Such a loss was shocking."]},{"number":1986,"title":"Chapter 1986 Killing Creators Like Cutting Cabbages","paragraphs":["1986 Killing Creators Like Cutting Cabbages","“Are you still going to just stand by and watch?” the leading Red Flame Demon Sect elder said with an ugly expression.","In any case, the demonic sects and Grand Xia had always been at odds with each other. Grand Xia advocated order, but the demonic sects were completely different. They hoped for endless chaos, especially many demonic techniques that required countless lives to be sacrificed.","Under such circumstances, they didn’t care about going against Grand Xia. After all, it was their nature to go against Grand Xia. But now, it was different. These old devils had noticed that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with. Naturally, they did not want to bear all the losses. Otherwise, even if they successfully killed Chu Yunfan in the end, they would suffer heavy losses.","One had to know that there were many experts who belonged to Grand Xia present. Who knew if they would come and steal from them and directly kill them, these evil devils, to claim credit from Grand Xia’s Imperial Court. No, to be precise, they would definitely do so. Seeing that they couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan easily, these old devils weren’t stupid. They immediately dragged the rest of the people with them.","The experts of the various forces looked at each other. Although they were all here for Chu Yunfan, they all had ulterior motives and were even hostile to each other. Previously, they were fighting to deal with Chu Yunfan, but now they were afraid that Chu Yunfan would target them and suffer heavy losses. However, they also knew that if this continued, Chu Yunfan would probably escape.","The experts looked at each other and made a decision almost at the same time. They began to surround Chu Yunfan.","“Let’s attack together. I don’t believe that the cauldron above his head is invincible!”","One of the Winged Tiger Clan experts roared and took the lead to attack. In an instant, he formed a terrifying storm that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","As soon as he finished speaking, all kinds of attacks fell on Chu Yunfan at the same time. All kinds of terrifying attacks covered the sky and covered the earth like a tidal wave.","Rumble!","The terrifying attack destroyed everything, forming a huge mushroom cloud that slowly rose. One had to know that all these experts was a fifth level Creator or higher. Each expert’s casual attack could shatter a mountain. With so many attacks gathered together and exploding, one could imagine how shocking it was.","“Is he dead?”","Some people widened their eyes and wanted to see Chu Yunfan die. Even if the Mountain River Cauldron above Chu Yunfan’s head was a defensive treasure, it was impossible to block such an attack.","Suddenly, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s figure passed through the mushroom cloud formed by the explosion. In an instant, he arrived before the Winged Tiger Tribe expert.","“What?! He’s still alive!”","The Winged Tiger Tribe expert immediately turned pale with fright. He was not prepared. Almost instinctively, he formed layers of barriers around himself. However, when the pitch-black sword slashed down, it was as if the barriers were made of paper. It easily cut through the countless layers.","Slice!","The head of this Flying Winged Tiger expert was instantly cut off and sent flying. The huge tiger head was cut off and sent flying into the sea.","“He’s over here! Kkill him!”","The other Winged Tiger Tribe experts suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of them. When they were unprepared, he had killed one of their own.","“Seven Violet Thunder Swords!” Chu Yunfan shouted loudly. Countless lightning powers condensed around him, turning into seven swords that spun around him.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","These sword lights pierced through the sky and turned into fatal lights. They swept across the sky and blasted into the marine folks’s square formation.","Among the experts who came this time, the marine folks had the most experts. Apart from the many Creators, they had also commanded many ferocious marine monsters to surround the entire sea area.","Under the attack of these shocking sword lights, in just an instant, several top Creators were pierced to death. The remaining monsters died even more. In just a moment, hundreds of monsters died tragically.","These marine folks experts did not expect that Chu Yunfan, who was still attacking the Winged Tiger Tribe, would turn his attention to them. Immediately, they suffered heavy losses.","After severely injuring the marine folks experts, Chu Yunfan appeared in the formation of the Godly Sabers. This time, there was a buffer in front. Although none of them could stop Chu Yunfan, he had spent a lot of effort to kill them.","The experts of the Godly Sabers were prepared.","As soon as Chu Yunfan’s figure appeared, more than a dozen saber lights slashed down at him.","“Nine Cyclone Phantoms!”","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and turned into nine phantoms in the air. The saber lights fell and slashed at Chu Yunfan’s phantoms. He seized the opportunity and slashed out with the Ocean Overturner.","In an instant, it was as if it had transformed into a long dragon of the sword path that killed the two Creator elders of the Godly Sabers. Blood spurted out, and their bodies were taken away by a huge hand formed by Chu Yunfan.","In a short time, the experts who had surrounded Chu Yunfan were all ambushed by him. In just a few breaths, many Creators had fallen. This sudden turn of events completely frightened the spies and experts of the various major powers who were watching from afar.","“What terrifying strength. These are all fifth level Creators and above. Usually, the death of one of them is a huge matter. Now, Chu Yunfan has killed them all as easily as cutting cabbages. It’s too terrifying!”"]},{"number":1987,"title":"Chapter 1987 Shocking the Flying Celestial Sect (1)","paragraphs":["1987 Shocking the Flying Celestial Sect (1)","Chu Yunfan was unscrupulous. He easily killed these Creators and stunned many people. Many of them were itinerant cultivators from the Eastern Sea who had received the news. In this place, once one’s cultivation reached the Creation Stage, they could establish a sect and become the ancestor of a sect.","Experts of this level were all big shots in the Eastern Sea. Even if one of them died, it would cause a big commotion. But now, many of them were slaughtered like cabbages.","“Too strong. Is this the glory of the current number one on the Prodigy List?”","“Now I know why Li Qianyuan was defeated by him. I’m afraid there is still a huge gap between the two sides.”","“An existence on a completely different level!”","Many of the itinerant cultivators from Eastern Sea had received the news and wanted to take advantage of it. However, when they saw a battle of this level, almost everyone was frightened. In a battlefield where even Creators were in danger, if it were them, they would probably be severely injured or even die on the battlefield if they were swept by the aftershock of the battle.","At the same time, on the other side, the group from the Flying Celestials finally broke out of the encirclement.","“Sure enough, their focus is on Chu Yunfan. That’s why we were able to break out of the encirclement so easily!” an elder of the Flying Celestials said.","“That’s right, but we don’t have that much time to sigh. Hurry up and back word to the sect. Tell the sect leader to bring people over to support us. Otherwise, I’m afraid it’ll be too late!” The Flying Celestials’ elder, Hu Dingtian, said, “Go and tell the sect. I’m going back to help Chu Yunfan.”","Hu Dingtian made a decision. The reason why he didn’t break out in the same direction as Chu Yunfan was to protect the others. Now that they had broken out of the encirclement for more than a thousand miles, even if those forces wanted to chase after them, they would not be able to catch up. He could finally heave a sigh of relief and go back to help Chu Yunfan.","“Be careful, sir.”","No one could say anything more. After all, even they knew very well that such a battlefield was not something they could interfere with. If they went, they would only become a burden.","In the Flying Celestials, the alarm sounded. The disciples in the Flying Celestials put down what they were doing and looked up. In the sky, streaks of light tore through the air and flew into the depths of the Flying Celestials.","“What happened?”","Many people didn’t know what was going on. Of course, they understood that this was an alarm that would only sound when something urgent happened. Such an alarm had only sounded a few times in the sect’s history.","The Flying Celestials was one of the ten great sects. If any enemy wanted to invade their encampment, they would have to wait until Grand Xia was destroyed. However, they had not received such summons. Thus, although everyone was puzzled, they could only watch.","At this moment, in the meeting hall deep in the Flying Celestials, the elders had received the summons and rushed over. They were still unclear about what had happened, but when they saw that sect leader Situ Xuan had arrived first, they immediately shut their mouths and waited for him to announce what was going on.","“Elders, I have gathered you here for one thing. On the birthday of the Eldest Princess, Chu Yunfan, a disciple of the Flying Celestials, successfully killed Li Qianyuan. Now, he’s the first on the Prodigy List,” Situ Xuan said when he saw that almost everyone had arrived. He looked calm on the surface, but he was a little anxious in his heart.","“What?! Chu Yunfan killed Li Qianyuan?!”","“How many years has it been since our sect has produced a genius ranked first on the Prodigy List?!”","“It’s really the blessing of the ancestors!”","Immediately, many elders burst out with excitement. This news was too shocking to them. If Chu Yunfan’s entry into the Prodigy List was only a small surprise for them, then him killing Li Qianyuan and becoming first on the Prodigy List was a huge surprise. Even Yang Dengxian, whom they had spent all their efforts to nurture, was only ranked 20th on the Prodigy List. This was already the limit. It wasn’t that Yang Dengxian’s talent wasn’t good. In fact, Yang Dengxian’s talent was already rare in the world. However, the competition on the Prodigy List was extremely fierce. It could be said that almost all the young geniuses in the world were recruited. It was already not easy to be ranked 20th.","As for the first place, they had never even thought about it. The last time the Flying Celestials had been ranked first on the Prodigy List was an unknown number of years ago. It was not without reason that the Flying Celestials’ ranking among the top ten sects was not high all year round. Now that one had suddenly appeared, many people had yet to react.","“Who is Chu Yunfan? Has the Prodigy List changed again this year?”","There were elders who had been in seclusion all year round. They found that they seemed to be unable to keep up with the times all of a sudden. They actually did not know who Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Yunfan’s rise was too short. It was so short that many elders had shut themselves in once before they realized that everything had changed.","“But now, many people are trying to lay their hands on the number one genius on the Prodigy List. Now, they are leading a large group of experts to surround him in the outer seas of Serene Immortal Mountain!”","Situ Xuan’s voice became even deeper. Those who were familiar with him knew that this was a sign that he was about to get angry.","“Preposterous! Who is so shameless?”","“Is it the Li clan? If Li Qianyuan died because his skills were inferior to others, then so be it. Do they still dare to take revenge?”","Many elders couldn’t help but clamor. To many forces, the Li clan, which was a very powerful military aristocratic family, was nothing to the Flying Celestials. In fact, the Flying Celestials had quite a few such branches. If it wasn’t for the fact that they had the crown prince’s heroic bearing and was an ally of his faction, the Li clan wouldn’t have been able to make the Flying Celestials look at them in a different light.","“They overestimate yourself. Who is it?”","Many elders were furious. They naturally understood what it meant for the Flying Celestials to have a genius like the number one on the Prodigy List. He was a key figure who could bring the Flying Celestials to another level and glory for hundreds of years. For the sake of such a character, even if they were to go against the other ten great sects, the Flying Celestials would not be polite, let alone a force like the Li clan.","“I only found out after receiving the message from elder Hu Dingtian. It doesn’t matter who it is now. What’s important is that we must let everyone understand that the dignity of the Flying Celestials can’t be challenged!” Situ Xuan said coldly."]},{"number":1988,"title":"Chapter 1988 Shocking the Flying Celestial Sect (2)","paragraphs":["1988 Shocking the Flying Celestial Sect (2)","On this day, the Flying Celestials disciples who had yet to figure out what had happened suddenly discovered that the high and mighty elders of the sect had actually appeared one after another. They angrily stepped on the light and rushed out of the meeting hall.","“What’s happening? Leader Situ and so many elder have moved out together?”","Many disciples didn’t know what was going on. They couldn’t even imagine who they were going to deal with such a terrifying lineup. Soon, the discussion in the meeting hall spread at an astonishing speed.","“Chu Yunfan killed Li Qianyuan and reached the top of the Prodigy List!”","When this news spread, many people were stunned and caught off guard.","“Isn’t Chu Yunfan dead?”","Many people did not know whether Chu Yunfan was still alive or if there was someone with the same name. Even if everyone knew that the probability of having the same name was low, Chu Yunfan was already pronounced dead. This was a well-known fact.","Now, not only was Chu Yunfan still alive, but he had also killed Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first on the Prodigy List. This caused the entire Flying Celestials to be completely shocked. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan, who was originally thought to be dead, was not only alive, but he had also done such a shocking thing?","Killing Li Qianyuan was something that many people wanted to do. Since Li Qianyuan was ranked first on the Prodigy List, many masters wanted to take his life. However, no one had been able to do it for decades. Even Yang Dengxian, the strongest disciple in the sect, was only ranked 20th on the Prodigy List, far from Li Qianyuan. How could Chu Yunfan, who had only entered the sect for a few years, do it?","Without a doubt, this news broke everyone’s previous understanding of Chu Yunfan.","On a mountain peak, Yang Dengxian was walking on the wind. The news he had just received shocked him.","“He killed Li Qianyuan?”","Chu Yunfan was alive. His death had been confirmed by the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia. He was supposed to have died at the hands of the supreme figure of the demons.","For this matter, the Grand Commandant had once ventured deep into the Demon Region and killed several supreme geniuses of the demons as revenge. It could be said that if it was not for the fact that Chu Yunfan was dead, the Grand Commandant of the Grand Xia would not have been so angry. But now, there was news that Chu Yunfan was alive and that he had killed Li Qianyuan during the Elder Princess’ birthday.","When Yang Dengxian received the news, he felt that it was absurd. How was this possible? Even if Chu Yunfan didn’t die, he wouldn’t be able to defeat Li Qianyuan, let alone kill him.","No matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan couldn’t have done such a thing. Unlike the others, they had only heard of Li Qianyuan’s name for a long time, but they only had a vague shadow of Li Qianyuan’s power.","Yang Dengxian had challenged Li Qianyuan. At that time, he was still young, but he was already recognized as the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials. Among the disciples of this generation, he was second to none. In the future, he would definitely be a major character that would influence Grand Xia—the next sect leader of the Flying Celestials.","Although he looked as warm as the spring breeze, the pride in his heart was self-evident. After the Prodigy List appeared, he was only ranked 20th. The difference between him and those above him could be imagined.","At that time, he went to the Imperial City to find Li Qianyuan. Only then did he learn the gap between him and Li Qianyuan. The latter was about the same age as him, but his strength was above his, and it was obvious that he was a small stage stronger than him.","Although it seemed like only a small stage and that he could quickly catch up, only he knew that the gap of one small stage represented a lot. He was making rapid progress, but Li Qianyuan’s progress would only be faster than his, not slower. Therefore, this gap of a small stage was very likely a gap that could not be crossed in a lifetime.","However, the news of Li Qianyuan’s death had spread out. Besides feeling empty in his heart, Yang Dengxian was also extremely shocked. He was very clear about Li Qianyuan’s strength. It was not difficult to deduce Li Qianyuan’s strength based on his own.","After all, for a top genius like Li Qianyuan, it was already very difficult to defeat him, and it was even more difficult to kill him. Otherwise, Li Qianyuan would have died long ago. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s strength was probably far beyond Li Qianyuan’s.","Yang Dengxian was confused. How did Chu Yunfan do it?","His cultivation speed was a little too shocking. The cultivation speed of the ancient emperors was probably just like this. However, what kind of characters were the ancient emperors? In the myths and legends, they were all people who descended from the heavens. Any one of them was a person chosen by the heavens and had outstanding talent. Moreover, in the ancient times, many rare treasures could be seen on the streets. This was an achievement that the emperors of the ancient times could easily achieve.","Just as Yang Dengxian was shocked by the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed Li Qianyuan, more news came out. On the birthday of the Eldest Princess, Chu Yunfan not only killed Li Qianyuan, but also killed the chief disciples of many forces in one breath. These forces naturally wouldn’t let the matter rest. Right now, they were surrounding Chu Yunfan in the outer seas of Serene Immortal Mountain.","Many of the Flying Celestials’ elders, including Sect Leader Situ Xuan, had urgently used the teleportation portal to rush to the Eastern Sea to save Chu Yunfan. For a moment, the entire Flying Celestials was in a commotion. Chu Yunfan, who should have been dead for a long time, was actually alive and had killed Li Qianyuan, the number one on the Prodigy List.","Chu Yunfan’s name once again became the topic of conversation for countless people. Many people knew what it meant for the Flying Celestials to be ranked first on the Prodigy List."]},{"number":1989,"title":"Chapter 1989 Being Killed by a Single Person and Retreating","paragraphs":["1989 Being Killed by a Single Person and Retreating","While Chu Yunfan’s matter caused a stir in the Flying Celestials, the cruel slaughter was still going on in the Eastern Sea around Serene Immortal Mountain.","After all, these were all top Creators. Among ten Creators, there might not even be one who could reach the fifth or sixth level of the Creation Stage. Each of them was like a pillar of existence in their respective factions. If it was an ordinary faction, such a loss could declare the destruction of the sect.","Although the various factions had split the damage equally, it still made them feel a heart-wrenching pain. The leaders of these forces could not help but stomp their feet in anger, but they could not stop Chu Yunfan’s lightning speed.","Among these experts, there was no lack of seventh level Creators. The leaders of the various factions were even peak Creators. At present, Chu Yunfan wasn’t a match for such an existence. He would be at a disadvantage. However, Chu Yunfan was like a slippery loach and had no intention of fighting them. He had specifically picked out their weaknesses to deal with them.","No matter who looked at it, a fifth level Creator was definitely not a weakness. In this world, fifth level Creators were experts among experts. But now, in front of Chu Yunfan, these top experts had become their weakness.","Soon, they discovered that not only were fifth level Creators not Chu Yunfan’s match, even sixth level Creators were not his match. It was completely overwhelming. A fifth level Creator could not even block Chu Yunfan’s sword, and it was the same for a sixth level Creator. They were not Chu Yunfan’s match at all.","With the support of the Ocean Overturner, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had clearly increased by quite a bit. Other than a seventh level Creator who could block him for a moment, the rest were not his match. He single-handedly forced everyone to retreat.","“D*mned Chu Yunfan! Don’t you have the courage to fight us?!” the leader of the Winged Tiger Clan was so angry that he cried out.","Several experts of their Winged Tiger Clan had already died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Such a loss was something that even the Winged Tiger Tribe had never suffered in the battle between humans and demons. He was confident that he could easily kill Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan stopped for a moment, he would be dead. As long as Chu Yunfan paused for a moment, the experts from all sides would arrive in time. However, Chu Yunfan seemed to know their plans and did not stop even for a second. The remaining fifth and sixth level Creators could not stop Chu Yunfan. The difference in strength was too great.","The Ocean Overturner in Chu Yunfan’s hand was sharp. No matter how many techniques these fifth and sixth level Creators had, they were still no match for Chu Yunfan. Killing one person with a single strike was something that they had never thought of before. Only an expert who had surpassed the Creation Stage could do such a thing.","However, Chu Yunfan was the most special one. Although he had not surpassed the Creation Stage, his lethality far exceeded that of experts of the same stage. In addition, Chu Yunfan’s speed was too shocking. Even the Winged Tiger Tribe, which was known for its speed, could not catch up with him.","Their strength was clearly above Chu Yunfan’s, but their speed was slower.","They clearly had the upper hand in terms of numbers and strength, but up until now, they had been unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. Instead, they were beaten back by Chu Yunfan and were almost out of the encirclement. They had never fought such an aggrieved battle before, and no one had ever forced them, these top experts, to such a point. It was as if CHu Yunfan was toying with their in the palm of his hand.","This was simply a great humiliation!","However, in the face of Chu Yunfan, who didn’t play by the rules, they had no way to deal with him. Only those who were flustered and exasperated would roar repeatedly.","“Hahahaha!” Chu Yunfan didn’t care about it at all. He just laughed at the sky and kept jumping on the battlefield. In an instant, he split a winged tiger in half.","All kinds of terrifying attacks followed. The moment Chu Yunfan killed the Winged Tiger, all of them landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. The Mountain River Cauldron above his head spun and almost flew out.","Chu Yunfan immediately realized that something was wrong. Although he had been attacked before, it was basically the aftermath of the attack. He had the Mountain River Cauldron to protect himself, so there was naturally nothing to be afraid of. This was the key reason why he could succeed every time. Not only was his defense unparalleled, his attack unparalleled, but his speed was also unmatched.","But now, he was completely covered by all kinds of attacks.","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that although more than 30 famous fifth and sixth level Creators had been killed by him as time passed, the experts of the various large factions had also tightened their encirclement. Now, the area he could move within was not even one-third of what it was before. Although these experts could not do anything to him, they had gradually found his weakness and gradually drew him into a small circle. Under such circumstances, it was only a matter of time before he was forced into a corner by these people.","“Chu Yunfan, it’s time for you to die!” The Winged Tiger leader gritted his teeth and stared at Chu Yunfan. “I’d like to see how you’re going to dodge what comes next!”","They also did not expect that with their strength, they would become a burden to others and drag them down. However, as they gritted their teeth, there was a hint of relief on their faces. It was not that they had never seen someone who could kill fifth and sixth level Creators, but they had never seen someone like Chu Yunfan, who could kill them as easily as cutting cabbages."]},{"number":1990,"title":"Chapter 1990 It’s Too Late!","paragraphs":["1990 It’s Too Late!","Chu Yunfan killed these top experts who had been through hundreds of battles like flies with his strength. If they were defeated and died after a long battle, it would not be enough to make them feel fear. However, when Chu Yunfan killed them, it was as easy as stepping on ants. In front of Chu Yunfan, they were no different from ordinary mortals. They were all killed in one blow.","“How is Chu Yunfan so strong? He’s like a monster!”","“It’s like he has no weaknesses!”","“That’s all the more reason we have to kill him here. If we let him continue to grow, he will become a huge threat to us!”","The more terrified these experts were of Chu Yunfan, the more they felt that they had to kill him. Otherwise, once Chu Yunfan grew up, he would definitely be a huge threat to them. Since he had already offended them, they would kill them at all costs.","In the distance, Li Weiyuan, who had been watching the battle without making a move, had a change in expression. His expression began to become a little solemn. He had not taken Chu Yunfan seriously. Chu Yunfan was just a lucky junior. So what if he stole Li Qianyuan’s first place on the Prodigy List? It was still too early for this batch of prodigies to grow to be on equal footing with him.","However, when he saw Chu Yunfan slaughter these top experts like they were ants, he suddenly felt a huge threat. It could be seen from Chu Yunfan’s body that there was not much time left for this batch of prodigies to mature. Although the strength of the others was not as good as Chu Yunfan’s, it was likely that within ten years, they would be on par with him or even surpass him. It would not be a problem at all.","Thinking of this, a hint of anxiety flashed through Li Weiyuan’s eyes. This feeling of being surpassed by a junior was not good. At the thought of this, his originally clear eyes burst out waves of killing intent.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan also realized that he could no longer dodge. He could have relied on his speed to surpass the others. Under the circumstances where the difference in strength was not much, it was impossible for them to catch up with him. But now, this biggest advantage had already vanished.","“Looks like it’s going to be a tough battle!” Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. He did not panic even though everyone had forced him into a corner.","“Today is the day you die, Chu Yunfan!” The leader of the Winged Tigers stared at Chu Yunfan. Beside him, there was another Winged Tiger. The remaining members of the Winged Tiger Tribe had already been killed by Chu Yunfan. More than ten fifth and sixth-level Creator Winged Tigers had been killed. Such a loss was enough to make the leader feel his heart bleed.","Although the Winged Tiger Tribe was a famous royal demon clan, the number of Flying Winged Tigers had never been considered large. The death of one was a big deal, let alone so many of them. It was a huge blow to their bones.","Now, there were only two of them at the seventh level of the Creation Stage. This made Chu Yunfan wary and did not attack the two of them. However, it was also because of this that the two of them gritted their teeth in hatred.","The rest of them were similar to everyone else. The Godly Sabers, the marine folks, and the Red Flame Demon Sect only had seventh-level Creators left. Some were even peak Creators who had not been killed by Chu Yunfan. The rest of the people had either been killed or had long fled the battlefield. Dozens of people came in a mighty manner, but in the end, there were less than nine people in total.","Such a loss was shocking.","“Do you think you can escape? If I kill you a hundred times, you won’t understand my hatred. If I die a hundred times, I’ll absolve myself of the blame!” The Winged Tiger elder gritted his teeth in hatred. The saber in his hand was burning hot, and the saber light that erupted shocked everyone.","“Since there’s no way to dodge, then I won’t play hide-and-seek with you. I’ll kill you all together,” Chu Yunfan stated arrogantly.","In the blink of an eye, he took out a pill from the Mountain River Diagram and swallowed it. Suddenly, a wave of pressure swept out like a surging river and flowed into Chu Yunfan’s body.","“Kill him!”","At that moment, a Red Flame Demon Sect elder pounced first, followed by the remaining two elders on his left and right. The three Red Flame Demon Sect elders were all seventh-level Creators. The three of them formed the Three Talents Formation and pounced at Chu Yunfan.","The demonic blade in the elders’ hands turned into a terrifying flame that burned the sky. In an instant, it swept toward Chu Yunfan. The three demonic blades slashed down from the sky, and in an instant, all of Chu Yunfan’s escape routes were sealed.","The three of them hated Chu Yunfan to the core. Compared to the beginning of the battle, their hatred was now even more intense. The power of the demonic sabers had increased many times.","Clang!","When the demonic sabers came down, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would be cut in half. However, they saw a huge sword that looked like a ruler blocking the three demonic sabers.","“Impossible!”","Everyone was stunned. They couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could block the joint attack of three demonic cultivators alone. Any one of these three devils had an illustrious reputation in the Eastern Sea. They had killed countless creatures and each of them had the ability to make children stop crying. Seventh-level Creators could be considered top experts in the Eastern Sea. But now, the three of them couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan blocked the attacks of the three demonic sabers with just one hand. The endless flames were unable to advance an inch, let alone burn him. Even the three old devils were stunned, let alone the crowd. They had attacked with hatred, and there was no possibility of them holding back. They had even erupted with 120% of their strength. Even a seventh-level Creator could be killed with a single slash if they were not careful.","Boom!","Just as everyone was shocked and confused, Chu Yunfan’s aura rose to the extreme. He had broken through again. If Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was already comparable to the peak sixth level of the Creation Stage, then he had charged into the seventh level of the Creation Stage and was still soaring at an astonishing speed. Many experts on the battlefield gasped as if they had seen a ghost.","“Sh*t! That pill he just swallowed increased his strength. We can’t let this continue. Otherwise, we’ll all die!” an expert from the Godly Sabers shouted.","“It’s too late for you to realize this now.”"]},{"number":1991,"title":"Chapter 1991 The Three Old Devils Are Dead, Everyone Is Shocked","paragraphs":["1991 The Three Old Devils Are Dead, Everyone Is Shocked","Chu Yunfan’s voice was extremely cold. This was the time for him to truly explode.","However, Chu Yunfan did not choose to break out of the encirclement. Instead, he chose to stay where he was and face their encirclement. If it was before, they might not have thought about it, but now, they thought of a terrifying possibility.","Chu Yunfan did it on purpose. He wanted everyone to think that he couldn’t escape and surround him with all their might.","In this short period, he had already caused the various large factions to suffer heavy losses. Dozens of fifth and sixth-level Creators had died on the same day. One could imagine how great a commotion it would cause.","It could be said that these forces had suffered heavy losses within a day. Their injuries were much greater than the losses of hundreds or thousands of ordinary disciples. Thinking of this, the expressions of the leaders of the various large factions turned extremely ugly.","“You did this on purpose?” The three old devils of the Red Flame Demon Sect stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Correct. Not only them, but all of you will die as well!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“Arrogant!”","The three old devils of the Red Flame Demon Sect were originally afraid that Chu Yunfan would take advantage of the situation to break out of the encirclement. If Chu Yunfan wanted to break out of the encirclement, it would probably be difficult for them to stop him.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. If he just ran away, it would be difficult for the others to catch him. However, if Chu Yunfan wanted to kill them, it would be a good thing.","Boom!","In an instant, Chu Yunfan made his move. Golden light swirled and his five fingers clenched into a fist. In an instant, he turned into eight dragons and swept out.","The eight gods made their moves one after another, and it was as if they were going to pierce through the sky. The fist force crushed out and covered the world. In an instant, the golden tide formed by the fist force enveloped everything within a radius of several miles.","It enveloped the three demons of the Red Flame Demon Sect.","This scene was too terrifying. Countless people in the distance saw this scene and felt a chill. Chu Yunfan’s punch was too terrifying. If it were them, they would probably die.","The fist force turned into a golden ocean. In this golden ocean, the eight gods crushed everything.","“How can Chu Yunfan be so powerful? His strength has already surpassed the seventh level of the Creation Stage, right?”","Some people only felt their hearts tremble. Such power made them afraid.","Chu Yunfan stood on the spot. He was dressed in a moon-white robe and looked extraordinary. He was like an immortal from the heavens.","The three old devils of the Red Flame Demon Sect were so shocked that their eyebrows jumped. Terrifying demonic flames erupted from their bodies, resisting the golden fist force that Chu Yunfan emitted.","However, there was no way to resist Chu Yunfan. In an instant, Chu Yunfan’s golden fist burst out with endless thunder power, turning into electric dragons. In the blink of an eye, it had already broken through the demonic sabers and demonic flame of the three old devils, tearing everything apart.","The fist force swept across and swept across the three old devils of the Red Flame Demon Sect. In an instant, they spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward.","Spurt!","The three old devils of the Red Flame Demon Sect were sent flying like kites.","“How can he be so strong?”","The eyes of the three old devils from the Red Flame Demon Sect were about to pop out as if they had seen a ghost. Their cultivation levels were already at the seventh level of the Creation Stage. Athough they were not at the peak of the Creation Stage, the combined strength of the three of them was not much inferior to a peak Creator.","Now, they were sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch. Their entire bodies were about to explode. Such a terrifying fist force made them feel scared.","However, it was too late at this moment. The moment they were sent flying, three shocking sword lights condensed in the air and slashed down at the three old devils with lightning speed.","Chu Yunfan formed a seal, and three sword lights swept through the sky like they were chasing souls and killing people, falling on the three old devils.","How could the three old devils not know that things were not good? They immediately joined forces to form a demonic flame barrier in front of them, trying to block Chu Yunfan’s three sword lights.","However, it was of no use. The sword lights flickered with the power of thunder and directly broke the barrier, piercing through the three old devils. The huge inertia brought the three old devils to the sea, cutting a huge crack in the sea.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The bodies of the three old devils exploded. Then, before they could continue falling, they were grabbed by Chu Yunfan’s large energy hand and pulled into the Mountain River Diagram.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in just a few short breaths, the outcome had already been decided. There was a deathly silence. Everyone was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s killing speed.","He killed three seventh-level Creation Stage old devils in two moves!","Coupled with Chu Yunfan’s powerful aura that was still growing, everyone was so scared that they didn’t dare to go forward. It was simply too shocking.","“What a powerful lightning technique.” A voice broke the silence.","Everyone took a look and wondered who it was if it wasn’t Li Weiyuan. When everyone heard his words, they suddenly came back to their senses. Everyone understood why the three old devils had been defeated so easily. It was because the cultivation techniques of the three old devils were completely restrained.","The demonic path was born from the dark aura of the world. It was the extreme of yin, but the power of lightning was the mighty power of the extreme of yang.","Chu Yunfan was born with all kinds of cultivation techniques that restrained all kinds of evil spirits.","The reason why he managed to easily break through the three devils’ defense and kill them was because their strength was completely restrained. In addition, they were not careful, so they were instantly defeated by Chu Yunfan.","When everyone thought of this, they finally calmed down from the shock of seeing the three seventh-level Creators die in a few moves."]},{"number":1992,"title":"Chapter 1992 Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest, Shocking Power","paragraphs":["1992 Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest, Shocking Power","If it was just a cultivation method restraining it, coupled with being careless, this was still within everyone’s acceptable range. After all, demonic path cultivation methods were restrained, but not everyone cultivated the demonic path. In fact, only a small portion of people cultivated the demonic path. Most people’s cultivation techniques were not restrained.","Thinking of this, many people’s expressions immediately became much better. Especially the remaining experts of the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe. Their expressions immediately became much better. The techniques they cultivated did not have the ability to be restrained by lightning techniques. As long as their cultivation was stronger than Chu Yunfan, it would be relatively easy for them to kill him.","However, the experts of the marine folks were dumbfounded. This was because other than the demonic cultivation methods being restrained, the water-type divine powers and cultivation methods cultivated by the marine folks were also restrained. It was just that it was not as severely restrained as the demonic cultivation techniques.","But no matter what, as long as they were restrained, it would be quite disadvantageous for them. Chu Yunfan had easily broken through the defense of the three old devils with his lightning technique and then easily killed them. These few remaining marine folk experts were not blind, so how could they not see it?","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s gaze sweep over, their expressions became even uglier. Chu Yunfan was treating them as pushovers.","“So what if Chu Yunfan knows lightning techniques? What we cultivate is the highest grade divine power. Why should we be afraid of him?” The marine folk experts shouted.","The water-type divine abilities was restrained by the thunder technique. This wasn’t something that had just happened today. Countless people were thinking of ways to overcome it. The marine folks had been studying this problem for a long time. Naturally, they had a solution.","At this moment, barbs grew out of their originally scaly bodies. These barbs merged together and transformed into armor. These armors completely surrounded them.","“Kill him!”","A buzzing voice came from the armor. A lightning dragon descended from the sky and landed on the armor. It scattered and couldn’t be broken.","“Hahahaha, Chu Yunfan, do you think that the marine folks have long known about this weakness and will not think of a way to solve it?” The marine folk expert laughed out loud. His armor flickered with the light of runes. On the runes, countless rays of light shone brightly, completely enveloping him. Even if he had thunder techniques, he couldn’t break through.","“As long as I have this armor, no matter how powerful your lightning technique is, it will be useless!” The marine folk laughed.","“Is that so?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You can defend against ordinary lightning techniques, but what about this one?”","At some point in time, Chu Yunfan raised his arm. In the sky, countless thunderclouds gathered. In an instant, they had enveloped a radius of more than ten miles. From afar, it looked like a black cloud pressing down on a fortress. Countless lightning dragons drilled around in it. It was extremely terrifying.","“This move is called Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest!”","In the blink of an eye, countless lightning dragons descended from the sky. Each of them had dense scales and were fully covered. It looked as if the divine dragons in the sky had awakened. Countless lightning dragons swept across the sky like a thunderstorm waterfall. It was extremely shocking from afar.","The lightning fell at a speed of 0.001 seconds. No one could dodge it. In an instant, countless lightning dragons covered everything.","In the distance, countless cultivators fled hundreds of miles away. They didn’t dare to get close. The countless terrifying lightning dragons exploded the entire ocean, and countless ferocious beasts hiding in the ocean were blown to pieces. The experts surrounding Chu Yunfan were also drowned by the lightning dragons.","“Th-That’s so scary...What technique is this?” Many people were dumbfounded as they watched the scene before them.","The power of this move, Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest, was truly too terrifying. It turned the entire area within a radius of more than ten miles into a sea of lightning. Such a large area made it almost impossible for people to hide.","“Chu Yunfan still has such a powerful ultimate technique hidden and has yet to display it. He’s too scheming!” someone said fearfully. There had never been any information that Chu Yunfan had such strength.","What did this mean? It meant that Chu Yunfan had hidden it very well and did not let anyone know.","In the sea of lightning, a figure retreated. Everyone looked and saw that it was Li Weiyuan. Because he was far away when he attacked, and his strength was outstanding. Therefore, he escaped very easily. However, he was still struck by a few lightning dragons. His body emitted a few wisps of green smoke, and he looked a little miserable.","However, Li Weiyuan did not have the time to tidy up his appearance, because his eyes were full of shock. He looked at Chu Yunfan in the endless sea of lightning. He was wearing a moon-white robe and looked like thunder god.","“What kind of technique is this? It’s definitely not a technique from the Flying Celestials. Where did Chu Yunfan learn it?” Li Weiyuan muttered to himself.","He was very familiar with the Flying Celestials. In fact, some of the Li clan disciples had joined the Flying Celestials. How could the Li clan not know the techniques of the Flying Celestials?","However, he had never seen such a move from the Flying Celestials. Chu Yunfan must have learned it from outside. The power of this move could be imagined. It even surpassed the power of a king-level martial art and reached the legendary emperor-level martial art.","A look of shock flashed across his eyes. It was said that only the top ten sects had martial arts at the level of emperors. Moreover, only a few people, including the sect leader, had the right to cultivate them. The rest were mostly in the imperial family of Grand Xia and could not be seen.","But now, Li Weiyuan was looking at an emperor-level divide ability. One could imagine how shocked he was. If any of these martial arts or divine abilities were to be leaked out, it would cause a huge uproar. It would probably even attract the attention of the top ten sects. He didn’t know what kind of luck Chu Yufan had to obtain such an inheritance.","Li Qianyuan was not wronged to be defeated by such a person. Even at that time, Chu Yunfan did not use this move when he killed Li Qianyuan. One could imagine the difference in strength between the two sides. Such a person would definitely be a huge threat to the Li clan in the future.","A hint of greed flashed through Li Weiyuan’s eyes. He also wanted to obtain such an emperor-level ability."]},{"number":1993,"title":"Chapter 1993 The Might of This Move Shocks Everyone","paragraphs":["1993 The Might of This Move Shocks Everyone","Even the Li clan didn’t have an emperor-level skill. They had been the leader of the army for generations, but they only had a king-level skill.","Emperor-level abilities or techniques, they were priceless and unimaginably valuable. The effect of an emperor-level divine ability was not necessarily less than the effect of Li Qianyuan on the Li clan.","For Li Weiyuan, if he had an emperor ability, the benefits would be unimaginable. He could overcome the current bottleneck he was facing. He was already at the peak of the Creation Stage, but he had been unable to overcome it. He believed that as long as he could obtain this emperor-level ability, he would be able to comprehend the Great Dao contained within and break through to a higher stage.","Once he truly broke through, he would become one of the few big shots in the Li clan and completely break away from the younger generation. He would then be considered a powerful expert in the world today.","Furthermore, if such a divine power was handed over to the clan, the resources it could exchange for were simply unimaginable. It was enough to make the clan abandon everything and focus on nurturing him. Especially now that Li Qianyuan was dead, the family had no choice but to train him.","When Li Qianyuan was around, Li Weiyuan felt invisible. No one remembered how much he had contributed to the Li clan and gathered around Li Qianyuan instead. Thus, Li Weiyuan was not angry when Chu Yunfan killed Li Qianyuan. He did not even want to pretend to be angry. However, he still wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, whether it was for the dignity of the Li clan or for himself. But before that, he had to pry out this emperor-level ability from Chu Yunfan.","Just as Li Weiyuan’s imagination was running wild, the sea of lightning that filled the sky finally dissipated. At this time, everyone saw that the marine folks experts who were originally targets of Chu Yunfan’s attack had all sunk to the bottom of the sea. Their corpses had been burnt to a crisp. The remaining experts of the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe who were affected were not much better. Although Chu Yunfan’s Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest was aimed at the marine folks, they were also affected.","They were all in a very sorry state. Chu Yunfan, who had suffered heavy injuries in many places and suddenly erupted, was terrifying. It was far beyond everyone’s expectations. The power of this move, Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest, could be imagined!","Even a Creator would be heavily injured here. Even those seventh-level Creators and even peak Creators would not be able to withstand it and would be heavily injured.","“What a terrifying divine ability! What kind of thunder divine ability is that? Why haven’t I seen it before?”","“Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest... What a powerful aura!”","“The marine folks were wiped out. After this battle, who would dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Suddenly, they found that Chu Yunfan, who was in the endless sea of lightning, was sweating profusely and panting. Releasing that move had consumed a lot of his energy.","“Huff, huff, huff!” Chu Yunfan felt that all the divine power in his body was instantly drained.","The Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest consumed too much of his energy. This move was a divine ability recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. Only those who possessed a special physique like the Thunderclap Physique could cultivate it.","Moreover, the requirement on the user’s strength was shocking. It was not something that ordinary people could play with. Therefore, although Chu Yunfan had long known about this move, he had never used it.","The power of this move was undoubtedly great. It instantly injured the marine folks and even killed them. The others were also heavily injured.","Among emperor-level abilities, this move was one of the best. If it was released on the battlefield, its effect would be maximized. It could even destroy an entire battlefield. If one cultivated it to the limit, they would be able to destroy the world and create a new world. That was truly unprecedented.","However, Chu Yunfan had only just grasped the basics of this ability. He couldn’t use it freely. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many lightning dragons that were out of control. If these lightning dragons were all under control, Chu Yunfan was confident that he could take down the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe in one go, not just deal a destructive blow to the marine folks. But even so, the power of this ability was shocking.","As Chu Yunfan’s cultivation grew stronger and stronger, many of the techniques and abilities that he had memorized from the Mighty Emperor Battle Book could be used. This was not the only emperor-level ability that Chu Yunfan knew.","No one knew that Chu Yunfan had something as heaven-defying as the Mighty Emperor Battle Book in his mind. Otherwise, the imperial family of Grand Xia would probably intervene. After all, the Mighty Emperor Battle Book was a treasure that recorded all kinds of emperor-level martial arts and divine abilities. It was something that could not be exchanged for with any amount of wealth.","“Get him! He has no divine power right now. Now’s the perfect time to kill him!”","The remaining two masters of the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe went completely crazy. They were seriously injured, and many parts of their bodies had been electrocuted black. They had almost died in this violent sea of lightning. If Chu Yunfan’s Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest had lasted a little longer, they would have died.","Thinking of this, they shivered. They had almost died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. This feeling of walking on the edge of death was horrible. But when they realized that Chu Yunfan had used up all of his divine power, it was as if they had discovered a new continent. They all burst out with shocking killing intent.","Kicking a person when they’re down!","Just as the Godly Saber expert shouted, the Winged Tiger expert appeared beside Chu Yunfan. This Winged Tiger expert had transformed into his true form. His body was as huge as a small mountain, but he was extremely agile. He merged into the wind and charged toward Chu Yunfan without a care for the sound barrier.","Clearly, he had grasped the wind-type nature laws to an astonishing level. Only then was he able to do this, eliminating the influence of the sound barrier.","“Die, Chu Yunfan!”"]},{"number":1994,"title":"Chapter 1994 Strength Comparable a Peak Creator, Extremely Powerful!","paragraphs":["1994 Strength Comparable a Peak Creator, Extremely Powerful!","Quick, quick, quick!","Too close!","The Winged Tiger’s speed was extremely fast. A pair of wind wings swept out from its back like two sharp blades, cutting the sky in half and falling fiercely toward Chu Yunfan. At this critical moment, Chu Yunfan raised his fist and punched the two falling blades.","Bam, bam!","Two incomparably loud booms rang out, like the explosion of a great bell. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan use his fist to smash the wings of this flying tiger expert into pieces. The wind wings shattered on the spot, turning into air currents that scattered in all directions.","“What?!” The Winged Tiger went wide-eyed. He was a seventh-level Creator and had met all kinds of opponents. However, this was the first time he had met someone like Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had clearly used up all his divine power, but he could still erupt with such terrifying combat strength. Why was this?","The Winged Tiger had no idea how this was possible.","‘A physique cultivator! Chu Yunfan was a physique cultivator!’","The Winged Tiger immediately thought of a terrifying possibility. Without a doubt, everyone had underestimated Chu Yunfan. After seeing Chu Yunfan release the Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest, they all thought that Chu Yunfan had a special thunder-type physique. Although it was very powerful, it was also a special physique of the magical class. When his divine power was exhausted, his strength would crazily decrease to less than one-third of its original strength, or even one-tenth. However, who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was also a terrifying body cultivator besides his special constitution of the lightning law?","The Winged Tiger’s wind wings seemed to be condensed from the wind, but that was not the case. He’s wind wings were innate, and with the passage of time, they had been continuously refined. They had long been equivalent to very high-grade magic tools.","But now, Chu Yunfan had shattered one of them with a single punch. Chu Yunfan’s identity as a physique cultivator was obvious. Other than that, they simply did not dare to imagine how Chu Yunfan could have such a terrifying physique. Even without the addition of divine power, he was still able to unleash such astonishing combat power.","However, the situation didn’t allow the Winger Tiger to think too much. After Chu Yunfan shattered one of the wings with a punch, he arrived in front of the Winged Tiger. In his hand, the Ocean Overturner, which was like a huge black ruler, began to dance.","In an instant, everyone saw a scene that they would never forget for the rest of their lives. Relying solely on his strength and without any divine power, Chu Yunfan brandished the Ocean Overturner in his hand, forming a terrifying whirlwind, and slashed at the Winged Tiger.","The Winged Tiger hastily retreated, trying to dodge this terrifying sword. However, Chu Yunfan’s sword seemed to have eyes. The Winged Tiger Clan was good at using wind-type divine abilities, so their speed was as fast as lightning. However, Chu Yunfan’s speed was even faster. In an instant, he had already caught up with the Winged Tiger with his sword aimed at him.","Slash!","The Winged Tiger let out a blood-curdling cry as he was struck by the sword. His powerful defensive ability was nothing in front of the Ocean Overturner. It was as easy as being cut through tofu.","Fresh blood spurted out and turned into blood that scattered in all directions. The enormous Winged Tiger was cut in half and died instantly. Before its corpse could fall to the surface of the sea, it was put into the Mountain River Diagram by Chu Yunfan.","Instantly, there was a deathly silence. The people who had thought of counterattacking were now all frightened. Chu Yunfan was clearly at the end of his rope, but he could still erupt with such terrifying combat strength. That Flying Winged Tiger was a seventh-level Creator, but it could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","The remaining experts of the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe looked at each other in dismay. They were even a little frightened. They could only watch Chu Yunfan stand in the air like a god.","“Sh*t! He’s recovering his divine power!” one of the Godly Blade School experts shouted.","At this moment, everyone realized that Chu Yunfan’s divine power was recovering at an astonishing speed. In a short time, he had already recovered half of it. The Immemorial Dark Phoenix physique had given Chu Yunfan an astonishing recovery speed. In a short time, he had already recovered so much.","“Attack! Attack together and interrupt his recovery. Otherwise, we will all die today!”","At this moment, the two masters of the Godly Sabers looked at each other and immediately knew that they could not stand by and watch. If they continued to let Chu Yunfan grow, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Rrraaaghhh!”","The last expert of the Winged Tiger Tribe was filled with indignation. He roared angrily and immediately began to transform. He transformed into his original appearance—a huge body that was like a small mountain.","In an instant, three experts collectively flew toward Chu Yunfan. The expert leading the Godly Sabers was at the peak of the Creation Stage, while the rest were at the seventh level of the Creation Stage. The experts of the Winged Tiger Tribe were also at the peak of the Creation Stage. They were truly at the peak.","In the distance, Li Weiyuan finally moved. He could not continue to watch Chu Yunfan grow. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan suddenly disappeared from where he was. In the next moment, he appeared above the seventh-level Creator from the Godly Sabers.","“Nine Underworld Stomps!”","It was as if his foot had stepped down from the netherworld and suddenly stomped on the seventh-level Creator from the Godly Sabers.","Bam!","The body of the seventh-level Creator from the Godly Sabers flew out abruptly and exploded in the air. Blood splattered everywhere. Before the corpse could fall, Chu Yunfan had already grabbed it with his Qi and dragged it into the Mountain River Diagram.","“You overestimate yourself. Only the three of you are left!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was extremely cold. The remaining three people immediately felt their expressions turn cold. They clearly felt that Chu Yunfan’s strength had made another breakthrough.","Peak Creation Stage!","They found it unbelievable. Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough was as simple as eating and drinking. They wanted to shout, “What sort of craziness is this?!”"]},{"number":1995,"title":"Chapter 1995 Chu Yunfan Is an Alchemy Master?","paragraphs":["1995 Chu Yunfan Is an Alchemy Master?","The entire battlefield fell into a strange calm. The freelance martial artists who were watching from afar also fell into extreme shock. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength rose steadily under everyone’s eyes, and he rushed into the peak of the Creation Stage. What a terrifying method!","Although everyone could guess that it should have something to do with the pill that Chu Yunfan had taken just now, even if they knew, it was still not something they could reach. This was because this kind of medicinal pill should undoubtedly be extremely expensive. It was simply not something they could obtain.","Even in Grand Xia, top-notch alchemists were extremely rare. Every single one of them was a famous character that could shake the world, and they could even sit down and discuss the Dao with those famous top-notch experts. There was no lack of powerful experts in alchemy.","“Perhaps his alchemy strength is his true trump card?” Princess Yun Yang stood on a mountain peak in Serene Immortal Mountain, watching the great battle on the Eastern Sea.","Unlike the others, Princess Yun Yang could vaguely guess that the pill that Chu Yunfan had just swallowed was made from the medicinal herbs that Chu Yunfan had asked her to buy. She even had the list in her hands. However, just having a list of medicinal ingredients was of no use because there were too many aspects involved in refining medicinal ingredients into medicinal pills.","She could only infer the effects of the pills to be made from the medicinal properties of some of the medicinal ingredients. The truth was similar to what she had guessed, but the effect of the medicine was even more shocking. She had clearly seen how strong Chu Yunfan was. In just a few days, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had improved further and broken through to another realm. Such progress was shocking.","Even so, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was only comparable to a sixth-level Creator. But with the pill, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had broken through to the seventh level of the Creation Stage. It had even reached the peak of the Creation Stage.","It wasn’t that she hadn’t seen pills that could increase one’s cultivation in a short period. Even she had such pills, but it was basically only able to increase one’s cultivation by 10% to 20%. It was already very shocking.","Don’t underestimate this ten to twenty percent. In a battle between experts, even a difference of ten percent in combat power could determine the outcome.","She also had a pill that could double one’s strength, but that would have serious repercussions and even damage one’s cultivation foundation, which would be a serious hindrance to future cultivation. It could be said that if it wasn’t a matter of life and death, she would absolutely not choose to take such a medicinal pill.","However, the pill that Chu Yunfan had swallowed clearly did not have so many problems. Now that Chu Yunfan had broken through from the sixth level of the Creation Stage to the peak of the Creation Stage, his combat strength had increased by more than ten times.","Such an increase was simply unbelievable. Therefore, Princess Yun Yang felt that Chu Yunfan’s amazing alchemy skills might be his true trump card. In addition, Princess Yun Yang recalled that the intelligence report had vaguely mentioned Chu Yunfan purchasing medicinal herbs and making pills. However, at that time, everyone’s attention had been attracted by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing growth in strength, so they ignored these bits and pieces of information.","But now, she realized that the information that she didn’t care about before might be the most important information. To Princess Yun Yang, Chu Yunfan’s alchemy ability was far more important than his combat strength. After all, there were plenty of top-notch experts in the world. Even peak Creators were not in the minority. However, alchemy masters who could compare to them were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Especially for her, who was interested in fighting for the throne, it was far more important to win the support of an alchemy master than to win over a martial dao master.","Originally she was happy to be able to get a top king-level movement technique, but now she felt like she had lost out. An alchemy master with such a limitless future and a favor was far more important than a top king-level movement technique.","At this time, the three experts on the battlefield had surrounded Chu Yunfan. The experts of the Godly Sabers and the Winged Tiger Tribe hated Chu Yunfan to the point of gnashing their teeth. They only wished that they could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces to make up for their losses.","Li Weiyuan’s eyes were extremely cold, with a hint of killing intent. Within the killing intent, there was also a hint of greed.","Chu Yunfan felt that the divine power in his body had expanded to the limit. The Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest had already exhausted all his divine power. Now, with the help of the powerful medicinal pill, he was recovering at an astonishing speed.","“It’s your turn.” Chu Yunfan looked at the three of them indifferently.","“You’re courting death!”","The Godly Saber expert roared. In an instant, his entire body seemed to have transformed into an ancient heavenly saber that split the world apart. The blood essence in his body was released like a vast ocean. The saber beam swept through everything and exploded with a blazing light, slashing down at Chu Yunfan. The terrifying saber light crushed down in the air, almost causing the entire world to collapse.","“Peak Creation Stage. This is a peak Creator. He’s at least twice as strong as the seventh-level Creator from before!”","“That’s right. The true battle has just begun!”","“It’s impossible for Chu Yunfan to be as arrogant as he was just now!”","The crowd was discussing animatedly. They were all shocked by the aura of the last expert of the Godly Sabers. Suddenly, at this moment, Chu Yunfan moved. He turned his hand and slapped the saber that was coming down from the sky.","Bam!","This palm hit the huge saber that was flickering with a blazing saber light.","Then, everyone saw a shocking scene. They saw Chu Yunfan smash the divine saber into pieces. The shards of the saber light turned into a rain of light that scattered in all directions.","“What?!” The expert from the Godly Sabers widened his eyes in disbelief. He had used all his strength to attack Chu Yunfan, but his attacks had been easily shattered. The terrifying force that had bounced back made his arms tremble. That terrifying force could shatter the sky.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a rocket, rising from the ground and spreading his wings like a great roc. Like a dragon rising and a phoenix falling, he rushed toward the Godly Saber experts."]},{"number":1996,"title":"Chapter 1996 One Suppressing Three, Crushing All of His Peers","paragraphs":["1996 One Suppressing Three, Crushing All of His Peers","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan clenched his fist, and a terrifying fist force seeped out from between his fingers. In an instant, it swept across the sky, and in an instant, it pierced through the sky, blasting toward the Godly Sabers expert.","“Little b*stard! Die!” The Winged Tiger broke through the sky and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","A pair of wind wings split the sky apart and fell toward Chu Yunfan. It swept out like a hurricane, shattering everything.","“Get lost! Don’t get in my way! Mountain Wrap Seal!”","Chu Yunfan’s other hand formed a seal and transformed into an archaic divine mountain. It descended on and suppressed the Winged Tiger. Chu Yunfan was not afraid at all when facing two peak Creators at the same time.","Li Weiyuan, who had been watching from the side and had not really moved, could not stand it anymore and attacked.","Boom!","His attack came swiftly. A halberd appeared in his hand. This halberd was engraved with layers of symbols and barriers. With a wave, it transformed into a sky full of human figures. The roars of humans and the neighs of horses turned the area within a radius of a hundred miles into a battlefield. From behind him, countless armored knights charged at Chu Yunfan. Thousands of soldiers and horses galloped over, and the entire sky trembled violently.","Li Weiyuan wanted to kill Chu Yunfan with one move. The Li clan was a military aristocratic family, and most of their martial arts were related to military tactics.","“Trying to kill me off? It won’t be that easy!”","At this moment, countless bolts of lightning surged from Chu Yunfan’s body and turned into swords. In an instant, these swords erupted with earth-shattering sword light. The sword light shattered the sky and charged at the countless cavalry.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Loud explosions sounded as the sword rays formed a sword screen in front of Chu Yunfan, blocking the army’s charge. Chu Yunfan’s fist swept across the sky and reached before the Godly Saber expert.","The saber in the man’s hand had been shattered by Chu Yunfan. He cursed in his heart. He didn’t know what kind of monster Chu Yunfan was. How could he be so terrifying?","However, there was no time for him to think about it. He could only bite the tip of his tongue and spit out a mouthful of blood essence. It turned into a terrifying saber light, which was 30% stronger than the saber light he had just slashed out. It actually fell toward the eight heavenly dragons formed by Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","Boom!","The saber light was instantly shattered. The eight heavenly dragons were like eight gods standing side by side between heaven and earth. In an instant, they blasted into the Godly Saber expert.","Bam!","The expert was hit head-on and couldn’t help but spit out a mouthful of blood. His entire chest caved in. One could imagine how shocking and terrifying Chu Yunfan’s punch was. The person was in complete disbelief. He was an expert at the peak of the Prodigy List. How many years had it been since he had been injured? Even he himself could not remember. But now, he was seriously injured by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","He couldn’t understand how Chu Yunfan had raised his combat strength to the peak of the Prodigy List using only external items. Under normal circumstances, he should be far inferior to a veteran peak of the Prodigy List. However, the truth had slapped him in the face. He had been seriously injured by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","On the other side, Chu Yunfan’s Mountain Wrap Seal sent the Winged Tiger Tribe expert flying.","“So strong... He managed to block the surprise attack of three peak Creators and even severely injured one of them!”","This series of events took a long time to describe, but in fact, it only took a short time for the outcome to be decided. Chu Yunfan had suppressed the three masters alone and even had the strength to severely injure the Godly Saber expert.","“He’s simply a monster. What kind of medicinal pill did he consume? Why is he so terrifying?”","Many people wanted to know what kind of pill Chu Yunfan had taken. At the same time, many people listed Chu Yunfan as someone who could not be provoked, even though Chu Yunfan had relied on pills to advance his combat strength to the peak of the Prodigy List.","However, who knew that he only had one medicinal pill in his hand, but he had several such medicinal pills? Moreover, even if Chu Yunfan did not consume that pill, his combat strength had already reached the peak of the Prodigy List. With such a cultivation, he was definitely an expert in the Eastern Sea. He could even establish a famous sect.","Among the itinerant cultivators of the Eastern Sea, many of them were already overlords of a region. What was even more terrifying was that Chu Yunfan was only a junior. If he continued to grow, it would only be a matter of time before he surpassed the peak of the Prodigy List, let alone the Prodigy List.","Even if Chu Yunfan could not deal with them for now, he would have a way to deal with them in the future. Moreover, in the Eastern Sea, there were many sect leaders whose cultivation was inferior to Chu Yunfan’s.","Unknowingly, Chu Yunfan had become a terrifying existence that many people feared. His strength seemed to be completely separated from the prodigies on the Prodigy List. They were not on the same level.","Originally, Li Qianyuan was the first on the Prodigy List. Everyone was wondering how Chu Yunfan could kill Li Qianyuan and become the first on the Prodigy List. Now, they finally understood that Chu Yunfan’s placing was indeed worthy. Especially when compared to everyone else, Chu Yunfan’s strength was a little too strong. It was obvious that he had already surpassed this year’s Prodigy List by a level, or even several levels.","Those who knew Li Weiyuan had felt like fainting when they saw that Li Weiyuan’s attack was easily blocked by Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan could actually compete with the previous Prodigy List, even though Li Weiyuan was only ranked at the bottom of the previous Prodigy List.","Although Chu Yunfan relied on the power of a medicinal pill, he had done it. Everyone understood what this meant. If Chu Yunfan didn’t die, the Flying Celestials would produce a legendary figure who would dominate the current generation and crush all his peers.","Every time such a figure appeared, it was enough to dim the light of everyone in the same generation. It was like a long night, and only his bright moon hung high in the sky."]},{"number":1997,"title":"Chapter 1997 Slaying a Peak Creator","paragraphs":["1997 Slaying a Peak Creator","On the Prodigy List, many geniuses were chasing after each other. Li Qianyuan suppressed everyone, but he only suppressed everyone. The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was completely different. It was obvious that there was a huge gap between him and the others. Once such a figure appeared, it would be the sorrow of all the geniuses of the same era. His name would suppress everyone for an era.","After this battle, everyone would remember their name!","While everyone was still shocked by how easily Chu Yunfan had blocked three peak Creators, the Godly Saber expert who had been sent flying by Chu Yunfan did not dare to stay. He spat out a mouthful of blood, burned all his divine power, and fled.","In an instant, he had fled more than a hundred miles away. He only stopped to catch a breath when he saw that Chu Yunfan was only a small black dot. Suddenly, his vision darkened. A moon-white figure was blocking his way.","“Leaving so soon? Stay!”","“I’ll fight it out with you!” the Godly Saber expert roared in grief and indignation.","The divine power in his entire body exploded and transformed into a saber light that swept across the sky. It was like a mountain range that pressed down. When the saber landed, half of the expert’s hair turned white. It could be said that this attack had burned half of his life.","“Using half of my lifespan to exchange for your life is worth it!” The Godly Saber expert’s face twitched, looking extremely ferocious.","However, this attack did not cut Chu Yunfan in half as he had expected. It didn’t even injure Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan simply raised his hand and grabbed it. The earth-shattering saber light was caught in his hand as if he were holding a lollipop.","Bam!","The blade light shattered inch by inch, unable to pose a threat to Chu Yunfan. It turned into a sky full of light and scattered in all directions.","“Impossible!”","The first reaction of the Godly Saber expert was disbelief. He had burned half of his lifespan in exchange for this strike. Among peak Creators, he was one of the best. Even if he faced Li Weiyuan, he had a chance to severely injure the latter. However, Chu Yunfan had easily crushed his attack, making him feel terrible.","What kind of monster was this?! How could Chu Yunfan be so terrifying?!","This expert had never seen anyone fight so fiercely. Chu Yunfan was like an invincible physique cultivator. He was the kind of person who didn’t need any magic tools because he was the most terrifying tool of all. But there was one thing the man was sure of, and that was that Chu Yunfan had become stronger.","When he thought of this, he felt even worse. Was there any justice in this world? Chu Yunfan was already very terrifying, but now he was even stronger. It was simply abnormal. If he had a way to fight against Chu Yunfan state earlier, he was now in complete despair.","However, he didn’t despair for long. Chu Yunfan pulled out the Ocean Overturner, and the terrifying sword slashed down, instantly blasting into the Godly Saber expert.","Slice!","The expert was cut into two halves and died instantly.","A peak Creator had fallen, and everyone gasped. Although there had been such experts who had fallen before, and there were such experts among the marine folks, they were not as emotional as they were now when they were destroyed by Chu Yunfan’s Ten Thousand Dragons Returning to the Nest.","Now that they had seen Chu Yunfan kill this Godly Saber expert with a single sword strike, they finally felt that it was real. What was even more terrifying was that they found that Chu Yunfan’s strength was increasing at an astonishing speed.","This was f*cking ridiculous, and many people felt despair!","Chu Yunfan couldn’t care less about the despair of the crowd, because there were still two people in front of him who hadn’t been dealt with. The divine power in his body was continuously increasing. It was not only because of the enhancement effect of the pill but also because of the effect of the pill. The Wood Spirit Essence in his body was transforming into power at an even more shocking speed.","In other words, his strength was still increasing. At this rate, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to the seventh level of the Prodigy List. This was why he could easily kill the Godly Saber expert. Chu Yunfan’s current power was enhanced by two things, and it was far more tyrannical than one.","Only he could withstand this kind of amplification. The two huge energies were wreaking havoc in his body. If it was someone else whose physical body was not strong enough, they would have exploded on the spot.","“Sh*t!”","The last Winged Tiger was a little dumbfounded. Before he could even figure out what had happened, everything was already over. The Godly Saber expert that even he was afraid of had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","At this moment, he had the same feeling as the expert from the Godly Sabers from before. What a lunatic. Was Chu Yunfan a monster?","The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was obviously different from the information he had received. He had thought that it would be an easy task. The real problem was to guard against the surprise attacks of other forces. Only now did he realize that compared to Chu Yunfan, the experts of the other forces were as docile as little white rabbits. They couldn’t be compared to Chu Yunfan at all. Not only was Chu Yunfan powerful, but he was also very cunning. Were all humans like this?","Chu Yunfan could have shown enough strength from the beginning to force everyone back and carve out an escape path for himself, but he insisted on showing weakness and letting everyone think that they could kill him as long as they put in a little more effort. In the end, the various factions suffered heavy losses, leaving only himself and Li Weiyuan.","“Damn it!”","There was only one thought in the Winged Tiger’s mind. He had to pair up with Li Weiyuan. If it was before, he would never get close to a human expert. The feud between the demons and the humans had lasted for countless years. No one knew if Li Weiyuan would suddenly kill him. To him, the humans were a race that he could not trust. But now, in the face of Chu Yunfan’s threat, it didn’t matter anymore.","However, it was too late. Chu Yunfan’s figure moved and activated the movement technique of the Prismatic Traveller. In an instant, he arrived before the Winged Tiger. Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and looked at the Winged Tiger as if he was looking at a dead man."]},{"number":1998,"title":"Chapter 1998 Killing Another Peak Creator","paragraphs":["1998 Killing Another Peak Creator","The Winged Tiger immediately realized something terrifying and transformed into its original form. As soon as its mountain-like huge body appeared, its terrifying pressure swept across the entire sea area. It was a true big demon, and could even be called a terrifying existence at the level of a demon king.","“Rrrraaaggh!” the Winged Tiger roared and opened its bloody mouth.","In an instant, the wind and clouds changed color. Countless storms gathered in its mouth and turned into a terrifying hurricane that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move. He just watched coldly as the hurricane swept toward him. Then, everyone saw the terrifying hurricane that could uproot mountains dissipate under Chu Yunfan’s feet and disappear without a trace. The terrifying storm seemed to have been frozen by some force and could not get close to Chu Yunfan.","“Roar!”","The Winged Tiger was not discouraged. He already knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was. If he had underestimated Chu Yunfan in the beginning, now, as time passed, he no longer dared to underestimate Chu Yunfan. This was a terrifying existence that could stand shoulder to shoulder with him, or even surpass him.","The wind wings on the back of the Winged Tiger flapped and turned into two terrifying long blades, slashing down at Chu Yunfan. In terms of cultivation base, the Winged Tiger was stronger than the Godly Saber expert. Although their cultivation levels were similar, this Winged Tiger was purebred. Their race was powerful. Among the countless demon tribed, the Winged Tigers were a powerful royal family. One could imagine how terrifying this demon was.","Clang!","Clang!","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing rang out. Everyone saw that the two long blades formed by the wind wings could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. They could not break through his defense.","Chu Yunfan then began to emit bursts of golden light. He was like a god in the sky, possessing a terrifying pressure that ordinary people could not imagine. He was a war god who dominated the battlefield.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan was expressionless. He took a step forward, and the entire sky shook. With his foot as the center, the attack spread in all directions. Everyone could even see the spreading tide, a terrifying scene like the end of the world.","Whoosh!","Terrifying netherworld water formed a mighty force and fell toward the Winged Tiger. He roared, and countless hurricanes appeared around him, trying to resist the falling netherworld water. However, the water was more than 1,000 catties heavy. Even if it was just a drop, it could smash through a mountain.","Wherever the netherworld water passed, the hurricanes were no match for it. The hurricanes collapsed and disintegrated one after another. Then, the water formed a terrifying aura and landed on the Winged Tiger.","The Winged Tiger’s body burst out with blood as if it had been injured by a sharp weapon. There were even signs of corrosion on the wounds as if the water could corrode everything.","“Second Netherworld Stomp.” Chu Yunfan’s cold voice didn’t stop, and he took a second step.","The Winged Tiger’s huge body was sent flying as if it had been struck by a critical blow. A mouthful of blood spurted out from its mouth. In an instant, he was severely injured by Chu Yunfan.","The gap between them was getting bigger and bigger. When the Winged Tiger met Chu Yunfan, it was almost impossible for him to resist. When it reached the second of the Nine Netherworld Stomps, he could not hold out any longer and was seriously injured. His iron-like bones were broken by the second step.","Chu Yunfan was cold and merciless as he took his third step. But at this time, Li Weiyuan arrived. The halberd in his hand danced and slashed down at Chu Yunfan from an unexpected angle. His movements were like that of a charging antelope. His movements looked incredible, but he was able to do it.","The halberd swept out, and within the martial intent domain, it transformed into an incomparably terrifying might. It was vast and mighty, turning into a black dragon that surged toward Chu Yunfan.","“You want to stop me?” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the attack. He brought out the Mountain River Cauldron, and it started to dance.","Bam!","The cauldron smashed fiercely into the black dragon. The black dragon let out a miserable shriek, and its body, which was formed by divine power, was shattered in the air. It was only a single blow, but in an instant, the halberd was struck back to its original appearance.","Spurt!","Li Weiyuan’s hands split open. He had suffered a huge loss in the battle with Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s terrifying and violent power was vividly displayed at this moment. They were all at the peak of the Prodigy List, but everyone had witnessed Chu Yunfan’s terror. Even when the three experts joined forces, they could not do anything to him. In fact, as time passed, Chu Yunfan’s strength was still developing further.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan had already taken the third step of the Nine Netherworld Stomps. The terrifying water of the Netherworld drowned everything. The protective barrier on the Winged Tiger’s body had completely collapsed. It instantly disintegrated and completely dissolved.","Squish!","The Winged Tiger was severely injured. His head caved in because Chu Yunfan had stomped on it, and his neck was broken. The power of Chu Yunfan’s Nine Netherworld Stomps increased exponentially with each step.","Boom!","The Winged Tiger let out a blood-curdling cry as its huge body smashed into the sea. The huge inertia caused it to crash into the deep sea, killing countless ferocious beasts in the deep sea. Although these deep-sea ferocious beasts were incomparably huge, they were like paper. They exploded with a single collision.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan swung his sword. The Ocean Overturned followed him like a shadow and rushed into the sea, catching up with the Winged Tiger.","Stab!","The Winged Tiger was pierced through by the sword and died instantly."]},{"number":1999,"title":"Chapter 1999 One More to Go, Let’s Call It a Day","paragraphs":["1999 One More to Go, Let’s Call It a Day","After killing the Winged Tiger with a single strike, Chu Yunfan was still in the mood to pick it up.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t be in a better mood. With so many top-notch Creators killed, it was enough to nurture a Brahma Fruit that would allow Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to advance. He had not seen Li Qianyuan for a short time, but Li Qianyuan had not only recovered from his injuries, but his cultivation had also improved. There was simply no justice.","This made Chu Yunfan truly realize one thing, and that was how amazing the foundation of those large forces was. Coupled with the talent of these top geniuses of the younger generation, their growth speed was very shocking.","Under such circumstances, if he wanted to match the speed of these prodigies, he would have to seize all kinds of resources. Right now, no one in his generation was his match.","Although Chu Yunfan was backed by the Flying Celestials, the only person he truly believed in was himself and no one else. He could sense that after this battle, his cultivation would advance further and break through to the third Creation Stage. At that time, his combat strength would even be enough to sweep through the seventh-level Creators. If he encountered an ordinary peak Creator, he would be able to fight them and retreat unscathed.","When the Brahma Fruit ripened, it was only a matter of time before Chu Yunfan’s combat strength broke through to the peak of the Creation Stage. At that time, he would not need to consume medicinal pills to easily defeat these powerful enemies.","In the Eastern Sea, Creators were considered experts. Peak Creators were enough to be considered a big shot. Other than a few hidden old monsters, they were at the level where they could do whatever they wanted.","In the Flying Celestials, a peak Creator was a peak expert that ordinary people could come into contact with. Those who had surpassed the Creation Stage were either in seclusion all year round or traveling outside all year round. They did not bother with the mundane affairs of the sect to avoid being slowed down. For such experts, there was only one thing left in their lives, and that was to continuously cultivate and become stronger.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but be in a good mood. Then, his gaze turned to Li Weiyuan. Li Weiyuan looked at Chu Yunfan and couldn’t help but shiver. Then, his face showed a bit of anger.","Li Weiyuan was afraid. For a moment, he was afraid of Chu Yunfan’s gaze. What was even stranger was that he could feel that Chu Yunfan was looking at him as if he was looking at a dead object, or rather, a treasure. He was instantly furious. Were the younger generation so arrogant these days?","He didn’t know that in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, he was just nourishment for the Brahma Tree, and already saw him as a dead man.","“You’re the only one left. Let’s call it a day!”","Chu Yunfan felt the gradually increasing energy in his body. He felt that he had not truly reached his limit. After he truly reached his limit, it would be time for him to break through to the third Creation Stage.","Li Weiyuan’s face revealed an extremely angry expression. Then, an extremely cold expression flashed across his eyes. The torn web between his thumb and forefinger healed at a speed visible to the naked eye. His face regained its confidence. Although Chu Yunfan looked terrifyingly strong now—like a god who would kill anyone in his way, he was still confident. He was a prodigy on the previous Prodigy List. Although he was ranked at the bottom, he was incomparable to the other two peak Creators that Chu Yunfan had just killed. He was more than twice as strong as them.","If it were him, he could also kill the two of them, but not as easily as Chu Yunfan had. This was the power of the prodigies on the Prodigy List. They were both at the peak of the Creation Stage. To the Winged Tiger and the Godly Saber expert, this might be the limit of their cultivation. There was only a small chance that they would break through to a higher stage in the future. However, for Li Weiyuan, this was only a temporary stage. As long as he did not make any mistakes, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to a higher stage. This was the fundamental difference.","Chu Yunfan relied on the power of a medicinal pill to break through to this stage. As long as Li Weiyuan could prolong the fight, the medicinal effect would fade, and Chu Yunfan would be crushed by him.","Boom!","Li Weiyuan made his move. He had seen how the others died, so he didn’t dare to let Chu Yunfan make the first move. His halberd swept across the sky like an antelope’s horn, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan. With his other hand, he grabbed at the air and took out a medicinal pill. Then, he swallowed it.","In an instant, Li Weiyuan’s strength soared, increasing by a full 20%. Although it was only a 20% increase in power, the increase in combat strength was almost a few times. It had almost doubled in an instant.","Li Weiyuan’s heart was bleeding. He didn’t have many pills that could increase one’s strength without too many side effects. After all, not everyone was like Chu Yunfan, who could make pills by himself. It was not easy for him to obtain such pills.","The more Li Weiyuan thought about it, the angrier he became. The halberd light that erupted from the halberd in his hand became even more astonishing.","Bam!","Divine light burst forth, almost causing the sky to explode. The two prodigies collided in the air. After the first attack failed, Li Weiyuan brandished the halberd in his hand again. With a casual wave, the sky changed color. Within a radius of a hundred miles, countless spirit energy danced, forming a huge dragon that smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“Spirit Dragon Halberd!” Li Weiyuan roared as if he was using the power of nature within a radius of 100 kilometers to shatter Chu Yunfan’s defense.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan was fearless and threw another punch.","The entire sky had turned into a battlefield for both sides. Below them, under the guidance of the mana of the two experts, the ocean was raging with waves that were tens of thousands of feet high, blocking everyone’s vision. They could only see the figures of the two experts flashing continuously."]},{"number":2000,"title":"Chapter 2000 Breakthrough in Battle, Third Creation Stage","paragraphs":["2000 Breakthrough in Battle, Third Creation Stage","Rumble!","An ordinary peak Creator would probably be killed in less than ten moves. Even if they were in the same stage, there would be a huge difference in their combat strength. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He could fight Li Weiyuan back and forth, almost evenly matched. The two sides clashed in the sky like two gods.","In the distance, many itinerant cultivators of the Eastern Sea were excited. This was a rare and shocking battle for them. Both sides exchanged blows. It could be said that they had unleashed their martial techniques to the extreme. All kinds of attacks swept out and flew through the sky without leaving any traces. It was truly a confrontation between top experts. They were as vigorous as dragons. Every collision made the sky tremble.","There were seventh-level or peak Creators among the Eastern Sea itinerant cultivators. When the traditional overlords of the Eastern Sea saw this scene, they could not help but gasp. Neither of these two people was an existence that they could contend with.","Among seventh-level Creators, only a small portion of them had the ability to step into the peak of the Creation Stage. This meant that they had the foundation to charge into a higher stage. Only by cultivating this peak, the realm of perfection, could one possibly step into a higher stage.","However, even though they were both at their limits, humans were completely different. The strength of these two people was clearly far above theirs. In the present world, it was unknown how many people could be on par with them. A peak Creator was not a cabbage on the roadside. They were truly top-notch experts.","Today, the four forces had besieged Chu Yunfan and were massacred by him. It could be said that their spines had been broken. Perhaps only the Flying Winged Tigers were slightly better off. The other three forces probably had to wait until they could recover the lost vitality.","“Chu Yunfan, let’s see how long you can last!” Li Weiyuan roared. The halberd in his hand danced, transforming into a spirit dragon that was more than a thousand feet long. Everyone seemed to hear the dragon’s roar, resounding through the world.","“It’s enough to kill you!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. He was not afraid at all. He rose up from the ground and used all kinds of martial arts.","Eight Astonishing Punches, Nine Netherworld Stomps, Violet Thunder Swords, the Ocean Overturner, the Mountain Wrap Seal, and other powerful unique skills were displayed in his hands without any difficulty. All kinds of martial arts were switched seamlessly, and each martial art had different characteristics. In Chu Yunfan’s hands, he performed them perfectly.","This made Li Weiyuan, who was opposite him, feel so depressed that he wanted to vomit blood. Different martial arts required different techniques. Chu Yunfan had many techniques, but he only had the Spirit Dragon Halberd. He was so depressed that he wanted to vomit blood.","However, he still gritted his teeth and persevered. As long as he persisted, Chu Yunfan would definitely not be able to persist. He had always believed in this principle. Chu Yunfan had only been able to hold out until now by relying on pills. Although he had also relied on pills, he had taken them later than Chu Yunfan. He could at least hold out longer than Chu Yunfan.","The intense battle between the two sides was going on crazily. In a moment, they had already exchanged more than a thousand moves. It was only in this desolate and uninhabited Eastern Sea that there was no one to control them. Otherwise, it would have caused a lot of suffering.","What kind of concept was it when a peak Creator attacked at full force? If it was in the past, even with the protection of the barrier, it was enough to destroy a base city. No monster attacking the city could compare to a peak Creator attacking.","Just as everyone was amazed by the terrifying combat strength of the two, Li Weiyuan became more and more depressed as he fought, because he realized that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was still increasing even though he had already reached the limit. He was a little dumbfounded. Was it so illogical?","He himself had clearly reached the limit, but why could Chu Yunfan go one step further? They were both relying on pills and had to follow the basic rules. Chu Yunfan seemed to have taken a more potent pill.","In the end, Chu Yunfan gave up on other methods and just threw out punches. They fell like raindrops, and it looked like a street brawl. The more they watched, the more speechless the onlookers became. Previously, they could still see various moves. Now, there were only simple punches left.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even cover his fists with divine power. He was using his own fists to resist Li Weiyuan’s Spirit Dragon Halberd. No one could understand this strange combat technique. What was he doing?","Even Li Weiyuan couldn’t figure it out, but he didn’t have the time to care about that. He was about to vomit blood from Chu Yunfan’s punches. Chu Yunfan’s strength was still increasing. He was a little dumbfounded. How did Chu Yunfan do it?","Spurt!","“Let’s go!”","And as time passed, his disadvantage grew. If it was supposed to break, it would be broken by now.","After Li Weiyuan made his judgment, he immediately began to escape. His eyes regained clarity, and he no longer had the greed for Chu Yunfan’s secret inheritance. He suddenly understood a lot. It was not possible for him to deal with Chu Yunfan now.","Boom!","Just as he was about to escape, a terrifying pressure erupted from Chu Yunfan’s body. In an instant, Chu Yunfan stopped Li Weiyuan.","“I’m sorry, but where are you going?” Chu Yunfan smiled, revealing his big white teeth. He felt at leisure.","Chu Yunfan’s aura was still rising at an astonishing speed. It was different from the faint increase that Li Weiyuan felt just now. Now, his aura was rising at a speed that was almost visible to the naked eye.","This was because Chu Yunfan had broken through to the third level of the Creation Stage!"]}]);
